comment: The urinary tract comprises the kidneys, ureters, a bladder, and a urethra.
synonym: "Frequent urinary tract infections" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Recurrent UTIs" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Repeated bladder infections" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Repeated urinary tract infections" EXACT layperson []
