comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في إنتاج البول أثناء الليل مما يؤدي إلى حاجة متكررة للتبول.
def: "Abnormally increased production of urine during the night leading to an unusually frequent need to urinate." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: Often occurring as a result of heart insufficiency.
synonym: "Nycturia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
