id: HP:0000090
name: Nephronophthisis
synonym: "نفرونوفثيس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود الكيسات عند ملتقى القشرة واللب في الكلية مترافقًا مع التليف الأنبوب الكبدي.
alt_id: HP:0004748
def: "Presence of cysts at the corticomedullary junction of the kidney in combination with tubulointerstitial fibrosis." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:Eurenomics_fschaefer]
comment: Nephronophthisis is here regarded as a phenotypic feature. The disease of the same name results in progressive symmetrical destruction of the kidneys involving both the tubules and glomeruli.
synonym: "juvenile nephronophthisis" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:204958008
xref: UMLS:C0687120
