[Term]
id: HP:0000196
name: Lower lip pit
synonym: "حفرة الشفة السفلى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حفرة في الشفة السفلى" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توجد انخسافة في منطقة الشفة السفلى، وعادة ما تكون بالقرب من الخط الوسطي.
def: "Depression located on the vermilion of the lower lip, usually paramedian." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154, PMID:19125428]
comment: A lip pit may be connected by a fistula to mucous minor salivary glands in the lower lip. In addition, a lip pit may on occasion be seen with a surrounding tissue elevation (mound). Pits located at the labial commisure (cheilon) are distinct from lip pits (see Commissural pit).
