[Term]
id: HP:0000243
name: Trigonocephaly
synonym: "رأس مثلث الشكل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "رأس مثلث" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل الرأس مثلث أو يشبه الوتد، حيث يكون قمة المثلث في منتصف الجبهة وقاعدته عند مؤخرة الرأس.
def: "Wedge-shaped, or triangular head, with the apex of the triangle at the midline of the forehead and the base of the triangle at the occiput." [PMID:19125436]
comment: This shape should be assessed from above, with the examiner looking down on the head of the patient. Trigonocephaly can be caused by premature fusion of the metopic suture.
