[Term]
id: HP:0000321
name: Square face
synonym: "وجه مربع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الملامح الوجهية كما تُرى من الأمام تظهر الوجه العلوي/الجمجمة والوجه السفلي/الفك عريضان، مما يخلق مظهرًا مربعًا.
def: "Facial contours, as viewed from the front, show a broad upper face/cranium and lower face/mandible, creating a square appearance." [PMID:19125436]
synonym: "Square face" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Square facial shape" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
