[Term]
id: HP:0000338
name: Hypomimic face
synonym: "وجه قليل التعبير" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تعابير الوجه قليلة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إنخفاض درجة حركة العضلات تحت الجلد في الوجه، غالبًا يرتبط بتقليل تكوين التجاعيد في الوجه.
alt_id: HP:0008769
def: "A reduced degree of motion of the muscles beneath the skin of the face, often associated with reduced facial crease formation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The movement and position of facial muscles are often interpreted as expressing emotions. Individuals with hypomimic face may be perceived as expressing less emotion than normal.
synonym: "Decreased facial expressions" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Decreased facial muscle movement" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Dull facial expression" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Hypomimia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
