[Term]
id: HP:0000482
name: Microcornea
synonym: "صغر القرنية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "القرنية أقل من 10 مم في القطر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل خلقي في القرنية حيث تكون القرنية والجزء الأمامي من العين أصغر من الطبيعي. لا يصل قطر القرنية الأفقي إلى 10 مم حتى في مرحلة البلوغ.
alt_id: HP:0100688
def: "A congenital abnormality of the cornea in which the cornea and the anterior segment of the eye are smaller than normal. The horizontal diameter of the cornea does not reach 10 mm even in adulthood." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Note that the cornea's diameter is normally about 9.5-10.0 mm at birth and reaches 10.0-12-5 mm in adulthood.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Cornea of eye less than 10mm in diameter" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
synonym: "Decreased corneal diameter" EXACT []
