[Term]
id: HP:0000506
name: Telecanthus
synonym: "التباعد بين الزاويتين الداخلتين للعين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تباعد أركان العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: المسافة بين الزاويتين الداخلتين للعين تكون أكبر من المتوسط بأكثر من انحرافين معياريين (موضوعي)؛ أو ظاهرياً زيادة في المسافة بين الزاويتين الداخلتين.
def: "Distance between the inner canthi more than two standard deviations above the mean (objective); or, apparently increased distance between the inner canthi." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Dystopia canthorum (also called telecanthus) describes a subtle but unusual facial feature in which the inner corners of the eyes (canthi) are spaced farther apart than normal, yet the eyes (pupils) themselves are not necessarily widely spaced.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Corners of eye widely separated" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Dystopia canthorum" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased distance between medial canthi" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased intercanthal distance" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
