[Term]
id: HP:0000510
name: Rod-cone dystrophy
synonym: "حثل القضبان والمخاريط" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حثل الشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من أمراض الشبكية الوراثية حيث تتأثر الخلايا المستقبلة لمخاريط الضوء بشكل أكثر شدة من الخلايا المستقبلة للضوء العصوية. العرض النموذجي يشمل العمى الليلي (بسبب خلل القضبان) تليها فقدان المجال البصري المتوسط، والذي يمتد تدريجياً ويترك العديد من المرضى بجزيرة مركزية صغيرة من الرؤية بسبب الحفاظ على المخاريط البقعية.
alt_id: HP:0000547
alt_id: HP:0001127
alt_id: HP:0007635
alt_id: HP:0007645
alt_id: HP:0007742
alt_id: HP:0007816
alt_id: HP:0007826
alt_id: HP:0007927
alt_id: HP:0008036
def: "An inherited retinal disease subtype in which the rod photoreceptors appear to be more severely affected than the cone photoreceptors. Typical presentation is with nyctalopia (due to rod dysfunction) followed by loss of mid-peripheral field of vision, which gradually extends and leaves many patients with a small central island of vision due to the preservation of macular cones." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20212494]
comment: Retinitis pigmentosa is a group of hereditary diseases of the eye. However, the term retinitis pigmentosa has also been used to describe the retinal findings characteristic of these diseases but also seen on other diseases such as Usher syndrome. It is preferable to describe the findings precisely if possible, but this term is kept for convenience.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Retinitis pigmentosa" EXACT []
synonym: "Rod cone dystrophy" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:28835009
xref: UMLS:C0035334
is_a: HP:0000556 ! Retinal dystrophy

[Term]
id: HP:0000511
name: Vertical supranuclear gaze palsy
synonym: "شلل نظرة عمودية فوق النوى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شلل في حركات العين العمودية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شلل النظرة الفوق نووي هو عدم القدرة على النظر في الاتجاه العمودي نتيجة لضرر في الدماغ. هناك فقدان في الجانب الإرادي لحركات العين، ولكن بما أن جذع الدماغ ما يزال سليماً، فإن جميع حركات العين الانعكاسية المتوافقة تكون طبيعية.
def: "A supranuclear gaze palsy is an inability to look in a vertical direction as a result of cerebral impairment. There is a loss of the voluntary aspect of eye movements, but, as the brainstem is still intact, all the reflex conjugate eye movements are normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20671861]
comment: Vertical gaze palsies can manifest as selective limitation of upgaze or downgaze.
synonym: "Vertical gaze palsy" EXACT []
synonym: "VSGP" EXACT abbreviation []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:246773002
xref: UMLS:C0339652
xref: UMLS:C1843369
is_a: HP:0000605 ! Supranuclear gaze palsy

[Term]
id: HP:0000512
name: Abnormal electroretinogram
synonym: "شذوذ في تخطيط كهربية الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مشكلة في القياسات الكهربائية للشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي شذوذ في الردود الكهربائية لأنواع الخلايا المختلفة في الشبكية كما يتم قياسها عن طريق تخطيط كهربية الشبكية.
alt_id: HP:0003285
def: "Any abnormality of the electrical responses of various cell types in the retina as measured by electroretinography." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The electrical responses of the photoreceptors (rods and cones), inner retinal cells (bipolar and amacrine cells), and the ganglion cells can be assessed by ERG.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Abnormal electroretinography" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormal ERG" EXACT []
synonym: "ERG abnormal" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:274524001
xref: UMLS:C0476397
is_a: HP:0030453 ! Abnormal visual electrophysiology

