[Term]
id: HP:0000518
name: Cataract
synonym: "إعتام عدسة العين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدسة العين غائمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إعتام عدسة العين هو تعتيم أو غيان يتطور في العدسة البلورية للعين أو في حوضها.
alt_id: HP:0001113
alt_id: HP:0007825
alt_id: HP:0010700
def: "A cataract is an opacity or clouding that develops in the crystalline lens of the eye or in its capsule." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Note that some ophthalmologists call any opacity in the lens a cataract, while others restrict the term to lens opacities that impair vision. We use the term to refer to the first meaning (any lens opacity).
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Cataracts" EXACT []
