[Term]
id: HP:0000555
name: Leukocoria
synonym: "بياض الحدقة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انعكاس أبيض من الحدقة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انعكاس أبيض غير طبيعي من الحدقة بدلاً من الانعكاس الأسود المعتاد.
def: "An abnormal white reflection from the pupil rather than the usual black reflection." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The word leukocoria literally means white pupil, but leukocoria is not an abnormality of the pupil. Rather, leukocoria can be caused by cataract, retinal detachment, retinopathy of prematurity, retinal malformation, endophthalmitis, retinal vascular abnormality, and intraocular tumor (e.g., retinoblastoma).
synonym: "Leukokoria" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "White pupillary reflex" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:1361009
xref: UMLS:C0152458
is_a: HP:0000615 ! Abnormal pupil morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0000556
name: Retinal dystrophy
synonym: "حثل الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تدهور الشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حثل الشبكية هو شذوذ في الشبكية مرتبط بعملية وراثية. تُعرف الحثولات الشبكية بميراثها الذي يكون عادةً أحادي الجين وغالباً ما يرتبط بفقدان أو خلل وظيفي في الخلايا المستقبلة للضوء كحدث رئيسي أو ثانوي.
alt_id: HP:0007736
alt_id: HP:0007910
alt_id: HP:0007974
alt_id: HP:0007982
def: "Retinal dystrophy is an abnormality of the retina associated with a hereditary process. Retinal dystrophies are defined by their predominantly monogenic inheritance and they are frequently associated with loss or dysfunction of photoreceptor cells as a primary or secondary event." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0986-4123]
synonym: "Breakdown of light-sensitive cells in back of eye" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:314407005
xref: UMLS:C0854723
is_a: HP:0000479 ! Abnormal retinal morphology

