synonym: "حالة ضخامة مقلة العين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضخم العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة تضخم شامل للعين (مع تضخم القرنية) مرتبطة بالجلوكوما.
def: "Diffusely large eye (with megalocornea) associated with glaucoma." []
comment: Buphthalmos refers to a congenital open-angle glaucoma of the eye. The term buphthalmos (from Greek 'bous' or ox and 'ophthalmos' or eye) is descriptive of an enlarged eyeglobe resulting from increased intraocular pressure. The eyeglobe is especially prone to distension in newborns and infants because its collagen filaments are not as rigid as in adults and may easily be stretched.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Enlarged eyeball" EXACT layperson [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/buphthalmos, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4551507
is_a: HP:0001087 ! Developmental glaucoma
is_a: HP:0001090 ! Abnormally large globe

[Term]
id: HP:0000558
name: Rieger anomaly
synonym: "شذوذ ريجر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شذوذ في مقدمة العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه خلقي في القطاع الأمامي يتميز بتشوه في القزحية والقرنية، والزرق، ونقص تنسج في سدى القزحية، وبروز القزحية الخلفي، وعتامات في القرنية.
def: "A congenital malformation of the anterior segment characterized by iridicorneal malformation, glaucoma, iris stroma hypoplasia, posterior embryotoxon, and corneal opacities." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Hypoplasia (underdevelopment) of the iris as well as iris strands to the peripheral cornea.
