def: "Bleeding located within the retina. Retinal hemorrhages range from the smallest dot and blot hemorrhage to massive sub-hyaloid hemorrhage." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:gcarletti]
comment: The type of retinal hemorrhage and its clinical appearance depends on its location within the retina.
