def: "Radiolucency (reflecting a reduction in the bony substance) around the apex (the tip of the dental root)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9338-3017]
comment: Periapical radiolucencies can be seen with periapical granuloma, cysts, ameloblastoma, odotogenic keratatoycsts, and other lesions.
