[Term]
id: HP:0000716
name: Depression
synonym: "اكتئاب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشعور المتكرر بالحزن واليأس والشعور بالصعوبة في التعافي من هذه المشاعر؛ وجود نظرة متشائمة حول المستقبل؛ الشهور بالخجل المستمر وانخفاض تقدير الذات؛ التفكير في الانتحار والانخراط في سلوكيات انتحارية.
def: "Frequently experiencing feelings of being down, miserable, and/or hopeless; struggling to recover from these moods; having a pessimistic outlook on the future; feeling a pervasive sense of shame; having a low self-worth; experiencing thoughts of suicide and engaging in suicidal behavior." []
synonym: "Depression" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Depressive disorder" RELATED []
synonym: "Depressive episode" EXACT []
synonym: "Depressivity" EXACT []
