[Term]
id: HP:0000717
name: Autism
synonym: "توحّد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التوحد هو اضطراب في النمو العصبي يتميز باضطرابات في التفاعل والتواصل الاجتماعي وسلوكيات محدودة ومتكررة. يبدأ التوحد في مرحلة الطفولة ويتميز بوجود تطور غير طبيعي أو مضطرب بشكل كبير في التفاعل الاجتماعي والتواصل، ومجموعة أنشطة واهتمامات محدودة بشكل كبير. تختلف مظاهر الاضطراب بشكل كبير اعتمادًا على مستوى النمو والعمر الزمني للفرد.
def: "Autism is a neurodevelopmental disorder characterized by impaired social interaction and communication, and by restricted and repetitive behavior. Autism begins in childhood. It is marked by the presence of markedly abnormal or impaired development in social interaction and communication and a markedly restricted repertoire of activity and interest. Manifestations of the disorder vary greatly depending on the developmental level and chronological age of the individual (DSM-IV)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6410-0882]
comment: The term refers to the diagnosis of autism and is left for convenience. However, it is preferable to annotate the exact phenotypic abnormalities rather than merely the diagnostic category autism.
synonym: "Autism" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:408856003
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:408857007
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:43614003
xref: UMLS:C0004352
is_a: HP:0000729 ! Autistic behavior

[Term]
id: HP:0000718
name: Aggressive behavior
synonym: "سلوك عدواني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوانية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: سلوك أو فعل يهدف إلى إيذاء شخص أو حيوان أو ممتلكات مادية (مثل أعمال العنف البدني؛ الصراخ، السب، واستخدام لغة قاسية؛ إتلاف إطارات السيارات).
alt_id: HP:0006919
def: "Behavior or an act aimed at harming a person, animal, or physical property (e.g., acts of physical violence; shouting, swearing, and using harsh language; slashing someone's tires)." []
synonym: "Aggression" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Aggressive behavior" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Aggressiveness" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "physical aggression" RELATED layperson []
