[Term]
id: HP:0000722
name: Compulsive behaviors
synonym: "سلوكيات قهرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: سلوك يتكون من أفعال متكررة، يتم القيام بها نتيجة للشعور بضرورة تنفيذها، مع الوعي بأن هذه الأفعال لا تتماشى مع الأهداف العامة للشخص.
def: "Behavior that consists of repetitive acts, characterized by the feeling that one \"has to\" perform them, while being aware that these acts are not in line with one's overall goal." []
synonym: "Obsessive compulsive behavior" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
synonym: "Obsessive compulsive behaviour" EXACT uk_spelling [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
synonym: "Obsessive compulsive disorder" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
