[Term]
id: HP:0000723
name: Restrictive behavior
synonym: "سلوك مقيد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اهتمامات محدودة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: سلوك يتميز بالقيود غير الطبيعية على عدد قليل من الاهتمامات والأنشطة.
def: "Behavior characterized by an abnormal limitation to a few interests and activities." []
synonym: "Restricted behavior" EXACT []
synonym: "Restricted behaviour" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Restrictive behavior" EXACT []
synonym: "Restrictive behavior, interests, and activities" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
