comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في نظام الرينين-أنجيوتنسين.
alt_id: HP:0003350
def: "An abnormality of the renin-angiotensin system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The renin-angiotensin system is a hormone system that regulates blood pressure and water (fluid) balance.
synonym: "Abnormality of the renin-aldosterone axis" EXACT []
