synonym: "انتفاخ القص" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحناء خارجي غير طبيعي (بروز) في منطقة التقاء الأضلاع بالغضروف العضلي.
def: "Abnormal outward curving (protuberance) of the junction of ribs and costal cartilage." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The costochondral junction is the structure where the ribs articulate with the sternum.
