[Term]
id: HP:0000911
name: Flat glenoid fossa
synonym: "حفرة حقانية مسطحة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حفرة الكتف مسطحة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تكوين غير طبيعي مسطح للحفرة الحقانية، والمعروفة أيضاً بتجويف الحقاني، وهي السطح المفصلي للكتف الذي يتصل برأس العضد.
def: "Abnormally flat configuration of the glenoid fossa, also known as the glenoid cavity, which is the articular surface of the scapula that articulates with the head of the humerus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:15163819]
comment: See PMID:15163819, figure 2, for the arthrographic appearance of a flat glenoid fossa.
