alt_id: HP:0006620
def: "Abnormally increased size of the costochondral junctions, which are located between the distal part of the ribs and the costal cartilages, which are bars of hyaline cartilage that connect the ribs to the sternum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
