[Term]
id: HP:0000969
name: Edema
synonym: "وذمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "احتباس السوائل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تجمع غير طبيعي للسوائل تحت الجلد أو في تجويف أو أكثر في الجسم.
alt_id: HP:0000990
def: "An abnormal accumulation of fluid beneath the skin, or in one or more cavities of the body." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Edema may be related to one or more of the following factors: 1) increased capillary hydrostatic pressure, 2) decreased osmotic pressure of plasma, 3) decreased tissue tension and lymphatic drainage, 4) increased osmotic pressure of tissue fluids, and 5) increased capillary permeability.
synonym: "Dropsy" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
