[Term]
id: HP:0000992
name: Cutaneous photosensitivity
synonym: "حساسية ضوئية جلدية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حساسية من الشمس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة حساسية الجلد للضوء. قد يؤدي التعرض للشمس إلى ظهور طفح جلدي يسمى التحسس الضوئي. يمكن تشخيص الحساسية الضوئية من خلال اختبارات التصوير الضوئي.
alt_id: HP:0005594
alt_id: HP:0006831
alt_id: HP:0007538
def: "An increased sensitivity of the skin to light. Photosensitivity may result in a rash upon exposure to the sun (which is known as photodermatosis). Photosensitivity can be diagnosed by phototests in which light is shone on small areas of skin." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Photosensitive skin" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Photosensitive skin rashes" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Photosensitivity" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Sensitivity to sunlight" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Skin photosensitivity" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Sun sensitivity" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:90128006
xref: UMLS:C0349506
is_a: HP:0011354 ! Generalized abnormality of skin

[Term]
id: HP:0000993
name: Molluscoid pseudotumors
synonym: "أورام كاذبة مولسكوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عقد جلدية زرقاء رمادية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عقد مزرقة رمادية إسفنجية تظهر عادة على الندوب في مناطق الضغط ونقاط التعرض للرضوض مثل المرفقين والركبتين.
def: "Bluish-grey, spongy nodules associated with scars over pressure points and easily traumatized areas like the elbows and knees." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Molluscoid pseudotumor" EXACT []
