[Term]
id: HP:0001012
name: Multiple lipomas
synonym: "الورم الشحمي المتعدد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كتل دهنية متعددة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أورام شحمية متعددة (وهي نوع من الأنسجة الحميدة المكونة من نسيج دهني).
def: "The presence of multiple lipomas (a type of benign tissue made of fatty tissue)." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: A lipoma is a benign tumor composed of fatty tissue. They are the most common form of soft tissue tumor and are usually soft to the touch, movable, and generally painless (but there is a separate entity of painful multiple lipomas which is a hereditary disease called Dercum disease or adiposis dolorosa). Many lipomas are small (under one centimeter diameter) but can enlarge to sizes greater than six centimeters. Lipomas are commonly found in adults from 40 to 60 years of age, but can also be found in children.
synonym: "Lipomas" RELATED []
synonym: "Lipomata" EXACT []
synonym: "Lipomatosis" RELATED []
synonym: "Multiple fatty lumps" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: NCIT:C3192
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:404062002
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:46720004
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:93163002
xref: UMLS:C0023798
xref: UMLS:C0745730
is_a: HP:0012031 ! Lipomatous tumor

[Term]
id: HP:0001013
name: Eruptive xanthomas
synonym: "الورم الأصفر الانفجاري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نتوءات صفراء حمراء على الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التورمات الصفراء البرتقالية إلى البنية الحمراء، والتي غالباً ما تحاط بهالة حمامية وتظهر في مجموعات على الأرداف والأسطح الباسطة للأطراف والثنيات الانثناءية، مصحوبة بالحكة والألم بأشكال متفاوتة.
def: "Eruptive xanthomas are yellow-orange-to-red-brown papules that are often surrounded by an erythematous halo. They appear in crops on the buttocks, extensor surfaces of the extremities, and flexural creases. Acutely, variable amounts of pruritus and pain occur." [PMID:12165227, PMID:22375975]
comment: Eruptive xanthomas occur in the setting of chylomicronemia and hypertriglyceridemia.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:238952003
xref: UMLS:C0221252
is_a: HP:0000991 ! Xanthomatosis

[Term]
id: HP:0001014
name: Angiokeratoma
synonym: "التقران الوعائي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بقع حمراء داكنة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التقران الوعائي هو حويصلات مفرطة التقرن تُميزات نسيجياً بالأوعية الدموية السطحية المتوسعة مع تكاثر البشرة. تقدم سريرًا كبقعة صغيرة مرتفعة ذو لون أحمر داكن.
def: "Angiokeratomas are hyperkeratotic papules that are characterized histologically by superficial ectatic (i.e., dilated) blood vessels with epidermal proliferation. Clinically, angiokeratoma presents as a small, raised, dark-red spot." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:8993949]
comment: Angiokeratomas occur clinically as 1 of 5 different subtypes.
synonym: "Angiokeratomas" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:26810009
xref: UMLS:C0002985
is_a: HP:0011276 ! Vascular skin abnormality

