def: "A benign peripheral nerve sheath tumor that generally appears as a soft, skin-colored papule or small subcutaneous nodule. Individuals with neurofibromatosis can have numerous neurofibromas." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:30969529]
