[Term]
id: HP:0001081
name: Cholelithiasis
synonym: "حصى المرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حصى في المرارة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: رواسب صلبة تشبه الحصى تتكون داخل المرارة.
def: "Hard, pebble-like deposits that form within the gallbladder." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Gallstones range in size from as small as a grain of sand to as large as a golf ball. Cholesterol gallstones are the most common type of gallstone. Gallstones resulting from too much bilirubin in the bile are referred to as pigment stones.
