[Term]
id: HP:0001118
name: Juvenile cataract
synonym: "الساد اليفعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الساد في الطفولة أو الشباب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الساد لا يظهر عند الولادة ولكنه يظهر في الطفولة أو المراهقة.
def: "A type of cataract that is not apparent at birth but that arises in childhood or adolescence." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Juvenile cataracts are generally either hereditary (especially if bilateral) or due to trauma (especially if unilateral).
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:399336001
