[Term]
id: HP:0001141
name: Severely reduced visual acuity
synonym: "انخفاض شديد في حدة البصر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف شديد في الرؤية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض شديد في القدرة على الرؤية. يُعرف الانخفاض الشديد في مقياس حدة البصر بمسافة 6 أمتار بأنه أقل من 6/60 ولكن على الأقل 3/60. في مقياس حدة البصر لمسافة 20 قدمًا، يُعرف بأنه أقل من 20/200 ولكن على الأقل 20/400. في مقياس حدة البصر العشري، يُعرف بأنه أقل من 0.1 ولكن على الأقل 0.05.
alt_id: HP:0007640
alt_id: HP:0007842
alt_id: HP:0007951
alt_id: HP:0008023
def: "Severe reduction of the ability to see. On the 6m visual acuity scale, severe reduction is defined as less than 6/60 but at least 3/60. On the 20ft visual acuity scale, severe reduction is defined as less than 20/200 but at least 20/400. On the decimal visual acuity scale, severe reduction is defined as less than 0.1 but at least 0.05." [PMID:28779882]
synonym: "Marked vision impairment" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Severe reduction in visual acuity" EXACT []
synonym: "Severe vision loss" EXACT []
synonym: "Severe visual impairment" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Severe visual loss" EXACT []
synonym: "Severely impaired vision" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:397541004
xref: UMLS:C1301509
is_a: HP:0007663 ! Reduced visual acuity

