[Term]
id: HP:0001169
name: Broad palm
synonym: "راحة عريضة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "راحة اليد العريضة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: بالنسبة للأطفال من الولادة حتى سن 4 سنوات يكون عرض الراحة أكثر من 2 انحراف معياري فوق المتوسط؛ للأطفال من سن 4 إلى 16 سنة يكون عرض الراحة فوق المئين الخامس والتسعين؛ أو يظهر عرض الراحة بشكل غير متناسب مع الطول.
alt_id: HP:0001174
def: "For children from birth to 4 years of age the palm width is more than 2 SD above the mean; for children from 4 to 16 years of age the palm width is above the 95th centile; or, the width of the palm appears disproportionately wide for the length." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19125433]
comment: Hand width is measured across the palm at the level of the MCPJ (radial aspect of the second MCPJ to the ulnar aspect of the fifth MCPJ) [Hall et al., 2007]. Caution is advised with the subjective assessment as short metacarpals can mimic a broad palm. In persons with polydactyly that includes a supernumerary metacarpal, that should be separately coded and the measurement technique from Hall et al, [2007] would need to be modified to account for the supernumerary digit (i.e., with postaxial polydactyly, measure to the sixth MCPJ).
synonym: "Broad hand" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Broad hands" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Broad palm" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Wide palm" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:48251003
xref: UMLS:C0264142
is_a: HP:0100871 ! Abnormal palm morphology

