[Term]
id: HP:0001187
name: Hyperextensibility of the finger joints
synonym: "فرط تمددية مفاصل الأصابع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مرونة زائدة في مفاصل الأصابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: قدرة مفاصل الأصابع على التحرك خارج نطاق الحركة الطبيعي لها.
alt_id: HP:0006158
def: "The ability of the finger joints to move beyond their normal range of motion." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Finger joint hyperextensibility" EXACT layperson []
