[Term]
id: HP:0001402
name: Hepatocellular carcinoma
synonym: "سرطانة خلايا الكبد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "سرطان الكبد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الأورام في الكبد التي تنشأ من الخلايا الكبدية وتظهر مجهرية ككتلة ناعمة ونازفة بلون بني في الكبد.
alt_id: HP:0002899
alt_id: HP:0003007
alt_id: HP:0006750
def: "A kind of neoplasm of the liver that originates in hepatocytes and presents macroscopically as a soft and hemorrhagic tan mass in the liver." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Hepatocellular carcinoma may be associated with hepatitis B virus infection and cirrhosis or alcoholic cirrhosis.
synonym: "Increased hepatocellular carcinoma risk" RELATED []
synonym: "Increased incidence of hepatocellular carcinoma" RELATED []
