comment: Arabic Definition: وجود تضيق في صمام الشريان الأورطي.
alt_id: HP:0005140
def: "The presence of a stenosis (narrowing) of the aortic valve." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Aortic stenosis can lead to a pressure gradient between the left ventricle and the aorta and may result in left ventricular hypertrophy and decreased left ventricular compliance.
synonym: "Aortic stenosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Narrowing of aortic valve" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
