[Term]
id: HP:0001805
name: Onychogryphosis
synonym: "أونيكوغريفوسيس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ظفر سميك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أونيكوغريفوسيس هو اضطراب في نمو صفيحة الظفر يتميز سريريًا بزيادة في سمك اللوح الظفري بلون أصفر-بني قاتم مع زيادة نمو الكيراتين الزائد واستطالة وزيادة التقوس.
alt_id: HP:0001819
alt_id: HP:0200088
def: "Onychogryphosis is a disorder of nail plate growth that is clinically characterized by an opaque, yellow-brown thickening of the nail plate with associated gross hyperkeratosis, elongation, and increased curvature." [PMID:19125433, PMID:30410908, PMID:33021642]
comment: There is a build up of keratin causing the nail plate to lift away from the nail bed. The thickened nail plate is usually very hard. Onychauxis and onychogryposis are dystrophic diseases of the nail in which the nail plate becomes decidedly hypertrophied. The differentiation of the two entities is only one of degree of severity. The spelling onychogryposis is occasionally used but it is not correct.
synonym: "Dystrophic thickened nails" EXACT []
synonym: "Onychogryposis" EXACT []
synonym: "Thick nail" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Thickened nails" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:52897009
xref: UMLS:C0263537
is_a: HP:0001597 ! Abnormal nail morphology

