synonym: "انخفاض في العدد الكلي للعدلات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض في عدد العدلات في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في عدد العدلات في الدم لكل ميكروليتر مقارنة بالمرجعية المناسبة للجنس والفئة العمرية.
alt_id: HP:0005515
alt_id: HP:0005533
def: "Abnormal decrease of absolute number of neutrophils in the blood, per microlitre, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:25642312]
comment: Mild neutropenia is defined as an absolute neutrophil count of less than 1500 cells per microliter of blood, moderate less than 1000 cells per microliter of blood and, and severe is less than 500 cells per microliter of blood.
synonym: "Low blood neutrophil count" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Low neutrophil count" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Neutropenia" EXACT []
synonym: "Neutropoenia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Peripheral neutropenia" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:165517008
xref: UMLS:C0853697
