[Term]
id: HP:0001902
name: Giant platelets
synonym: "صفائح ضخمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صفائح دموية كبيرة الحجم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الصفائح الضخمة تفوق حجمها 7 ميكرومترات وعادة ما تكون من 10 إلى 20 ميكرومتر. يُستخدم مصطلح الصفائح الضخمة عندما يكون حجم الصفيحة أكبر من حجم خلية الدم الحمراء المتوسطة في المجال.
def: "Giant platelets are larger than 7 micrometers and usually 10 to 20 micrometers. The term giant platelet is used when the platelet is larger than the size of the average red cell in the field. (Description adapted from College of American Pathologists, Hematology Manual, 1998)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This phenotype may be present in myelodysplastic or myeloproliferative diseases and autoimmune thrombocytopenia (associated with severe leukemoid reactions). It may also be present in inherited diseases such as Bernard-Soulier syndrome or May-Hegglin anomaly.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:44687006
