[Term]
id: HP:0001924
name: Sideroblastic anemia
synonym: "فقر الدم الحديدي الارتباط" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقر دم بسبب خلل نقل الحديد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينتج فقر الدم الحديدي الارتباط من خلل في إدماج الحديد في جزئ الهيم. يعتبر السايدروبلاست هو كريه حمراء تحتوي على ترسبات حديد قابلة للتلوين في السيتوبلازم (يمكن إظهار ذلك بتلوين الأزرق البروسي).
alt_id: HP:0100791
def: "Sideroblastic anemia results from a defect in the incorporation of iron into the heme molecule. A sideroblast is an erythroblast that has stainable deposits of iron in cytoplasm (this can be demonstrated by Prussian blue staining)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Sideroblastic anemia may be either congenital or acquired. In sideroblastic anemia, the hematocrit tends to be around 20 to 30 percent, and the mean corpuscular volume is normal or low.
synonym: "Hypersideremic anaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Hypersideremic anemia" EXACT []
synonym: "Sideroblastic anaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
