def: "Acidosis owing to malfunction of the kidney tubules with accumulation of metabolic acids and hyperchloremia, potentially leading to complications including hypokalemia, hypercalcinuria, nephrolithiasis and nephrocalcinosis." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Accumulation of acid in body due to kidney problem" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
