comment: Arabic Definition: أي شذوذ في فروة الرأس، وهي الجلد والأنسجة تحت الجلد في الرأس التي ينمو عليها شعر الرأس.
def: "Any anomaly of the scalp, the skin an subcutaneous tissue of the head on which head hair grows." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The scalp of the head has the following five layers: 1) skin and head hair; 2) connective tissue; 3) the aponeurosis (a layer of dense fibrous tissue); 4) loose areolar connective tissue; and 5) the periosteum of the skull bones.
