name: Reduced lymphocyte surface expression of CD43
synonym: "انخفاض في التعبير السطحي للـ CD43 في الخلايا اللمفاوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض في بروتين الدم على سطح الخلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في تعبير CD43 على سطح خلايا الخلايا اللمفاوية.
def: "A reduction in the expression of CD43 on the cell surface of lymphocytes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: CD43 is a cell-surface sialoglycoprotein that is expressed, typically at high levels, on all leukocytes except most resting B lymphocytes.
synonym: "Cd43 defectively expressed on surface of blood cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced lymphocyte surface expression of sialophorin" EXACT []
