[Term]
id: HP:0002046
name: Heat intolerance
synonym: "عدم تحمل الحرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدم القدرة على الحفاظ على درجة حرارة الجسم مريحة في الطقس الحار أو الدافئ.
def: "The inability to maintain a comfortable body temperature in warm or hot weather." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Heat intolerance tends to produce a feeling of being overheated and profuse diaphoresis (sweating). Many, but not all, cases of heat intolerance are related to thyrotoxicosis.
