[Term]
id: HP:0002091
name: Restrictive ventilatory defect
synonym: "خلل تهوية تقييدي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تصلب في الرئة أو جدار الصدر يسبب تقليل حجم الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيب وظيفي يتميز بانخفاض السعة الكلية للرئة (TLC) وليس مرتبطًا باضطرابات في تدفق الزفير أو مقاومة المجاري التنفسية. يُعرف العيب التقييدي عن طريق قياسات معينة مثل FEV1 وFVC أقل من 80 في المئة. قد يكون مرض الرئة التقييدي ناتجًا عن تغيرات في نسج الرئة أو بسبب مرض في الجنب، جدار الصدر، أو الجهاز العصبي العضلي.
alt_id: HP:0002111
def: "A functional defect characterized by reduced total lung capacity (TLC) not associated with abnormalities of expiratory airflow or airway resistance. Spirometrically, a restrictive defect is defined as FEV1 (forced expiratory volume in 1 second) and FVC (forced vital capacity) less than 80 per cent. Restrictive lung disease may be caused by alterations in lung parenchyma or because of a disease of the pleura, chest wall, or neuromuscular apparatus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4546-6667, PMID:28194273]
comment: The most commonly used term for this feature is restrictive lung disease, but we choose the term Restrictive ventilatory defect to emphasize that this term refers to a phenotypic feature rather than a disease entity.
synonym: "Restrictive deficit on pulmonary function testing" EXACT []
synonym: "Restrictive deficit on pulmonary function tests" EXACT []
synonym: "Restrictive lung disease" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Restrictive respiratory disease" EXACT []
synonym: "Restrictive respiratory insufficiency" EXACT []
synonym: "Restrictive respiratory syndrome" EXACT []
synonym: "Spirometric restriction" EXACT []
synonym: "Stiff lung or chest wall causing decreased lung volume" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:36485005
xref: UMLS:C0085581
xref: UMLS:C3277226
is_a: HP:0030878 ! Abnormality on pulmonary function testing

[Term]
id: HP:0002092
name: Pulmonary arterial hypertension
synonym: "ارتفاع ضغط الدم الشرياني الرئوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع ضغط الدم في أوعية الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يُعرف ارتفاع ضغط الدم الرئوي بأنه ضغط الشريان الرئوي المتوسط بمقدار 25 ملم زئبقي أو أكثر وضغط إسفين شعري رئوي يبلغ 15 ملم زئبقي أو أقل عند قياسه عن طريق قسطرة القلب الأيمن في حالة الراحة وعلى الوضع المستلقي.
alt_id: HP:0006546
def: "Pulmonary hypertension is defined mean pulmonary artery pressure of 25mmHg or more and pulmonary capillary wedge pressure of 15mmHg or less when measured by right heart catheterisation at rest and in a supine position." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Pulmonary hypertension can be secondary to known cardiac, pulmonary, or hepatic disease. If no cause is identifiable, the term primary pulmonary hypertension is used.
synonym: "Increased blood pressure in blood vessels of lungs" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
synonym: "Primary pulmonary hypertension" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Pulmonary artery hypertension" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:11399002
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:697898008
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:70995007
xref: UMLS:C0020542
xref: UMLS:C2973725
xref: UMLS:C3203102
is_a: HP:0033578 ! Pre-capillary pulmonary hypertension

