[Term]
id: HP:0002098
name: Respiratory distress
synonym: "ضائقة تنفسية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبات التنفس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشير الضائقة التنفسية إلى الأعراض الجسدية أو العاطفية الناجمة عن صعوبة التنفس، والتي تظهر عادة بصعوبة في التنفس أو الشعور بضيق في التنفس.
alt_id: HP:0002880
def: "Respiratory distress is objectively observable as the physical or emotional consequences from the experience of dyspnea. The physical presentation of respiratory distress is generally referred to as labored breathing, while the sensation of respiratory distress is called shortness of breath or dyspnea." []
synonym: "Breathing difficulties" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Labored breathing" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Laboured breathing" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Respiratory difficulties" EXACT []
