[Term]
id: HP:0002266
name: Focal clonic seizure
synonym: "النوبة التشنجية البؤرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التشنجات البؤرية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: النوبة التشنجية البؤرية هي نوع من النوبات الحركية البؤرية التي تتميز بارتعاش مستمر وريتمي منتظم.
def: "A focal clonic seizure is a type of focal motor seizure characterized by sustained rhythmic jerking, that is regularly repetitive." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178, PMID:11580774, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
comment: The movement involves sustained rhythmic jerking, this may involve a limb, half the face or one side of the body, and may spread according to a Jacksonian march: The jerking may spread to involve parts of the body according to their representation on the motor cortex (according to the homunculus).
synonym: "Focal clonic seizures" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Localised clonic seizure" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Localized clonic seizure" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Partial clonic seizure" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Segmental clonic seizure" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C0752323
