[Term]
id: HP:0002322
name: Resting tremor
synonym: "الرعاش أثناء الراحة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "رعشة أثناء الراحة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الرعاش أثناء الراحة يحدث عندما تكون العضلات في حالة راحة ويصبح أقل وضوحًا أو يختفي عند تحريك العضلات المصابة. عادة ما يكون الرعاش أثناء الراحة بطيئًا وخشنًا.
def: "A resting tremor occurs when muscles are at rest and becomes less noticeable or disappears when the affected muscles are moved. Resting tremors are often slow and coarse." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:22675666]
comment: Resting tremor vanishes with active movement, but typically reappears after a few seconds when the arms are held outstretched (reemergent tremor). In Parkinson disease, rest tremor frequency is usually in the low to mid-range (3-6 Hz), and the amplitude is quite variable, from less than 1 cm to over 10 cm in width.
synonym: "Parkinsonian tremor" RELATED []
synonym: "Rest tremor" EXACT []
synonym: "Resting tremor" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Tremor at rest" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:25082004
xref: UMLS:C0234379
is_a: HP:0001337 ! Tremor

[Term]
id: HP:0002323
name: Anencephaly
synonym: "اللا دماغية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشوه في الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اللا دماغية هي شذوذ تطوري يتميز بجنين لا يمتلك القحف، مع نقص في معظم أو كل أنسجة الدماغ للجنين. تنتمي اللا دماغية إلى مجموعة تعرف بعيوب الأنبوب العصبي ناتجة عن فشل الأنبوب العصبي في الانغلاق في نهايته الأمامية خلال التطور الجيني.
def: "Anencephaly is a developmental anomaly characterized by a fetus that has no calvarium, with a lack of most or all of the fetus' brain tissue. Anencephaly belongs to a collective group known as neural tube defects (NTD) and is a result of the neural tube failing to close in its rostral end during fetal development." [PMID:31424828, PMID:32706613]
comment: See Figure 3 of PMID:32706613.
synonym: "Embryonic anencephaly" EXACT []
synonym: "Fetal anencephaly" EXACT []
synonym: "Foetal anencephaly" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: Fyler:4332
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:89369001
xref: UMLS:C0002902
is_a: HP:0007364 ! Aplasia/Hypoplasia of the cerebrum
is_a: HP:0034237 ! Open neural tube defect

[Term]
id: HP:0002324
name: Hydranencephaly
synonym: "استسقاء الدماغ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في نمو الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو خلل في نمو الدماغ يتميز باستبدال أجزاء كبيرة من نصفي كرة الدماغ والنواة المخططية بالسائل النخاعي والأنسجة الدبقية.
def: "A defect of development of the brain characterized by replacement of greater portions of the cerebral hemispheres and the corpus striatum by cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) and glial tissue." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Hydrancephaly" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:30023002
xref: UMLS:C0020225
is_a: HP:0002323 ! Anencephaly

