def: "A tremor present when the limbs are active, either when outstretched in a certain position or throughout a voluntary movement." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Action tremor occurs with voluntary contraction of muscle. Subforms of action tremor include postural, isometric, and kinetic tremors
