name: Focal aware seizure
synonym: "نوبة بؤرية مع وعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من النوبات التي تبدأ بؤريًا حيث يتم الحفاظ على الوعي. يُعرف الوعي أثناء النوبة بأن المريض يكون مدركاً تماماً لنفسه وبيئته طوال مدة النوبة، حتى لو كان غير قادر على الحركة.
def: "A type of focal-onset seizure in which awareness is preserved. Awareness during a seizure is defined as the patient being fully aware of themself and their environment throughout the seizure, even if immobile." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276062, PMID:28276064]
comment: In the previous (1981) ILAE classification of seizure types, the term 'simple partial seizure' was used to denote a focal aware seizure. Awareness during a seizure is defined as the patient being fully aware of themself and their environment throughout the seizure, even if immobile. If awareness is preserved throughout, then the seizure is a focal aware seizure. Previously the terms simple partial was used to describe focal aware seizures.
synonym: "Focal aware seizures" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Focal seizure with retained awareness" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal seizure without impairment of awareness" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal seizure without impairment of consciousness or awareness" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal seizures without impairment of consciousness or awareness" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Partial seizure with retained awareness" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial seizure without impairment of awareness" EXACT []
synonym: "Simple partial seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Simple partial seizures" EXACT plural_form []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:117891000119100
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:79348005
xref: UMLS:C0234974
is_a: HP:0007359 ! Focal-onset seizure

