[Term]
id: HP:0002375
name: Hypokinesia
synonym: "نقص الحركة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص الحركة في العضلات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نشاط حركي منخفض بصورة غير طبيعية. بخلاف الشلل، فإن نقص الحركة لا يتميز بنقص القوة الحركية، بل بنقص الحركات. الحركات الاعتيادية مثل (طي الذراعين أو تقاطع الساقين) تقل في التكرار.
alt_id: HP:0002603
alt_id: HP:0006795
def: "Abnormally diminished motor activity. In contrast to paralysis, hypokinesia is not characterized by a lack of motor strength, but rather by a poverty of movement. The typical habitual movements (e.g., folding the arms, crossing the legs) are reduced in frequency." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Decreased muscle movement" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Decreased spontaneous movement" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Decreased spontaneous movements" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:255385008
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:43994002
xref: UMLS:C0086439
is_a: HP:0002374 ! Diminished movement

