synonym: "حركات زائدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: النشاط الحركي المفرط مع حركة زائدة للعضلات في الجسم ككل.
def: "Motor hyperactivity with excessive movement of muscles of the body as a whole." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Hyperactive movements" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Hyperkinesia" EXACT []
synonym: "Hyperkinesis" EXACT []
