[Term]
id: HP:0002664
name: Neoplasm
synonym: "ورم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كتلة غير طبيعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في أحد الأعضاء أو جهاز نظامي يتكون من تكاثر الخلايا بشكل غير منضبط ومستقل، ويمكن أن يحدث في أي جزء من الجسم كونه ورم حميد أو خبيث.
alt_id: HP:0003008
alt_id: HP:0006741
def: "An organ or organ-system abnormality that consists of uncontrolled autonomous cell-proliferation which can occur in any part of the body as a benign or malignant neoplasm (tumor)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The World Health Organization (WHO) classifies neoplasms into four main groups: (i) benign neoplasm, (ii) in situ neoplasm, (iii) malignant neoplasm, and (iv) neoplasm of uncertain or unknown behavior. A malignant neoplasm is also known as cancer.
synonym: "Abnormal tissue mass" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
synonym: "Cancer" RELATED layperson []
synonym: "Neoplasia" EXACT []
synonym: "Oncological abnormality" EXACT []
synonym: "Oncology" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Tumor" EXACT []
synonym: "Tumour" EXACT []
