synonym: "J-shaped sella" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Omega shaped hypophysial fossa" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Omega shaped pituitary fossa" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
