[Term]
id: HP:0002683
name: Abnormal calvaria morphology
synonym: "شذوذ مورفولوجيا الجدارية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شذوذ في الجزء العلوي من الجمجمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في التركيب (الشكل) للعظم الجداري، وهو الجزء العلوي من الجمجمة الذي يتكون من أجزاء العظم الجبهي والجدار القذالي والجداري ويغطي تجويف الدماغ.
alt_id: HP:0002648
def: "Abnormality of the morphology (structure) of the calvaria (skullcap), that is, of that part of the skull that is made up of the superior portions of the frontal bone, occipital bone, and parietal bones and covers the cranial cavity that contains the brain." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The calvaria, or skull cap, is the upper part of the skull (cranium) and comprises the frontal, occipital and right and left parietal bones. Occasionally, calvaria is misspelled as 'calvarium' in the medical literature.
synonym: "Abnormality of calvarium" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of cranial vault" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of cranium" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of the calvaria" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the shape of calvarium" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the skull cap" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of the skullcap" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
