[Term]
id: HP:0002725
name: Systemic lupus erythematosus
synonym: "الذئبة الحمامية الجهازية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الذئبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب مزمن، متكرر، التهابي ومصاحب للحمى في بعض الأحيان، يصيب العديد من أنظمة الجسم، يتميز بشكل رئيسي بمشاركة الجلد والمفاصل والكلى والأغشية المصليّة.
def: "A chronic, relapsing, inflammatory, and often febrile multisystemic disorder of connective tissue, characterized principally by involvement of the skin, joints, kidneys, and serosal membranes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This is a bundled term that describes a disease rather than a phenotypic feature, but is left for convenience for annotations of lupus conceived of as a feature of another disease.
synonym: "SLE" EXACT abbreviation []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:55464009
xref: UMLS:C0024141
is_a: HP:0002960 ! Autoimmunity

