[Term]
id: HP:0002843
name: Abnormal T cell morphology
synonym: "شذوذ شكل الخلايا التائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في الخلايا التائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة أو نقصان غير طبيعي في العدد الكلي أو جزء محدد من الخلايا التائية. تُعتبر الخلايا التائية عادةً خلايا لمفاوية CD3+ أو أنواعها الفرعية في الدم، مقارنة بنطاق مرجعي لجنس وعمر معين، ويُقاس خارج الجسم الحي. ويمكن أن تشمل كلًا من خلايا TCR ألفا/بيتا وغاما/دلتا.
alt_id: HP:0002734
alt_id: HP:0030332
alt_id: HP:0030333
def: "Abnormal increase or decrease of total or subset T cell count. T cells are commonly characterized as CD3+ lymphocytes, or their subpopulations, in the blood, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group, measured ex vivo. These may include both TCR alpha/beta and gamma/delta T cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: T-cells are lymphocytes whose principle function in the adaptive immune system is to mediate cell-mediated immunity.
synonym: "Abnormal T cells" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Abnormality of T cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Cellular immune defect" EXACT []
synonym: "Defective cellular immunity" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1855752
is_a: HP:0004332 ! Abnormal lymphocyte morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0002845
