is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: HP:0002851

[Term]
id: HP:0002846
name: Abnormal B cell morphology
synonym: "شذوذ شكل الخلايا البائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في الخلايا البائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ هيكلي في الخلايا البائية.
def: "A structural abnormality of B cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:18725575]
comment: B cells are bursal or bone marrow-derived lymphocytes whose principle function in the adaptive immune system is to make antibodies against antigens. A simple definition of B lymphocytes is a population of cells that express clonally diverse cell surface immunoglobulin (Ig) receptors recognizing specific antigenic epitopes. Over 10 B cell-specific cell surface molecules have been identified by monoclonal antibodies, including CD19, which is considered a pan-B cell and possibly follicular dendritic cell marker, and CD20, which is considered to be a marker for mature B cells.
synonym: "Abnormal B cells" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Abnormality of B cells" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021748
is_a: HP:0004332 ! Abnormal lymphocyte morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0002847
name: Impaired memory B cell generation
synonym: "ضعف تكوين خلايا الذاكرة B" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إنتاج غير كاف لخلايا الذاكرة، وهي الخلايا B التي تبقى لسنوات أو مدى الحياة وتوفر استجابة سريعة ومحسنة للتحديات الثانوية.
def: "Impaired production of memory cells, the B cells that persist for years or an entire lifetime and which confer rapid and enhanced response to secondary challenge." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4025672
is_a: HP:0005372 ! Abnormal B cell physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0002848
name: Decreased specific anti-polysaccharide antibody level
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى الأجسام المضادة الخاصة ضد السكريات المتعددة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض الأجسام المضادة ضد البكتيريا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود مستويات طبيعية عامة من الجلوبولين المناعي مع نقص في الأجسام المضادة المخصوصة الموجهة ضد السكريات المتعددة البكتيرية.
def: "The presence of normal overall immunoglobulin levels with deficiency of specific immunoglobulins directed against bacterial polysaccharides." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Specific anti-polysaccharide antibody deficiency is associated with an increased risk of infection with Streptococcus pneumoniae, Haemophilus influenzae type b, and Staphylococcus aureus.
synonym: "Depressed antibody response to polysaccharide antigens" EXACT []
synonym: "Low specific anti-polysaccharide antibody titer" EXACT []
synonym: "Specific anti-polysaccharide antibody deficiency" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021747
is_a: HP:0012475 ! Decreased circulating level of specific antibody

[Term]
id: HP:0002849
name: Absence of lymph node germinal center
synonym: "غياب مركز الحوصلة في العقد اللمفاوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "غياب أجزاء مهمة في العقد اللمفاوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدم وجود مراكز الحوصلة في العقد اللمفاوية. مراكز الحوصلة هي الأجزاء الموجودة في العقد اللمفاوية حيث تتكاثر وتتمايز الخلايا اللمفاوية البائية وتتحور من خلال طفرات سوماوية وانتقال الفئة خلال استجابات الأجسام المضادة.
def: "Absence of germinal centers in lymph nodes. Germinal centers are the parts of lymph nodes in which B lymphocytes proliferate, differentiate, mutate through somatic hypermutation and class switch during antibody responses." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Absence of lymph node germinal centre" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Lymph nodes lack germinal center" EXACT []
synonym: "Lymph nodes lack germinal centre" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Lymphoid germinal center defect" EXACT []
synonym: "Lymphoid germinal centre defect" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: UMLS:C1847383
is_a: HP:0002733 ! Abnormal lymph node morphology

