def: "Widening of the ilium ala, that is of the wing of the ilium, combined with external rotation, leading to a flared appearance of the iliac wing." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:28744080]
comment: See Figure 4A of PMID:28744080.
