def: "Episodes of very rapid breathing." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Hyperpnea, episodic" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C3806218
is_a: HP:0002789 ! Tachypnea

[Term]
id: HP:0002877
name: Nocturnal hypoventilation
synonym: "نقص التهوية الليلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف التنفس أثناء النوم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في التهوية السنخية يحدث أثناء النوم. يتميز هذا الاضطراب بزيادة نسبة ثاني أكسيد الكربون في الدم.
def: "An abnormal reduction in alveolar ventilation occurring during sleep. This is characterized by a rise in arterial carbon dioxide." [PMID:20308760]
synonym: "Hypoventilation during sleep" EXACT []
synonym: "Nocturnal hypopnea" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Nocturnal slow breathing" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Nocturnal under breathing" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
xref: UMLS:C1843643
is_a: HP:0002791 ! Hypoventilation

[Term]
id: HP:0002878
name: Respiratory failure
synonym: "فشل تنفسي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عجز التنفس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل حاد من قصور التنفس يتميز بعدم كفاية عملية تبديل الغازات مما يؤدي إلى عدم القدرة على المحافظة على مستويات الأكسجين أو ثاني أكسيد الكربون ضمن الحدود الطبيعية.
alt_id: HP:0004877
def: "A severe form of respiratory insufficiency characterized by inadequate gas exchange such that the levels of oxygen or carbon dioxide cannot be maintained within normal limits." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Respiratory failure is classified as type 1 with hypoxemia (arterial partial pressure of oxygen less than 60 mmHg) without hypercapnea, and type 2 with hypoxemia in the present of hypercapnea (partial pressure of carbon dioxide over 50 mmHg).
synonym: "Respiratory failure" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:409622000
xref: UMLS:C1145670
is_a: HP:0002093 ! Respiratory insufficiency

[Term]
id: HP:0002879
name: Anisospondyly
synonym: "التفاوت الفقاري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تفاوت حجم الفقرات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في تباين حجم أجسام الفقرات.
def: "Abnormally increased variability of the size of the vertebral bodies." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
