def: "The occurrence of an immune reaction against the organism's own cells or tissues." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Autoimmune condition" EXACT []
synonym: "Autoimmune disease" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Autoimmune disorder" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Autoimmunity" EXACT layperson []
