[Term]
id: HP:0003102
name: Increased carrying angle
synonym: "زيادة زاوية الحِمل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة زاوية الذراع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في زاوية الحِمل، وهي الزاوية التي تتماشى مع المحور الطويل للزند كما هو موضح عند تواجده جانبيًا محور الذراع.
def: "An abnormal increase in the carrying angle, which is the angle he long axis of the extended forearm as it lies lateral to the long axis of the arm." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:18506557]
comment: Anatomically, the carrying angle in human adults is approximately 10 degrees in men and 13 degrees in women. Increasing the carrying angle may lead to elbow instability and pain during exercise or in throwing activities of sports, may reduce function of elbow flexion, predispose to risk of elbow dislocation, and increase evidence of elbow fracture when falling on the outstretched hand and fracture of the distal humeral epiphysis.
xref: UMLS:C1855478
is_a: HP:0020301 ! Abnormal elbow physiology

