[Term]
id: HP:0003210
name: Decreased methylmalonyl-CoA mutase activity
synonym: "نشاط منخفض لإنزيم مثيل مالونيل-كو إيه ميوتيز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض نشاط إنزيم مثيل مالونيل-كو إيه ميوتيز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو اضطراب في أيض دورة كريبس يتميز بانخفاض معدل نشاط إنزيم مثيل مالونيل-كو إيه ميوتيز.
def: "An abnormality of Krebs cycle metabolism that is characterized by a decreased rate of methylmalonyl-CoA mutase activity." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The product of the enzyme, succinyl-CoA, is a key molecule of the TCA (Krebs) cycle. The substrate of the enzyme, methylmalonyl-CoA, is primarily derived from propionyl-CoA, a substance formed from the catabolism of isoleucine, valine, threonine, methionine, thymine, uracil, cholesterol, or odd-chain fatty acids.
synonym: "Decreased methylmalonyl CoA mutase activity" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1848579
is_a: HP:0000816 ! Abnormality of Krebs cycle metabolism

