comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تكسر الكروموسومات في الخلايا الليمفاوية الدموية المزروعة أو خلايا أخرى بسبب علاجها بعوامل متشابكة للحمض النووي مثل دايبوكسبيوتان وميتومايسين C.
def: "Increased amount of chromosomal breaks in cultured blood lymphocytes or other cells induced by treatment with DNA cross-linking agents such as diepoxybutane and mitomycin C." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: Increased tendency to chromosomal breakage induced by crosslinking agents is typical for the various forms of Fanconi anemia.
synonym: "Chromosomal breakage induced by diepoxybutane" EXACT []
synonym: "Chromosomal breakage induced by mitomycin C" EXACT []
