def: "An abnormal decrease in orotidine 5'-phosphate decarboxylase level." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:gcarletti]
comment: The enzyme orotidine-5-prime-phosphate decarboxylase (EC 4.1.1.23) catalyzes the reaction H(+) + orotidine 5'-phosphate = CO(2) + UMP (uridine monophosphate). The enzyme is thusinvolved in pyrimidine biosynthesis.
