[Term]
id: HP:0003304
name: Spondylolysis
synonym: "انحلال الفقار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كسر في العمود الفقري" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحلال الفقار هو عيب عظمي في الجزء بين المفاصل، يعتقد أنه كسر تطوري أو مكتسب ناتج عن صدمات مزمنة منخفضة الدرجة.
def: "Spondylolysis is an osseous defect of the pars interarticularis, thought to be a developmental or acquired stress fracture secondary to chronic low-grade trauma." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20440613]
comment: The pars interarticularis is one of the bony bridges that connect the upper with the lower facet joints of the vertebra. Lumbar spondylolysis is a common cause of lower back pain. The vast majority of cases of spondylolysis occur at the L5 or L4 levels, and is usually diagnosed radiographically. Over half of patients affected by spondylolysis have associated spondylolisthesis.
subset: hposlim_core
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:240221008
xref: UMLS:C0038018
is_a: HP:0000925 ! Abnormality of the vertebral column

