id: HP:0003348
name: Hyperalaninemia
synonym: "فرط الألانين في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة الألانين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تركيز الألانين في الدم.
def: "An increased concentration of alanine in the blood." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:gcarletti, PMID:16902722, PMID:4696900]
comment: This class referring to the clinical feature Hyperalaninemia and not to the disease entry. Normal alanine blood levels are around 350-400 micromole per liter.
synonym: "Increased blood alanine" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Increased serum alanine" EXACT layperson []
