def: "An abnormality of amino acid metabolism characterized by a decreased level of propionyl-CoA carboxylase." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Propionyl-CoA is an important intermediate in the metabolism of several amino acids and is also produced by oxidation of odd-numbered fatty acids.
