alt_id: HP:0007320
alt_id: HP:0007322
def: "A loss of myelinated nerve fibers in the peripheral nervous system (in general, this finding can be observed on nerve biopsy)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This finding can be demonstrated by nerve biopsy.
synonym: "Decreased number of large and small myelinated fibers" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased number of large and small myelinated fibres" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Decreased number of peripheral myelinated nerve fibres" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Loss of myelinated fibers" EXACT []
synonym: "Loss of myelinated fibres" EXACT uk_spelling []
