[Term]
id: HP:0003383
name: Onion bulb formation
synonym: "تكوين بصيلات البصل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تؤدي الحلقات المتكررة من إزالة الميالين وإعادة الميالين إلى تراكم الخلايا الشوانية الزائدة حول المحاور العصبية، ويُشير إلى هذا بتكوين بصيلات البصل. يؤثر هذا الاكتشاف على الأعصاب المحيطية.
alt_id: HP:0003389
alt_id: HP:0007013
alt_id: HP:0007022
alt_id: HP:0007084
alt_id: HP:0008276
def: "Repeated episodes of segmental demyelination and remyelination lead to the accumulation of supernumerary Schwann cells around axons, which is referred to as onion bulb formation. This finding affects peripheral nerves." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This feature is characteristic of chronic demyelinating neuropathies as well as certain hereditary neuropathies. Onion-bulb formation may be observed in electron microscopic examinations of peripheral nerve biopsy material. Often, this examination is performed on the sural nerve.
synonym: "Onion bulb formations" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: UMLS:C1847906
is_a: HP:0003130 ! Abnormal peripheral myelination

