id: HP:0003484
name: Upper limb muscle weakness
synonym: "ضعف عضلات الأطراف العلوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف في عضلات الذراع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ضعف في عضلات الذراعين.
def: "Weakness of the muscles of the arms." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Decreased arm strength" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
synonym: "Weak arm" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
