[Term]
id: HP:0003524
name: Decreased methionine synthase activity
synonym: "نشاط الميثيونين سينثاز المنخفض" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في نشاط الميثيونين سينثاز.
def: "A reduction in methionine synthase activity." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Cobalamin-dependent methionine synthase catalyzes the transfer of a methyl group from N5-methyltetrahydrofolate to homocysteine, producing tetrahydrofolate and methionine, i.e., (6S)-5-methyl-5,6,7,8-tetrahydrofolate + L-homocysteine = (6S)-5,6,7,8-tetrahydrofolate + L-methionine.
synonym: "Decreased activity of methionine synthase" EXACT []
synonym: "Methionine synthase activity decreased" EXACT []
synonym: "Methionine synthase deficiency" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced methionine synthase activity" EXACT []
