def: "An abnormal reduction in xanthine dehydrogenase level." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This enzyme is on the purine degradation pathway and catalzyes the reaction xanthine + NAD+ + H2O = urate + NADH + H+.
synonym: "Xanthine dehydrogenase deficiency" RELATED []
