def: "An increased amount of 3-methylglutaconic acid in the urine." []
comment: 3-methylglutaconic aciduria describes five different disorders that impair mitochondrial function and resulting in buildup of 3-methylglutaconic acid and 3-methylglutaric acid and consequent increased excretion in the urine.
