synonym: "زيادة مستوى الإيدورونات-سلفاتاز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة إنزيم في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة نشاط إنزيم الإيدورونات-2-سلفاتاز في الدم.
def: "An increased level of iduronate-2-sulfatase activity in the blood." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Iduronate-2-sulfatase is required for the lysosomal degradation of heparan sulfate and dermatan sulfate. Mutations in this X-chromosome gene are associated with Mucopolysaccharidosis Type II. Increased serum iduronate-2-sulfatase is observed in mucolipidosis II alpha/beta.
