def: "An abnormally increased number of mitochondria in the cytoplasma adjacent to the sarcolemma (muscle cell membrane), whereby the mitochondria also possess an abnormal morphology." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This finding can be demonstrated by electron microscopy. This finding is typical of mitochondrial myopathies.
