[Term]
id: HP:0003596
name: Middle age onset
synonym: "بداية في منتصف العمر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من بداية البالغين حيث تبدأ الأعراض في سن 40 إلى 60 عاماً.
def: "A type of adult onset with onset of symptoms at the age of 40 to 60 years." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Middle age is of course not amenable to precise definitions. We suggest using this term for onset of disease symptoms between the age of 40 and 60 years.
