def: "The presence of foam cells, a type of macrophage that localizes to fatty deposits on blood vessel walls, in the central nervous system." []
xref: UMLS:C1843373
is_a: HP:0003651 ! Foam cells

[Term]
id: HP:0003641
name: Hemoglobinuria
synonym: "دم في البول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود دم بالبول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود الهيموجلوبين الحر في البول.
def: "The presence of free hemoglobin in the urine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: If, following hemolysis, haptoglobins (hemoglobin-binding proteins) are saturated, then free hemoglobin appears in the urine.
synonym: "Haemoglobin in urine" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Hemoglobin in urine" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:68600005
xref: UMLS:C0019048
is_a: HP:0033354 ! Abnormal urine metabolite level

[Term]
id: HP:0003642
name: Type I transferrin isoform profile
synonym: "نوع I من بروتين الترانسفيرين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوع غير طبيعي من الترانسفيرين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع غير طبيعي من بروتين الترانسفيرين يتمثل في اضطراب خلقي في التحلل السكري من النوع الأول. في التسمية التقليدية لأمراض التحلل السكري الخلقية، يُشار إلى غياب السكريات الكاملة بالنوع الأول، وفقدان واحد أو أكثر من السكريات الأحادية بالنوع الثاني.
def: "Abnormal transferrin isoform profile consistent with a type I congenital disorder of glycosylation. In the traditional nomenclature for congenital disorders of glycosylation, absence of entire glycans was designated type I, and loss of one or more monosaccharides as type II." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:15105360, PMID:22516080]
comment: There are several methods in use with which this feature can be diagnosed. Using HPLC analysis an increased asialo- and disialotransferrin and reduced tetrasialotransferrin are observed. Using immunoaffinity column analysis, the mono-oligosaccharide/di-oligosaccharide transferrin ratio, and/or the a-oligosaccharide/di-oligosaccharide transferrin ratio are abnormal.
synonym: "Abnormal isoelectric focusing of serum transferrin, type I pattern" EXACT []
synonym: "Isoelectric focusing of serum transferrin consistent with CDG type I" EXACT []
synonym: "Type 1 transferrin isoform profile" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1837899
is_a: HP:0003160 ! Abnormal isoelectric focusing of serum transferrin

[Term]
id: HP:0003643
name: Sulfite oxidase deficiency
synonym: "عوز إنزيم السلفيت أوكسيديز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص في إنزيم السلفيت أوكسيديز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مستوى السلفيت أوكسيديز منخفض بشكل غير طبيعي.
def: "Abnormally reduced sulfite oxidase level." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Sulfite oxidase is responsible for the oxidation of sulfite to sulfate and is the terminal enzyme in the oxidative degradation pathway of sulfur-containing amino acids.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:367368009
xref: UMLS:C0268624
is_a: HP:0012379 ! Abnormal circulating enzyme concentration or activity

[Term]
id: HP:0003645
name: Prolonged partial thromboplastin time
synonym: "زمن التخثر الجزئي المطول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زمن تخثر مطول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وقت طويل حتى يحدث التخثر في اختبار زمن التخثر الجزئي (PTT)، وهو مقياس لمسارات التخثر الداخلية والعامة. يتم خلط الفوسفوليبيد والمنشط والكالسيوم في عينة بلازما مخثرة، ثم يُقاس الوقت حتى يتكون الجلطة.
def: "Increased time to coagulation in the partial thromboplastin time (PTT) test, a measure of the intrinsic and common coagulation pathways. Phospholipid, and activator, and calcium are mixed into an anticoagulated plasma sample, and the time is measured until a thrombus forms." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormal partial thromboplastin time" EXACT []
synonym: "Delayed thromboplastin generation" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial thromboplastin time prolonged" EXACT []
synonym: "Prolonged activated partial thromboplastin time" EXACT []
synonym: "Prolonged PTT" EXACT abbreviation []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:409675001
xref: UMLS:C0240671
is_a: HP:0001928 ! Abnormality of coagulation

