[Term]
id: HP:0003707
name: Calf muscle pseudohypertrophy
synonym: "ضخامة كاذبة في عضلات الساق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة حجم خادعة في عضلات الساق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تكبير العضلات في الساق بسبب استبدالها بنسيج ضام أو شحوم.
def: "Enlargement of the muscles of the calf due to their replacement by connective tissue or fat." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Pseudohypertrophy of the calf musculature is commonly seen in certain muscular dystrophies but also with spinal muscular atrophy and other denervating conditions.
