def: "Spontaneous, repetitive electrical activity demonstrated by electromyography (EMG)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This is a characteristic abnormality seen in the myotonias and periodic paralyzes.
synonym: "EMG: spontaneous, repetitive electrical activity" RELATED []
