[Term]
id: HP:0004051
name: Advanced ossification of the hand bones
synonym: "تقدم التعظم في عظام اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تسارع نضج عظام اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حدوث التعظم في عظام اليد في عمر مبكر عن العمر الطبيعي المتوقع.
def: "Ossification of hand bones at an earlier age than normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Accelerated maturation of hand bones" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Advanced maturation of the hand bones" RELATED []
