[Term]
id: HP:0004052
name: Delayed ossification of the hand bones
synonym: "تأخر التعظم في عظام اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تأخر نضوج عظام اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التعظم في عظام اليد أقل من المتوقع وفقًا للمقاييس العمرية.
def: "Ossification of hand bones is less advanced than would be expected according to age-adjusted norms." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Delay maturation/delayed ossification of the hand" EXACT []
synonym: "Delayed maturation of the hand bones" RELATED layperson []
