synonym: "عظم زورقي على شكل فاصلة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
xref: UMLS:C4025395
is_a: HP:0004235 ! Comma-shaped carpal bones
is_a: HP:0004243 ! Abnormal scaphoid morphology

