comment: Arabic Definition: تكوين أنسجة العظام في العظم الزورقي يكون أقل من المتوقع للعمر.
def: "Formation of bone tissue of scaphoid is less than expected for age." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "Delayed maturation of the scaphoid" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021670
is_a: HP:0001216 ! Delayed ossification of carpal bones
is_a: HP:0045003 ! Abnormal ossification of the scaphoid

