[Term]
id: HP:0004383
name: Hypoplastic left ventricle
synonym: "صغر البطين الأيسر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تطوير ناقص للقلب الأيسر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيب خلقي خطير يميز بتطوير ناقص للبطين الأيسر.
def: "A severe congenital heart defect characterized by underdevelopment of the left ventricle." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:22192721, PMID:32119463]
comment: This feature most often occurs as part of the Hypoplastic left heart syndrome (HLHS), which may comprise additional malfmorations atresia of the aortic or mitral orifice and hypoplasia of the ascending aorta. If present, the additional features should be coded with the corresponding HPO terms.
synonym: "Heart left ventricle hypoplasia" EXACT []
synonym: "Left ventricular hypoplasia" EXACT []
