[Term]
id: HP:0004433
name: Secretory IgA deficiency
synonym: "نقص إفراز IgA" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص IgA الإفرازي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص في إفراز IgA (بلمرات مكونة من 2-4 وحدات IgA مربوطة بسلسلتين إضافيتين) وهي الاستجابة الأولية المضادة المناعية على مستوى الأغشية المخاطية حيث يشكل مجمعات مناعية مع العوامل المرضية والمسببات للحساسية.
def: "Deficiency of secretory IgA (polymers of 2-4 IgA monomers are linked by two additional chains) and is the primary antibody response at the mucosal level, where it forms immune complexes with pathogens and allergens." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:2251975]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:234554004
xref: UMLS:C0398709
is_a: HP:0041078 ! Decreased immunoglobulin level in body fluid
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2008-03-18T09:48:00Z

[Term]
id: HP:0004434
name: Decreased circulating complement C8 concentration
synonym: "نقص تركيز المكمل C8 الدوراني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص مكمل C8 في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز مكون المكمل C8 في الدم أقل من الحد الأدنى الطبيعي.
def: "Concentration of the complement component C8 in the blood circulation below the lower limit of normal." [PMID:8098723]
comment: The eighth component of complement (C8) plays an important role in the function of membrane attack complex (MAC) that is generated on target cells upon activation of the complement system. MAC is generated by sequential addition of C5b, C6, C7, C8, and C9 molecules, which results in the transmembrane pore and eventual cell lysis. Individuals with C8 deficiency tend to have recurrent neisserial infections.
synonym: "C8 deficiency" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased serum complement C8" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C3151082
is_a: HP:0033057 ! Decreased circulating terminal complement component concentration
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2008-03-18T09:53:00Z

