comment: Arabic Definition: آفة خلقية حميدة في الأنسجة الرخوة خلف الأذن تتكون من أنبوب ضيق أو حفرة مغلقة.
def: "Benign congenital lesion of the postauricular soft tissue consisting of a blind-ending narrow tube or pit." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Pit behind the ear" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Postauricular earpits" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Postauricular fistula" EXACT []
synonym: "Posterior auricular pit" EXACT []
synonym: "Posterior auricular sinus" EXACT []
