[Term]
id: HP:0004490
name: Calvarial hyperostosis
synonym: "فرط تعظم القحف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في نمو سقف الجمجمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمو مفرط في القحف.
def: "Excessive growth of the calvaria." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The calvaria (skull cap) is made up of the frontal, occipital, right and left parietal, right and left temporal, sphenoid, and ethmoid bones, and thus comprises the upper dome-like part of the skull and does not include the lower jaw.
synonym: "Enlargement of calvarial bones" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Excessive growth of calvarial bones" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Hyperostosis of calvarial bones" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Hypertrophy of calvarial bones" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased ossification of calvarial bones" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Overgrowth of calvarial bones" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Overgrowth of skullcap" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Thick calvarial bones" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
