[Term]
id: HP:0004510
name: Pancreatic islet-cell hyperplasia
synonym: "فرط تنسج في خلايا الجزر البنكرياسية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في خلايا البنكرياس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فرط تنسج في جزر لانجرهانز، وهي المناطق في البنكرياس التي تحتوي على الخلايا الصماء.
alt_id: HP:0001736
alt_id: HP:0006275
def: "Hyperplasia of the islets of Langerhans, i.e., of the regions of the pancreas that contain its endocrine cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The islets of Langerhans contain the alpha cells (producing glucagon), beta cells (insulin and amylin), delta cells (somatostatin),PP cells (pancreatic polypeptide), and the epsilon cells (ghrelin).
synonym: "Hyperplastic islets of langerhans" EXACT []
synonym: "Hypertrophic pancreatic islets" EXACT []
synonym: "Islet of Langerhans hyperplasia" EXACT []
synonym: "Islets of langerhans hypertrophy" EXACT []
synonym: "Pancreatic islet-cell hypertrophy" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C0597167
is_a: HP:0006476 ! Abnormality of the pancreatic islet cells

