comment: Arabic Definition: انعطاف خارجي للكعب، يؤدي إلى القدم الفحجية حيث يمشي الشخص على الجزء الداخلي من القدم.
def: "Outward turning of the heel, resulting in clubfoot with the person walking on the inner part of the foot." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The phrase talipes valgus is derived from the Latin words talus (ankle), pes (poot), and valgus (outward angulation of the distal segment of a bone).
