[Term]
id: HP:0004794
name: Malrotation of small bowel
synonym: "انسداد الأمعاء الدقيقة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التواء الأمعاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف عن الدوران الطبيعي للأمعاء الوسطى أثناء التطور الجنيني مما يؤدي إلى عدم تموضع الأمعاء الدقيقة بشكل صحيح.
def: "A deviation from the normal rotation of the midgut during embryologic development with mislocalization of the small bowel." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Malrotation results not only in the malposition of the bowel but also in the malfixation of the mesentery. The normally broad mesenteric attachment is shortened to a narrow pedicle that predisposes the patient to the complication of midgut volvulus.
synonym: "Malrotation of the small intestine" EXACT []
