[Term]
id: HP:0004810
name: Congenital hypoplastic anemia
synonym: "فقر الدم اللا تنسجي الخلقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقر الدم الخلقي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من فقر الدم اللا تنسجي يبدأ منذ الولادة.
alt_id: HP:0005545
def: "A type of hypoplastic anemia with congenital onset." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: In this condition, hematopoiesis must have been inadequate in fetal life. Affected infant have marked pallor and reticulocytopenia or absence of red blood cell precursors in an otherwise normally cellular bone marrow. This term does not refer to a particular diagnosis or etiology (or which several are known) but to the phenotypic feature.
synonym: "Congenital dyserythropoietic anaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Congenital dyserythropoietic anemia" EXACT []
synonym: "Congenital hypoplastic anaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
