[Term]
id: HP:0004821
name: Hypersegmentation of neutrophil nuclei
synonym: "تقسيم مفرط لنوى العدلات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تقسيم زائد لنوى خلايا الدم البيضاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تقسيم مفرط لفصوص نواة العدلة.
def: "An excessive division of the lobes of the nucleus of a neutrophil." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Neutrophils usually display 3-4 nuclear lobes. Hypersegmented neutrophile nuclei display 5 or more lobes. This feature can be seen in vitamin B12 or folate deficiency or with other etiologies.
synonym: "Hypermature neutrophils" EXACT []
synonym: "Hypersegmentation of neutrophil nuclei in peripheral blood" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8169-9049]
