synonym: "فقر الدم الناتج عن تدمير ذاتي لخلايا الدم الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من فقر الدم الانحلالي الذي يكون فيه اختبار كومبس إيجابيًا.
alt_id: HP:0003539
def: "A type of hemolytic anemia in which the Coombs test is positive." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The Coombs test measures a coating of immunoglobulin or complement on the red cell surface.
synonym: "Coombs-positive hemolytic anaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Direct Coombs positive" EXACT []
