[Term]
id: HP:0004935
name: Pulmonary artery atresia
synonym: "رتق الشريان الرئوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انسداد في الشريان الرئوي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه خلقي يتميز بتضيق أو غياب تام للفتحة بين البطين الأيمن والشريان الرئوي.
def: "A congenital anomaly with a narrowing or complete absence of the opening between the right ventricle and the pulmonary artery." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Pulmonary artery atresia means that unoxygenated blood in the right ventricle can not be effectively pumped into the lung for oxygenation.
synonym: "Atresia of the pulmonary artery" EXACT []
synonym: "Pulmonary atresia" EXACT []
