alt_id: HP:0006816
def: "The presence of a localized dilatation or ballooning of a cerebral artery." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Aneurysm is considered a severe form of dilatation.
synonym: "Brain aneurysm" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Cerebral aneurysm" NARROW []
synonym: "Cerebral artery aneurysm" NARROW []
synonym: "Intracranial aneurysm" BROAD []
