def: "A congenital defect with aplasia (absence) of one of the right or left pulmonary artery." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:17192541]
comment: This is a rare feature that has been observed in recessive lethal osteogenesis imperfecta with mutation in CRTAP.
