[Term]
id: HP:0005194
name: Flattened metatarsal heads
synonym: "رؤوس السلاميات الممسطحة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تسطيح عظام القدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل مسطح غير طبيعي لرؤوس عظام المشط.
def: "Abnormally flat shape of the heads of the metatarsal bones." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The metatarsal heads articulate with the proximal phalanges of the toes.
synonym: "Flattened head of long bone of foot" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4025240
is_a: HP:0001832 ! Abnormal metatarsal morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0005195
name: Polyarticular arthropathy
synonym: "اعتلال مفصلي متعدد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اعتلال في عدة مفاصل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير هذا الشرط إلى وجود اعتلالات وفقدان في الوظائف الطبيعية لأكثر من مفصل في الجسم.
xref: UMLS:C4025239
is_a: HP:0003040 ! Arthropathy

[Term]
id: HP:0005197
name: Generalized morning stiffness
synonym: "تيبس صباحي عام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تيبس في الجسم عند الاستيقاظ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشعور بتيبس في المفاصل يحدث بعد الاستيقاظ في الصباح.
def: "A sensation of stiffness in the joints that occurs following waking up in the morning." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Generalised morning stiffness" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: UMLS:C4025238
is_a: HP:0001387 ! Joint stiffness

[Term]
id: HP:0005198
name: Stiff interphalangeal joints
synonym: "تيبس المفاصل السلامية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تيبس مفاصل الأصابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تيبس المفاصل السلامية هو شعور بضيق في المفاصل السلامية عند محاولة تحريكها بعد فترة من عدم النشاط.
def: "Interphalangeal joint stiffness is a perceived sensation of tightness in the interphalangeal joints when attempting to move them after a period of inactivity." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Stiff hinge joints" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4025237
is_a: HP:0001387 ! Joint stiffness

