[Term]
id: HP:0005215
name: Frequent Giardia lamblia infestation
synonym: "عدوى متكررة بجيارديا لامبليا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى متكررة من جيارديا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة القابلية للإصابة بعدوى جيارديا لامبليا في الأمعاء، كما يتضح من التاريخ الطبي لعدة حالات من العدوى المعوية بجيارديا لامبليا.
def: "Increased susceptibility to Giardia lamblia infection of the intestine, as manifested by a medical history of multiple episodes of Giardia lamblia intestinal infection." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4025235
is_a: HP:0004798 ! Recurrent infection of the gastrointestinal tract

[Term]
id: HP:0005216
name: Impaired mastication
synonym: "خلل في عملية المضغ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبة في المضغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في القدرة على المضغ، أي في القدرة على تكسير وطحن الطعام للإعداد للبلع.
def: "An abnormal reduction in the ability to masticate (chew), i.e., in the ability to crush and ground food in preparation for swallowing." [PMID:23713640]
comment: Chewing and swallowing are interrelated. The act of chewing plays a fundamental role in the process of swallowing food. Mastication prepares food for swallowing by breaking it into small particles. Accordingly, loss of teeth has been associated with swallowing difficulties. Chewing difficulties may be caused by loss of teeth, partial dentures, or by tooth pain. Swallowing difficulties, in contrast, are often characterized by difficulties swallowing liquids, reflux, throat spasms, choking on dry food, or dysphagia.
synonym: "Chewing difficulties" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Chewing difficulty" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Difficulty chewing" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:162020001
xref: UMLS:C0239043
is_a: HP:0031815 ! Abnormal oral physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0005217
name: Abdominal organ duplication
synonym: "ازدواج الأعضاء البطنية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود عضو زائد في البطن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه خلقي يتصف بنمو عضو إضافي أو هيكل شبيه بالعضو، أي نسخة إضافية من العضو الموجود عادة في البطن.
def: "A congenital malformation characterized by the development of an additional organ or organ-like structure, i.e., an extra copy of the organ normally located in the abdomen." []
