name: Intestinal edema
synonym: "وذمة معوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انتفاخ الأمعاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تراكم السائل الخالي من الخلايا وغير الالتهابي داخل جدار القنوات المعوية مما يؤدي إلى سماكة منتظمة للثنيات المخاطية.
def: "Accumulation of cell free, noninflammatony fluid within the wall of the intestinal tract producing uniform thickening of the mucosal folds." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This finding can be observed upon abdominal radiography. The bowel lumen may be slightly dilated. Secondary to the fluid accumulation, there are anatomic and motor alterations in the intestine which are reflected in the roentgenogram.
