name: Inspiratory stridor
synonym: "صرير شهيقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت عالي عند الشهيق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الصوت العالي عند الشهيق الناجم في العادة عن اختلالات في الحنجرة.
def: "Inspiratory stridor is a high pitched sound upon inspiration that is generally related to laryngeal abnormalities." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:58596002
xref: UMLS:C0677600
is_a: HP:0010307 ! Stridor

