[Term]
id: HP:0005352
name: Severe T-cell immunodeficiency
synonym: "نقص مناعي شديد للخلايا التائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف مناعة الخلايا التائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص في المناعة الأولية يتميز بعيوب أو نقص في الخلايا اللمفاوية التائية مما يسبب قابلية محددة للإصابة بالكائنات الدقيقة داخل الخلايا.
def: "A primary immune deficiency that is characterized by defects or deficiencies of T-lymphocytes that causes specific susceptibility to intracellular micro-organisms." [PMID:18755723]
comment: Several diseases are classified as severe T cell immunodeficiencies: severe combined immunodeficiency syndrome (SCID), reticular dysgenesis, thymic dysplasia (Nezelof syndrome), combined immunodeficiency disease (CID), and Wiskott-Aldrich syndrome (WAS).
synonym: "Severe T-cell immunodeficiency" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4025208
is_a: HP:0005374 ! Cellular immunodeficiency

[Term]
id: HP:0005353
name: Recurrent herpes
synonym: "الهربس المتكرر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تكرار الإصابة بالهربس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة القابلية للإصابة بفيروس الهربس، كما يظهر من خلال نوبات الهربس المتكررة.
def: "Increased susceptibility to herpesvirus, as manifested by recurrent episodes of herpesvirus." []
synonym: "Susceptibility to herpesvirus" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4025207
is_a: HP:0034318 ! Unusual virus reactivation

[Term]
id: HP:0005354
name: Absent cellular immunity
synonym: "غياب المناعة الخلوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم وجود مناعة خلوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدم القدرة الكاملة للخلايا التائية على أداء وظائفها في المناعة الخلوية.
def: "Complete inability of T cells to perform their functions in cell-mediated immunity." []
synonym: "Lack of T cell function" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1849426
is_a: HP:0011840 ! Abnormal T cell physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0005356
name: Decreased circulating complement factor I concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز عامل المكمل I في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض المكمل في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز مكون المكمل العامل I في الدورة الدموية أقل من الحد الأدنى الطبيعي.
def: "Concentration of the complement component factor I in the blood circulation below the lower limit of normal." [https://emedicine.medscape.com/article/135478-overview]
synonym: "Decreased serum complement factor I" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1970257
is_a: HP:0004431 ! Reduced circulating complement concentration

[Term]
id: HP:0005357
name: Defective B cell differentiation
synonym: "خلل في تمايز الخلايا البائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف خلايا ب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض وظيفة عملية اكتساب نوع الخلية السلفية لخصائص متخصصة لخلايا ب. وتعتبر خلايا ب نوعًا من الخلايا اللمفاوية التابعة للخط البياني مع النمط الظاهري CD19-positive وقادرة على المناعة التي تتوسطها خلايا ب.
def: "Reduced functionality of the process in which a precursor cell type acquires the specialized features of a B cell. A B cell is a lymphocyte of B lineage with the phenotype CD19-positive and capable of B cell mediated immunity." [GO:0030183]
xref: UMLS:C1859624
is_a: HP:0005384 ! Defective B cell activation

[Term]
id: HP:0005359
name: Aplasia of the thymus
synonym: "عدم التنسج الغدة الصعترية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "غياب الغدة الصعترية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب الغدة الصعترية. يمكن التعرف على هذه الحالة من خلال عدم وجود الظل الصعترى في الفحص الإشعاعي.
def: "Absence of the thymus. This feature may be appreciated by the lack of a thymic shadow upon radiographic examination." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Absent thymic shadow" RELATED []
synonym: "Absent thymus" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Athymia" EXACT []
synonym: "Lack of thymic shadow" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:702623002
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:91918005
xref: UMLS:C0685894
is_a: HP:0010515 ! Aplasia/Hypoplasia of the thymus

[Term]
id: HP:0005360
name: Susceptibility to chickenpox
synonym: "قابلية للإصابة بالجدري المائي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عرضة للجدري المائي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة القابلية للإصابة بالجدري المائي، كما يتضح من النوبات المتكررة من الجدري المائي.
def: "Increased susceptibility to chicken pox, as manifested by recurrent episodes of chicken pox." []
