[Term]
id: HP:0005368
name: Abnormality of humoral immunity
synonym: "خلل في المناعة الخلطية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في وظيفة الأجسام المضادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في النظام المناعي الخلطي الذي يتضمن الأجسام المضادة التي تنتجها الخلايا البائية وكذلك نظام المكمل.
def: "An abnormality of the humoral immune system, which comprises antibodies produced by B cells as well as the complement system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Defective humoral immunity" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C3150510
is_a: HP:0010978 ! Abnormality of immune system physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0005369
name: Decreased circulating complement factor H concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز عامل المتمم H في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة عامل المتمم H في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز مكون المتمم H في الدورة الدموية أقل من الحد الأدنى الطبيعي.
def: "Concentration of the complement component factor H in the blood circulation below the lower limit of normal." [https://emedicine.medscape.com/article/135478-overview]
synonym: "Decreased serum complement factor H" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1969222
is_a: HP:0004431 ! Reduced circulating complement concentration

[Term]
id: HP:0005372
name: Abnormal B cell physiology
synonym: "خلل في فسيولوجيا الخلايا البائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في وظيفة الخلايا البائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في الوظيفة الفسيولوجية للخلايا البائية.
alt_id: HP:0005398
def: "An abnormality of the physiological functioning of B cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This term refers to any abnormality of the B cells, which play a role in the humoral immune response. The main functions of B cells are to produce antibodies, to perform the role of antigen presenting cells, and to develop into memory cells.
synonym: "Abnormality of B cell physiology" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Reduced B cell function" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C1849242
is_a: HP:0031409 ! Abnormal lymphocyte physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0005374
name: Cellular immunodeficiency
synonym: "نقص المناعة الخلوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل المناعة الخلوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص مناعة يتسم بخلل في المناعة الخلوية أو المناعة الخلطية.
alt_id: HP:0005375
def: "An immunodeficiency characterized by defective cell-mediated immunity or humoral immunity." [http://www.dictionary.com/browse/cellular-immunodeficiency]
