[Term]
id: HP:0005458
name: Premature closure of fontanelles
synonym: "إغلاق مبكر للنافذات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انسداد مبكر فتحات الجمجمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عادة ما تُغلق النافذات الخلفية والجانبية بعد حوالي ستة أشهر من الولادة، بينما تُغلق النافذة الأمامية في منتصف العام الثاني تقريباً. يشير هذا المصطلح إلى الحالة التي تُغلق فيها النافذات في وقت مبكر غير مناسب.
def: "Normally, the posterior and lateral fontanelles are obliterated by about six months after birth, the anterior fontanelle closes by about the middle of the second year. This term refers to the situation in which the fontanelles close at an inappropriately early time point." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2972-5481]
synonym: "Early closure of the bregma sutures" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Early closure of the cranial sutures" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Early closure of the fontanelles" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Obliterated fontanelles" EXACT []
synonym: "Premature closure of the bregma sutures" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Premature closure of the cranial sutures" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Premature fontanel closure" EXACT []
