is_a: HP:0001903 ! Anemia

[Term]
id: HP:0005506
name: Chronic myelogenous leukemia
synonym: "ابيضاض الدم النقوي المزمن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "سرطان الدم المزمن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب نقوي تكاثري يتميز بزيادة تكاثر خلايا الحُبَيبة النخاعية بدون فقدان قدرتها على التمايز.
alt_id: HP:0005544
def: "A myeloproliferative disorder characterized by increased proliferation of the granulocytic cell line without the loss of their capacity to differentiate." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Chronic myelocytic leukaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Chronic myelocytic leukemia" EXACT []
synonym: "Chronic myelogenous leukaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Chronic myeloid leukaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Chronic myeloid leukemia" EXACT []
xref: DOID:8552 "chronic myeloid leukemia"
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:63364005
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:92818009
xref: UMLS:C0023473
is_a: HP:0005558 ! Chronic leukemia

[Term]
id: HP:0005507
name: Hemoglobin Barts
synonym: "هيموغلوبين بارتس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "هيموغلوبين غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يكون الهيموغلوبين بارتس عبارة عن رباعية تتكون من أربع سلاسل غاما، ويمثل علامة مميزة لنوع من الثلاسيميا الألفا، ويمتاز بارتفاع كبير في قابلية الارتباط بالأكسجين، مما يؤدي إلى توصيل ضعيف للأكسجين للأنسجة.
def: "Normal adult hemoglobin is composed of two chains each of alpha and beta globin. Hb Barts (Hemoglobin Barts) is a tetramer with four gamma globin chains, and is essentially pathognomonic for one or another form of alpha thalassemia. Hb Barts has an extremely high affinity for oxygen, resulting in almost no oxygen delivery to the tissues." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Hb Bart is normally not present in adult blood. It makes up about 85-90 percent of hemoglobin in Hb Bart hydrops fetalis syndrome, and about 2-5 percent in HbH disease.
synonym: "Haemoglobin Barts" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Hb Barts" EXACT abbreviation []
xref: UMLS:C3539063
is_a: HP:0011902 ! Abnormal hemoglobin

[Term]
id: HP:0005508
name: Monoclonal immunoglobulin M proteinemia
synonym: "بروتين دم الجلوبولین المناعي م الأحادي النسيلة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة بروتين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود بروتين الجلوبولين المناعي م الأحادي النسيلة في مصل الدم.
def: "Presence of a monoclonal immunoglobulin M protein in the serum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:25815903]
comment: This is a characteristic feature of Waldenstrom macroglobulinemia (WM), which is defined as a B-cell lymphoplasmacytic lymphoma, characterized by monoclonal immunoglobulin M protein in the serum and infiltration of bone marrow with lymphoplasmacytic cells.
synonym: "Waldenstrom macroglobulinemia" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:190817009
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:190818004
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:35562000
xref: UMLS:C0024419
is_a: HP:0003496 ! Increased circulating IgM level
is_a: HP:0005523 ! Lymphoproliferative disorder
is_a: HP:0031047 ! Paraproteinemia

[Term]
id: HP:0005510
name: Transient erythroblastopenia
synonym: "نقص الكريات الحمر العابر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص مؤقت في خلايا الدم الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض مؤقت في عدد الكريات الحمر التكاثرية في الدورة الدموية.
def: "A transient reduction in the number of erythroblasts in the circulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: An erythroblast, the immediate precursor of a normal erythrocyte which, still retains a cell nucleus.
synonym: "Transient decrease in blood erythrocyte number" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4082199
is_a: HP:0001903 ! Anemia

[Term]
id: HP:0005511
name: Heinz body anemia
synonym: "فقر دم الهيليز بادي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقر دم بكريات غير طبيعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقر دم يتميز بوجود احتجازات غير طبيعية داخل الخلايا، تتكون من هيموغلوبين متخثر، تظهر على غشاء خلايا الدم الحمراء.
def: "Anemia characterized by abnormal intracellular inclusions, composed of denatured hemoglobin, found on the membrane of red blood cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Heinz body anaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: UMLS:C0700299
is_a: HP:0001878 ! Hemolytic anemia

