[Term]
id: HP:0005513
name: Increased megakaryocyte count
synonym: "زيادة عدد الخلايا العملاقة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة خلايا الصفائح" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في عدد الخلايا العملاقة، أي خلايا السلف للصفائح، الموجودة في نخاع العظام.
def: "Increased megakaryocyte number, i.e., of platelet precursor cells, present in the bone marrow." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4025187
is_a: HP:0012143 ! Abnormal megakaryocyte morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0005517
name: T-cell lymphoma/leukemia
synonym: "ورم الغدد الليمفاوية / ابيضاض الدم من الخلايا التائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "سرطان خلايا الدم التائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من ورم الغدد الليمفاوية من الخلايا التائية حيث يمكن أن تظهر الخلايا التائية السرطانية في الدم (ابيضاض الدم)، الغدد الليمفاوية (ورم الغدد الليمفاوية)، الجلد أو في مناطق متعددة.
def: "A type of T-cell lymphoma in which cancerous T-cells may present in the blood (leukemia), lymph nodes (lymphoma), skin or in multiple areas." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: T-cell lymphoma/leukemia is linked to infection by the human T-cell lymphotropic virus 1 (HTLV-1).
xref: UMLS:C4025186
is_a: HP:0012190 ! T-cell lymphoma

[Term]
id: HP:0005518
name: Increased mean corpuscular volume
synonym: "زيادة الحجم الكروي المتوسط" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حجم خلايا الدم كبير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حجم خلايا الدم الحمراء أكبر من الحجم الطبيعي.
alt_id: HP:0005536
def: "Larger than normal size of erythrocytes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Macrocytosis refers to a mean cell volume (MCV) greater than 100 fL. If macrocytosis is an isolated abnormality, the amount of hemoglobin in the cell increases proportionately, so the mean cell hemoglobin concentration (MCHC) remains within normal limits.
synonym: "Erythrocyte macrocytosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased MCV" EXACT abbreviation []
xref: UMLS:C0855791
is_a: HP:0025065 ! Abnormal mean corpuscular volume

[Term]
id: HP:0005520
name: Chronic disseminated intravascular coagulation
synonym: "تخثر داخل الأوعية المنتشر المزمن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اختلال تخثر الدم المزمن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل مزمن من تخثر داخل الأوعية المنتشر حيث يتواجد محفز ضعيف أو متقطع لتنشيط الخثرة بشكل دائم وتوازن بين تحطيم وإنتاج عوامل التخثر والصفائح.
def: "A chronic form of disseminated intravascular coagulation in which a persistent weak or intermittent activating stimulus is present and destruction and production of coagulation factors and platelets are balanced." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Chronic consumption coagulopathy" EXACT []
synonym: "Compensated disseminated intravascular coagulation" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1862184
is_a: HP:0005521 ! Disseminated intravascular coagulation

[Term]
id: HP:0005521
name: Disseminated intravascular coagulation
synonym: "تخثر داخل الأوعية المنتشر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اختلال تخثر الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يتسم تخثر داخل الأوعية المنتشر بتفعيل واسع النطاق للتخثر، مما يؤدي إلى تكوين الفبرين داخل الأوعية وانسداد خثري في الأوعية الصغيرة والمتوسطة الحجم.
def: "Disseminated intravascular coagulation is characterized by the widespread activation of coagulation, which results in the intravascular formation of fibrin and ultimately thrombotic occlusion of small and midsize vessels." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:10451465, PMID:11816725]
comment: DIC is a complex syndrome in which there is pathological generation of thrombin and diffuse intravascular clot formation. DIC may occur as acute decompensated or chronic compensated form. In acute decompensated DIC, there is a sudden massive exposure of tissue factor over a brief time period; Intravascular coagulation can also compromise the blood supply to organs and, in conjunction with hemodynamic and metabolic derangements, may contribute to the failure of multiple organs. At the same time, the use and subsequent depletion of platelets and coagulation proteins resulting from the ongoing coagulation may induce severe bleeding. Chronic DIC, also known as compensated DIC, results from a persistent weak or intermittent activating stimulus. Under such conditions, destruction and production of coagulation factors and platelets are balanced.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:67406007
xref: UMLS:C0012739
is_a: HP:0001977 ! Abnormal thrombosis

[Term]
id: HP:0005522
name: Pyridoxine-responsive sideroblastic anemia
synonym: "فقر الدم الحديدي الأرومات المستجيب للبيريدوكسين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقر الدم المعالج بفيتامين ب-6" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من فقر الدم الحديدي الأرومات الذي يتحسن بتناول البيريدوكسين (فيتامين ب-6).
def: "A type of sideroblastic anemia that is alleviated by pyridoxine (vitamin B-6) treatment." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Pyridoxine-responsive sideroblastic anaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:191260004
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:25443007
xref: UMLS:C0272027
