[Term]
id: HP:0005978
name: Type II diabetes mellitus
synonym: "داء السكري من النوع الثاني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "السكري من النوع الثاني" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من داء السكري يتميز في البداية بمقاومة الأنسولين وارتفاع إفراز الأنسولين ومن ثم بعدم تحمل الغلوكوز وفرط سكر الدم.
alt_id: HP:0005965
alt_id: HP:0100652
def: "A type of diabetes mellitus initially characterized by insulin resistance and hyperinsulinemia and subsequently by glucose interolerance and hyperglycemia." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Persons with type II diabetes mellitus rarely develop ketoacidosis.
synonym: "Diabetes mellitus type 2" RELATED []
synonym: "Diabetes mellitus Type II" EXACT []
synonym: "Diabetes mellitus, noninsulin-dependent" EXACT []
synonym: "NIDDM" EXACT abbreviation [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "NIDDM diabetes mellitus" EXACT []
synonym: "Non-insulin dependent diabetes" EXACT []
synonym: "Noninsulin dependent diabetes mellitus" EXACT []
synonym: "Noninsulin-dependent diabetes" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Noninsulin-dependent diabetes mellitus" RELATED []
