[Term]
id: HP:0006070
name: Metacarpophalangeal joint contracture
synonym: "تقلص مفصل المشط السلامي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تيبس في مفاصل اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان مزمن لحركة مفاصل المشط السلامية بسبب تغييرات هيكلية في العضلات أو الأوتار أو الأربطة أو الجلد مما يمنع الحركة الطبيعية.
alt_id: HP:0005674
def: "A chronic loss of joint motion in metacarpophalangeal joints due to structural changes in muscle, tendons, ligaments, or skin that prevents normal movement." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: In the literature this has been called metacarpophalangeal camptodactyly, but the term camptodactyly should be reserved for a painless flexion contracture of the proximal interphalangeal (PIP) joint.
synonym: "Metacarpal/phalangeal joint contractures" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C2677209
is_a: HP:0011911 ! Abnormal metacarpophalangeal joint morphology

