comment: Arabic Definition: ظهور الأسنان في الفم قبل الوقت المتوقع بشكل ملحوظ، عادة أكثر من متوسط الوقت بفترة تزيد عن انحرافين معياريين.
alt_id: HP:0006317
def: "Premature tooth eruption, which can be defined as tooth eruption more than 2 SD earlier than the mean eruption age." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9338-3017, PMID:19125428]
comment: There are established norms for the timing of eruption in both deciduous and permanent teeth [Garn and Rohmann, [1966]; Lunt and Law, [1974]; McDonald et al. [2004]]. Eruption is defined by the appearance of a tooth that has pierced the gum.
