synonym: "Advanced tooth eruption" EXACT []
synonym: "Early dental eruption" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Early eruption of teeth" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Eruption, advanced" EXACT []
synonym: "Premature dental eruption" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Premature eruption of teeth" EXACT []
synonym: "Premature tooth eruption" EXACT []
