synonym: "Failure of development of permanent teeth" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Failure of development of secondary teeth" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Missing permanent teeth" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "No permanent dentition" EXACT []
