[Term]
id: HP:0006509
name: Diverticulosis of trachea
synonym: "رتاجات القصبة الهوائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشكل جيوب في القصبة الهوائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الرتاجات القصبية هي جيوب مغلقة النهايات تنشأ من القصبة الهوائية. عادةً ما توجد كاكتشاف عرضي. في بعض الأحيان يمكن أن تحاكي الرئة خلف القصبة. يمكن أن تكون خلقية أو مكتسبة، وفي الحالة الأخيرة تكون الأسباب الأكثر شيوعًا هي الضغط الداخلي المتزايد لفترة طويلة كما في السعال المزمن، والانسداد الرئوي المزمن، واللين القصبي، والجراحة (مثل ما بعد العمليات الجراحية).
def: "Tracheal diverticula are blind-ended outpouchings arising from the trachea. They are usually an incidental finding. Occasionally they can mimic pneumomediastinum. Tracheal diverticula are either congenital or acquired, in the latter case the most common causes are prolonged increased intraluminal pressure, e.g. chronic cough, COPD, tracheomalacia, and iatrogenic (e.g. post-surgical)." [PMID:18544671, PMID:27867581]
synonym: "Paratracheal air cyst" RELATED []
synonym: "Tracheal diverticulosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Tracheal diverticulum" EXACT [http://radiopaedia.org/articles/tracheal-diverticulum, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Tracheocele" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:14011008
xref: UMLS:C0340213
is_a: HP:0002778 ! Abnormal tracheal morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0006510
name: Chronic pulmonary obstruction
synonym: "الانسداد الرئوي المزمن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل يتميز بانسداد متقدم في تدفق الهواء الذي لا يكون إلا جزئيًا قابلًا للإصلاح، مع وجود التهاب في الممرات الهوائية وتأثيرات جهازية أو أمراض مصاحبة.
alt_id: HP:0006541
def: "An anomaly that is characterized progressive airflow obstruction that is only partly reversible, inflammation in the airways, and systemic effects or comorbities." [PMID:25943942]
comment: COPD is usually conceptualized as a disease entity. It is heterogeneous histologically and pathogenically, and conventionally includes emphysema and chronic bronchitis, It is included as a phenotype term as COPD is often annotated as a feature of other diseases.
synonym: "Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease" EXACT []
synonym: "COPD" EXACT abbreviation []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:13645005
xref: UMLS:C0024117
is_a: HP:0006536 ! Airway obstruction

[Term]
id: HP:0006511
name: Laryngeal stridor
synonym: "صرير الحنجرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت حنجرة عالي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: صوت غير طبيعي عالي النغمة يحدث أثناء الشهيق أو الزفير بسبب انسداد غير كامل في الحلق.
def: "An abnormal high-pitched noisy sound, occurring during inhalation or exhalation caused by the incomplete obstruction in the throat." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The laryngeal stridor sound is usually heard during inspiratory phase, also called inspiratory stridor, and may accompanied by inspiratory difficulty in breathing. It may be due to abnormal flaccidity of the epiglottis or arytenoids.
synonym: "Laryngeal stidor" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:406444002
