is_a: HP:0002611 ! Cholestatic liver disease

[Term]
id: HP:0006568
name: Increased hepatic glycogen content
synonym: "زيادة محتوى الجليكوجين الكبدي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة السكر في الكبد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في كمية الجليكوجين المخزن في الخلايا الكبدية مقارنة بالمعدل الطبيعي.
def: "An increase in the amount of glycogen stored in hepatocytes compared to normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Glycogen acts as secondary long-term energy storage in the liver and other organs. Its intracellular concentration can be increased in some disease states such as obesity.
synonym: "Increased liver glycogen content" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1856285
is_a: HP:0500030 ! Abnormal hepatic glycogen storage

[Term]
id: HP:0006571
name: Reduced number of intrahepatic bile ducts
synonym: "نقص عدد القنوات الصفراوية داخل الكبد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة القنوات الصفراوية داخل الكبد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود عدد أقل من القنوات الصفراوية داخل الكبد عن المعتاد.
def: "The presence of reduced numbers of intrahepatic bile duct than normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
