def: "An abnormal reduction in the number of mitochondria in hepatocytes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4025018
is_a: HP:0030059 ! Mitochondrial depletion
is_a: HP:0410042 ! Abnormal liver morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0006582
name: Reye syndrome-like episodes
synonym: "نوبات شبيهة بمتلازمة راي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبات تشبه متلازمة راي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تكرار حدوث حالة التهاب دماغي حاد غير التهابي وفشل كبدي دهني تنكسي، مشابهة للأعراض التي تظهر في متلازمة راي.
def: "Repeated occurrences of acute noninflammatory encephalopathy and fatty degenerative liver failure." []
comment: This feature has been observed in individuals withe mitochondrial DNA depletion syndrome-6 (MTDPS6), also known as Navajo neurohepatopathy [MIM:256810].
xref: UMLS:C1850413
is_a: HP:0006846 ! Acute encephalopathy
is_a: HP:0025155 ! Abnormal hepatobiliary system physiology

[Term]
id: HP:0006583
name: Fatal liver failure in infancy
synonym: "فشل كبدي قاتل في الطفولة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فشل كبدي قاتل عند الأطفال الصغار" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
