[Term]
id: HP:0006677
name: Prolonged QRS complex
synonym: "استطالة مركب QRS" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "توسّع مركب QRS في القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة الوقت اللازم لمركب QRS الذي يتألف من موجات Q و R و S كما يقاس بجهاز مخطط كهربية القلب (EKG). في البالغين، تتراوح القيم الطبيعية بين 0.06 – 0.10 ثانية.
def: "Increased time for the complex comprised of the Q wave, R wave, and S wave as measured by the electrocardiogram (EKG).. In adults, normal values are 0.06 - 0.10 sec." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Intraventricular conduction delay" EXACT []
synonym: "Prolonged QRS complex on EKG" EXACT []
synonym: "QRS widening" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:991002
xref: UMLS:C0235475
is_a: HP:0025074 ! Abnormal QRS complex

[Term]
id: HP:0006679
name: Granulomatous coronary arteritis
synonym: "التهاب الشرايين التاجية الحبيبي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب شرايين القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب في الشرايين التاجية يتضمن استجابة حبيبية، وهي استجابة التهابية غير محددة تشمل الحبيبات، وهي تجمع منظم ومضغوط من الخلايا البلعمية الناضجة بما في ذلك الخلايا الطلائية والخلايا العملاقة.
def: "Inflammation of the coronary arteries involving a granulomatous response, i.e., a non-specific inflammatory response involving granulomas, defined as a compact organized collection of mature mononuclear phagocytes including epithelioid and giant cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:937513]
comment: A granuloma is a compact (organized) collection of mature mononuclear phagocytes (macrophages and/or epithelioid cells) which may or may not be accompanied by accessory features such as necrosis or the infiltration of other inflammatory leukocytes (Adams DO. The granulomatous inflammatory response. Am J Pathol 1976:84:163-192).
xref: UMLS:C4025007
is_a: HP:0006704 ! Abnormal coronary artery morphology
is_a: HP:0012089 ! Arteritis

