[Term]
id: HP:0006698
name: Dilatation of the ventricular cavity
synonym: "تمدّد تجويف البطين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تمدّد في البطين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انتفاخ موضعي في تجويف البطين يرتبط غالبًا بحركات غير طبيعية وتمدد مفارقة خلال الانقباض.
def: "A localized outpouching of ventricular cavity that is generally associated with dyskinesia and paradoxical expansion during systole." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Aneurysm is considered a severe form of dilatation. Ventricular aneurysms may have rim of calcium in the affected regions of the ventricular wall (which can become fibrotic). Thromboembolism is a potential complication. Ventricular aneurysms can be diagnosed by ventriculography.
synonym: "Ventricular aneurysm" NARROW []
