[Term]
id: HP:0006937
name: Impaired distal tactile sensation
synonym: "ضعف الإحساس اللمسي البعيد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض الإحساس باللمس في الذراعين أو الساقين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في الإحساس اللمسي على جلد الأطراف البعيدة. يتم اختباره عادةً بواسطة قطعة من القطن أو فرشاة ناعمة، ويطلب من المرضى أن يقولوا 'الآن' كلما شعروا بالمنبه.
alt_id: HP:0006981
def: "A reduced sense of touch (tactile sensation) on the skin of the distal limbs. This is usually tested with a wisp of cotton or a fine camel's hair brush, by asking patients to say 'now' each time they feel the stimulus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Decreased distal touch sense" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased touch sensation in extremities" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: UMLS:C4021583
is_a: HP:0002936 ! Distal sensory impairment
is_a: HP:0010830 ! Impaired tactile sensation

[Term]
id: HP:0006938
name: Impaired vibration sensation at ankles
synonym: "ضعف الإحساس بالاهتزاز في الكعبين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض الإحساس بالاهتزاز في القدمين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض القدرة على إدراك الاهتزاز عند الكعبين. وعادةً ما يتم اختبار ذلك سريريًا باستخدام شوكة الرنين التي تهتز بتردد 128 هيرتز ويتم تطبيقها على الكعبين.
alt_id: HP:0007144
def: "A decrease in the ability to perceive vibration at the ankles. Clinically, this is usually tested with a tuning fork which vibrates at 128 Hz and is applied to the malleoli of the ankles." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Decreased vibration sense at ankles" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Decreased vibration sense in feet" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Impaired vibration sensation at ankles" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C1854372
is_a: HP:0002166 ! Impaired vibration sensation in the lower limbs
is_a: HP:0006886 ! Impaired distal vibration sensation

[Term]
id: HP:0006943
