synonym: "فقدان تام للإحساس بالاهتزاز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان كامل للقدرة على إدراك الاهتزاز.
def: "A complete loss of the ability to perceive vibration." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Apallesthesia" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1837520
is_a: HP:0002495 ! Impaired vibratory sensation

