[Term]
id: HP:0006979
name: Sleep-wake cycle disturbance
synonym: "اضطراب دورة النوم واليقظة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مشاكل في النوم واليقظة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي اضطراب في إيقاع الساعة البيولوجية للفرد يؤثر على توقيت النوم واليقظة يعتبر اضطراباً في دورة النوم واليقظة.
def: "Any abnormality of an individual's circadian rhythm that affects the timing of sleeping and being awake is referred to as a sleep-wake disorder." [PMID:30725708, PMID:36115370, PMID:36872502]
comment: Often, patients complain of insomnia when their desired sleep-wake cycle is inconsistent with their intrinsic rhythms.
synonym: "Internal-clock disorders" EXACT []
synonym: "Sleep phase disturbance" EXACT []
synonym: "Sleep-wake cycle disorders" EXACT []
synonym: "Sleep-wake cycle disturbance" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Sleep-wake mistiming" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1833362
is_a: HP:0002360 ! Sleep disturbance
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6262-8264
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9446-5121
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1592-0825
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4672-4923
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5554-6946
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7367-663X

