[Term]
id: HP:0007281
name: Developmental stagnation
synonym: "توقف النمو" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "توقف في تطور الطفل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توقف في تطور الطفل في مجالات المهارات الحركية والكلام واللغة، والمهارات العقلية والاجتماعية أو العاطفية.
alt_id: HP:0007130
alt_id: HP:0007198
def: "A cessation of the development of a child in the areas of motor skills, speech and language, cognitive skills, and social and/or emotional skills." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Developmental arrest" EXACT []
