[Term]
id: HP:0007285
name: Facial palsy secondary to cranial hyperostosis
synonym: "شلل الوجه الثانوي لضخامة العظام القحفية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شلل الوجه الناتج عن تضخم العظام بالقحف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شلل في الأعصاب الوجهية الناتج عن نمو مفرط في العظام القحفية مما يسبب ضغطاً على العصب القحفي السابع.
def: "Paralysis of the facial nerves on the basis of overgrowth of the cranial bones causing impingement upon the seventh cranial nerve." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Facial palsy caused by enlargement of cranial bones" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Facial palsy caused by excessive growth of facial bones" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Facial palsy caused by overgrowth of cranial bones" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Facial palsy secondary to hypertrophy of cranial bones" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
