is_a: HP:0005465 ! Facial hyperostosis

[Term]
id: HP:0007286
name: Horizontal jerk nystagmus
synonym: "رأرأة أفقية رَجّاعة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تحرك غير طبيعي للعينين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الرأرأة يتكون من حركات عينية أفقية ذهابًا وإيابًا، حيث تكون الحركة في اتجاه واحدة أسرع من الاتجاه الآخر.
def: "Nystagmus consisting of horizontal to-and-fro eye movements, in which the movement in one direction is faster than in the other." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Pendular nystagmus refers to the situation in which the eye appeared to oscillate with equal speed in either direction, in contrast to jerk nystagmus, in which the movement in one direction is faster than in the other.
xref: UMLS:C4024910
is_a: HP:0000666 ! Horizontal nystagmus

