[Term]
id: HP:0007305
name: CNS demyelination
synonym: "إزالة النخاعين في الجهاز العصبي المركزي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقدان المادة العازلة في الأعصاب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان الميالين من الألياف العصبية في الجهاز العصبي المركزي.
alt_id: HP:0007222
def: "A loss of myelin from nerve fibers in the central nervous system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: CNS demyelination affects the white matter, which consists mostly of axons with their envelope of myelin, along with two types of neuroglia: oligo-dendrocytes and astrocytes.
synonym: "Demyelination in central white matter" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C0338474
is_a: HP:0011400 ! Abnormal CNS myelination

[Term]
id: HP:0007307
name: Rapid neurologic deterioration
synonym: "تدهور عصبي سريع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقدان سريع للوظائف العصبية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان الوظيفة العصبية في فترة زمنية تعتبر سريعة نسبيًا، على سبيل المثال، فقدان إحدى معالم النمو أو تفاقم كبير للمضاعفات العصبية مثل النوبات أو صعوبات التغذية خلال بضعة أشهر.
def: "Loss of neurological function in a time frame that is considered relatively quick, for instance, loss of a develomental milestone or substantial exacerbation of neurological complications such as seizures or feeding difficulties within a few months." []
xref: UMLS:C4024908
is_a: HP:0002344 ! Progressive neurologic deterioration

