[Term]
id: HP:0007417
name: Discoid lupus rash
synonym: "طفح الذئبة القرصي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح جلدي أحمر متقشر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: آفة جلدية تتطور كلطخة حمراء جافة ومتقشرة، تتحول لاحقًا إلى صفيحة متصلبة وفرط تصبغ مع وجود قشور ملتصقة. قد يسبب التندب بقعًا بيضاء مركزية (فقدان التصبغ) وتآكل الجلد.
alt_id: HP:0000981
def: "Cutaneous lesion that develops as a dry, scaly, red patch that evolves to an indurated and hyperpigmented plaque with adherent scale. Scarring may result in central white patches (loss of pigmentation) and skin atrophy." []
comment: This lesion is characteristic of discoid lupus erythematosus, but similar lesions may be observed in other diseases.
synonym: "Discoid lupus erythematosus" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:200938002
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:238927000
xref: UMLS:C0024138
