def: "Keratinization of the bulbar conjunctiva near the limbus (corneoscleral junction), resulting in a raised spot." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Bitot spots can be a feature of vitamin A deficiency.
synonym: "Bitot's spots" RELATED []
