[Term]
id: HP:0007703
name: Abnormal retinal pigmentation
synonym: "شذوذ تصبغ الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير لون الشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن التصبغ الطبيعي للشبكية.
alt_id: HP:0007741
alt_id: HP:0007743
alt_id: HP:0008051
def: "Any deviation from the normal pigmentation of the retina." []
comment: This includes abnormalities of the pigmentation of the RPE and intraretinal pigment migration. An abnormality of the retina characterized by pigment deposition. It is typically associated with migration and proliferation of macrophages or retinal pigment epithelial cells into the neuroretina; melanin from these cells causes the pigmentary changes. Pigmentary retinopathy is a common final pathway of many retinal conditions and is often associated with visual loss.
synonym: "Abnormality of retinal pigment epithelium" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of retinal pigmentation" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of RPE" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the retinal pigment epithelium" RELATED []
synonym: "Retinal pigmentary anomaly" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:421689001
xref: UMLS:C1720508
xref: UMLS:C1862475
is_a: HP:0000479 ! Abnormal retinal morphology

