synonym: "عمى الألوان الكلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم القدرة التامة على تمييز الألوان" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: العمى الكلي للألوان، وهو عدم القدرة التامة على تمييز الألوان. الأشخاص المصابون لا يمكنهم رؤية الألوان، فقط درجات اللون الرمادي.
alt_id: HP:0007954
def: "Complete color blindness, a complete inability to distinguish colors. Affected persons cannot perceive colors, but only shades of gray." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8727-6592]
comment: Rod monochromacy is the condition of having only rods in the retina. A rod monochromat is truly unable to see any color and can see only shades of gray.
synonym: "Complete achromatopsia" EXACT []
synonym: "Total colorblindness" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:56852002
xref: UMLS:C0152200
xref: UMLS:C1857618
is_a: HP:0000551 ! Color vision defect

