alt_id: HP:0001124
def: "Mottling (spots or blotches of different shades) of the retinal pigment epithelium, i.e., localized or generalized fundus pigment granularity associated with processes at the level of the retinal pigment epithelium." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Focal hypopigmentation of the retinal pigment epithelium" EXACT []
synonym: "Retinal pigment epithelium irregularity" EXACT []
