[Term]
id: HP:0007843
name: Attenuation of retinal blood vessels
synonym: "تضيق الأوعية الدموية الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضيق الأوعية في مؤخرة العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تضيق الأوعية الدموية الشبكية، سواء الشرايين الصغيرة أو الأوردة، مما يؤثر على تدفق الدم في الشبكية.
def: "Narrowing of the retinal blood vessels, both arterioles and venules." [PMID:22661482]
comment: Attenuation of retinal blood vessels is commonly seen in conditions with reduced photoreceptor cell metabolism and intact choroid, such as Retinitis Pigmentosa or vitamin A deficiency, or loss of inner retina, such as after central retinal artery occlusion. Narrowing may also be seen in accelerated hypertension and chronic hypertension.
synonym: "Narrowing of blood vessels in back of eye" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: UMLS:C3278975
is_a: HP:0008046 ! Abnormal retinal vascular morphology

