[Term]
id: HP:0007984
name: Electronegative electroretinogram
synonym: "مخطط الشبكية الكهربي سالب الشحنة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تخطيط شبكية غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مخطط الشبكية الكهربي للضوء الساطع المظلم التكيف يظهر فيه الموجة الثانية (b-wave) منخفضة بشكل كبير مقارنة بالموجة الأولى (a-wave).
def: "A dark-adapted bright flash electroretinogram in which the b-wave that is of markedly lower amplitude than the associated a-wave (source: Holder GE., Inherited Chorioretinal Dystrophies: A Textbook and Atlas; 2014; p.17; ISBN 978-3-540-69466-3)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Flashes will elicit an a-wave with an initial negative deflection followed by a b-wave with positive deflection. This feature refers to a reduction in the amplitude primarily of the b-wave.
synonym: "Electronegative ERG" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Electroretinogram: reduced b-wave amplitude" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced amplitude of dark-adapted bright flash electroretinogram b-wave" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced electroretinogram rod b-wave" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced ERG amplitude of b-wave" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021561
is_a: HP:0030478 ! Abnormal amplitude of dark-adapted bright flash electroretinogram

[Term]
id: HP:0007985
name: Retinal arteriolar occlusion
synonym: "انسداد الشرايين الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انسداد الشرايين في الشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انسداد في الشرايين الشبكية، يُعد هذا عادةً مرتبطًا بقطع تدفق الدم وتوصيل الأكسجين إلى المناطق المتأثرة من الشبكية. قد يؤثر ذلك على الهياكل الداخلية أو المتوسطة للشبكية.
def: "Blockage of retinal arteriole, generally associated with interruption of blood flow and oxygen delivery to affected regions of the retina. This can affect the inner or mid-retinal structures." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This can be due to embolic, inflammatory, or hyperviscosity disorders. This can be associated with Cotton wool spots. It is often referred to as Branch retinal artery occlusion.
synonym: "Blocked retinal arteriole" EXACT []
synonym: "Blocked retinal artery" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: UMLS:C4024761
is_a: HP:0000630 ! Abnormal retinal arterial/arteriolar morphology

