[Term]
id: HP:0008369
name: Abnormal tarsal ossification
synonym: "شذوذ تعظم رسغي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تصلب عظام الكاحل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في تشكيل وتكلس أي من عظام الرسغ، وهي سبع عظام القدم المكونة من العقب والكاحل والعظمة المكعبة والعظم القنوي والعظام الوتدية.
def: "An abnormality of the formation and mineralization of any of the tarsal bones, seven bones of the foot comprising the calcaneus, talus, cuboid, navicular, and the cuneiform bones." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormal maturation of ankle bones" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Abnormal ossification of tarsal bones" EXACT []
synonym: "Hardening of ankle bones" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
