alt_id: HP:0008448
alt_id: HP:0008474
def: "A reduction of the distance between vertebral pedicles, which are the two short, thick processes, which project backward, one on either side, from the upper part of the vertebral body, at the junction of its posterior and lateral surfaces." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
