[Term]
id: HP:0008633
name: Agonadism
synonym: "فقدان الغدد التناسلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم وجود الأعضاء التناسلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب الغدد التناسلية (الغدد التناسلية هي الأعضاء التي تنتج الخلايا الجنسية؛ الخصية عند الذكور والمبيض عند الإناث).
def: "Absence of sex glands (gonads are the organs that produce gametes; testis in males and ovary in females)." []
comment: Gonadal agenesis refers to the lack of development of gonads during fetal development; it may not be possible clinically to determine if gonal tissue was present at any point of development. For this reason, we regard agonadism and gonadal agenesis as synonymous.
synonym: "Absent gonadal tissue" EXACT []
synonym: "Gonadal agenesis" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4024652
is_a: HP:0000812 ! Abnormal internal genitalia

[Term]
id: HP:0008635
name: Urinary bladder wall hypertrophy
synonym: "تضخم في جدار المثانة البولية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في سمك جدار المثانة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في سمك جدار المثانة البولية. يمكن أن يظهر هذا في حالات مثل انسداد مخرج المثانة وقد يصاحبه زيادة في التربيق في عضلات جدار المثانة.
def: "Increase in thickness of the wall of the urinary bladder. This finding may be seen in conditions such as bladder outlet obstruction and may be accompanied by increased trabeculation of the bladder wall musculature." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:11002301]
synonym: "Hypertrophic urinary bladder" EXACT []
synonym: "Hypertrophy of the urinary bladder wall" EXACT []
synonym: "Urinary bladder wall thickening" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021531
is_a: HP:0025487 ! Abnormal bladder morphology

