synonym: "توسع الحالب منذ الولادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب في التطور يؤدي إلى توسع شديد في الحالب.
def: "A developmental disturbance with extreme ureteral dilatation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The cause of congenital megaloureter is thought to be aperistalsis of the distal ureter, leading to dilatation. The defect in peristalsis may be due to faulty development of muscle layers of ureter, that is, there is a functional, not a mechanical cause of obstruction.
synonym: "Congenital megaloureter" EXACT []
synonym: "Primary megaloureter" EXACT []
synonym: "Primary megaureter" EXACT []
