[Term]
id: HP:0008807
name: Acetabular dysplasia
synonym: "خلل تنسجي في الجوف الحقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في تكوين الجوف الحقي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: جوف الحقي أصغر من المعدل الطبيعي مما يؤدي إلى تغطية غير كافية لرأس عظم الفخذ، مما يتسبب في ضغوط غير طبيعية على مفصل الورك وعدم استقرار وألم.
alt_id: HP:0008799
def: "A smaller than normal acetabulum that has insufficient femoral head coverage leading to abnormal hip joint contact pressures, instability and pain." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157, PMID:23764788, PMID:34377520]
comment: Acetabular dysplasia can lead to hip pain and early-onset hip osteoarthritis.
synonym: "Decreased femoral head coverage by acetabulum" RELATED []
synonym: "Dysplastic acetabulae" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1328407
is_a: HP:0003170 ! Abnormal acetabulum morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0008808
name: High iliac wing
synonym: "الجناح الحرقفي العالي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "جناح الحرقفة العالي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في ارتفاع جناح الحرقفة (أو الآلة) الذي هو الجزء الكبير المتوسع الذي يحد الحوض الأكبر من الجوانب).
alt_id: HP:0008778
def: "Increased height of the wing (or ala) of the ilium (which is the large expanded portion which bounds the greater pelvis laterally)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "High iliac wings" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Narrow, high iliac wings" EXACT []
