comment: Arabic Definition: رأس الفخذ الذي يأخذ شكلًا مسطحًا بشكل غير طبيعي.
def: "An abnormally flattened femoral head." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Flat head of thigh bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Flattened femoral heads" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
