synonym: "عنق الفخذ الضيق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: قطر عنق الفخذ المضيق بشكل غير طبيعي، وهو الجزء الذي يربط بين رأس الفخذ وجسم عظمة الفخذ.
def: "An abnormally reduced diameter of the femoral neck (which is the process of bone, connecting the femoral head with the femoral shaft)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Narrow femoral necks" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Narrow neck of thigh bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
