id: HP:0008820
name: Absent ossification of capital femoral epiphysis
synonym: "عدم التعظم في مشاشة رأس عظم الفخذ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم تكوين العظم في رأس عظم الفخذ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب التعظم في المشاشة القريبة من الفخذ.
def: "Lack of ossification of the proximal epiphysis of the femur." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The ossification center of the capital femoral epiphysis appears at the end of the first year after birth.
synonym: "Absent ossification of femoral capital epiphyses" EXACT []
