[Term]
id: HP:0008835
name: Multicentric femoral head ossification
synonym: "تعظم رأس الفخذ متعدد المراكز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تعظم متعدد برأس عظم الفخذ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يوجد عادة مركز تعظم واحد في رأس عظم الفخذ. ينطبق هذا المصطلح إذا كان هناك مراكز تعظم متعددة.
def: "There is normally one ossification center in the head of the femur. This term applies if there are multiple such centers." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Additionally, the ossification center of the capital femoral epiphysis appears at the end of the first year after birth. This is not what this term refers to.
