[Term]
id: HP:0008866
name: Failure to thrive secondary to recurrent infections
synonym: "فشل في النمو لثانوي لعدوى متكررة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص الوزن بسبب العدوى المتكررة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدم كفاية زيادة الوزن أو فقدان الوزن غير المناسب لطفل، وهذا يُعزَى إلى العدوى المتكررة الذاتية.
def: "Insufficient weight gain or inappropriate weight loss for a child, that is attributed to an endogenous recurrent infections." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Failure_to_thrive]
synonym: "Faltering weight secondary to recurrent infections" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Weight faltering secondary to recurrent infections" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
