[Term]
id: HP:0009102
name: Anterior open-bite malocclusion
synonym: "إطباق مفتوح أمامي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فجوة بين الأسنان الأمامية العلوية والسفلية أثناء العض" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الإطباق المفتوح الأمامي هو انحراف في الإطباق يتميز بوجود فجوة بين الأسنان الأمامية (القواطع)، نتيجة لعدم كفاية التداخل الرأسي الطبيعي بين حواف القواطع عند إطباق الأسنان الخلفية.
alt_id: HP:0200095
def: "Anterior open bite is a malocclusion characterized by a gap between the anterior teeth (incisors), that is, by a deficiency in the normal vertical overlap between antagonist incisal edges when the posterior teeth are in occlusion." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9338-3017, PMID:27615261]
synonym: "Absence of overlap of anterior upper and lower teeth" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Anterior open bite" EXACT []
synonym: "Anterior open bite between upper and lower teeth" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Anterior openbite" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "AOB" EXACT abbreviation [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Apertognathia malocclusion" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Gap between upper and lower front teeth when biting" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: UMLS:C4024598
is_a: HP:0000689 ! Dental malocclusion
is_a: HP:0010807 ! Open bite

