is_a: HP:0009388 ! Ivory epiphyses of the 5th finger
is_a: HP:0010274 ! Ivory epiphyses of the proximal phalanges of the hand
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2008-12-22T05:50:39Z

