is_a: HP:0009375 ! Bullet-shaped phalanges of the 5th finger
is_a: HP:0009845 ! Bullet-shaped middle phalanges of the hand
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2008-12-29T02:44:53Z

