[Term]
id: HP:0009183
name: Joint contracture of the 5th finger
synonym: "تقلص المفصل للإصبع الخامس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان مزمن لحركة المفصل في الإصبع الخامس بسبب تغييرات هيكلية في الأنسجة غير العظمية. يُستخدم مصطلح تقفُّع الإصبع الخامس إذا تأثرت المفاصل البعيدة و/أو القريبة.
alt_id: HP:0001184
def: "Chronic loss of joint motion in the 5th finger due to structural changes in non-bony tissue. The term camptodactyly of the 5th finger is used if the distal and/or proximal interphalangeal joints are affected." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "5th finger camptodactyly" RELATED []
synonym: "Fifth finger camptodactyly" RELATED []
xref: UMLS:C1865702
is_a: HP:0004207 ! Abnormal 5th finger morphology
is_a: HP:0012785 ! Flexion contracture of finger
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2008-12-29T04:11:30Z

