[Term]
id: HP:0009193
name: Metacarpal pseudoepiphysis
synonym: "شذوذ في مشاشة العظم السنعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شكل غير طبيعي في العظم السنعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: المشاشة المزدوجة هي مركز تعظم ثانوي يختلف عن المشاشة العادية. توجد المشاشات العادية في نهاية العظام السنعية. يمكن أحيانًا ملاحظة مشاشات فرعية (معروفة أيضًا بالمشاشات المزدوجة) في نهايات العظام السنعية الخاصة بالإصبع الثاني.
alt_id: HP:0006091
alt_id: HP:0006164
def: "A pseudoepiphysis is a secondary ossification center distinct from the normal epiphysis. The normal metacarpal epiphyses are located at the distal ends of the metacarpal bones. Accessory epiphyses (which are also known as pseudoepiphyses) can also occasionally be observed at the proximal ends of the metacarpals, usually involving the 2nd metacarpal bone." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "Accessory proximal metacarpal ossification centers" EXACT []
synonym: "Accessory proximal metacarpal ossification centres" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Metacarpal pseudoepiphyses" EXACT []
synonym: "Pseudoepiphyses of the metacarpals" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1860253
is_a: HP:0004288 ! Pseudoepiphyses of hand bones
is_a: HP:0005913 ! Abnormal metacarpal epiphysis morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2008-12-30T02:03:34Z

