def: "A triangular appearance of the epiphysis of the distal phalanx of the 3rd finger of the hand. This epiphysis is located at the proximal end of the phalanx and is normally nearly flat." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Delta-shaped epiphysis of the distal phalanx of the 3rd finger" EXACT []
synonym: "Triangular end part of the outermost long bone of the middle finger" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4021489
