[Term]
id: HP:0009383
name: Bracket epiphyses of the 5th finger
synonym: "مشاشات الترقوة للإصبع الخامس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نهاية عظم الإصبع الصغير بشكل قوس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وشذوذ الإصبع الخامس حيث يحيط المشاش عظمة السلامى بشكل قوسي يصل من الجانب القريب للسلامى حتى الجانب البعيد.
def: "An abnormality of the fifth finger in which the epiphysis surrounds a phalangeal bone, having a bracket-like form and reaching from the proximal side of a phalanx to the distal side." [PMID:24432108]
synonym: "Bracket shaped end part of little finger bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Bracket shaped end part of pinkie finger bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
