alt_id: HP:0006142
def: "A secondary ossification center in the second finger that is distinct from the normal epiphysis that does not contribute to the longitudinal growth of a tubular bone." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Accessory index finger epiphysis" EXACT []
