id: HP:0009554
name: Preauricular hair displacement
synonym: "ازاحة شعر قبل الأذن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نمو الشعر على الخد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: امتداد يشبه اللسان للشعر نحو الخدين، حيث يمتد نمو الشعر أمام الأذن إلى عظام الخد الجانبية.
def: "An tongue-like extension of hair towards the cheeks, in which hair growth extends in front of the ear to the lateral cheekbones." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Hair displacement, preauricular, towards lateral cheekbone" EXACT []
synonym: "Hair growing down to cheek" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Projection of scalp hair onto lateral cheek" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4024296
is_a: HP:0009553 ! Abnormality of the hairline
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2009-01-21T05:21:54Z

