xref: SNOMEDCT_US:126949007
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:985004
xref: UMLS:C0027859
is_a: HP:0009591 ! Abnormal vestibulocochlear nerve morphology
is_a: HP:0040096 ! Neoplasm of the inner ear
is_a: HP:0100008 ! Schwannoma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2009-01-28T10:37:32Z

