alt_id: HP:0005697
def: "Chronic loss of joint motion of the interphalangeal joint of the thumb due to structural changes in non-bony tissue. This joint is also called Articulatio interphalangealis pollicis." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Contracture of the interphalangeal joint of the thumb" EXACT []
synonym: "Interphalangeal extension contractures of thumbs" EXACT []
