def: "Triangular shaped distal phalanx of the thumb. A triangular or so called delta shaped phalanx is a typical result after a bracket epiphysis of the affected phalanx." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Triangular shaped outermost bone of the thumb" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
