[Term]
id: HP:0009654
name: Osteolytic defect of thumb phalanx
synonym: "عيب تحلل العظام في سلاميات الإبهام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تآكل العظام في الإبهام" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تحلل أو تدهور نسيج العظام في واحدة أو أكثر من سلاميات الإبهام.
def: "Dissolution or degeneration of bone tissue of one or more phalanges of the thumb." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Osteolytic lesions are visible on radiography as demarcated areas of radiolucency ('darkness').
synonym: "Osteolytic defects of the phalanges of the thumb" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4020905
