alt_id: HP:0006041
def: "Fusion involving two or more metacarpal bones (A synostosis of the first metacarpal and the proximal phalanx of the thumb can also be observed, note that the first metacarpal bone corresponds to a proximal phalanx)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
