is_a: HP:0011314 ! Abnormal long bone morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-02-23T05:17:25Z

[Term]
id: HP:0009830
name: Peripheral neuropathy
synonym: "اعتلال عصبي محيطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اعتلال الأعصاب الطرفية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الاعتلال العصبي المحيطي هو مصطلح شامل لأي اضطراب في الجهاز العصبي المحيطي. تشمل السمات السريرية الرئيسية المستخدمة لتصنيف الاعتلال العصبي المحيطي التوزيع والنوع (خاصة الاعتلال الميليني مقابل المحور العصبي) والمدة والمسار.
alt_id: HP:0003157
alt_id: HP:0003407
alt_id: HP:0007088
alt_id: HP:0007235
alt_id: HP:0007355
def: "Peripheral neuropathy is a general term for any disorder of the peripheral nervous system. The main clinical features used to classify peripheral neuropathy are distribution, type (mainly demyelinating versus mainly axonal), duration, and course." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: Terms from this subhierarchy should be used to describe functional abnormalities seen in peripheral neuropathy. Morphological abnormalities should be coded separately.
synonym: "Neuropathy" RELATED []
synonym: "Peripheral nerve damage" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Peripheral neuritis" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:302226006
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:386033004
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:42658009
xref: UMLS:C0031117
xref: UMLS:C0442874
is_a: HP:0032120 ! Abnormal peripheral nervous system physiology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2009-03-01T07:49:18Z

[Term]
id: HP:0009831
name: Mononeuropathy
synonym: "اعتلال عصبي أحادي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تلف عصب واحد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إصابة بؤرية لعصب محيطي واحد. يكون التلف في العصب الحسي مصحوبًا بضعف حسي في جميع الأنماط في التوزيع التشريحي المصاب.
def: "A focal lesion of a single peripheral nerve. Damage to a sensory nerve is accompanied by sensory impairment of all modalities in the affected anatomic distribution." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Single damaged nerve" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
