[Term]
id: HP:0009901
name: Crumpled ear
synonym: "أذن مجعدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه في مسار الطيات الطبيعية للأذن وظهور طيات وسياقات إضافية.
def: "Distortion of the course of the normal folds of the ear and the appearance of supernumerary crura and folds." [PMID:19152421]
comment: This is distinct from Stahl ear and Shell ear, with which the term has sometimes been conflated. The appearance often changes markedly after birth.
