synonym: "Enlarged nares" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Enlarged nostril" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased diameter of nares" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased diameter of nostril" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased width of nares" EXACT []
synonym: "Large nares" EXACT []
synonym: "Naris, broad" EXACT []
synonym: "Naris, enlarged" EXACT []
synonym: "Wide nares" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Wide nostril" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
