[Term]
id: HP:0009972
name: Duplication of phalanx of 4th finger
synonym: "ازدواج سلامية الإصبع الرابع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ازدواج عظام الإصبع الرابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق هذا المصطلح إذا كانت واحدة أو أكثر من سلاميات الإصبع الرابع مكررة جزئيًا، مما يؤدي إلى مظهر واسع أو مشقوق للسلاميات، أو مكررة بالكامل.
def: "This term applies if one or more of the phalanges of the 4th finger are either partially duplicated, depending on severity leading to a broad or bifid appearance of the phalanges, or completely duplicated." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "Duplication of bones of the ring finger" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Partial/complete duplication of phalanges of the 4th finger" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021359
is_a: HP:0009172 ! Abnormal 4th finger phalanx morphology
is_a: HP:0009971 ! Polydactyly affecting the 4th finger
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-05-26T02:19:28Z

[Term]
id: HP:0009973
name: Complete duplication of the phalanges of the 4th finger
synonym: "ازدواج كامل لسلاميات الإصبع الرابع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ازدواج كامل لعظام الإصبع الرابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ازدواج كامل يؤثر على واحدة أو أكثر من سلاميات الإصبع الرابع. بخلاف الازدواج الجزئي حيث لا يزال هناك درجة متغيرة من الاندماج بين العظام المكررة، فإن الازدواج الكامل يؤدي إلى ظهور عظمتين منفصلتين بجانب بعضهما البعض (محور شعاعي-زندي) كما يظهر في الأشعة السينية.
def: "A complete duplication affecting one or more of the phalanges of the 4th finger. As opposed to a partial duplication were there is still a variable degree of fusion between the duplicated bones, a complete duplication leads to two separate bones appearing side to side (radio-ulnar axis) as seen on x-rays. A duplication leading to an accessory bone appearing in the proximo-distal axis on x-rays, this is actually a different entity called a Pseudoepiphyses (see according terms) sometimes also referred to as Hyperphalangism." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Complete duplication of the bones of the ring finger" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4024135
is_a: HP:0009972 ! Duplication of phalanx of 4th finger
is_a: HP:0009998 ! Complete duplication of phalanx of hand
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-05-26T02:20:08Z

[Term]
id: HP:0009974
name: Partial duplication of the phalanges of the 4th finger
synonym: "ازدواج جزئي لسلاميات الإصبع الرابع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ازدواج جزئي لعظام الإصبع الرابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ازدواج جزئي، يعتمد على شدة الحالة مما يؤدي إلى مظهر واسع أو مشقوق، يؤثر على واحدة أو أكثر من سلاميات الإصبع الرابع. بخلاف الازدواج الكامل، لا يزال هناك درجة متغيرة من الاندماج بين العظام المكررة.
def: "A partial duplication, depending on severity leading to a broad or bifid appearance, affecting one or more of the phalanges of the 4th finger. As opposed to a complete duplication there is still a variable degree of fusion between the duplicated bones." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Partial duplication of the bones of the ring finger" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4024134
