[Term]
id: HP:0010229
name: Bracket epiphyses of the phalanges of the hand
synonym: "مشاشات على شكل قوس في سلاميات اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شكل مشاشة قوسية في نهاية عظام الأصابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تصف المشاشة القوسية شذوذاً حيث تحيط المشاشة بعظمة السلامية، وتأخذ شكل قوس يمتد من الجانب القريب إلى الجانب البعيد للسلامية.
alt_id: HP:0009360
def: "Bracket epiphysis refers to an abnormality in which the epiphysis surrounds a phalangeal bone, having a bracket-like form and reaching from the proximal side of a phalanx to the distal side." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:24432108]
synonym: "Bracket epiphyses of the fingers" EXACT []
synonym: "Bracket shaped end part of finger bones" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4021309
is_a: HP:0005920 ! Abnormal epiphysis morphology of the phalanges of the hand
is_a: HP:0010578 ! Bracket epiphyses
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-07-06T03:31:52Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010230
name: Cone-shaped epiphyses of the phalanges of the hand
synonym: "مشاش مخروطية الشكل لسلاميات اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نهاية عظام الأصابع مخروطية الشكل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مظهر مخروطي الشكل للمشاش في أصابع اليد، مما يخلق مظهر كرة في التجويف. الكيان المرتبط 'المشاش على شكل ملاك' يشير إلى مشاش مخروطية الشكل بارزة بالاشتراك مع مشاش زائف في النهاية البعيدة للسلامية.
alt_id: HP:0001175
alt_id: HP:0001207
alt_id: HP:0001242
alt_id: HP:0003766
alt_id: HP:0005803
alt_id: HP:0009361
def: "A cone-shaped appearance of the epiphyses of the fingers of the hand, producing a 'ball-in-a-socket' appearance. The related entity 'angel-shaped' epiphysis refers to a pronounced cone-shaped epiphysis in combination with a pseudoepiphysis at the distal end of a phalanx." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Cone-shaped end part of finger bones" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Cone-shaped epiphyses of hand" EXACT []
synonym: "Cone-shaped epiphyses of the fingers" EXACT []
synonym: "Coned epiphyses of hands" EXACT []
synonym: "Conical phalangeal epiphyses" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1859480
is_a: HP:0005920 ! Abnormal epiphysis morphology of the phalanges of the hand
is_a: HP:0034281 ! Phalangeal cone-shaped epiphyses
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-07-06T03:31:52Z

