def: "Increased pigmentation, either focal or generalized, of the mucosa of the mouth." [PMID:19125428]
comment: Pigmentation of alveolar ridges is common in people with dark skin pigmentation. This term encompasses a range of pigmentary findings, from freckles to generalized hyperpigmentation.
