synonym: "بروز التجاعيد الحنكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في حجم و/أو عدد الطيات النسجية الناعمة على الجانب الحنكي للحد السنخي العلوي.
def: "Increased size and/or number of soft tissue folds on the palatal side of the maxillary alveolar ridge." [PMID:19125428]
comment: Soft tissue folds are typically present on the lateral sides of the palate, especially anteriorly.
