comment: Arabic Definition: الشق القصي هو تشوه خلقي نادر ناتج عن فشل في التحام عظم القص.
def: "The sternal cleft is a rare congenital anomaly resulting from a fusion failure of the sternum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Various degrees of bifid sternum may occur, varying from an enlarged suprasternal notch to complete separation of the two halves of the sternum. Ectopia cordis may or may not accompany this defect in its more severe form.
