is_a: HP:0010342 ! Abnormality of the phalanges of the 5th toe
is_a: HP:0100929 ! Sclerosis of 5th toe phalanx
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-07-16T11:52:18Z

