[Term]
id: HP:0010444
name: Pulmonic regurgitation
synonym: "قصور صمام الرئة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "رجوع الدم في صمام الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التدفق العكسي للدم من خلال صمام الرئوي إلى البطين الأيمن خلال انبساط القلب.
def: "The retrograde (backwards) flow of blood through the pulmonary valve into the right ventricle during diastole." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3302-4610, PMID:32491496]
comment: The pulmonary valve directs blood from the right ventricle (RV) towards the pulmonary arteries during systole.
