def: "An abnormality of the sacrosciatic notch, i.e., the deep indentation in the posterior border of the hip bone at the point of union of the ilium and ischium." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormality of greater sciatic notch" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the greater sacrosciatic notch" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the sacroiliac notch" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4023822
