[Term]
id: HP:0010478
name: Abnormality of the urachus
synonym: "شذوذ في السرة الجنينية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شذوذ في الأنبوب الجنين أسفل السرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في السرة الجنينية، وهو الأنبوب الذي يربط المثانة البولية لدى الجنين مع السرة.
def: "Abnormality of the urachus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The urachus is a vestigial embryonic structure, a canal that connects the urinary bladder of the fetus with the allantois (a structure involved in the development of the umbilical cord). During embryonic development, the lumen of the urachus is normally obliterated, transforming the urachus into a solid cord.
xref: UMLS:C4023811
