[Term]
id: HP:0010487
name: Small hypothenar eminence
synonym: "صغر بارز الراحي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص بروزة راحة اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض حجم العضلات في جانب الزندي من راحة اليد، أي انخفاض في حجم بروز الراحي الغضروفي.
alt_id: HP:0005721
def: "Reduced muscle mass on the ulnar side of the palm, that is, reduction in size of the hypothenar eminence." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19125433]
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Hypoplasia of the hypothenar eminence" EXACT []
