[Term]
id: HP:0010529
name: Echolalia
synonym: "الترديد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ترديد الكلام" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الترديد هو التكرار الآلي للترددات الصوتية أو الكلمات أو العبارات دون وعي صريح. غالبًا ما تكون الكلمات أو العبارات المكررة غريبة أو تُستخدم بطريقة غير اجتماعية. يمكن أن تكون هذه كلمات أو عبارات سمعها الفرد المتأثر أو اخترعها.
def: "Echolalia is the automatic imitative repetition of sounds, words, or phrases in the absence of explicit awareness. The repeated words or phrases are typically odd or used in a non-social manner. These can be words or phrases that the affected individual has heard or invented." [PMID:31651053]
synonym: "Echoing another person's speech" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
synonym: "Echologia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
synonym: "Echophrasia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
synonym: "Repeated speech" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
