[Term]
id: HP:0010541
name: Cutis gyrata of scalp
synonym: "جلد الشعاب المتجعد على الفروة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تجاعيد فروة الرأس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود طيات وتجاعيد متعرجة ناتجة عن سماكة الجلد في فروة الرأس، بشكل يشبه النمط الدماغي. تحتوي فروة الرأس على طيات معقدة ومرتفعة، تتراوح سماكتها بين 1 إلى 2 سم. عادة لا يمكن تسوية الطيات بالضغط عليها.
def: "The presence of convoluted folds and furrows formed from thickened skin of the scalp, resembling cerebriform pattern. The scalp has convoluted and elevated folds, 1 to 2 cm in thickness. The convolutions generally cannot be flattened by traction." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Cutis verticis gyrata" EXACT []
synonym: "Furrows in thickened skin on top of scalp" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Scalp folds" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Scalp furrows" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Scalp rugae" EXACT []
synonym: "Thickened folds on top of scalp" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Thickening of the scalp" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:51603000
xref: UMLS:C0263417
xref: UMLS:C4072877
xref: UMLS:C4280378
