[Term]
id: HP:0010605
name: Chalazion
synonym: "شالازيون" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم في الجفن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب حُبيبي مزمن للخلايا الظهارية في غدة الميبوميان ناتج عن انسداد والتهاب الغدة، يظهر كتلون عديم الألم في الجفن الأعلى دون فقدان الرموش.
def: "A chronic epithelioid cell granulomatous inflammation of the meibomian gland caused by inflammation of a blocked meibomian gland. A chalazion or meibomian cyst appears as a painless tuberous swelling in the upper lid without loss of eyelashes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Meibomian gland lipogranuloma" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:1482004
xref: UMLS:C0007933
is_a: HP:0010604 ! Cyst of the eyelid
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-10-27T10:58:24Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010606
name: Hordeolum
synonym: "دمل الجفن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تورم مؤلم في الجفن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدوى صديدية حادة في غدد زيتس الدهنية عند قاعدة الرموش، أو غدد العرق المفرزة لمول أو غدد زيتية ميبوميانية بسبب عدوى ستافيلوكوكس. يظهر الدمل ككتل مؤلمة للغاية يمكن أن تسبب تورمًا شديدًا محليًا.
def: "An acute purulent infection of the sebaceous glands of Zeis at the base of the eyelashes, of the apocrine sweat glands of Moll or the meibomian sebacious glands often caused by staphylococcus infections. Hordeola can either occur as Hordeola externa affecting the sebaceous glands of Zeis or the apocrine sweat glands of Moll or as Hordeola interna affecting the meibomian sebacious glands. In contrast to chalazia, hordeola are extremely painful and can cause extreme local swelling." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "Red bump on eyelid" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Stye of eyelid" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:1489008
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:397513003
xref: UMLS:C0019917
xref: UMLS:C4280376
is_a: HP:0010732 ! Nodular changes affecting the eyelids
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2009-10-27T11:01:13Z

