def: "The presence of a fibroma of the ovary." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Ovarian fibromas belong to the sex cord-stromal tumor group of ovarian neoplasms. Ovarian fibromas are most frequent during middle age, and rare in children. Upon gross pathological inspection, ovary fibromas are firm and white or tan.
