[Term]
id: HP:0010758
name: Abnormality of the premaxilla
synonym: "شذوذ في عظم الفك العلوي الأمامي (ما قبل الفك)" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في عظم الفك الأمامي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في عظم الفك العلوي الأمامي، وهو الجزء الأكثر أنفوية من الفك العلوي الذي يحمل عادة الأنياب والأضراس الجانبية ويضم العمود الأنفي الأمامي والجانب السفلي من الحافة الدائرية للأنف. يحتوي العظم الأمامي للفك العلوي ع$ العظم والأسنان للحنك الأولي.
def: "An abnormality of the premaxilla, the most anterior part of the maxilla that usually bears the central and lateral incisors and includes the anterior nasal spine and inferior aspect of the piriform rim. The premaxilla contains the bone and teeth of the primary palate." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463, https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "Abnormality of the intermaxillary bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of the intermaxillary segment of the maxilla" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of the premaxillary bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of the primary palate bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: UMLS:C4023711
is_a: HP:0000326 ! Abnormal maxilla morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-04-23T10:59:07Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010759
name: Prominence of the premaxilla
synonym: "بروز مقدمة الفك العلوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بروز في مقدمة الفك العلوي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تموضع بارز لمقدمة الفك العلوي بالنسبة إلى بقية الفك العلوي أو الهيكل الوجهي أو الفك السفلي. ولا يحدث ذلك بالضرورة بسبب زيادة في الحجم (التضخم) لمقدمة الفك العلوي.
def: "Prominent positioning of the premaxilla in relation to the rest of the maxilla, the facial skeleton, or mandible. Not necessarily caused by an increase in size (hypertrophy of) the premaxilla." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463, https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154, PMID:19125436]
comment: As a consequence of prominence of the premaxilla, the overlying structures, the nose and philtrum, may appear prominent. There is increased convexity of the face and an increased nasolabial angle. In the presence of a normal sized mandible, retrognathia may be appreciated.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Anterior position of the premaxilla" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Anterior position of the primary palate bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Premaxillary bone excess" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Prominence of the intermaxillary bone" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Prominence of the primary palate bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Prominent premaxilla" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C2749369
is_a: HP:0010758 ! Abnormality of the premaxilla
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-04-23T11:01:23Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010760
name: Absent toe
synonym: "غياب إصبع القدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "إصبع قدم مفقود" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب إصبع من أصابع القدم، أي عدم وجود جميع السلاميات لإصبع القدم غير الإبهامي والأنسجة الرخوة المرتبطة بها.
alt_id: HP:0008084
alt_id: HP:0010108
alt_id: HP:0011306
def: "Aplasia of a toe. That is, absence of all phalanges of a non-hallux digit of the foot and the associated soft tissues." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This descriptor does NOT require absence of the metatarsal. The definition excludes partial absent hallux.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Absent toe" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Absent toes" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Aplasia of the toes" RELATED []
synonym: "Aplasia of toe" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C3553754
is_a: HP:0001991 ! Aplasia/Hypoplasia of toe
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-04-23T03:58:25Z

