alt_id: HP:0000186
def: "Gentle upward curve of the upper lip vermilion such that the center is placed well superior to the commissures." [PMID:19125428]
comment: The U-shaped upper vermilion is a more rounded version of the Tented upper lip vermilion. In U-shaped upper vermilion there is loss of the central groove of the Cupid's bow. Replaces: Carpmouth; Fish mouth (pejorative terms).
