property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-05T11:12:26Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010814
name: Abnormal position of hair whorl
synonym: "موقع غير طبيعي لبؤرة دوران الشعر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمو الشعر من نقطة واحدة على فروة الرأس في موقع غير جانبي للخط المنصف أو بعيداً عن قمة الجمجمة.
def: "Hair growth from a single point on the scalp in any location other than lateral to the midline and close to the vertex of the skull." [PMID:19125436]
comment: Placement of hair whorl should be described as parietal, vertex, eccentric, etc. In addition, the number of hair whorls should be noted. Five percent of the population has two whorls.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Abnormal location of hair swirl" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
