[Term]
id: HP:0010828
name: Hemifacial spasm
synonym: "تشنج نصفي الوجه" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشنجات في نصف الوجه" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تقلص كلوني أو توتري متقطع للعضلات التي يغذيها العصب الوجهي. ترتخي العضلات بين التقلصات.
def: "Intermittent clonic or tonic contraction of muscles supplied by facial nerve. Muscles are relaxed in between contractions." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12145388]
comment: Hemifacial spasm presents in the fifth or sixth decade of life, and is almost always unilateral. An attack usually begins with brief clonic movements of the orbicularis oculi and spreads over years to other facial muscles. Hemifacial spasm is often the result of chronic irritation of the facial nerve or nucleus.
synonym: "Hemifacial spasms" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Spasms on one side of the face" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:13753008
xref: UMLS:C0278152
is_a: HP:0003739 ! Myoclonic spasms
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T04:15:33Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010829
name: Impaired temperature sensation
synonym: "خلل في الإحساس بالحرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف في الإحساس بالحرارة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض القدرة على التمييز بين درجات الحرارة المختلفة.
alt_id: HP:0006901
alt_id: HP:0100772
def: "A reduced ability to discriminate between different temperatures." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Temperature sensation can be tested by touching the skin several seconds with a water flask filled to the desired temperature. Persons with normal temperature sensation should at least be able to identify as warm a flask that is 35-36 degrees C and identify as cool a flask at 28-32 degrees C.
synonym: "Abnormality of temperature sensation" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Impaired temperature sensation" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Impaired thermal sensitivity" EXACT []
synonym: "Loss of temperature sensation" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4021222
is_a: HP:0033748 ! Hypoesthesia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:08:10Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010830
name: Impaired tactile sensation
synonym: "خلل في الإحساس باللمس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف في الإحساس باللمس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في حاسة اللمس ويُختبر عادة باستخدام شعرة أو فرشاة رقيقة.
def: "A reduced sense of touch (tactile sensation). This is usually tested with a wisp of cotton or a fine camel's hair brush, by asking patients to say 'now' each time they feel the stimulus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormal thigmesthesia" EXACT []
synonym: "Impaired touch sensation" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Loss of tactile sensation" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021221
is_a: HP:0033748 ! Hypoesthesia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:09:54Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010831
name: Impaired proprioception
synonym: "خلل في الإحساس بالموضع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف في الإحساس بوضع الجسم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان أو ضعف في الإحساس بموقع أجزاء الجسم ووضع المفاصل.
alt_id: HP:0010870
def: "A loss or impairment of the sensation of the relative position of parts of the body and joint position." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormality of proprioception" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1856691
is_a: HP:0003474 ! Somatic sensory dysfunction
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:12:53Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010832
name: Abnormality of pain sensation
synonym: "شذوذ في الإحساس بالألم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مشاكل في الإحساس بالألم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الألم هو شعور غير مريح قد يتراوح بين انزعاج طفيف وألم شديدة. ينجم عنه تغيرات عصبية وهو غالبًا ما يصاحبه عنصر عاطفي. هذا المصطلح يشير إلى الشذوذ في الإحساس بالألم الناتج عن شذوذ في الألياف العصبية المختصة بنقل إشارات الألم إلى الدماغ.
def: "Pain is an unpleasant sensation that can range from mild, localized discomfort to agony, whereby the physical part of pain results from nerve stimulation and is often accompanied by an emotional component. This term groups abnormalities in pain sensation presumed to result from abnormalities related to the specific nerve fibers that carry the pain impulses to the brain." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4023691
is_a: HP:0033747 ! Abnormal exteroceptive sensation
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:15:58Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010833
name: Spontaneous pain sensation
synonym: "إحساس بالألم العفوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم يحدث بدون سبب واضح" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الألم العفوي هو نوع من الألم العصبي الذي يحدث دون وجود مثير واضح.
def: "Spontaneous pain is a kind of neuropathic pain which occurs without an identifiable trigger." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4023690
is_a: HP:0010832 ! Abnormality of pain sensation
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:19:19Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010834
name: Trophic changes related to pain
synonym: "تغيرات غذائية تتعلق بالألم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغيرات في الجلد والعضلات بسبب الألم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تُعبر التغيرات الغذائية عن شذوذ في منطقة الألم تشمل بشكل رئيسي ضعف الجلد والأنسجة أو العضلات، ترقق العظام، وتغير في نمو الشعر أو الأظافر.
def: "Trophic changes is a term used to describe abnormalities in the area of pain that include primarily wasting away of the skin, tissues, or muscle, thinning of the bones, and changes in how the hair or nails grow, including thickening or thinning of hair or brittle nails." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Trophic changes" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021220
is_a: HP:0010832 ! Abnormality of pain sensation
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:23:26Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010835
name: Dissociated sensory loss
synonym: "فقدان حسي منفصل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقدان جزئي للإحساس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمط لفقدان الحس يتميز بفقدان انتقائي للإحساس باللمس والإحساس بالموضع دون فقدان الألم أو درجة الحرارة، أو العكس.
def: "A pattern of sensory loss with selective loss of touch sensation and proprioception without loss of pain and temperature, or vice-versa." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Dissociated sensory loss indicates a focal lesion within the spinal cord or brainstem.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:87275002
xref: UMLS:C0278136
is_a: HP:0003474 ! Somatic sensory dysfunction
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:28:04Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010836
name: Abnormal circulating copper concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز النحاس في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستويات غير طبيعية للنحاس في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في تركيز النحاس.
def: "An abnormal concentration of copper." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: An abnormality in the concentration of copper, which normally occurs as a cofactor for a number of proteins including amine oxidases and chaperone proteins.
synonym: "Abnormal copper levels" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
