creation_date: 2010-07-10T07:39:09Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010837
name: Decreased circulating ceruloplasmin concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز السيرولوبلازمين في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض السيرولوبلازمين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض تركيز السيرولوبلازمين في الدم.
def: "Decreased concentration of ceruloplasmin in the blood." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:32119309]
comment: Ceruloplasmin is the major copper-carrying protein in the serum. Decreased serum ceruloplasmin levels can indicate other defects in copper metabolism.
synonym: "Decreased serum ceruloplasmin" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Decreased serum ceruloplasminA" EXACT []
synonym: "Hypoceruloplasminaemia" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Hypoceruloplasminemia" EXACT []
