[Term]
id: HP:0010891
name: Morbus Scheuermann
synonym: "مرض شويرمان" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انحناء في العمود الفقري عند الأطفال" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو تأخر نمو تطوري في صفائح الفقرات الختامية الذي قد يؤدي إلى تدمير ثانوي في الصفائح الختامية للفقرات وبروز النواة اللبية إلى جسم الفقرة (ما يعرف بعقيدات شمورل كما يظهر في الأشعة السينية).
def: "A developmental growth retardation of the vertebral end plates that may lead to secondary destruction of the vertebral end plates and protrusion of the nucleus pulposus into the vertebral body (so called Schmorl's nodes as seen on x-rays)." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: Scheuermann's disease usually manifests during the 2nd decade and leads to the appearance of the so called adolescence kyphosis. Late manifestations may be wedge-shaped vertebrae, platyspondyly and arthrosis affecting the verterbal collum.
synonym: "Calve disease" EXACT []
synonym: "Juvenile osteochondrosis of the spine" EXACT []
synonym: "Scheuermann disease" EXACT []
synonym: "Scheuermann kyphosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Sherman's Disease" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:53406005
xref: UMLS:C0036310
is_a: HP:0003468 ! Abnormal vertebral morphology
is_a: HP:0100323 ! Juvenile aseptic necrosis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-09-25T11:04:19Z

