[Term]
id: HP:0010920
name: Zonular cataract
synonym: "ساد المنطقة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عتامة عدسة في مناطق محددة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يتم تعريف ساد المنطقة بأنه حالة تؤثر على مناطق معينة من العدسة.
alt_id: HP:0007713
def: "Zonular cataracts are defined to be cataracts that affect specific regions of the lens." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:vkumar, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:18035564]
comment: Zonular cataracts include specific regions of the lens and include nuclear cataracts, which affect the fetal or embryonic lens nucleus and lamellar cataracts. These tend to affect lens fibers that are formed at the same time, resulting in a shell like opacity. Zonular cataracts can also be characterized as dense or pulverulent (dusty appearing), and can be accompanied by arcuate opacities extending into the lens cortex, called cortical riders.
xref: UMLS:C1861821
is_a: HP:0000518 ! Cataract
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-12-12T12:00:37Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010921
name: Coralliform cataract
synonym: "ساد مرجاني الشكل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عتامة عدسة مثل المرجان" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمط من العتامة في عدسة العين يشبه المرجان، وهو عبارة عن ساد ذو شكل نجمي غير منتظم.
def: "A 'coral-like' pattern of opacity in the lens of the eye. That is, a cataract with an irregular, stellate form." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:vkumar, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C1392104
is_a: HP:0010920 ! Zonular cataract
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-12-12T12:16:28Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010922
name: Membranous cataract
synonym: "ساد غشائي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدسة منكمشة ومسطحة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل من العتامة حيث يتقلص مادة العدسة، تاركة كبسولة منكمشة ومسطحة مع قليل أو بدون قشرة أو ظهارة على العدسة.
def: "A form of cataract in which the lens substance has shrunk, leaving a collapsed, flattened capsule with little or no cortex or epithelium on the lens." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:17539799]
xref: UMLS:C0524524
is_a: HP:0000518 ! Cataract
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2010-12-12T12:31:45Z

