[Term]
id: HP:0010956
name: Fetal megacystis
synonym: "مثانة جنينية ضخمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مثانة جنينية كبيرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مثانة جنينية ضخمة هي مثانة متضخمة بشكل غير طبيعي تُعرف في أي عمر حملي.
def: "Fetal megacystis is an abnormally enlarged bladder identified at any gestational age." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20837325]
comment: Abnormal enlargement of the fetal bladder can be detected by prenatal ultrasound by fourteen weeks of gestation. In some cases, dilatation of the fetal bladder is transient and resolves without sequelae, and in other cases it is the earliest manifestation of bladder outlet obstruction.
synonym: "Foetal megacystis" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: UMLS:C2931117
is_a: HP:0010955 ! Dilatation of the bladder
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-01-18T10:43:58Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010957
name: Congenital posterior urethral valve
synonym: "صمام الإحليل الخلفي الخلقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صمام الإحليل الخلفي للذكور" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيب نمائي يؤدي إلى وجود غشاء مسد في الإحليل الخلفي للذكور.
def: "A developmental defect resulting in an obstructing membrane in the posterior male urethra." [eMedicine:1016086, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Congenital posterior urethral valve is a cause of bladder outlet obstruction in male newborns. It results from a failure of resorption of the caudal end of the Wolffian duct into the primitive cloaca at the site of the future verumontanum in the posterior urethra (Following normal resorption of the posterior urethral valve there remain the posterior urethral folds, also called plicae colliculi).
synonym: "Congenital obstructing posterior urethral membranes" EXACT []
synonym: "COPUM" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Posterior urethral valve" EXACT []
synonym: "Posterior urethral valves" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:253900005
xref: UMLS:C0238506
is_a: HP:0010481 ! Urethral valve
is_a: HP:0034378 ! Urethrovesical occlusion
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-01-18T10:51:22Z

