synonym: "خلل عدد الخلايا البائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في عدد الخلايا البائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع أو انخفاض غير طبيعي في إجمالي عدد الخلايا البائية أو أي انحراف في نسبة النوع الفرعي للخلايا البائية. تُعرف الخلايا البائية عادةً باسم خلايا إما CD19+ أو CD20+ أو مجموعاتها الفرعية في الدم، مقارنةً بالمرجع المعتاد لجنس وعمر معين.
def: "Abnormal increase or decrease of total B cells or any deviation of the propoortion of a B cell subtype. B cells are commonly characterized as CD19+ or CD20+ lymphocytes, or their subpopulations, in the blood, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group, measured ex vivo." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, MP:0002458]
synonym: "Abnormal number of B cells" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Abnormal numbers of B cells" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Abnormality of B cell count" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of B cell numbers" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021208
is_a: HP:0002846 ! Abnormal B cell morphology
is_a: HP:0040088 ! Abnormal lymphocyte count
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-02-06T09:38:18Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010976
name: Decreased total B cell count
synonym: "انخفاض إجمالي عدد الخلايا البائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض عدد الخلايا البائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: العدد المطلق للخلايا البائية في الدم، لكل ميكروليتر يكون تحت الحد الأدنى للمدى الطبيعي للمدى المرجعي للجنس والفئة العمرية المناسبين.
alt_id: HP:0002856
alt_id: HP:0002956
alt_id: HP:0005365
alt_id: HP:0030251
def: "The absolute number of B cells in the blood, per microlitre is below the lower limit of normal of the reference range for the appropriate sex and age-group." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:32569607]
comment: Plasma B cells differentiate from B cells and secrete large amounts of antibodies.
synonym: "B cell deficiency" EXACT []
synonym: "B cell lymphopenia" EXACT []
synonym: "B lymphocytopenia" EXACT []
synonym: "CD19 lymphocytes low" NARROW []
synonym: "Decreased B cell count" EXACT []
synonym: "Low B cell count" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Reduction in B cell number" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1855067
is_a: HP:0025806 ! Abnormal total B cell count
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-02-06T09:44:11Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010977
name: Abnormal phagocytosis
synonym: "خلل البلعمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في عملية بلعمة الخلايا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في وظيفة البلعمة، وهي عملية معقدة لابتلاع والقضاء على مسببات الأمراض، كما أنها مهمة في القضاء على الخلايا المبرمجة للموت، وبالتالي فهي أساسية لاستتباب الأنسجة. يمكن تقسيم البلعمة إلى أربع خطوات رئيسية: (i) التعرف على الجسيم المستهدف، (ii) الإشارة لتنشيط آلية الادخال الداخلي، (iii) تشكيل الفجوة البلعيمة، و(iv) نضج البلعوم الليزومى.
def: "An abnormal functioning of phagocytosis. Phagocytosis is an elegant but complex process for the ingestion and elimination of pathogens, but it is also important for the elimination of apoptotic cells and hence fundamental for tissue homeostasis. Phagocytosis can be divided into four main steps: (i) recognition of the target particle, (ii) signaling to activate the internalization machinery, (iii) phagosome formation, and (iv) phagolysosome maturation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:28691037]
xref: UMLS:C4023617
is_a: HP:0010978 ! Abnormality of immune system physiology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-02-06T10:31:46Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010978
name: Abnormality of immune system physiology
synonym: "خلل فسيولوجي في الجهاز المناعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في عمل الجهاز المناعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل وظيفي في الجهاز المناعي.
def: "A functional abnormality of the immune system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, MP:0001790]
xref: UMLS:C4023616
is_a: HP:0002715 ! Abnormality of the immune system
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-02-07T04:28:55Z

[Term]
id: HP:0010979
name: Abnormality of lipoprotein cholesterol concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز ليبوبروتين الكوليسترول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى غير طبيعي لكوليسترول الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة أو نقصان غير طبيعي في مستوى ليبوبروتين الكوليسترول في الدم.
def: "An abnormal increase or decrease in the level of lipoprotein cholesterol in the blood." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Lipoproteins transport fats (lipids) in the blood circulation. Lipids are insoluble in water, meaning that they could not be transported in the blood circulation on their own. There are five major types of lipoproteins: (i) chylomicrons; VLDL (very low-density lipoprotein); (iii) IDL (intermediate-density lipoprotein); (iv) LDL (low-density lipoprotein); and (v) HDL (high-density lipoprotein). Clinical measures assess the amount of cholesterol carried by different lipoproteins. For instance, LDL-cholesterol (LDL-C) is the maount of cholesterol carried by LDL.
synonym: "Abnormality of the level of lipoprotein cholesterol" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4023615
is_a: HP:0003107 ! Abnormal circulating cholesterol concentration
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-02-07T09:47:29Z

