[Term]
id: HP:0011001
name: Increased bone mineral density
synonym: "زيادة كثافة المعادن في العظام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة كثافة العظام" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في كثافة المعادن في العظام، أي كمية المادة لكل سنتمتر مكعب من العظام، والذي غالبًا ما يُعرف بتصلب العظام. يمكن اكتشاف تصلب العظام من خلال الفحص الشعاعي كزيادة في بياض (كثافة) العظام المصابة.
alt_id: HP:0002796
alt_id: HP:0004350
alt_id: HP:0005711
alt_id: HP:0005741
alt_id: HP:0010738
def: "An abnormal increase of bone mineral density, that is, of the amount of matter per cubic centimeter of bones which is often referred to as osteosclerosis. Osteosclerosis can be detected on radiological examination as an increased whiteness (density) of affected bones." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This term may be merged with Increased bone density in the future or made obsolete.
synonym: "Increased bone density" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Increased bone mineral density" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Osteosclerosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Osteosclerosis of bones" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:49347007
xref: UMLS:C0029464
is_a: HP:0004348 ! Abnormality of bone mineral density
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2011-02-13T11:57:32Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011002
name: Osteopetrosis
synonym: "داء العظم الرخامي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عظام أصعب وأكثر كثافة ومعرضة للكسر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في تكوين نسيج العظم الإسفنجي الكثيف. على الرغم من زيادة كثافة نسيج العظم، فإن عظام داء العظم الرخامي تكون أكثر عرضة للكسر من العظام الطبيعية.
def: "Abnormally increased formation of dense trabecular bone tissue. Despite the increased density of bone tissue, osteopetrotic bones tend to be more fracture-prone than normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Albers-Schoenberg disease" RELATED []
synonym: "Albers-Schonberg disease" RELATED []
synonym: "Albers-SchÃ¶nberg disease" RELATED []
synonym: "Harder, denser, fracture-prone bones" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
synonym: "Marble bone disease" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:1926006
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:367489004
xref: UMLS:C0029454
is_a: HP:0011001 ! Increased bone mineral density
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2011-02-13T11:58:36Z

