comment: Arabic Definition: وجود ورم سني.
def: "The presence of an odontoma." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9338-3017]
comment: MPATH defines odontoma as a hamartomatous malformation of odontogenic tissue. It may vary from nondescript masses of dental tissue (complex odontoma) to multiple well-formed teeth (compound odontoma).
