[Term]
id: HP:0011069
name: Supernumerary tooth
synonym: "زيادة في عدد الأسنان" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "أسنان زائدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود سن أو أكثر إضافية على العدد الطبيعي للأسنان.
alt_id: HP:0000672
def: "The presence of one or more teeth additional to the normal number." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9338-3017, PMID:31468724]
comment: Age-related physiological sequential eruption should be taken into account during evaluation. The type and the location of the additional tooth/teeth should be added to the description. Supernumerary teeth are uncommon (in 0.21% of deciduous dentitions and in 0.9% of permanent dentitions), and often abnormal positioning of a normal number of teeth is wrongly classified as supernumerary teeth. Supernumerary teeth are most frequent in the upper maxilla, and typically, a single additional tooth is present. We discourage the use of distodens, distomolars (an extra fourth molar posterior to the third molar), paramolars (supernumerary tooth in the molar region) but rather to mention the presence of the supernumerary tooth mesial to or distal to a tooth from the normal series. Diagnosing a supernumerary tooth may require radiographic examination. A supernumerary tooth present between the maxillary central incisors is called mesiodens.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Extra teeth" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Hyperdontia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased number of teeth" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Increased tooth count" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "More teeth than normal" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Supernumary dentition" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Supernumary teeth" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Supernumerary teeth" EXACT []
synonym: "Supplemental dentition" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Supplemental teeth" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Tooth, supernumerary" EXACT []
