[Term]
id: HP:0011075
name: Green teeth
synonym: "أسنان خضراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تلون أخضر للأسنان.
def: "A green staining of teeth." [PMID:12686928]
comment: Green teeth are a rare finding in children with neonatal hyperbilirubinaemia due to blood group incompatibility, sepsis-induced cholestasis or biliary atresia. Rarely, green staining of the teeth may be seen with cholestasis and sepsis.
synonym: "Green colored teeth" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
