property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-05-15T08:57:11Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011099
name: Spastic hemiparesis
synonym: "شلل نصفي تشنجي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف تشنجي في نصف الجسم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ضعف (شلل جزئي) في جانب واحد مع تشنج في العضلات المتضررة وزيادة في ردود الأوتار.
def: "Unilateral paresis (weakness) with spasticity of the affected muscles and increased tendon reflexes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Spastic hemiplegia" EXACT []
