[Term]
id: HP:0011119
name: Abnormal nasal dorsum morphology
synonym: "شذوذ في شكل الظهر الأنفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في شكل الأنف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في شكل ظهر الأنف، المعروف أيضًا بالجسر الأنفي.
def: "An abnormality of the nasal dorsum, also known as the nasal ridge." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19152422]
comment: The nasal ridge is the midline prominence of the nose, extending from the nasal root to the tip.
