[Term]
id: HP:0011157
name: Focal sensory seizure
synonym: "نوبة حسية بؤرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة تبدأ بإحساس معين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: النوبة الحسية البؤرية هي نوع من النوبات تبدأ بشعور ذاتي.
def: "A focal sensory seizure is a type seizure beginning with a subjective sensation." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1511-5893, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276062, PMID:28276064]
comment: A focal sensory seizure involves a sensation being experienced at seizure onset, without objective clinical signs of a seizure evident to the observer.
synonym: "Focal sensory seizures" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Partial sensory seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Sensory aura" EXACT []
