[Term]
id: HP:0011158
name: Focal sensory seizure with auditory features
synonym: "نوبة بؤرية حسية مع ميزات سمعية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة سمعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة تتميز بظواهر سمعية أولية مثل الطنين أو الرنين أو الدق أو النغمات الفردية كتجليها السريري الأول.
def: "A seizure characterized by elementary auditory phenomena including buzzing, ringing, drumming or single tones as its first clinical manifestation." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers, PMID:28276062, PMID:28276064]
comment: More complex auditory hallucinations such as voices are considered a focal cognitive seizure. Focal sensory auditory seizures involve auditory cortex in the lateral superior temporal lobe.
synonym: "Auditory aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal auditory seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal sensory auditory seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial auditory seizure" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1838063
is_a: HP:0011157 ! Focal sensory seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-10-18T02:26:59Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011159
name: Focal autonomic seizure with epigastric sensation/nausea/vomiting/other gastrointestinal phenomena
synonym: "نوبة بؤرية ذاتية مع إحساس شرسوفي/غثيان/قيء/ظواهر جهاز هضمي أخرى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة مع غثيان أو اضطرابات في البطن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من النوبات البؤرية الذاتية التي تتميز بأعراض أو علامات تتعلق بالجهاز الهضمي كميزة سيميوجية أولية.
def: "A type of focal autonomic seizure characterized by symptoms or signs pertaining to the gastrointestinal system as the initial semiological feature." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers, PMID:28276060]
comment: This includes epigastric sensations (which may rise up to the chest or throat) such as upper abdominal discomfort, emptiness, tightness, churning, or hunger, as well as ictal nausea and ictal vomiting.
synonym: "Abdominal aura" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Epigastric aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Epigastric auras" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Localised seizure with epigastric sensation" EXACT []
synonym: "Localized seizure with epigastric sensation" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial seizure with epigastric sensation" EXACT []
synonym: "Visceral aura" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
xref: UMLS:C4023506
is_a: HP:0011154 ! Focal autonomic seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
