[Term]
id: HP:0011160
name: Focal sensory seizure with gustatory features
synonym: "نوبة بؤرية حسية مع ميزات تذوقية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "هلوسات التذوق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة تتميز بظواهر التذوق مثل الطعم الحامضي أو المر أو المالح أو الحلو أو المعدني كتجليها السريري الأول.
def: "A seizure characterized by taste phenomena including acidic, bitter, salty, sweet, or metallic tastes as its first clinical manifestation." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers, PMID:28276060]
comment: These seizures involve the parietal operculum and the insula.
synonym: "Focal gustatory seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal sensory gustatory seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Gustatory aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Gustatory auras" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Partial gustatory seizure" EXACT []
