[Term]
id: HP:0011161
name: Focal sensory seizure with olfactory features
synonym: "نوبة بؤرية حسية مع ميزات شمية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "هلوسة شمية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبات تتميز بظواهر شمية كتجليها السريري الأول.
def: "Seizures characterized by olfactory phenomena as its first clinical manifestation." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers]
comment: These seizures involve the mesial temporal or orbitofrontal regions.
synonym: "Focal olfactory seizure" EXACT []
