[Term]
id: HP:0011165
name: Focal sensory seizure with visual features
synonym: "نوبة بؤرية حسية مع ميزات بصرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "هلوسة بصرية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة تتميز بهلوسات بصرية أولية مثل وميض أو وميض الأضواء/الألوان، أو أشكال أخرى، أو أنماط بسيطة، أو العتمة، أو العمى كتجليها السريري الأول.
alt_id: HP:0007175
alt_id: HP:0025121
def: "A seizure characterized by elementary visual hallucinations such as flashing or flickering lights/colors, or other shapes, simple patterns, scotomata, or amaurosis as its first clinical manifestation." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers]
comment: More complex visual hallucinations such as seeing formed images are considered a focal cognitive seizure. Focal sensory visual seizures arise in the occipital lobe. Note that there is a distinction between Visual aura and Simple partial occipital seizures. See HPO term HP:0025121 for comments.
synonym: "Focal visual seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial visual seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Simple partial occipital seizures" RELATED []
synonym: "Visual aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Visual auras" EXACT plural_form []
xref: UMLS:C1850765
is_a: HP:0011157 ! Focal sensory seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-10-18T02:31:15Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011166
name: Focal myoclonic seizure
synonym: "نوبة عضلية بؤرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اهتزاز مفاجئ في العضلات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من النوبات العضلية البؤرية يتميز بانقباضات مفاجئة وقصيرة (<100 مل ثانية) وغير إرادية لعضلة أو مجموعة عضلات بتوزيع متغير (محورية، قريبة الأطراف، بعيدة). الميوكلون أقل انتظاما وتكرارا من النوبة العضلية الرمعية.
alt_id: HP:0025191
def: "A type of focal motor seizure characterized by sudden, brief (<100 ms) involuntary single or multiple contraction(s) of muscles(s) or muscle groups of variable topography (axial, proximal limb, distal). Myoclonus is less regularly repetitive and less sustained than is clonus." [PMID:11580774, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
synonym: "Focal myoclonic seizures" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Local myoclonic seizures" EXACT plural_form [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Localised myoclonic seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Localized myoclonic seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial myoclonic seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial myoclonic seizures" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Segmental myoclonic seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Segmental myoclonic seizures" EXACT plural_form []
xref: UMLS:C4023501
is_a: HP:0011153 ! Focal motor seizure
is_a: HP:0032794 ! Myoclonic seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-10-18T02:34:14Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011167
name: Focal tonic seizure
synonym: "نوبة توترية بؤرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة توترية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من النوبات الحركية البؤرية يتميز بزيادة مستمرة في انقباض العضلات، يستمر لبضع ثواني إلى دقائق.
def: "A type of focal motor seizure characterized by sustained increase in muscle contraction, lasting a few seconds to minutes." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers, PMID:11580774, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
comment: The abnormal movements of dystonia resulting from co-contraction of agonist and antagonist muscles differentiates these from tonic seizures, see focal dystonic seizure.
synonym: "Focal tonic seizures" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Local tonic seizures" EXACT plural_form [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Localised tonic seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Localized tonic seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial tonic seizure" EXACT []
synonym: "Partial tonic seizures" EXACT plural_form [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Segmental tonic seizure" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C0752324
is_a: HP:0011153 ! Focal motor seizure
is_a: HP:0032792 ! Tonic seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-10-18T02:35:03Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011168
name: Focal seizure with eyelid myoclonia
synonym: "نوبة بؤرية مع رجفان الجفن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة مع رجفان الجفن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة بؤرية مع رجفان الجفن، وليس رجفان الجفن في سياق النوبات الغيابية.
def: "Focal seizure with eyelid myoclonia, not eyelid myoclonias in the context of absence seizures." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8486-0558]
synonym: "Eyelid myoclonias" EXACT []
