comment: Arabic Definition: نشاط خلفية رسم دماغ كهربائي عند 4-5/ثانية.
def: "EEG background activity at 4-5/second." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:jalbers]
comment: EEG background activity at 4-5/second is rare and unusual but not generally pathologic.
