[Term]
id: HP:0011222
name: Depressed glabella
synonym: "انخفاض الجَبَهَة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "منطقة مسطحة بين الحاجبين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وضع خلفي للجبهة، أي الجزء الأوسط للجبهة بين الحواف العليا للمحجر.
def: "Posterior positioning of the glabella, i.e., of the midline forehead between the supraorbital ridges." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19125436]
comment: The glabella is the area of the forehead in the midline between the supraorbital ridges, just above the nasal root.
synonym: "Concave glabella" EXACT []
synonym: "Deficiency of glabella" EXACT []
synonym: "Deficient area between the eyebrows" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Flat area between the eyebrows" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
