[Term]
id: HP:0011230
name: Laterally extended eyebrow
synonym: "الحاجب الممتد عرضياً" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حاجب طويل من الجانب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حاجب يمتد بشكل جانبي خارج الحافة المدارية بدلاً من الانحناء بلطف نحو الأسفل في هذا الموقع.
def: "An eyebrow that extends laterally beyond the orbital rim rather than turning gently downward at that location." [PMID:19125427]
comment: The degree of extension beyond the obital rim that is considered abnormal has not been established.
