synonym: "Tragus, prominent" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: UMLS:C4021171
is_a: HP:0009912 ! Abnormal tragus morphology
creation_date: 2011-12-18T07:59:22Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011272
name: Underdeveloped tragus
synonym: "تطور ناقص لصيوان الأذن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صيوان أذن صغير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض البروز الخلفي الجانبي لصيوان الأذن.
def: "Decreased posterolateral protrusion of the tragus." [PMID:19152421]
