[Term]
id: HP:0011274
name: Recurrent mycobacterial infections
synonym: "العدوى الميكوبكتيرية المتكررة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى متكررة بالميكوبكتيريا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة القابلية للإصابة بالعدوى الميكوبكتيرية، كما يتجلى في حالات العدوى المتكررة بالميكوبكتيريا.
def: "Increased susceptibility to mycobacterial infections, as manifested by recurrent episodes of mycobacterial infection." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Mycobacteria represent a family of slowly growing bacteria, including M. tuberculosis, the agent of tuberculosis, M. leprae, the agent of leprosy, M. avium complex species, and others. Mycobacteria infection can be asymptomatic or not, and are typically difficult to treat with antibiotics.
xref: UMLS:C4023438
is_a: HP:0002718 ! Recurrent bacterial infections
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-12-28T12:11:54Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011275
name: Recurrent mycobacterium avium complex infections
synonym: "العدوى المتكررة بمركب المتفطرة الطيرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "العدوى المتكررة بالمتفطرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة القابلية للإصابة بعدوى مركب المتفطرة الطيرية، كما يظهر من خلال نوبات العدوى المتكررة بالمتفطرة.
def: "Increased susceptibility to mycobacterial avium complex infections, as manifested by recurrent episodes of mycobacterial infection." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Mycobacterium avium complex (MAC) is a group of species including M. avium, M. avium paratuberculosis, and others. Disseminated MAC infections can be seen associated with HIV infection. Pulmonary disease and cervical adenitis are other sequellae of MAC infection.
xref: UMLS:C1737260
is_a: HP:0011274 ! Recurrent mycobacterial infections
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2011-12-28T12:16:46Z

