def: "Craniosynostosis involving at least 2 cranial sutures, where the exact pattern of sutures fused has not been precisely specified." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2972-5481]
comment: If possible, it is preferable to annotate the precise pattern of involvement of the cranial sutures involved in craniosynostosis. This term may be chosen if more information is not available.
