synonym: "شق غير مكتمل في الشفة العليا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شق في الشفة العليا لا يمتد بالكامل من أسفل الشفة العليا وحتى تجويف الأنف.
def: "Cleft of the upper lip that does not go all the way from the bottom of the upper lip until the nasal cavity." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9602-2321]
comment: If the cleft lip is on only one side, use 'Incomplete unilateral cleft lip' (HP:5201000). This term was created to be used in association with a left (HP:0012835) or right (HP:0012834) modifier to annotate completeness of a cleft lip.
