[Term]
id: HP:0011388
name: Enlarged cochlear aqueduct
synonym: "تضخم قناة القوقعة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضخم قناة الأذن الداخلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة حجم قناة القوقعة، وهي قناة تتواصل بين الفضاء المحيط باللمف والمساحة تحت العنكبوتية، وتنقل الوريد من القوقعة للانضمام إلى الوريد الوداجي الداخلي.
def: "Increased size of the cochlear duct, i.e., of a duct that communicates between the perilymphatic space and the subarachnoid space, and transmits a vein from the cochlea to join the internal jugular." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dfitzpatrick]
comment: The cochlear aqueduct surrounds the perilymphatic (periotic duct). Enlargement of the cochlear aqueduct may be seen in POU3F4 X-linked deafness with Gusher.
synonym: "Dilated cochlear aqueduct" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021154
is_a: HP:0000375 ! Abnormal cochlea morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-03-09T07:41:47Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011389
name: Functional abnormality of the inner ear
synonym: "خلل وظيفي في الأذن الداخلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وظيفة غير طبيعية للأذن الداخلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في وظيفة الأذن الداخلية.
def: "An abnormality of the function of the inner ear." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dfitzpatrick]
comment: The inner ear comprises the cochlea, three semicircular canals and the vestibule (labyrinth), and is directly responsible for hearing. Additionally, the vestibule and semicircular canals function to maintain balance or equilibrium.
synonym: "Functional abnormality of the inner ear" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4023382
is_a: HP:0031704 ! Abnormal ear physiology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-03-09T04:58:30Z

