[Term]
id: HP:0011399
name: Tibialis anterior muscle atrophy
synonym: "ضمور في العضلة الظنبوبية الأمامية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف في العضلة الأمامية للساق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هزال في العضلة الظنبوبية الأمامية.
def: "Wasting of the tibialis anterior muscle." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The tibialis anterior muscle is located in the front of the lower leg. The shin may appear prominent because of atrophy of the tibialis anterior muscle (sharp shin sign).
synonym: "Sharp shin sign" EXACT []
synonym: "Tibialis anterior amyotrophy" EXACT []
synonym: "Tibialis muscle degeneration" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4023375
