creation_date: 2012-03-15T09:58:47Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011412
name: Ventouse delivery
synonym: "الولادة بالمحجم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ولادة المولود باستخدام جهاز شفط (محجم)، وهو جهاز يُستخدم للمساعدة في ولادة الطفل عندما لا تتقدم المرحلة الثانية من الولادة بشكل كافٍ.
def: "Delivery of newborn by means of a ventouse, a vacuum device used to assist the delivery of a baby when the second stage of labor has not progressed adequately." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6410-0882]
synonym: "Vacuum extraction" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Vacuum-assisted vaginal delivery" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:10761101000119105
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:61586001
xref: UMLS:C0042225
xref: UMLS:C1456852
xref: UMLS:C2825567
is_a: HP:0001787 ! Abnormal delivery
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-03-15T09:59:31Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011413
name: Shoulder dystocia
synonym: "عسر الولادة الكتفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يحدث عسر الولادة الكتفي عندما يصطدم الكتف الأمامي للجنين ضد الارتفاق العاني للأم بعد ولادة الرأس.
def: "Shoulder dystocia occurs when the fetal anterior shoulder impacts against the maternal symphysis following delivery of the vertex." [PMID:15086043]
comment: Adelivery in which additional maneuvers are required to deliver the fetus after normal gentle downward traction has failed.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:89700002
xref: UMLS:C0269825
is_a: HP:0001787 ! Abnormal delivery
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-03-15T10:01:02Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011414
name: Hydropic placenta
synonym: "مشيمة مائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضخم المشيمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو تشوه في المشيمة حيث توجد مساحات كيسية عديدة داخل المشيمة بالإضافة إلى تضخم المشيمة.
def: "An abnormality of the placenta in which there are numerous cystic spaces within the placenta as well as placental enlargement." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6410-0882]
synonym: "Hydrops of the placenta" EXACT []
