[Term]
id: HP:0011528
name: Solitary congenital hypertrophy of retinal pigment epithelium
synonym: "تضخم خلقي منفرد في ظهارة صبغية الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التضخم الخلقي في الطبقة الصبغية للعين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تغير لوني محدد بوضوح في ظهارة صبغية الشبكية يكون خلقيًا وليس له أهمية وظيفية.
def: "Sharply demarcated hyperpigmentation of the retinal pigment epithelium (RPE) that is congenital and of no functional significance." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8727-6592]
comment: These lesions may become depigmented with time, leaving a hyperpigmented border.
synonym: "Single isolated CHRPE" EXACT []
synonym: "Single isolated congenital hypertrophy of retinal pigment epithelium" EXACT []
