[Term]
id: HP:0011529
name: Multiple congenital hypertrophy of retinal pigment epithelium
synonym: "تضخم خلقي متعدد في ظهارة صبغية الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التضخم الخلقي المتعدد في الطبقة الصبغية للعين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: آفات مصبوغة صغيرة وحيدة أو ثنائية الجوانب، محددة بوضوح، في ظهارة صبغية الشبكية. تظهر الآفات مظلمة في المركز مع محيط شاحب وغالباً ما تكون موجودة في المحيط.
def: "Unilateral or bilateral small, well-demarcated pigmented lesions localized in the retinal pigment epithelium (RPE). Lesions are dark in the center, with a pale circumference and are mostly located in the periphery." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8727-6592]
comment: Bilateral multiple CHRPE is strongly associated with familial adenomatous polyposis coli.
synonym: "Multiple bilateral CHRPE" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Multiple bilateral congenital hypertrophy of retinal pigment epithelium" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021144
is_a: HP:0007649 ! Congenital hypertrophy of retinal pigment epithelium
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-04-06T09:25:33Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011530
name: Retinal hole
synonym: "ثقبة شبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ثقب في الشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيب كامل السمك في الشبكية.
def: "A full-thickness defect in the retina." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: A retinal hole can be asymptomatic or can lead to the sudden appearance of many floaters or flashes, blurry, or wavy vision, or of a a dark shadow or curtain in the peripheral visual field.
