[Term]
id: HP:0011532
name: Subretinal exudate
synonym: "إفرازات تحت الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "إفرازات في العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الإفرازات الشبكية يتواجد في الفراغ تحت الشبكي بين الشبكية الحسية وصُباغ الشبكية الظهاري.
def: "A type of retinal exudate located in the subretinal space between the sensory retina and the retinal pigment epithelium." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Tsis type of retinal exudate is due to chorioretinal vascular disease and can be can be seen in Coats disease or retinal angioma.
