[Term]
id: HP:0011574
name: Imperforate atrioventricular valve
synonym: "صمام أذيني بطيني غير مثقوب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صمام غير مفتوح" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: صمام أذيني بطيني لم ينفتح (مغلق).
def: "An atrioventricular valve that has failed to open (atretic)." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dbrown]
synonym: "Unopened atrioventricular valve" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
