[Term]
id: HP:0011645
name: Dilatation of the sinus of Valsalva
synonym: "تمدد الجيب العصابي لفالزلفا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انتفاخ في الجيب العصابي للأبهر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انتفاخ غير طبيعي أو تمدد على شكل كيس لإحدى التمددات التشريحية للشريان الأبهر الصاعد، والذي يحدث فوق صمام الأبهر مباشرة.
def: "Abnormal outpouching or sac-like dilatation of one of the anatomic dilations of the ascending aorta, which occurs just above the aortic valve." []
comment: Aneurysm is considered a severe form of dilatation.
synonym: "Aneurysm of the aortic sinus" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
synonym: "Aortic sinus aneurysm" EXACT []
synonym: "Sinus of Valsalva aneurysm" NARROW []
