property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-04-09T09:31:57Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011646
name: Juxtaductal coarctation of the aorta
synonym: "تضيق الأبهر المحاذي للقناة الشريانية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضيق في الأبهر قرب القناة الشريانية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تضيق أو انقباض في الأبهر موضعه في منطقة التحام القناة الشريانية، أي في المنطقة المحاذية للقوس الأبهر.
def: "Narrowing or constriction of the aorta localized at the insertion of the ductus arteriosus, i.e., to the juxtaductal region of aortic arch." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dbrown, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Juxtaductal coarctation usually presents when the ductus arteriosus closes.
xref: UMLS:C4023250
is_a: HP:0012305 ! Coarctation of the descending aortic arch
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-04-09T09:41:05Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011647
name: Postductal coarctation of the aorta
synonym: "تضيق الأبهر ما بعد القناة الشريانية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضيق في الأبهر بعد القناة الشريانية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تضيق أو انقباض في الأبهر موضعه في المنطقة البعيدة للقناة الشريانية، أي في المنطقة ما بعد الجسرية للقوس الأبهر.
def: "Narrowing or constriction of the aorta localized distal to the ductus arteriosus, i.e., to the postductal region of aortic arch." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dbrown]
comment: Blood flow to the aorta distal to the coarctation may be dependent on a patent ductus arteriosus, and hence closure of the ductus arteriosus can lead to serious ischemia of the affected tissues.
synonym: "Postductal aortic coarctation" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:72242008
xref: UMLS:C0265879
