[Term]
id: HP:0011682
name: Perimembranous ventricular septal defect
synonym: "عيب حاجزي بطيني حول الغشائي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عيب بطيني حول الغشائي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيب في الحاجز البطيني يتماشى مع ويشمل الحاجز الغشائي ومحاط بصمام أذيني بطيني، باستثناء النوع الثالث من عيوب الحاجز البطيني.
def: "A ventricular septal defect that is confluent with and involves the membranous septum and is bordered by an atrioventricular valve, not including the type 3 VSDs." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dbrown, PMID:10798413]
synonym: "Conoventricular ventricular septal defect" EXACT []
synonym: "Membranous ventricular septal defect" EXACT []
synonym: "Paramembranous ventricular septal defect" EXACT []
synonym: "Perimembraneous ventricular septal defect" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Type 2 ventricular septal defect" EXACT []
synonym: "Ventricular septal defect, perimembranous" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
