[Term]
id: HP:0011683
name: Restrictive ventricular septal defect
synonym: "عيب حاجزي بطيني مقيد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عيب بطيني صغير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي عيب في الحاجز البطيني يكون صغيراً بما يكفي لتقييد التدفق عبره بحيث يوجد فرق في الضغط بين جانبي العيب.
def: "Any ventricular septal defect (VSD) that is small enough to restrict flow across it such that a pressure gradient exists between the two sides of the VSD." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dbrown, PMID:10798413]
comment: This term can be used in addition to another term describing the morphology of a VSD.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:253551005
xref: UMLS:C0344924
is_a: HP:0001629 ! Ventricular septal defect
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-04-10T08:26:59Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011684
name: Non-restrictive ventricular septal defect
synonym: "عيب حاجزي بطيني غير مقيد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عيب بطيني كبير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي عيب في الحاجز البطيني لا يقيد التدفق عبره بما يكفي لخلق فرق في الضغط بين جانبي العيب.
def: "Any ventricular septal defect (VSD) that does not restrict flow across it sufficiently to generate a pressure gradient between the two sides of the VSD." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:DDD_dbrown]
comment: This term can be used in addition to another term describing the morphology of a VSD.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:373131000
xref: UMLS:C1298817
is_a: HP:0001629 ! Ventricular septal defect
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-04-10T08:29:05Z

