def: "An abnormal growth of parafollicular (C-cells) cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0538-4547, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Thyroid C cell hyperplasia usually occurs before the development of familial forms of medullary thyroid cancer and is considered a pre-cancerous condition.
