[Term]
id: HP:0011825
name: Tented philtrum
synonym: "أعلى الشريط الشفوي المؤنف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: بروز في المنطقة النسيجية الرخوة مثلثة الشكل في الشريط الشفوي مع القمة نحو العمود الأنفي.
def: "Prominence of a triangular soft tissue area of the philtrum with the apex to the columella." [PMID:19152422]
comment: A tented philtrum may accompany a Smooth philtrum. If present this should be coded separately.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Philtrum, Tented" EXACT []
