[Term]
id: HP:0011827
name: Malaligned philtral ridges
synonym: "غير انتظام توازي خطوط الشريط الشفوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم انتظام خطوط الشريط الشفوي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب الوضعية الموازية المعتادة لخطوط الشريط الشفوي.
def: "Absence of the usual parallel position of philtral ridges." [PMID:19152422]
comment: Hajnis [1972] has described downwards convergent, downwards divergent (trapezoid or triangular), convex (ovoid), and concave philtral configurations. Any of these findings may be coded using this term.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Asymmetric philtral columns" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Asymmetric philtral ridges" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
