synonym: "Decreased transverse dimension of philtrum" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Decreased width of philtrum" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Philtrum, Narrow" EXACT []
synonym: "Thin philtrum" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
