[Term]
id: HP:0011834
name: Moyamoya phenomenon
synonym: "ظاهرة مويامويا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انسداد غير التهابي وتقدمي للشرايين السباتية داخل القحف بسبب تشكيل شرايين جانبية شبيهة بالشبكة تنبثق من دائرة ويليس.
def: "A noninflammatory, progressive occlusion of the intracranial carotid arteries owing to the formation of netlike collateral arteries arising from the circle of Willis." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Cerebral angiography shows puff-of-smoke (moyamoya) collaterals at the base of the brain.
xref: UMLS:C4023169
is_a: HP:0009145 ! Abnormal cerebral artery morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-05-05T03:24:26Z

