[Term]
id: HP:0011863
name: Abnormal sternal ossification
synonym: "شذوذ تعظم القص" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشوه في نضوج عظم الصدر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي خلل في تكوين المادة العظمية للقص.
alt_id: HP:0006624
def: "Any anomaly in the formation of the bony substance of the sternum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The sternum develops from two cartilaginous bars, situated one on either side of the median plane and connected with the cartilages of the upper nine ribs of its own side. During development, the two cartilaginous bars fuse with each other to form the cartilaginous sternum. This in turn is ossified from six centers: one in the manubrium, four in the body of the sternum, and one in the xiphoid process.
synonym: "Abnormal maturation of breastbone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Sternal ossification center abnormalities" EXACT []
synonym: "Sternal ossification centre abnormalities" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: UMLS:C1860243
is_a: HP:0000766 ! Abnormal sternum morphology
is_a: HP:0003336 ! Abnormal enchondral ossification
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-05-27T04:08:55Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011864
name: Elevated plasma pyrophosphate
synonym: "ارتفاع في مستوى البيروفوسفات في البلازما" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع مستوى البيروفوسفات في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في تركيز ثنائي الفوسفات (4-) في الدم. يُعرف ثنائي الفوسفات (4-)، كمجموعة إستر تحتوي على مجموعتي فوسفات، أيضًا باسم البيروفوسفات.
def: "An abnormally increased diphosphate(4-) concentration in the blood. Diphosphate(4-), as ester with two phosphate groups, is also known as pyrophosphate." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4023157
is_a: HP:0100529 ! Abnormal blood phosphate concentration
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-05-28T06:05:24Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011867
name: Abnormal iliac wing morphology
synonym: "شذوذ في شكل جناح الحرقفة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشوه في جناح عظم الورك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في جناح الحرقفة، وهذا هو الجزء الموسع الكبير من الحرقفة الذي يحد الحوض الكبير من الجانبين.
