def: "An abnormality of the level of activity of circulating fibrinogen." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2945-4463]
comment: Fibrinogen is an essential hemostatic factor that is converted to fibrin (a final product of the hemostatic pathway) by activated thrombin.
