[Term]
id: HP:0011925
name: Decreased activity of mitochondrial ATP synthase complex
synonym: "انخفاض نشاط مركب تصنيع ATP في الميتوكوندريا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف في صناعة الطاقة في الميتوكوندريا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في نشاط مركب تصنيع ATP الذي ينقل البروتون في الميتوكوندريا، والذي ينتج ATP عبر الفسفرة التأكسدية، ويوصف أحيانًا كمركب V في سلسلة نقل الإلكترون.
def: "A reduction in the activity of the mitochondrial proton-transporting ATP synthase complex, which makes ATP via oxidative phosphorylation, and is sometimes described as Complex V of the electron transport chain." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Decreased activity of mitochondrial complex V" EXACT []
synonym: "Mitochondrial complex V deficiency" EXACT []
synonym: "Respiratory complex deficiency, ATPase deficiency" RELATED []
xref: UMLS:C4020737
xref: UMLS:C4023125
is_a: HP:0008972 ! Decreased activity of mitochondrial respiratory chain
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-06-08T09:08:42Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011926
name: Proximal placement of hallux
synonym: "وضعية قريبة للإصبع الكبير" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مكان متغير للإصبع الكبير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توضُّع غير معتاد للإصبع الكبير بعيداً عن موضعه الطبيعي.
def: "Proximal mislocalization of the big toe from its normal position." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Thumb placement index greater than 0.55; or, the base of the thumb appears closer to the wrist than is typical. The technique for the thumb placement index is described in detail [Malina et al., 1973; Hall et al., 2007]. Briefly, the thumb placement index is the distance from the proximal crease of the index finger to the angle of the first interdigital space divided by the distance from the proximal crease of the index finger to the wrist flexion crease at the base of the thumb. This term should not be used with Preaxial polydactyly.
synonym: "Proximal placement of big toe" EXACT []
synonym: "Proximally placed halluces" EXACT plural_form []
xref: UMLS:C4021110
is_a: HP:0010051 ! Deviation of the hallux
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-06-09T03:29:59Z

[Term]
id: HP:0011927
name: Short digit
synonym: "قِصر الإصبع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "إصبع قصير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: واحد أو أكثر من الأصابع يبدو قصيرًا بشكل غير متناسب مقارنة باليد/القدم، حيث يتم تقصير الإصبع بأكمله أو سلامية معينة.
def: "One or more digit that appears disproportionately short compared to the hand/foot, whereby either the entire digit or a specific phalanx is shortened." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Note that the term brachydactyly is reserved for specific patterns of short digits, see HP:0001156.
synonym: "Short digit" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Very short digits" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: UMLS:C1860176
xref: UMLS:C4023124
is_a: HP:0011297 ! Abnormal digit morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-06-10T09:18:42Z

