[Term]
id: HP:0011977
name: Elevated urinary homovanillic acid
synonym: "ارتفاع حامض الهوموفنيلفيك البولي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة حامض الهوموفنيلفيك في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تركيز حامض الهوموفنيلفيك في البول.
def: "An increased concentration of homovanillic acid in the urine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:27830764]
comment: Homovanillic acid is the main metabolite produced from dopamine degradation by the action of monoamine oxidase. Increased levels of catecholamines or catecholamine metabolites, including dopamine, homovanillic acid (HVA) and/or vanillylmandelic acid (VMA), can be detected in the urine of 90% of all patients with neuroblastoma.
synonym: "Increased urinary homovanillic acid" RELATED []
xref: UMLS:C4020736
is_a: HP:0040156 ! Elevated urinary carboxylic acid
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-07-18T09:10:06Z

