[Term]
id: HP:0011999
name: Paranoia
synonym: "جنون الارتياب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشعور والاعتقاد بأن الفرد مستهدف أو أنه محور لأفعال سلبية من الآخرين، ظاهرة أو خفية. الفرد المصاب يعبر عن مخاوفه بأن الناس بشكل عام ضده ويجرون أعمالاً خفية أو علنية لجعل الأمور صعبة عليه. قد تكون بداية هذه الأفكار نابعة من أحداث حقيقية وتتحول إلى مبالغات مع مرور الوقت. قد تنشأ جنون الارتياب أيضًا في غياب أي عمل أو تفاعل بين الشخص وبيئته.
def: "The feeling and belief that one is being targeted or is a focus of negative or untoward actions, overt or covert, from others. The affected individual expresses a concern that people are in general against the individual and are engaging in subtle behaviors to make things difficult for them. The origins of such thinking may arise from real events and become amplified over time. Paranoia may also arise in the absence of any action or interaction between the person and their environment." [PMID:34618805]
comment: Paranoia is defined as a non-delusional state characterized by a vague sense that 'everyone and anyone' is unfavorable towards one as in 'the whole world hates me'. A persecutory delusion is, in contrast, typically fixed and focused - as in 'my neighbor is pumping poison into my house'.
synonym: "Paranoia" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:191667009
xref: UMLS:C1456784
is_a: HP:5200242 ! Cognitive distortion
