def: "Affective auras with subjective qualities similar to those experienced in life but are recognized by the subject as occurring outside of actual context." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Affective aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Affective auras" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Emotional aura" EXACT []
