property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-07-20T11:52:11Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012004
name: Focal cognitive seizure with deja vu/jamais vu
synonym: "نوبة صرعية معرفية موضعية مع ديجا فو/جامي فو" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة دماغية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة معرفية موضعية تتميز بظواهر الذاكرة مثل مشاعر الألفة (ديجا فو) والغرابة (جامي فو) كتجليات أولية للحدث.
alt_id: HP:0032697
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by memory phenomena such as feelings of familiarity (deja vu) and unfamiliarity (jamais vu) as the initial semiological manifestation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:28276060]
comment: See the Glossary of Descriptive Terminology for Ictal Semiology at http://www.ilae.org.
synonym: "Mnemonic aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Mnemonic auras" EXACT plural_form []
xref: UMLS:C4023085
is_a: HP:0012002 ! Experiential epileptic aura
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-07-20T11:53:39Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012005
name: Deja vu aura
synonym: "هالة ديجا فو" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ديجا فو" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشعور الذاتي بأن تجربة تحدث للمرة الأولى قد تم المرور بها من قبل.
def: "A subjective feeling that an experience which is occurring for the first time has been experienced before." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Deja vu" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:313005
xref: UMLS:C0011194
is_a: HP:0012004 ! Focal cognitive seizure with deja vu/jamais vu
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-07-20T11:54:16Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012006
name: Jamais vu aura
synonym: "هجمة جمال فو" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور غير مألوف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شعور ذاتي بأن تجربة حدثت من قبل يتم تجربتها لأول مرة.
def: "A subjective feeling that an experience which has occurred before is being experienced for the first time." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Jamais vu" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:28249008
xref: UMLS:C0233803
is_a: HP:0012004 ! Focal cognitive seizure with deja vu/jamais vu
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-07-20T11:55:38Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012007
name: Focal cognitive seizure with hallucination
synonym: "نوبة معرفية بؤرية مع هلوسة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة بصرية أو سماعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة معرفية بؤرية تتميز بالهلوسة كأول مظاهر العرض.
alt_id: HP:0032703
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by hallucination as the initial semiological manifestation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:28276060]
comment: Hallucination is the creation of composite perceptions without the presence of external sensory stimuli, these may be visual (e.g. formed images), auditory (e.g. hearing voices) or involve other sensory modalities, without change in awareness. The sensory phenomena may be accompanied by associated emotion or interpretation e.g. a formed visual image may be accompanied by fear, or may be experienced as persecutory or with paranoia (i.e. with unjustified suspicion / mistrust). These features distinguish focal seizures with hallucinations from focal sensory seizures.
synonym: "Hallucinatory aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Hallucinatory auras" EXACT plural_form []
xref: UMLS:C4023084
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
is_a: HP:0033347 ! Cognitive epileptic aura
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-07-20T11:56:47Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012008
name: Focal cognitive seizure with illusion
synonym: "نوبة معرفية بؤرية مع أوهام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير بالإحساس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة معرفية بؤرية تتميز بتغيير في الإدراك الفعلي وتشمل ظواهر بصرية، سمعية، حسية، شمية، و/أو تذوقية كأول مظاهر العرض.
alt_id: HP:0032695
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by an alteration of actual perception involving visual, auditory, somatosensory, olfactory, and/or gustatory phenomena as the initial semiological manifestation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:28276060]
synonym: "Illusory aura" EXACT []
synonym: "Illusory auras" EXACT plural_form []
xref: UMLS:C4023083
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
is_a: HP:0033347 ! Cognitive epileptic aura
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-07-20T11:57:32Z

