[Term]
id: HP:0012025
name: Abnormal circulating ornithine concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز الأورنيثين في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى غير طبيعي للأورنيثين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف عن التركيز الطبيعي للأورنيثين في الدم.
def: "Deviation from the normal concentration of ornithine in the blood circulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Ornithine is an amino acid produced in the urea cycle by the splitting off of urea from arginine. Ornithine is a naturally occurring, non-proteinogenic amino acid found in meat, fish, dairy and eggs.
