[Term]
id: HP:0012071
name: Abnormal circulating acylcarnitine concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز الأسيل كارنيتين في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى غير طبيعي للأسيل كارنيتين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن التركيز الطبيعي للأسيل كارنيتين في الدورة الدموية، الذي ينتج عن الاسترة العكسية لمجموعة الهيدروكسيل 3 للكارنيتين.
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration in the blood circulation of an acylcarnitine, which is produced by reversible esterification of the 3-hydroxyl group of carnitine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:18281923, PMID:23258903, PMID:6348429]
comment: Acylcarnitines are esters of l-carnitine and fatty acids. Therefore, it is inferred that the number of acylcarnitines that may be formed with these fatty acids is very considerable. Similar to fatty acids, acylcarnitines are also differed by length of the acyl groups, often categorized as short, medium and long-chain acylcarnitines (simply marked as SCACs, MCACs and LCACs). Carnitine fundergoes reversible esterification of its 3-hydroxyl group producing acylcarnitine, which can enter the mitochondria with the assistance of specific translocases.
synonym: "Abnormal acetylcarnitine profile" RELATED []
synonym: "Abnormal circulating esterified carnitine concentration" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4020733
xref: UMLS:C4023058
is_a: HP:0010966 ! Abnormal circulating fatty-acid anion concentration
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-08-11T09:03:41Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012072
name: Aciduria
synonym: "حموضة البول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "البول الحمضي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إفراز البول ذو الرقم الهيدروجيني الحامضي، أي بزيادة تركيز أيونات الهيدروجين.
def: "Excretion of urine with an acid pH, i.e., having an increased hydrogen ion concentration." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Acidic urine" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:21806007
xref: UMLS:C0278026
is_a: HP:0032943 ! Abnormal urine pH

[Term]
id: HP:0012073
name: Abnormal urinary acylglycine profile
synonym: "شذوذ نمط الأسيلجليسين البولي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نمط غير طبيعي للأسيلجليسين في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توزيع غير طبيعي للأسيلجليسينات في البول. هناك العديد من الأسيلجليسينات المختلفة، ويشير هذا المصطلح إلى التغيرات المرضية في مستواها أو توزيعها.
def: "An abnormal distribution of N-acylglycines in the urine. There are numerous different N-acylglycines, and this term refers to pathological alterations in their level or distribution." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:10870848]
comment: N-acylglycines result from glycine conjugation with exogenous compounds to enhance their excretion in urine. Glycine conjugation is also an effective detoxification system for preventing accumulation of acyl-CoA esters in several inherited metabolic disorders.
xref: UMLS:C4023057
is_a: HP:0033097 ! Increased urine proteinogenic amino acid derivative level
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-08-11T09:46:03Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012074
name: Tonic pupil
synonym: "بؤبؤ مقيد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في حجم البؤبؤ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في استجابة البؤبؤ للضوء يتميز بتباطؤ شديد في استجابة الضوء في الغالب لبؤبؤ واحد فقط. يميل البؤبؤ إلى أن يكون متوسعًا نسبيًا مع ضعف في التكيف.
def: "An abnormality of the pupillary light reaction characterized by a marked slowing of the light reaction of usually just one pupil. The pupil tends to be relatively dilated, and there is reduced accommodation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Adie pupil" EXACT []
synonym: "Adie's tonic pupil" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:24225004
xref: UMLS:C0040416
is_a: HP:0007686 ! Abnormal pupillary function
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-08-11T09:58:20Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012075
name: Personality disorder
synonym: "اضطراب في الشخصية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اضطراب في السلوك الشخصي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب في الشخصية هو نمط عميق من السلوك من نوع مخصوص يختلف بشكل ملحوظ عن السلوك المقبول عموماً. يظهر عادة في مرحلة المراهقة ويسبب صعوبات طويلة الأمد في العلاقات الشخصية أو الأداء الاجتماعي.
def: "A personality disorder is a deeply ingrained pattern of behavior of a specified kind that deviates markedly from the norms of generally accepted behavior. It is typically apparent by the time of adolescence and causes long-term difficulties in personal relationships or functioning in society." []
comment: A personality disorder is generally associated with significant problems and limitations in relationships, social encounters, work, and school. It usually manifests since childhood or adolescence and continues throughout adulthood.
xref: ICD-10:F60 "Specific personality disorders"
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:33449004
xref: UMLS:C0031212
is_a: HP:0031466 ! Impairment in personality functioning
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1111-7357
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7954-5235
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2897-0458
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4298-5074
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4618-6544
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-08-11T02:20:27Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012076
name: Borderline personality disorder
synonym: "اضطراب في الشخصية الحدية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الشخصية الاندفاعية وغير المستقرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب في الشخصية يتميز بالسلوك الاندفاعي والمزاج غير المتوقع والمتقلب. يظهر الأشخاص المصابون ميلًا للتعبير عن انفجارات عاطفية وفشل في السيطرة على هذه الانفجارات السلوكية. يعانون عموماً من خوف شديد من الهجر أو عدم الاستقرار ويكافحون أيضاً مع مشاعر الفراغ.
def: "A personality disorder characterized by impulsive behavior and unpredictable, capricious mood. Affected individuals show a tendency to have outbursts of emotion and an inability to control these behavioral explosions. They generally experience an intense fear of abandonment or instability and also struggle with feelings of emptiness." []
synonym: "BPD" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Emotionally unstable personality disorder" EXACT []
synonym: "EUPD" EXACT abbreviation []
xref: ICD-10:F60.3 "Emotionally unstable personality disorder, borderline type"
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:20010003
xref: UMLS:C0006012
is_a: HP:0012075 ! Personality disorder
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1111-7357
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7954-5235
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2897-0458
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4298-5074
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4618-6544
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-08-11T02:26:02Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012077
name: Histrionic personality disorder
synonym: "اضطراب في الشخصية الهستيرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الشخصية الدرامية والمبالغة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب في الشخصية يتميز بالعاطفة الضحلة والمتقلبة، والميل للدراما، والمسرحية، والتعبير المبالغ فيه عن العواطف، والتأثرية، والأنانية، والاهتمام بالذات، والافتقار للاهتمام بالآخرين، وشعور بسهولة الجرح، والسعي المستمر للحصول على التقدير، والإثارة والانتباه.
def: "A personality disorder characterized by shallow and labile affectivity, self-dramatization, theatricality, exaggerated expression of emotions, suggestibility, egocentricity, self-indulgence, lack of consideration for others, easily hurt feelings, and continuous seeking for appreciation, excitement and attention." [ICD-10:F60.4]
xref: ICD-10:F60.4 "Histrionic personality disorder"
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:55341008
xref: UMLS:C0019681
is_a: HP:0012075 ! Personality disorder
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2012-08-11T02:38:39Z

