[Term]
id: HP:0012108
name: Open angle glaucoma
synonym: "جلوكوما مفتوحة الزاوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع ضغط العين مع زاوية مفتوحة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الجلوكوما يُعرف بوجود زاوية غرفة أمامية مفتوحة ومظهر طبيعي مع ارتفاع ضغط العين.
def: "A type of glaucoma defined by an open, normal appearing anterior chamber angle and raised intraocular pressure," [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:11815354]
comment: Evidence of optic nerve damage can include s optic disc abnormalities (Vertical cup:disk ratio over the 97. 5th percentile in the normal population), visual field defects. The role of increased intraocular pressure (IOP) in glaucoma is debated, but an IOP exceeding the 99. 5th percentile of the normal population may be considered to support the diagnosis.
synonym: "Primary open angle glaucoma" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:77075001
xref: UMLS:C0339573
is_a: HP:0000501 ! Glaucoma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-09-10T05:17:24Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012109
name: Angle closure glaucoma
synonym: "جلوكوما انغلاق الزاوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع ضغط العين مع زاوية مغلقة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الاعتلال العصبي البصري الجلوكوما في عين تظهر دليلًا على انغلاق الزاوية (أي تلامس قزحي ترابيكولي كبير).
alt_id: HP:0032119
def: "A type of glaucomatous optic neuropathy in an eye that has evidence of angle closure (i.e. significant iridotrabecular contact)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0986-4123, PMID:11815354]
comment: Evidence of optic nerve damage can include s optic disc abnormalities (Vertical cup:disk ratio over the 97. 5th percentile in the normal population), visual field defects. The role of increased intraocular pressure (IOP) in glaucoma is debated, but an IOP exceeding the 99. 5th percentile of the normal population may be considered to support the diagnosis.
synonym: "Closed-angle glaucoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Narrow angle glaucoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Primary angle closure glaucoma" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:392288006
xref: UMLS:C0017606
is_a: HP:0000501 ! Glaucoma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-09-10T05:22:48Z

