comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في تركيز حمض المثيلمالونيك في البول.
def: "Increased concentration of methylmalonic acid in the urine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Methylmalonic aciduria is a genetically heterogeneous disorder of methylmalonate and cobalamin (cbl; vitamin B12) metabolism.
synonym: "High blood methylmalonic acid levels" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Methymalonicaciduria" EXACT []
