[Term]
id: HP:0012130
name: Abnormal erythroid lineage cell morphology
synonym: "شذوذ في مورفولوجيا خلايا سلسلة الكريات الحمراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلايا دم حمراء غير طبيعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في خلايا سلسلة الكريات الحمراء، وهي الخلايا المكونة للكريات الحمر في السلالة المؤدية إلى الكريات الحمر وضمنها.
def: "An anomaly of erythroid lineage cells, that is, of the erythropoietic cells in the lineage leading to and including erythrocytes." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2945-4463]
comment: Proerythroblasts are the earliest recognizable erythroid precursors. They are followined during the process of hematopoiesis by basophilic erythroblasts, polychromatic (polychromatophilic) erythroblasts, orthochromatic erythroblasts (normoblasts), reticulocytes, and finally mature erythrocytes (red blood cells). This term encompasses structural anomalies of erythroblast precursors in the bone marrow.
synonym: "Abnormality of cells of the erythroid lineage" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4020862
is_a: HP:0005561 ! Abnormal bone marrow cell morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-09-16T07:14:03Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012131
name: Abnormal number of erythroid precursors
synonym: "شذوذ في عدد الخلايا السالفة للكريات الحمراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدد غير طبيعي من خلايا الكريات الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف عن العدد الطبيعي لخلايا السالفة للكريات الحمراء، وهي خلايا سلسلة الكريات الحمراء في نقي العظام.
def: "A deviation from the normal count of erythroid precursor cells, that is, erythroid lineage cells in the bone marrow." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2945-4463]
xref: UMLS:C4023033
is_a: HP:0001877 ! Abnormal erythrocyte morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2012-09-16T07:17:18Z

