[Term]
id: HP:0012155
name: Decreased corneal sensation
synonym: "انخفاض الإحساس بالقرنية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص في الشعور بسطح العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض قدرة القرنية على الاستجابة للتحفيز.
def: "Reduced ability of the cornea to respond to stimulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Corneal sensitivity to touch can be assessed by an aesthesiometer, which measures the corneal touch threshold. Decreased corneal sensation is associated with a decreased corneal reflex (HP:0008000); however, impairment of the corneal reflex can have other causes such as trigeminal nerve compression or a cerebellopontine angle lesion. Well known causes of decreased corneal sensation include Herpes simplex keratitis, neuroparalytic keratitis, leprosy, acoustic neuroma, and absolute glaucoma.
synonym: "Corneal hypaesthesia" EXACT []
synonym: "Corneal hypesthesia" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased corneal sensitivity" RELATED []
synonym: "Reduced corneal sensation" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:373433005
xref: UMLS:C0271292
xref: UMLS:C0859996
is_a: HP:0012373 ! Abnormal eye physiology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2013-01-04T08:36:10Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012156
name: Hemophagocytosis
synonym: "البلعمة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: البلعمة بواسطة الخلايا البلعمية للخلايا الحمراء والبيضاء والصفائح الدموية وسلالاتها الأولية في نخاع العظم والأنسجة الأخرى.
def: "Phagocytosis by macrophages of erythrocytes, leukocytes, platelets, and their precursors in bone marrow and other tissues." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:25328776]
comment: Hemophagocytosis is a nonspecific phenotypic feature observed in several conditions including hemolytic anemia, malignant disease, infections, and hemophagocytic syndrome (also known as hemophagocytic lymphohistiocytosis, a rare hyperinflammatory syndrome caused by severe hypercytokinemia due to a highly stimulated but ineffective immune process).
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:61070002
xref: UMLS:C0876991
is_a: HP:0004311 ! Abnormal macrophage morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-01-07T10:11:21Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012157
name: Subcortical cerebral atrophy
synonym: "ضمور في الدماغ تحت القشرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضمور في الجزء السفلي من الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ضمور في المادة البيضاء والرمادية تحت القشرة الدماغية، يعكس فقدان الخلايا العصبية في العقد القاعدية أو الألياف في المادة البيضاء العميقة.
def: "Atrophy of the cerebral subcortical white and gray matter, termed subcortical atrophy, reflects loss of nerve cells in the basal ganglia or fibers in the deep white matter." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20813998]
xref: UMLS:C4023018
is_a: HP:0007369 ! Atrophy/Degeneration affecting the cerebrum
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-01-20T11:22:50Z

