[Term]
id: HP:0012179
name: Craniofacial dystonia
synonym: "خلل التوتر العضلي القحفي الوجهي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في عضلات الوجه" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل من الأشكال الموضعية لخلل التوتر العضلي الذي يصيب الوجه خاصة الفك، وذلك بسبب الكلام، وهو عبارة عن تقلص لاإرادي لعضلات المضغ، مما يؤدي إلى عسر النطق أو عسر البلع.
def: "A form of focal dystonia affecting the face and especially the jaw that is induced by the act of speaking. It is an involuntary contraction of the masticatory muscles, resulting in dysarthria or dysphagia." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormal craniofacial muscle tone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormal craniofacial posture" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormal facial muscle tone" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Distorted craniofacial posture" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Facial Dystonia" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: UMLS:C1851915
xref: UMLS:C4023011
xref: UMLS:C4072883
is_a: HP:0004373 ! Focal dystonia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-02-23T10:10:32Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012180
name: Cystic medial necrosis
synonym: "تنخر الكيسة المتوسطة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مرض في الشرايين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب في الشرايين الكبيرة، خاصة الأورطى، يتميز بتراكم مادة قاعدية قاعدية في الطبقة المتوسطة مع ظهور آفات تشبه الكيسات مصحوبة بتغيرات تنكسية في الكولاجين، الإيلاستين وخلايا العضلات الملساء الوعائية.
alt_id: HP:0200145
def: "A disorder of large arteries, in particular the aorta, characterized by an accumulation of basophilic ground substance in the media with cyst-like lesions associated with degenerative changes of collagen, elastin and the vascular smooth muscle cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The lesions of cystic medial necrosis are not true cysts.
synonym: "Arterial cystic medial necrosis" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:234021009
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:42182000
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:45894003
xref: UMLS:C0392775
is_a: HP:0011004 ! Abnormal systemic arterial morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-02-23T10:17:16Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012181
name: Entrapment neuropathy
synonym: "اعتلال عصبي انحباسي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضغط على العصب المحيطي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في أحد الأعصاب المحيطية ناتج عن ضغط ميكانيكي على جذور الأعصاب نتيجة لأسباب داخلية أو خارجية مما يؤدي إلى عرقلة في التوصيل أو فقدان المحوار.
def: "Malfunction of a peripheral nerve resulting from mechanical compression of the nerve roots from internal or external causes and leading to a conduction block or axonal loss." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: An entrapment neuropathy is an isolated peripheral nerve injury due to mechanical constriction in a fibrous or fibro-osseous tunnel or to deformation of the nerve by a fibrous band.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:45781009
xref: UMLS:C1510429
is_a: HP:0009830 ! Peripheral neuropathy
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-02-23T10:20:59Z

