[Term]
id: HP:0012184
name: Increased HDL cholesterol concentration
synonym: "زيادة تركيز الكولسترول البروتين الدهني العالي الكثافة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع HDL في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع في تركيز كولسترول البروتين الدهني العالي الكثافة (HDL) في الدم.
def: "An elevated concentration of high-density lipoprotein cholesterol (HDL) in the blood." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The major apolipoproteins of HDL are apolipoprotein (apo) A-I and apo A-II, also known as the alpha lipoproteins. Thus, hyperalphalipoproteinemia refers to an elevated concentration of apo A-I and apo A-II.
synonym: "High blood HDL level" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Hyperalphalipoproteinemia" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased circulating high-density lipoprotein levels" EXACT []
