[Term]
id: HP:0012185
name: Constrictive median neuropathy
synonym: "اعتلال عصبي انحباسي في العصب المتوسط" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "متلازمة النفق الرسغي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إصابة للعصب المتوسط ناتجة عن انحباسه عند الرسغ عندما يمر عبر النفق الرسغي. يتميز الاعتلال العصبي الانحباسي في العصب المتوسط بألم وخدر وضعف في توزيع العصب المتوسط في اليد.
def: "Injury to the median nerve caused by its entrapment at the wrist as it traverses through the carpal tunnel. Clinically, constrictive median neuropathy is characterized by pain, paresthesia, and weakness in the median nerve distribution of the hand." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Constrictive median neuropathy is the major clinical feature of carpal tunnel syndrome.
synonym: "Carpal tunnel syndrome" RELATED []
xref: UMLS:C4023009
is_a: HP:0012181 ! Entrapment neuropathy
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-02-24T09:24:32Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012186
name: Entrapment neuropathy of the ulnar nerve at elbow
synonym: "اعتلال عصبي انحباسي في العصب الزندي عند الكوع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "متلازمة النفق المرفقي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اعتلال عصبي انحباسي في العصب الزندي في النفق المرفقي (في الكوع) يتميز بخدر في الأصابع الخنصر والبنصر وضعف في العضلات الداخلية في اليد.
def: "An entrapment neuropathy of the ulnar nerve in the cubital tunnel (in the elbow) characterized by numbness in the ring and little fingers and weakness of the intrinsic muscles in the hand." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Cubital tunnel syndrome" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4023008
is_a: HP:0012181 ! Entrapment neuropathy
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-02-24T09:27:57Z

