[Term]
id: HP:0012216
name: Entrapment neuropathy of suprascapular nerve
synonym: "اعتلال عصبي حاصر في العصب فوق الكتف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انحصار العصب فوق الكتف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اعتلال عصبي حاصر في العصب فوق الكتف يظهر بضعف في الكتف يقتصر على العضلة فوق الشوكة أو العضلة تحت الشوكة، وكذلك ألم في الجزء الخلفي من الكتف والمنطقة المحيطة بالعظم فوق الكتف.
def: "An entrapment neuropathy of the suprascapular nerve, presenting with shoulder weakness confined to the supraspinatus muscle (this muscle initiates shoulder abduction) or to the infraspinatus (this muscle externally rotates the arm), as well as with pain in the posterior part of the shoulder and upper periscapular region." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Suprascapular nerve entrapment" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:230635000
xref: UMLS:C0393890
is_a: HP:0012181 ! Entrapment neuropathy
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-03-14T08:09:05Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012217
name: Increased urinary porphobilinogen
synonym: "زيادة بوليفيرينوجين البول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة بوليفيرينوجين في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز بوليفيرينوجين في البول يكون أعلى من الحد الأقصى الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of porphobilinogen in the urine, normalized for urine concentration, is above the upper limit of normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:11861450]
comment: Increased porphobilinogen (PBG) in urine is pathognomonic of an attack of acute porphyria (acute intermittent porphyria, variegate porphyria, hereditary coproporphyria); the absence of increased urinary PBG in a suspected attack excludes the diagnosis.
xref: UMLS:C4023000
