[Term]
id: HP:0012227
name: Urethral stricture
synonym: "تضيق الإحليل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضيق في مجرى البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تضيق في الإحليل المرتبط بالتهاب أو نسيج ندبي.
def: "Narrowing of the urethra associated with inflammation or scar tissue." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:24346008]
comment: A urethral stricture may result from surgery, disease, or injury. The term should not be used for a congenital narrowing of the urethra (Consider the term Urethral stenosis, HP:0008661). All strictures result from injury to the epithelium of the urethra or underlying corpus spongiosum, which ultimately causes fibrosis during the healing process. The pathological changes associated with strictures show that the normal pseudostratified columnar epithelium is replaced with squamous metaplasia. Small tears in this metaplastic tissue result in urinary extravasation, which causes a fibrotic reaction within the spongiosum. At the time of injury, this fibrosis can be asymptomatic; however, over time, the fibrotic process can cause further narrowing of the lumen of the urethra, resulting in symptomatic obstructive voiding.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:236647003
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:76618002
xref: UMLS:C0041974
is_a: HP:0008661 ! Urethral stenosis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-03-30T07:37:46Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012228
name: Tension-type headache
synonym: "صداع من نوع التوتر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صداع التوتر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الصداع يستمر لساعات مع ألم متواصل خفيف أو متوسط الشدة، يتموضع على الجانبين، ذو طبيعة ضاغطة/مشدودة (غير نابضة) ولا يتفاقم مع النشاط البدني الروتيني مثل المشي أو صعود الدرج.
def: "A type of headache that last hours with continuous pain of mild or moderate intensity, bilateral location, a pressing/tightening (non-pulsating) quality and that is not aggravated by routine physical activity such as walking or climbing stairs." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Tension-type headache" EXACT layperson []
xref: ICD-10:G44.2 "Tension-type headache"
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:398057008
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:66551002
xref: UMLS:C0033893
is_a: HP:0002315 ! Headache
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-03-30T07:50:13Z

