[Term]
id: HP:0012245
name: Sex reversal
synonym: "انعكاس الجنس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تطور الجهاز التناسلي بشكل غير متوافق مع الجنس الكروموسومي.
def: "Development of the reproductive system is inconsistent with the chromosomal sex." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, MP:0005652]
comment: Sex reversal is present if an XX individual develops phenotypically as a male or if an XY individual develops as a female.
