[Term]
id: HP:0012249
name: Abnormal ST segment
synonym: "اضطراب شريحة ST" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مشاكل في شريحة ST على تخطيط القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوهات في تخطيط القلب الكهربائي لشريحة ST والتي تصل بين مركب QRS والموجة T. تكون شريحة ST عادة بطول 80 إلى 120 مللي ثانية، مسطحة وعلى نفس المستوى (مستوى متساوي) مثل شريحة PR وTP.
def: "An electrocardiographic anomaly of the ST segment, which is the segment that connects the QRS complex and the T wave. The ST segment normally has a duration of 80 to 120 ms, is flat and at the same level (isoelectric) as the PR and TP segment." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022993
is_a: HP:0003115 ! Abnormal EKG
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-07T08:56:46Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012250
name: ST segment depression
synonym: "انخفاض مقطع ST" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض خط ST في تخطيط القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في تخطيط القلب الكهربائي يظهر فيه مقطع ST موجوداً عند مستوى أدنى من الخط المتساوي الجهد.
def: "An electrocardiographic anomaly in which the ST segment is observed to be located inferior to the isoelectric line." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:26141007
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:429622005
xref: UMLS:C0520887
is_a: HP:0012249 ! Abnormal ST segment
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-07T08:59:59Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012251
name: ST segment elevation
synonym: "ارتفاع مقطع ST" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع في قراءة تخطيط القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في تخطيط القلب حيث يُلاحظ أن مقطع ST يكون أعلى من الخط المتساوي الكهربي.
def: "An electrocardiographic anomaly in which the ST segment is observed to be located superior to the isoelectric line." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: ST segment elevation may have multiple causes including myocardial infaction, left ventricular aneurysm, and hyperkalemia.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:164931005
