comment: Arabic Definition: الأهداب التي لا تتحرك.
xref: UMLS:C1855672
is_a: HP:0012262 ! Abnormal ciliary motility
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-07T10:11:17Z

