def: "Absence of the two central microtubules of motile cilia with a 9+2 microtubuluar configuration." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022982
is_a: HP:0005938 ! Abnormal respiratory motile cilium morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-07T10:12:06Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012265
name: Ciliary dyskinesia
synonym: "خلل الحركة الهدبية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في حركة الأهداب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف عن النمط المنسق عادة للحركة داخل الخلايا وبين الخلايا للأهداب المحركة. الأهداب المختلة الحركة عادة تتحرك بشكل غير متزامن بالنسبة للأهداب المجاورة.
def: "A deviation from the normally well coordinated pattern of intracellular and intercellular synchrony of motile cilia. Dyskinetic cilia usually beat out of synchrony relative to neighboring cilia." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19606528]
comment: Typically, but not always, dyskinesia is characterized by markedly attenuated ciliary beat frequency.
synonym: "Lack of coordinated beating of respiratory cilia" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:86204009
xref: UMLS:C0008780
is_a: HP:0012262 ! Abnormal ciliary motility
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-07T10:14:07Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012266
name: T-wave alternans
synonym: "تناوب موجة T" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغيرات دورية في موجة T" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تغير دوري من نبضة إلى أخرى في سعة أو شكل موجة T في تخطيط القلب الكهربائي.
def: "A periodic beat-to-beat variation in the amplitude or shape of the T wave in an EKG." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:17592081]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:428550008
xref: UMLS:C1998313
is_a: HP:0005135 ! Abnormal T-wave
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-07T10:23:08Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012267
