[Term]
id: HP:0012282
name: Morbilliform rash
synonym: "طفح شبيه بالحصبة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح جلدي مثل الحصبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: طفح جلدي يتكون من بقع مسطحة وردية إلى حمراء أو حطاطات تتلاشى عند الضغط عليها. يمكن أن تتجمع البقع والحطاطات لتشكل صفائح على مدى عدة أيام.
def: "An exanthema consisting of widespread pink-to-red macules (flat spots of 2-10 mm in diameter) or papules (red bumps) that blanch with pressure. The macules and papules may cluster and merge to form sheets over several days." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: A morbilliform rash is said to resemble the rash of measles, rubella or scarlet fever, thus mimicking viral and bacterial exanthemas.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:247470007
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:50495000
xref: UMLS:C0234918
is_a: HP:4000054 ! Exanthem
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-07T10:11:58Z

