[Term]
id: HP:0012286
name: Abnormal hypothalamus morphology
synonym: "شذوذ شكل الوطاء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شكل الوطاء غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي شذوذ في بنية الوطاء.
alt_id: HP:0002443
def: "Any structural anomaly of the hypothalamus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The hypothalamus is a cone-shaped cerebral structure that projects downward, ending in the pituitary (infundibular) stalk, a tubular connection to the pituitary gland. It is linked vascularly with the anterior lobe of the pituitary gland and thereby controls the secretion of pituitary hormones.
synonym: "Abnormal shape of hypothalamus" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Abnormality of hypothalamus morphology" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of the hypothalamus" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021095
is_a: HP:0010662 ! Abnormal diencephalon morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-04-09T07:53:16Z

