[Term]
id: HP:0012313
name: Heberden node
synonym: "عقدة هيبردن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تورم في مفاصل الأصابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تورم عظمي في المفصل البعيد بين السلاميات (DIP) مرتبط بتكوين نمو عظمي (نتوءات كلسية) في غضروف المفصل يمكن رؤيته بالأشعة.
def: "Bony swelling of the distal interphalangeal joint (DIP) associated with the formation of osteophytes (calcific spurs) of the articular (joint) cartilage that are visible radiographically." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:10531070, PMID:17488856, PMID:18390583, PMID:9709182]
comment: Heberden's nodes are nodular deformities at the distal interphalangeal joint of the fingers (usually the middle and index) and are commonly seen in the elderly. The deformity is created by osteophyte formation and synovial thickening at the margin ofan osteoarthritic joint. Significant functional problems are rarely encountered though patients may suffer with stiffness and pain. Surgical intervention is seldom indicated unless there is severe pain or instability. In such cases, a joint fusion may be appropriate.
synonym: "Heberden's node" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:371598009
xref: UMLS:C0018862
is_a: HP:0006247 ! Enlarged interphalangeal joints
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-08-10T12:19:59Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012314
name: Bouchard node
synonym: "عقدة بوشار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تورم في مفاصل الأصابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تورم عظمي في المفصل القريب بين السلاميات (PIP) مرتبط بتكوين نمو عظمي (نتوءات كلسية) في غضروف المفصل يمكن رؤيته بالأشعة.
def: "Bony swelling of the proximal interphalangeal joint (PIP) associated with the formation of osteophytes (calcific spurs) of the articular (joint) cartilage that are visible radiographically." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:10531070, PMID:9709182]
comment: Heberden's nodes are generally a sign of osteoarthritis.
synonym: "Bouchard's node" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:20243008
xref: UMLS:C0263780
is_a: HP:0006247 ! Enlarged interphalangeal joints
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-08-10T12:27:25Z

