[Term]
id: HP:0012343
name: Decreased circulating ferritin concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز الفيريتين في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض مستويات الفيريتين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في تركيز الفيريتين، وهو بروتين داخل الخلايا موجود في كل مكان يقوم بتخزين الحديد، في الدم.
def: "Abnormally reduced concentration of ferritin, a ubiquitous intracellular protein that stores iron, in the blood." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Ferritin levels measured in serum usually have a direct correlation with the total amount of iron stored in the body, but ferritin levels may also be increased with anemia of chronic disease or in the course of an acute phase reaction.
synonym: "Decreased plasma ferritin" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased serum ferritin" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Low ferritin level" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Reduced serum ferritin" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C0241012
is_a: HP:0040133 ! Abnormal circulating ferritin concentration
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-09-13T09:51:46Z

