[Term]
id: HP:0012366
name: Basilar invagination
synonym: "انغراز القاعدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: بروز قمة الفقرة الثانية فوق الخط الذي يصل بين الحنك الصلب والشفة الخلفية للثقب المغزلي (خط تشامبرلين)، أو تكون قمة الفقرة الثانية أكبر بسبعة ملليمترات فوق خط ماكجريجور (من الخلفية الصلبة للحنك إلى أدنى نقطة من قصعة القذالي).
def: "Projection of the tip of the dens more than 5 mm above a line joining the hard palate to the posterior lip of the foramen magnum (Chamberlain's line) or the tip of the dens is greater than 7 mm above McGregor's line (the back of the hard palate to the lowest point of the occipital squama)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:10084535]
xref: UMLS:C3887851
is_a: HP:0000932 ! Abnormal posterior cranial fossa morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-10-13T12:18:53Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012367
name: Extra fontanelles
synonym: "فتحات اليافوخ الزائدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فتحات الجُمَجَمة الزائدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيوب عظمية تقع على طول خطوط الدرز القحفية أو عند تقاطع الصفائح العظمية للجمجمة.
def: "Bony defects situated along the cranial suture lines or at the junction of the bone plates of the skull." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Extra fontanelles include glabellar, metopic, sagittal (parietal) and cerebellar fontanelles.
subset: hposlim_core
xref: UMLS:C4022927
is_a: HP:0011328 ! Abnormal fontanelle morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-10-13T12:27:03Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012368
name: Flat face
synonym: "الوجه المسطح" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب التقعر أو التحدب في الوجه عند النظر إليه من الجانب.
def: "Absence of concavity or convexity of the face when viewed in profile." [PMID:19125436]
comment: A useful guide is to imagine that a line connecting the glabella to the anterior most part of the mandible touches the top of the philtrum where it meets the base of the columella. The glabella is the most prominent point on the frontal bone above the root of the nose. If the superior philtrum is anterior to this line the face is convex, if the superior philtrum is posterior to this line the face is concave.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Flat face" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Flat facial profile" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Flat facial shape" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Flat facies" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: UMLS:C1853241
is_a: HP:0001999 ! Abnormal facial shape
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-10-13T01:49:13Z

