[Term]
id: HP:0012371
name: Hyperplasia of midface
synonym: "فرط تنسج في الجزء الأوسط من الوجه" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كبر في الوجه الأوسط" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تموضع أمامي بشكل غير طبيعي في المناطق الجبهية وحول الغشاء المخاطي في الأنف، أو زيادة تحدب الوجه، أو زيادة في زاوية الأنف الشفوية. يشمل الجزء الأوسط من الوجه العظم الفكي العلوي، الخدود، العظم الوجني، والمناطق الجبهية وحول الأنف في الوجه.
alt_id: HP:0010279
def: "Abnormally anterior positioning of the infraorbital and perialar regions, or increased convexity of the face, or increased nasolabial angle. The midface includes the maxilla, the cheeks, the zygomas, and the infraorbital and perialar regions of the face" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19125436]
comment: This term represents increased size of the maxilla (upper jaw) in length (increased midface height) or anterior-posterior projection (midface prominence). In the presence of normal mandible size, maxillary prominence may give the appearance of retrognathia.
subset: hposlim_core
synonym: "Big midface" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Hypertrophy of midface" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Large midface" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Midface hyperplasia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Midfacial excess" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Midfacial prominence" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Overgrowth of the midface" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: UMLS:C0240309
is_a: HP:0000309 ! Abnormal midface morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-10-13T02:55:54Z

