[Term]
id: HP:0012418
name: Hypoxemia
synonym: "نقص الأكسجين في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى منخفض من الأكسجين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مستوى غير طبيعي ومنخفض من الأكسجين في الدم.
def: "An abnormally low level of blood oxygen." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Note that hypoxemia is defined as a condition where arterial oxygen tension is below normal (80-100mmHg). Hypoxia is defined as the failure of oxygenation at the tissue level. Hypoxia is not measured directly by a standard laboratory value.
synonym: "Hypoxia" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Low blood oxygen level" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:389087006
xref: UMLS:C0700292
