id: HP:0012421
name: Congenital absence of foreskin
synonym: "غياب خلقي للقلفة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "غياب القلفة منذ الولادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الافتقار الخلقي لجلد قلفة القضيب، وهي الطية المزدوجة من الجلد والغشاء المخاطي الذي يغطي حشفة القضيب.
def: "Congenital lack of the skin of prepuce of penis, that is, of the double-layered fold of skin and mucous membrane that covers the glans penis." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Absence of the foreskin can be accompanied by Cryptorchidism and Hypospadias, which should be coded separately.
synonym: "Absent foreskin" EXACT []
synonym: "Aposthia" EXACT []
