[Term]
id: HP:0012431
name: Episodic fatigue
synonym: "إرهاق متقطع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور بالتعب المتقطع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبات متكررة ومتقطعة من الشعور الذاتي بالتعب تتميز بقلة الطاقة والدافعية.
def: "Intermittent and recurrent bouts of a subjective feeling of tiredness characterized by a lack of energy and motivation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022907
is_a: HP:0012378 ! Fatigue
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-11-13T07:45:40Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012432
name: Chronic fatigue
synonym: "إرهاق مزمن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور بالتعب المستمر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شعور ذاتي بالتعب يتميز بنقص في الطاقة والدافعية ويستمر لمدة ستة أشهر أو أكثر.
def: "Subjective feeling of tiredness characterized by a lack of energy and motivation that persists for six months or longer." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
comment: Note that chronic fatigue can be a symptom of chronic fatigue syndrome (CFS), which is characterized by profound fatigue that is not improved by bed rest and that may be worsened by physical or mental activity. Symptoms of CFS may include weakness, muscle pain, impaired memory, impaired mental concentration, and insomnia, which can result in reduced participation in daily activities.
synonym: "Chronic extreme exhaustion" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Chronic fatigue" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: UMLS:C0518656
is_a: HP:0012378 ! Fatigue
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-11-13T07:49:08Z

