[Term]
id: HP:0012441
name: Sphincter of Oddi dyskinesia
synonym: "خلل حركة مصرة أودي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في الحركة من خلال مصرة أودي، مما يؤدي إلى عرقلة تدفق العصارة الصفراوية وعصارة البنكرياس من القناة الصفراوية المشتركة إلى الاثني عشر.
def: "Reduced motility through the sphincter of Oddi, resulting in impedance of bile and pancreatic juice flow from the common bile duct into the duodenum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The sphincter of Oddi (also known as sphincter of ampulla) is a muscular valve that controls the flow of bile and pancreatic juice through the ampulla of Vater into the second part of the duodenum. Increased tone of the sphincter or disturbance in the coordination of contraction of the biliary ducts prevents normal emptying of the biliary tree. This may result in biliary pain, common bile duct dilation and episodes of pancreatitis.
synonym: "Sphincter of Oddi dysfunction" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:430887001
xref: UMLS:C0878588
xref: UMLS:C4048750
is_a: HP:0012396 ! Biliary dyskinesia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-11-23T02:21:59Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012442
name: Gallbladder dyskinesia
synonym: "خلل حركة المرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حركة المرارة غير الطبيعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في حركة المرارة مصحوب بانخفاض في جزء الإفراغ.
def: "Reduced motility of the gallbladder with reduced emptying fraction." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12095476, PMID:17761125]
comment: Patients with this gallbladder dyskinesia present with biliary-type pain but no evidence of gallstones in the gallbladder. The diagnosis is made by performing a radionuclide investigation of the gallbladder ejection fraction. An abnormal gallbladder ejection fraction has a value less than 40 percent.
xref: UMLS:C1449631
is_a: HP:0012396 ! Biliary dyskinesia
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-11-23T02:28:07Z

