id: HP:0012461
name: Bacteriuria
synonym: "بكتيريا في البول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود بكتيريا في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود بكتيريا في البول.
def: "The presence of bacteria in the urine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
comment: The urine is normally bacteria-free. The term refers to bacteria from the urinary tract and not to bacteria found in the urine because of contamination from the surrounding tissues. Significant bacteriuria is a sign of urinary tract infection.
synonym: "Bacteria in urine" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
