synonym: "Jaw joint sounds" BROAD layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Temporomandibular joint clicking sound" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Temporomandibular joint grating sound" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Temporomandibular joint noise" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Temporomandibular joint popping sound" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Temporomandibular joint sounds" BROAD [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
