[Term]
id: HP:0012488
name: Intraventricular arachnoid cyst
synonym: "كيسة العنكبوتية داخل البطينين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كيسة داخل الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كيسة عنكبوتية تقع داخل النظام البطيني.
def: "An arachnoid cyst located within the ventricular system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:8951893]
comment: Arachnoid cysts very rarely occur within the ventricular system, where no arachnoid tissue exists.
