[Term]
id: HP:0012531
name: Pain
synonym: "ألم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تجربة حسية وعاطفية غير سارة مرتبطة بتلف فعلي أو محتمل في الأنسجة، أو توصف بمثل هذه الأضرار.
def: "An unpleasant sensory and emotional experience associated with actual or potential tissue damage, or described in terms of such damage." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Pain" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:22253000
xref: UMLS:C0030193
is_a: HP:0025142 ! Constitutional symptom
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-12-15T09:38:08Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012532
name: Chronic pain
synonym: "ألم مزمن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم طويل الأمد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ألم مستمر، يُعرف عادةً بأنه الألم الذي يستمر لمدة تزيد عن 3 إلى 6 أشهر.
def: "Persistent pain, usually defined as pain that has lasted longer than 3 to 6 months." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:1875958]
comment: Acute pain is provoked by a specific disease or injury, serves a useful biologic purpose, is associated with skeletal muscle spasm and sympathetic nervous system activation, and is self-limited. Chronic pain, in contrast, may be considered a disease state. It is pain that outlasts the normal time of healing.
synonym: "Chronic pain" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Long-lasting pain" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:82423001
xref: UMLS:C0150055
is_a: HP:0012531 ! Pain
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-12-15T09:46:55Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012533
name: Allodynia
synonym: "الألودينيا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم من سبب غير مؤلم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الألم الناتج عن محفز لا يسبب الألم عادة.
def: "Pain due to a stimulus that does not normally provoke pain." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:247404004
xref: UMLS:C0458247
is_a: HP:0012531 ! Pain
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
