[Term]
id: HP:0012541
name: Cephalohematoma
synonym: "ورم دموي رأسي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نزيف في رأس حديثي الولادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نزيف يحدث بين الجمجمة والسمحاق لدى حديثي الولادة نتيجة لتمزق الأوعية الدموية التي تعبر السمحاق.
def: "Hemorrhage between the skull and periosteum of a newborn resulting from rupture of blood vessels that cross the periosteum." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
comment: Cephalohematoma is generally caused by trauma during labor.
synonym: "Cephalohaematoma" EXACT []
