[Term]
id: HP:0012544
name: Elevated circulating aldolase concentration
synonym: "ارتفاع تركيز الألدولاز في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة الألدولاز في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز الفركتوز 1,6-بيسفوسفات ألدولاز في الدورة الدموية يزيد عن الحد الأعلى الطبيعي.
def: "Concentration of fructose 1,6-bisphosphate aldolase in the blood circulation above the upper limit of normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
comment: Aldolase is an enzyme responsible for converting fructose 1,6-bisphosphate into the triose phosphates dihydroxyacetone phosphate and glyceraldehyde 3-phosphate.
synonym: "Elevated aldolase level" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4022858
is_a: HP:0012400 ! Abnormal circulating aldolase concentration
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2013-12-21T09:18:43Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012545
name: Reduced circulating aldolase concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز الألدولاز في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص الألدولاز في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز الفركتوز 1,6-بيسفوسفات ألدولاز في الدورة الدموية يقل عن الحد الأدنى الطبيعي.
def: "Concentration of fructose 1,6-bisphosphate aldolase in the blood circulation below the lower limit of normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
comment: Aldolase is an enzyme responsible for converting fructose 1,6-bisphosphate into the triose phosphates dihydroxyacetone phosphate and glyceraldehyde 3-phosphate.
synonym: "Reduced aldolase level" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4022857
is_a: HP:0012400 ! Abnormal circulating aldolase concentration
