def: "A lipoma (a benign tumor composed of adipose tissue) located in the conjunctiva." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Conjunctival lipoma displays yellowish-pink stromal mass, histologically with large lipid vacuoles surrounded by stellate cells.
