[Term]
id: HP:0012561
name: Unicuspid aortic valve
synonym: "الصمام الأبهري ذو الشرفة الواحدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صمام القلب بشرفة واحدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود صمام أبهري بشرفة واحدة بدلاً من الشرف الثلاث الطبيعة.
def: "The presence of an aortic valve with one instead of the normal three cusps (flaps)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:18480095, PMID:20329493]
comment: The aortic valve normally has three cusps (flaps), that is, it is normally tricuspid. Unicuspid aortic valve (UAV) shares many of the features of bicuspid aortic valve, including valvular dysfunction, aortic dilatation, aortic dissection, and dystrophic calcification, although these conditions develop at an earlier age and progress at a faster pace in UAV.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:253610004
xref: UMLS:C0345001
is_a: HP:0031567 ! Abnormal aortic valve cusp morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-01-08T08:14:15Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012562
name: Premature epimetaphyseal fusion in hand
synonym: "اندماج مشاشي كردوسي مبكر في اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "توقف نمو في عظام اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توقف النمو عند اللوحة المشاشية وهي لوحة غضروف زجاجي في كردوس واحدة أو أكثر من العظام الطويلة في اليد في وقت مبكر عن العمر الطبيعي، مما يؤدي إلى توقف النمو وقصر في العظم المعني.
def: "Stop of growth at the epiphyseal plate the hyaline cartilage plate in the metaphysis at one or more long bones in the hand, at an earlier than normal age, resulting in growth arrest and shortening of the involved bone." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022844
is_a: HP:0010588 ! Premature epimetaphyseal fusion
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-01-04T02:02:35Z

