[Term]
id: HP:0012570
name: Synovial sarcoma
synonym: "ساركومة زليلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم في الأنسجة اللينة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الورم في خلايا الأنسجة المتوسطة التي تظهر تمايزاً ظهارياً، ينشأ غالبًا في الأطراف.
def: "A type of mesenchymal tissue cell tumor that exhibits epithelial differentiation, which most frequently arises in the extremities." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Synovial sarcoma is a high-grade tumor that is associated with poor prognosis.
