[Term]
id: HP:0012571
name: Ureter fissus
synonym: "الحالب المشقوق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انقسام جزئي في الحالب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انقسام جزئي للحالب حيث تندمج الحالبات المنقّسمة لتكوّن حالباً واحداً قبل الدخول إلى المثانة.
def: "A partial duplication of the ureter where the duplicated ureters fuse to a single ureter before their insertion into the bladder." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:Eurenomics_ewuehl]
comment: This anomaly is only seen in the presence of renal duplication.
synonym: "Partially duplicated ureter" EXACT []
xref: ICD-10:Q62.5 "Duplication of ureter"
xref: UMLS:C4021079
is_a: HP:0000073 ! Ureteral duplication
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-01-16T11:38:41Z

[Term]
