[Term]
id: HP:0012623
name: Stage 1 chronic kidney disease
synonym: "المرحلة 1 من المرض الكلوي المزمن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "المرحلة الأولى من مرض الكلى" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من المرض الكلوي المزمن يتميز بمعدل ترشيح كبيبي طبيعي أو مرتفع (معدل ترشيح كبيبي لا يقل عن 90 مل/دقيقة/1.73 م^2).
def: "A type of chronic kidney disease with normal or increased glomerular filtration rate (GFR at least 90 mL/min/1.73 m2)." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:Eurenomics_fschaefer]
comment: Proteinuria is commonly seen in stage 1 chronic kidney disease.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:431855005
xref: UMLS:C2316401
is_a: HP:0012622 ! Chronic kidney disease
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-01-17T01:20:48Z

