[Term]
id: HP:0012634
name: Iris pigment dispersion
synonym: "انتشار صبغة القزحية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انتشار صبغة عين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تساقط الحبيبات الصبغية التي تلتصق عادةً على ظهر القزحية إلى الخلط المائي.
def: "Shedding of the pigment granules that normally adhere to the back of the iris into the aqueous humor." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: These pigment granules can accumulate in the trabucular meshwork and lead to increased intraocular pressure. That is coded separately as HP:001263.
