[Term]
id: HP:0012636
name: Retinal venous occlusion
synonym: "انسداد الوريد الشبكي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انسداد وريد العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انسداد وريد أو وريدة شبكية، يحدث عادة في تقاطع شرياني وريدي. يظهر عادة مع تمدد في الأوردة، نزيف شبكي وفي بعض الحالات عدم تدفق الدم.
def: "Blockage of a retinal vein or venule, occurring typically at an arteriovenous crossing. Typically presenting with dilated veins, retinal hemorrhages and in some cases non-perfusion." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Retinal vein occlusion is generally associated with systemic cardiovascular diseases.
synonym: "Retinal vein occlusion" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:46085004
xref: UMLS:C0035328
is_a: HP:0008046 ! Abnormal retinal vascular morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-01-17T11:43:32Z

