[Term]
id: HP:0012640
name: Abnormality of intracranial pressure
synonym: "خلل الضغط داخل الجمجمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير الضغط داخل الرأس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو انحراف عن القيم الطبيعية لضغط السائل في الجمجمة.
def: "A deviation from the norm of the intracranial pressure." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Intracranial pressure (i.e., the pressure inside the skull) represents the pressure in the brain tissue and in the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF). Deviations from normal are generally identified by measuring the pressure of the CSF.
