[Term]
id: HP:0012645
name: Enlarged peripheral nerve
synonym: "تكبير العصب المحيطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة حجم العصب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في حجم العصب المحيطي. يمكن تقدير هذا الاكتشاف عن طريق الجس على طول محور العصب.
def: "Increase in size of a peripheral nerve. This finding can be appreciated by palpation along the axis of the nerve." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: This feature can be appreciated by imaging studies (magnetic resonancy tomography), by palpation along the axis of a nerve, and by biopsy, and may be caused by axonal swelling or by myelin thickening. The differential diagnosis of enlarged peripheral nerves includes leprosy, hereditary motor and sensory neuropathy type 1 (about 30% of patients), but not type 2 (the axonal form), some other polyneuropathies, neurofibromatosis, and nerve tumors. A good review is available in Practical Neurology, 2003,3:40-45 by Michael Donaghy (no pubmed id).
synonym: "Enlarged peripheral nerves" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: UMLS:C2675074
is_a: HP:0000759 ! Abnormal peripheral nervous system morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-02-01T12:44:16Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012646
name: Retractile testis
synonym: "الخصية القابلة للانكماش" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خصية متحركة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خصية تقع في الجزء العلوي من الصفن أو القناة الإربية السفلية والتي يمكن جعلها تنزل بالكامل إلى الكيس الصفني دون مقاومة عن طريق التخفيض اليدوي ولكنها تعود إلى موضعها الأصلي بواسطة منعكس المشلة.
def: "A testis that is located at the upper scrotum or lower inguinal canal and that can be made to descend completely into the scrotum without resistance by manual reduction but returns to its original position by the cremasteric reflex." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23061004, PMID:4380054]
synonym: "Retractile testicle" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:21779006
xref: UMLS:C0520578
is_a: HP:0000035 ! Abnormal testis morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-02-01T12:57:41Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012647
name: Abnormal inflammatory response
synonym: "اضطراب الاستجابة الالتهابية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في الاستجابة الالتهابية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي خلل في الاستجابة الالتهابية، وهي استجابة للإصابة أو العدوى تتسم بتوسع الأوعية الدموية موضعيًا، وتسرب البلازما إلى المساحات الخلوية وتراكم خلايا الدم البيضاء والماكروفاجات.
def: "Any anomaly of the inflammatory response, a response to injury or infection characterized by local vasodilation, extravasation of plasma into intercellular spaces and accumulation of white blood cells and macrophages." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9114-8737]
synonym: "Abnormal inflammatory response" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4022805
is_a: HP:0010978 ! Abnormality of immune system physiology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-02-01T01:25:42Z

