id: HP:0012660
name: Thalamic hypometabolism in FDG PET
synonym: "انخفاض التمثيل الغذائي في الثالاموس في FDG PET" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض النشاط في الثالاموس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض امتصاص [18F]-فلوروديوكسيجلوكوز (FDG) في الثالاموس كما هو مقاس بواسطة مسح الدماغ بالتطبيق المقطعي بالإصدار البوزيتروني (PET).
def: "Reduced uptake of [18F]-fluorodeoxyglucose (FDG) in the thalamus as measured by positron emission tomography (PET) brain scan." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Glucose uptake measured with FDG-PET is a marker of neuronal metabolic activity, thus this sign indicates reduced metabolic activity in the thalamus.
xref: UMLS:C4022796
is_a: HP:0012658 ! Abnormal brain FDG positron emission tomography
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-02-15T11:35:25Z

