comment: Arabic Definition: فشل في تكوين الجزء السفلي من المهبل.
def: "A failure to develop of the lower part of the vagina." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Absent lower vagina" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Agenesis of the lower vagina" EXACT []
