synonym: "تغير في شكل الغدة الصنوبرية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل تركيبي في الغدة الصنوبرية.
def: "A structural abnormality of the pineal gland." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_htrang]
comment: The pineal gland typically measures 7 x 6 x 3mm in size and is located in a groove between the laterally placed thalamic bodies.
