[Term]
id: HP:0012683
name: Pineal cyst
synonym: "الكيسة الصنوبرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كيسة في الغدة الصنوبرية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كيس مملوء بسائل، يمكن أن يكون وحيد الجوف أو متعدد الجوف، يَتَوَضَّع داخل أو يحل محل الغدة الصنوبرية بشكل كامل.
def: "A glial uniloculated or multiloculated fluid-filled sac that either reside within or completely replace the pineal gland." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:21801982]
comment: Pineal cysts are benign and often asymptomatic lesions. They are typically visualized by computed tomography or magnetic resonance imaging.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:413099000
xref: UMLS:C1335411
is_a: HP:0010576 ! Intracranial cystic lesion
is_a: HP:0012681 ! Abnormal pineal morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2014-03-22T01:01:45Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012684
name: Abnormal pineal volume
