def: "Disturbance in the atrial activation that is caused by transient failure of impulse conduction from the sinoatrial node to the cardiac atria." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Sinoatrial block is characterized by a delayed in heartbeat and pauses between P waves as demonstrated by electrocardiography.
