[Term]
id: HP:0012763
name: Paroxysmal dyspnea
synonym: "ضيق التنفس الانتيابي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة ضيق التنفس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هجوم مفاجئ من ضيق التنفس يحدث أثناء الراحة.
def: "A sudden attack of dyspnea that occurs while the affected person is at rest." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnea (PND) is a sensation of shortness of breath that awakens the patient, often after 1 or 2 hours of sleep, and is usually relieved in the upright position.
synonym: "Paroxysmal dyspnoea" EXACT uk_spelling []
