comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان السمع الذي يحدث بشكل حاد ويتماثل للشفاء بالكامل.
def: "Hearing loss that occurs acutely and resolves completely." [PMID:21776317]
comment: Transient hearing loss is particularly common in childhood as a result of inadequate ventilation of the middle ear.
