[Term]
id: HP:0012793
name: Kinked brainstem
synonym: "التواء في جذع الدماغ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انحناء في منطقة جذع الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مظهر ملتوي لجذع الدماغ، أي انحناء مبالغ فيه.
def: "A kinked appearance of the brainstem, i.e., an exaggerated flexure." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:16301726]
comment: Kinked brainstem is an indicator of severe neurodysgenesis arising early in gestation. This sign can be appreciated in prenatal magnetic resonance imaging.
