[Term]
id: HP:0012805
name: Iris transillumination defect
synonym: "عيب شفافية القزحية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عيب في شفافية القزحية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مرور الضوء عبر القزحية كما يُرى عند فحص المصباح المشقوق أو فيديوغرافيا الشفافية القزحية بالأشعة تحت الحمراء. يمر الضوء عبر العيوب في تصبغ القزحية.
def: "Transmission of light through the iris as visualized upon slit lamp examination or infrared iris transillumination videography. The light passes through defects in the pigmentation of the iris." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19920562]
comment: Initially, transillumination defects are usually slit-like, but if pigment loss increases, the defects may be become larger and irregularly shaped.
xref: UMLS:C1096099
is_a: HP:0008034 ! Abnormal iris pigmentation
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2014-05-25T03:43:06Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012806
name: Proboscis
synonym: "خرطوم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شفة أنفية كبيرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هيكل لحمي أنبوبي الشكل يقع عادة في منتصف الوجه أو بجانب واحد من الوسط.
def: "A fleshy, tube-like structure usually located in the midline of the face or just to one side of the midline." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:19152422]
comment: A proboscis has a single cavity. It may be found in association with a malformed nose and absence of one or both nares.
xref: UMLS:C0687082
is_a: HP:0005105 ! Abnormal nasal morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2014-05-25T05:46:42Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012807
name: High insertion of columella
synonym: "التركيب العالي من الدعامة الأنفية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التركيب العالي للدعامة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إدخال الجزء الخلفي من الدعامة الأنفية أعلى من قاعدة الأنف.
def: "Insertion of the posterior columella superior to the nasal base." [PMID:19152422]
comment: This feature is different from a convex Low hanging columella that has a normal insertion. It may be associated with a Short philtrum, but this should be assessed and coded separately. A low insertion is best appreciated when viewed from the side.
