[Term]
id: HP:0012884
name: Fallopian tube torsion
synonym: "التواء قناة فالوب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قناة فالوب ملتوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التواء قناة فالوب. العرض المعتاد هو ظهور مفاجئ مع ألم حاد ومتقطّع في الحوض، يرتبط بالغثيان والقيء وأعراض المثانة والأمعاء.
def: "A twisting of the Fallopian tube. Sudden onset with sharp, colicky pelvic pain associated with nausea, vomiting, bowel, and bladder symptoms is the usual presentation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:24251052]
comment: Fallopian tube torsion, though rare, should be considered in women of reproductive age with unilateral pelvic pain. Early diagnostic laparoscopy is important for an accurate diagnosis and could salvage the tube.
synonym: "Twisted fallopian tube" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:46946009
xref: UMLS:C0269169
is_a: HP:0011027 ! Abnormal fallopian tube morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2014-06-11T08:01:57Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012885
name: Fallopian tube duplication
synonym: "ازدواج قناة فالوب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قناة فالوب إضافية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود قناة فالوب فائضة.
def: "The presence of a supernumerary Fallopian tube." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23532389]
comment: Accessory fallopian tube is the congenital anomaly attached to the ampullary part of main tube. This accessory tube is common site of pyosalpinx, hydrosalpinx, cystic swelling and torsion.
synonym: "Accessory fallopian tube" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:48672005
xref: UMLS:C0266375
is_a: HP:0011027 ! Abnormal fallopian tube morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2014-06-11T08:05:41Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012886
name: Hemorrhagic ovarian cyst
synonym: "كيس مبيضي نزفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نزيف في الكيس المبيضي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كتلة بطنية تتكون من النزيف في كيس مبيضي جريبي أو كيس الجسم الأصفر.
def: "An abdominal mass formed by bleeding into a follicular ovarian cyst or corpus luteum cyst." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12928726]
comment: The clinical signs and symptoms of hemorrhagic ovarian cyst (HOC) are variable and include such patients as asymptomatic cases or patients showing symptoms of acute abdomen. HOC is detected as pelvic masses by ultrasonography, but it is often misdiagnosed with other organic masses because of its variable clinical and sonographic findings, and in some cases may lead to laparotomy.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:119420007
xref: UMLS:C0473311
is_a: HP:0000138 ! Ovarian cyst
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2014-06-11T09:26:15Z

[Term]
id: HP:0012887
name: Ovarian serous cystadenoma
synonym: "ورم كيسي مصلي مبيضي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كيس مائي في المبيض" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم كيسي في المبيض يحتوي على سائل مصلي أصفر رقيق وواضح، مع كميات متباينة من النسيج الصلب.
def: "A cystic tumor of the ovary, containing thin, clear, yellow serous fluid and varying amounts of solid tissue." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23766763]
comment: Ovarian serous cystadenoma HAS a malignant potential several times greater than that of mucinous cystadenoma. It can be unilocular, parvilocular, or multilocular. It is often bilateral and papillary. The cysts may vary greatly in size.
synonym: "Serous ovarian cyst" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:119421006
xref: UMLS:C0346170
xref: UMLS:C4020715
is_a: HP:0000138 ! Ovarian cyst
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6996-5279
creation_date: 2014-06-11T09:32:06Z

