comment: Arabic Definition: كمية البيتا-ألانين في البول، عند تطبيعها لمستوى تركيز البول، تكون فوق الحد الأعلى للمستوى الطبيعي.
alt_id: HP:6000276
def: "The amount of beta-alanine in the urine, when normalized for urine concentration, is above the upper limit of normal." [PMID:7936305]
comment: Beta-alanine is a component of carnosine, anserine and pantothenic acid. It is comprised of propionic acid with the amino group in the 3-position.
synonym: "Beta-alanine high in urine" EXACT []
synonym: "Elevated urinary beta-alanine level" EXACT []
synonym: "Hyper-beta-alaninuria" EXACT []
