id: HP:0020083
name: Furuncle
synonym: "دُمَّل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدوى في جريبات الشعر تمتد تحت الجلد، مكونة خراجًا.
def: "An infection of a hair follicle that extends subcutaneously, forming an abscess." []
synonym: "Boil" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0025084 ! Folliculitis
property_value: dc:date "2019-04-08T16:59:51Z" xsd:dateTime
