comment: This phenotype can be related to a defect in the degradation pathway of L- isoleucine leading to increased urinary excretion of 2-methylbutyryl glycine.
is_a: HP:0033097 ! Increased urine proteinogenic amino acid derivative level
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2019-07-05T19:25:20Z

