def: "The presence of autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the serum that react against double-stranded DNA." [PMID:15804704]
comment: Anti-DNA antibodies can be observed in persons with systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE), being a formal classification criterion.
synonym: "Anti-double-stranded DNA antibody positivity" EXACT []
