comment: Arabic Definition: انسداد فرع من الشريان الشبكي. يمكن أن يسبب فقدان جزء من المجال البصري.
def: "Blockage of a branch of the retinal artery. This can cause loss of a section of visual field." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0986-4123, PMID:19376586]
is_a: HP:0025326 ! Retinal arterial occlusion
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2019-07-06T20:57:42Z

[Term]
id: HP:0020162
name: Abnormal neoplastic cell morphology
synonym: "شذوذ نسيجي لخلايا الأورام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
