[Term]
id: HP:0020207
name: Reflex seizure
synonym: "النوبة المنعكسة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "النوبة المحفزة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبات تحدث نتيجة محفزات خارجية.
def: "Seizures precipitated by exogenous stimuli." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178, PMID:11422340]
comment: Included in 2001 ILAE Proposed Classification of Seizures. Seizures precipitated by fever, head injury, or alcohol withdrawal or anti-epileptic medication withdrawal are not provoked seizures.
is_a: HP:0001250 ! Seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2020-02-24T13:36:35Z

[Term]
id: HP:0020208
name: Eating-induced seizure
synonym: "النوبة المتحرضة بالأكل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة بسبب الأكل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة تُحفَّز من خلال توقع الطعام أو تناوله أو الفترة التي تلي تناول الطعام.
def: "A seizure precipitated by aspects of anticipating food, eating itself, or the post-prandial period." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178, PMID:11422340]
is_a: HP:0020207 ! Reflex seizure
