id: HP:0025029
name: Abnormal enteric neuron morphology
synonym: "شذوذ في شكل الخلايا العصبية المعوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه هيكلي في الخلايا العصبية للجهاز العصبي المعوي.
synonym: "Abnormality of enteric neuron morphology" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025028 ! Abnormal enteric nervous system morphology
property_value: dc:date "2016-08-27T11:22:10Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025030
name: Enteric neuronal degeneration
synonym: "تنكس الخلايا العصبية المعوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تلف أعصاب الأمعاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تدهور الخلايا العصبية المعوية مع تأثير على هيكل الخلايا العصبية المعوية. تشمل النتائج المرضية العصبية النموذجية الشذوذ النوعي (مثل تورم الخلايا العصبية، إدخالات داخل النواة، تنكس المحاور العصبية) والكمي (مثل تقليل عدد الخلايا العصبية) في الخلايا العصبية المعوية.
def: "Deterioration of enteric neurons with impairment of enteric neuronal structure. Typical neuropathological findings include qualitative (e.g., neuronal swelling, intranuclear inclusions, axonal degeneration) and quantitative (e.g., reduction in the number of neurons) abnormalities of the enteric neurons." []
synonym: "Degenerative enteric neuropathy" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0025029 ! Abnormal enteric neuron morphology
property_value: dc:date "2016-08-27T11:43:00Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025031
name: Abnormality of the digestive system
synonym: "شذوذ الجهاز الهضمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه أو خلل في بنية أو وظيفة الجهاز الهضمي.
comment: Any anomaly of the digestive system, a collection of organs that is made up of the gastrointestinal tract and the liver, pancreas, and gallbladder. The gastrointestinal tract is a series of hollow organs joined in a long, twisting tube from the mouth to the anus, including the mouth, esophagus, stomach, small intestine, large intestine and anus.
is_a: HP:0000118 ! Phenotypic abnormality
property_value: dc:date "2016-08-27T13:44:32Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

