def: "A circumscribed area of pus or necrotic debris in the parenchyma of the spleen." [PMID:21319348]
comment: Splenic abscesses generally occur in patients with neoplasia, immunodeficiency, trauma, metastatic infection, splenic infarct or diabetes.
