[Term]
id: HP:0025063
name: Scaphoid abdomen
synonym: "البطن القرصي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بطن مجوفة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الجدار الأمامي للبطن يكون مجوفاً ويظهر بشكل مقعر بدلاً من محدب.
def: "The anterior abdominal wall is sunken and presents a concave rather than a convex contour." []
comment: Scaphoid abdomen can be observed in diseases such as congenital diaphragmatic hernia (since the abdominal contents can be in the thorax).
is_a: HP:0011458 ! Abdominal symptom
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T09:54:43Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025064
name: Thalamic hemorrhage
synonym: "نزيف المهاد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نزيف في الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نزيف في المهاد.
def: "Bleeding in the thalamus." []
comment: Thalamic hemorrhage may be observed in individuals with hypertension. In both the acute and chronic phases of bleeding, prominent susceptibility effect, seen as hypointense blooming on sequences, is typically seen upon magnetic resonance imaging.
synonym: "Thalamic hemorrhage" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0010663 ! Abnormal thalamus morphology
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:03:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025065
name: Abnormal mean corpuscular volume
synonym: "شذوذ حجم الكرية الوسطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في حجم خلايا الدم الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف عن الحجم الطبيعي للكرية الوسطي أو حجم الخلية الوسطي (MCV) لخلايا الدم الحمراء، الذي يُحدد بين 80 و100 فيمتوليتر عادة.
def: "A deviation from normal of the mean corpuscular volume, or mean cell volume (MCV) of red blood cells, usually taken to be 80 to 100 femtoliters." []
synonym: "Abnormal erythrocyte volume" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormal MCV" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0001877 ! Abnormal erythrocyte morphology
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:08:33Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025066
name: Decreased mean corpuscular volume
synonym: "انخفاض حجم الكريّات الوسطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صغر حجم خلايا الدم الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض عن الطبيعي في حجم الكريات الوسطي، أو حجم الخلايا الوسطي (MCV) لخلايا الدم الحمراء (وعادة ما يُعرف بأنه حجم يقل عن 80 فيمتولتر).
def: "A reduction from normal of the mean corpuscular volume, or mean cell volume (MCV) of red blood cells (usually defined as an MCV below 80 femtoliters)." []
synonym: "Decreased MCV" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Microcytosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced erythrocyte volume" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025065 ! Abnormal mean corpuscular volume
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:10:48Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025067
name: Recurrent sepsis
synonym: "إنتانات متكررة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى متكررة حادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبات متكررة من الإنتان، يعرّف بأنه خلل في وظيفة الأعضاء يهدد الحياة بسبب استجابة غير منظمة للعدوى من قبل الجسم.
def: "Repeated bouts of sepsis, defined as life-threatening organ dysfunction caused by a dysregulated host response to infection." []
is_a: HP:0100806 ! Sepsis
property_value: dc:date "2025-08-10T08:46:21Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

