id: HP:0025068
name: Incomitant strabismus
synonym: "حول غير متوافق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حول متغير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حول تختلف فيه زاوية الانحراف حسب اتجاه النظر أو العين المثبتة، يرتبط ب: (i) حركة العين المعيبة، (ii) جهد تكيفي غير متماثل.
def: "Strabismus in which the angle of deviation differs depending upon the direction of gaze or according to which eye is fixing, associated with: (i) defective movement of the eye, (ii) asymmetrical accommodative effort." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0986-4123]
is_a: HP:0000486 ! Strabismus
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:25:28Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025069
name: Concomitant strabismus
synonym: "حول متوافق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حول ثابت" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حول تبقى فيه زاوية انحراف العين المائلة ثابتة بالنسبة للعين الأخرى في جميع اتجاهات النظر، وأيًّا كانت العين المثبتة.
def: "Strabismus in which the angle of deviation of the squiting eye remains the same in relation to the other eye, in all directions of gaze, and whichever eye is fixing." []
synonym: "Comitant strabismus" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000486 ! Strabismus
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:29:59Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025070
name: Abnormal U wave
synonym: "اضطراب موجة U" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في موجة U في رسم القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في موجة U برسم القلب الكهربائي (EKG). موجة U هي انحراف صغير (0.5 مم) يظهر مباشرة بعد موجة T، وعادة ما يكون في نفس الاتجاه مع موجة T، وتظهر بشكل أوضح في الأماكن V2 وV3.
def: "An anomaly of the U wave of the electrocardiogram (EKG). The U wave is a small (0.5 mm) deflection immediately following the T wave, usually in the same direction as the T wave. It is best seen in leads V2 and V3." [PMID:22665396]
comment: U waves represent prolonged repolarisation of myocardial M cells. Under normal conditions the M cells are electrically coupled to adjacent cell layers. However, in conditions that produce electrical uncoupling, these M cells have significant effects on repolarisation producing prolonged rounded ST-T waves or U waves. The finding of U wave inversion on an ECG at rest or baseline is a non-specific finding. It is significant when observed post exercise, being originally described in early 1940s. Subsequent studies in the late 1970s, demonstrated a significant correlation of U wave inversion with either left main or LAD disease.
is_a: HP:0003115 ! Abnormal EKG
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:36:56Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025071
name: U wave inversion
synonym: "انعكاس موجة U" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اتجاه موجة U يكون معاكسًا لموجة T (أي تحت الخط القاعدي) في الدالات التي تحتوي على موجات T قائمة.
def: "Direction of the U wave opposite to the T wave (i.e., below baseline) in leads with upright T waves." []
comment: Inverted U wave may be a sign of coronary artery disease, hypertension, valvular heart disease, congenital heart disease, cardiomyopathy, or hyperthyroidism. In individuals with acute chest pain, it may be a sign of myocardial ischemia.
is_a: HP:0025070 ! Abnormal U wave
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:39:43Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025072
name: Prominent U wave
synonym: "موجة U بارزة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "موجة U واضحة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في سعة موجة U، تُعرّف على أنها سعة أكبر من 1-2 ملم أو 25 بالمئة من ارتفاع موجة T.
def: "Increased amplitude of the U wave, defined as an amplitude greater than 1-2mm or 25 percent of the height of the T wave." []
synonym: "Increased U wave amplitude" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025070 ! Abnormal U wave
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:42:48Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025073
name: Exercise-induced U wave inversion
synonym: "انعكاس موجة U المستحث بالتمرين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انعكاس موجة U بعد التمرين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انعكاس موجة U الذي يُستحث عن طريق اختبار الإجهاد البدني.
def: "U wave inversion that is induced by exercise stress testing." [PMID:22665396]
is_a: HP:0025071 ! U wave inversion
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:44:21Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025074
name: Abnormal QRS complex
synonym: "اضطراب المركب QRS" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في المركب QRS" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في المركب الناتج عن الموجات Q وR وS، والتي تحدث بشكل متعاقب وسريع في الرسم الكهربائي للقلب.
def: "An anomaly of the complex formed by the Q, R, and S waves, which occur in rapid succession on the electrocardiogram." []
is_a: HP:0003115 ! Abnormal EKG
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:46:17Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025075
name: Increased QRS voltage
synonym: "ارتفاع جهد QRS" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع الجهد الكهربائي لـ QRS" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في جهد (ارتفاع) معقد QRS. هناك عدة معايير مستخدمة، وأشهرها معيار Sokolov-Lyon (عمق موجة S في V1 + ارتفاع أعلى موجة R في V5-V6 أكثر من 35 ملم).
def: "Elevation of the voltage (height) of the QRS complex. There are several criteria in use, but the most common is the Sokolov-Lyon criterion (S wave depth in V1 + tallest R wave height in V5-V6 greater than 35 mm)." []
is_a: HP:0025076 ! Abnormal QRS voltage
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:48:06Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025076
name: Abnormal QRS voltage
synonym: "اضطراب جهد المركب QRS" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اختلال في جهد المركب QRS على رسم القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف في سعة المركب QRS في الرسم الكهربائي للقلب (EKG).
def: "Abnormal amplitude of the QRS complex of the electrocardiogram (EKG)." []
is_a: HP:0025074 ! Abnormal QRS complex
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:50:26Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025077
name: Decreased QRS voltage
synonym: "انخفاض جهد QRS" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض الجهد الكهربائي لـ QRS" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض سعة (ارتفاع) معقد QRS على مخطط كهربائية القلب (EKG)، يُعرف بأنها حالات سعة جميع معقدات QRS في الأطراف أقل من 5 ملم أو سعة جميع معقدات QRS في الليدات الصدرية أقل من 10 ملم.
def: "Reduced amplitude (height) of the QRS complex of the electrocardiogram (EKG), defined as amplitudes of all the QRS complexes in the limb leads are less than 5 mm or amplitudes of all the QRS complexes in the precordial leads less than 10 mm." []
is_a: HP:0025076 ! Abnormal QRS voltage
property_value: dc:date "2016-09-26T10:50:45Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025078
name: Electrical alternans
synonym: "تذبذب كهربائي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في ارتفاع QRS" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تتناوب معقدات QRS في مخطط القلب الكهربائي في الارتفاع.
def: "The QRS complexes of the electrocardiogram alternate in height." [PMID:8222799]
