property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025233
name: Sleep paralysis
synonym: "شلل النوم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "العجز عن الحركة أثناء النوم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدم القدرة على تحريك الجسم أو الكلام أثناء الانتقال إلى النوم أو الاستيقاظ، مع وعي كامل واستذكار للحالة.
def: "Inability to move trunk and limbs and inability to speak during transition into or out of sleep; awareness is preserved and recall is present." [PMID:32965993]
comment: Sleep paralysis is associated with the transition from or to the REM stage of sleep.
is_a: HP:5200293 ! Sleep-wake transition abnormality
