[Term]
id: HP:0025235
name: NREM parasomnia
synonym: "الباراسومنيا في نوم غير حركة العين السريعة (NREM)" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اضطراب نوم بدون حركة العين السريعة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الباراسومنيا يحدث أثناء النوم في مراحل بدون حركة العين السريعة.
def: "A parasomnia that occurs during non-rapid eye movement (NREM) sleep." [PMID:31375204]
comment: NREM parasomnias typically occur within a few hours after the onset of sleep. Episodes can last from a few minutes to as long as 30-40 minutes and are characterized by amnesia for the event.
synonym: "Disturbance in NREM" EXACT []
synonym: "Non-rapid eye movement parasomnia" EXACT []
synonym: "NREM parasomnia" EXACT []
