id: HP:0025259
name: Stiff elbow
synonym: "تيبس الكوع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صلابة الكوع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس بالضيق في مفصل الكوع عند محاولة تحريكه، خاصة بعد فترة من السكون.
def: "A sensation of tightness in the elbow joint when attempting to move it, especially after a period of inactivity." []
synonym: "Elbow stiffness" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Stiff elbow" EXACT layperson []
