[Term]
id: HP:0025267
name: Snoring
synonym: "الشخير" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التنفس بعمق وبصوت عال أثناء النوم، مصحوبًا بأصوات خشنة أو قاسية، ناتجة عن اهتزاز الهياكل التنفسية، خاصة الحنك الرخو. يحدث هذا الاهتزاز بسبب انسداد حركة الهواء أثناء التنفس خلال النوم.
def: "Deep, noisy breathing during sleep, accompanied by hoarse or harsh sounds, is caused by the vibration of respiratory structures, especially the soft palate. This vibration results in sound due to obstructed air movement during breathing while sleeping." [PMID:35216759]
synonym: "Snore" EXACT []
synonym: "Snores" EXACT []
synonym: "Snoring symptoms" EXACT []
is_a: HP:5200283 ! Sleep-related breathing disorders
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T13:24:58Z" xsd:dateTime
