[Term]
id: HP:0025268
name: Stuttering
synonym: "التلعثم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطرابات في إنتاج الأصوات الكلامية، تتضمن تكرار غير إرادي للكلمات أو أجزاء منها، إطالة الأصوات في الكلام، أو توقف كامل عن إنتاج الكلام لعدة ثوانٍ.
def: "Disruptions in the production of speech sounds, with involuntary repetitions of words or parts of words, prolongations of speech sounds, or complete blockage of speech production for several seconds." []
synonym: "Stammering" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Stuttering" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0002167 ! Abnormal speech pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T13:27:31Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025269
name: Panic attack
synonym: "نوبة هلع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حلقة مفاجئة من الخوف الشديد في موقف لا يوجد به خطر أو سبب واضح.
def: "A sudden episode of intense fear in a situation where there is no danger or apparent cause." []
comment: The panic attack is accompanied by symptoms such as palpitations, sweating, and chills or hot flushes. There may be a sensation of dyspnea (feeling out of breath), chest pain, or abdominal distress. Some individuals with panic attacks may experience depersonalization, a fear of going crazy, or a fear of dying.
synonym: "Panic attack" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0000739 ! Anxiety
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T13:34:22Z" xsd:dateTime
