[Term]
id: HP:0025291
name: Lower-body predominance
synonym: "غلبة في الجزء السفلي من الجسم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تأثير أكبر في الجزء السفلي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ يؤثر على الساقين بشكل أكبر من الذراعين والجذع والرأس.
def: "Applies to an abnormality that affects the legs more than the arms, trunk, head." []
is_a: HP:0012838 ! Localized
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T16:12:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025292
name: Acral
synonym: "طرفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "في الأطراف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ يؤثر على الأجزاء البعيدة من الأطراف (اليد، القدم) والرأس (الأذنين، الأنف).
def: "Applies to an abnormality that affects the distal portions of limbs (hand, foot) and head (ears, nose)." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T16:15:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025293
name: Distributed along Blaschko lines
synonym: "منتشر على طول خطوط بلاشكو" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "على طول خطوط بلاشكو" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ يتوافق موقعه مع خطوط بلاشكو، وهي تتوافق مع نسب الخلايا الظهارية. تكون خطوط بلاشكو غير مرئية عادةً ولكن قد تصبح واضحة في بعض أمراض الجلد ويمكن رؤيتها تتوزع في خطوط أفقية على الجسم.
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose localization corresponds to the lines of Blaschko, which correspond to the lineage of epithelia cells. Blaschko lines are normally invisible but may become apparent with certain skin diseases and then can be seen to be distributed in lines horizontal to the body." [PMID:17061271]
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T16:16:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025294
name: Dermatomal
synonym: "جلدي جلدي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حسب توزيع الأعصاب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ يتطابق موقعه مع التوزيع الجلدي، أي، توزيع جذر العصب.
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose localization corresponds to the dermatomes, i.e., the nerve root distribution." [PMID:19772560]
comment: This distribution can be seen with certain skin findings such as shingles. The term radicular is used to describe a dermatomal distribution of nerve root pain.
synonym: "Radicular" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T16:17:51Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025295
name: Herpetiform
synonym: "هربي الشكل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح يشبه الهربس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على الشذوذ الذي يكون توزيعه ومظهره يشبه المجموعات الحويصلية الموجودة في عدوى فيروس الهربس البسيط والنطاقي.
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose distribution and appearance resembles that of the grouped umbilicated vesicles seen in herpes simplex and herpes zoster infections." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T16:19:13Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025296
name: Morbilliform
synonym: "حصبي الشكل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح يشبه الحصبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على الشذوذ الذي يكون توزيعه ومظهره يشبه الحصبة، أي آفات حطاطية حمامية يبلغ قطرها حوالي 2 إلى 10 ملم وقد تكون متصلة جزئياً.
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose distribution and appearance resembles that of measles, i.e., maculopapular lesions that are red and roughly 2 to 10 mm in diameter and may be partially confluent." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T16:20:14Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025297
name: Prolonged
synonym: "مطوّل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طويل المدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على الشذوذ الذي تطول مدته لفترة أطول مما هو متوقع أو عاد (مثال: الحمى المطولة تستمر لفترة أطول مما يُرى عادةً في العدوى).
def: "Applied to an abnormality whose duration is extended over a longer period of time than is expected or usual (e.g., prolonged fever lasts longer than one usually sees with an infection)." []
is_a: HP:0011008 ! Temporal pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-18T16:26:30Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025298
name: Extended nighttime sleep
synonym: "نوم ليلي مطول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوم طويل في الليل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: النوم لفترة أطول من المعتاد خلال الليل.
def: "Sleeping for a longer duration than usual during the night." []
synonym: "Long nighttime sleep" EXACT []
synonym: "Prolonged nocturnal sleep" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025288 ! Excessive sleep
property_value: dc:date "2025-10-20T16:49:06Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025299
name: Frequent napping
synonym: "غفوات متكررة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تكرار القيلولة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فترات منتظمة من النوم تحدث أثناء النهار خارج فترة النوم الرئيسية.
def: "Regular episodes of sleep that occur during the day outside of the main sleep period." []
synonym: "Frequent daytime naps" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025288 ! Excessive sleep
property_value: dc:date "2025-10-20T16:50:12Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025300
name: Malar rash
synonym: "طفح فراشي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح على الخدين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: طفح جلدي محمر ومستوي يصيب البشرة في منطقة الوجنتين ويمتد عبر جسر الأنف.
def: "An erythematous (red), flat facial rash that affects the skin in the malar area (over the cheekbones) and extends over the bridge of the nose." []
comment: This type of rash is seen in lupus erythematosus, but also in other diseases such as rosacea and seborrheic dermatitis.
synonym: "Butterfly rash" EXACT []
synonym: "Cheekbone rash" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000988 ! Skin rash
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-20T11:59:38Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025301
name: Nocturnal
synonym: "ليلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ليلاً" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على الشذوذ الذي يحدث في الليل أو يزداد سوءًا خلاله.
def: "Applies to an abnormality that occurs in or is exacerbated during the night." []
is_a: HP:0011008 ! Temporal pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-20T12:30:06Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025302
name: Diurnal
synonym: "نهاري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نهاراً" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على العلامة أو العَرَض أو الشذوذ الآخر الذي يحدث أو يزداد سوءًا خلال وقت النهار.
def: "Applies to a sign, symptom, or other abnormality that occurs in or is exacerbated in the day time." []
is_a: HP:0011008 ! Temporal pattern
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-20T12:31:12Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025303
name: Episodic
synonym: "متقطع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بين حين وآخر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يصطلح على العلامة أو العَرَض أو التجلي الآخر الذي يحدث عدة مرات عند فترات غير منتظمة عادةً. يفصل بين كل تكرار فترة يخلو فيها من العلامة أو العَرَض.
def: "Applied to a sign, symptom, or other manifestation that occurs multiple times at usually irregular intervals. The occurrences are separated by an interval in which the sign, symptom, or manifestation is not present." []
comment: In our definition, episodic is synonymous with intermittent and recurrent. The term does not imply any particular temporal pattern of the recurrence.
synonym: "Now and then" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0031796 ! Recurrent
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-21T00:51:43Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025304
name: Periodic
synonym: "دوري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على العلامة أو العَرَض أو التجلي الآخر الذي يتكرر بفاصل زمني ثابت، أي أن فترات الخلو من الأعراض تكون دائماً بنفس الطول.
def: "Applies to a sign, symptom, or other manifestation that recurs with a fixed time interval, i.e., the symptom-free periods are always of the same length." []
synonym: "Cyclic" EXACT []
synonym: "Cyclical" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031796 ! Recurrent
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-21T00:55:09Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025305
name: Quotidian
synonym: "كوتيديان" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "يومي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تُستخدم للإشارة إلى علامة أو عرض أو مظهر آخر يكون حلقيًا بفاصل زمني ثابت يبلغ يوماً واحداً (24 ساعة).
def: "Applies to a sign, symptom, or other manifestation that is episodic with a fixed time interval of one day (24 hours)." []
is_a: HP:0025304 ! Periodic
property_value: dc:date "2016-12-21T00:57:17Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

