[Term]
id: HP:0025320
name: Leakage of dye on fundus fluorescein angiography
synonym: "تسرب صبغة في تصوير الأوعية الفلورسينية لشبكية العين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تسرب صبغة في فحص العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تسرب صبغة الفلوريسئين الملحوظ أثناء تصوير الأوعية الدموية لشبكية العين. يمكن ملاحظة مناطق التسرب على أنها تظهر توسعًا تدريجيًا وطمس في الحواف.
def: "Leakage of fluorescein dye observed upon retinal fluorescein angiography. Areas of leakage can be appreciated as showing gradual enlargement with blurring of margins." []
comment: Leakage can be caused by incompetent blood vessels such as with choroidal or diabetic neovascularization. Alternatively, leakage can be associated with a diseased retinal pigment epithelium resulting in leakage of fluorescein from the choroid.
synonym: "Fluorescein leakage" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0030604 ! Abnormal fundus fluorescein angiography
property_value: dc:date "2017-01-25T14:52:18Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

