[Term]
id: HP:0025326
name: Retinal arterial occlusion
synonym: "انسداد الشريان الشبكي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انسداد شريان العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انسداد في الشريان الشبكي، وغالبًا ما يرتبط بانقطاع تدفق الدم وتوصيل الأكسجين إلى الشبكية.
def: "Blockage of the retinal artery, generally associated with interruption of blood flow and oxygen delivery to the retina." []
comment: Retinal artery occlusion can manifest as painless loss of monocular vision.
synonym: "Retinal artery occlusion" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000630 ! Abnormal retinal arterial/arteriolar morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-02-04T17:22:01Z" xsd:dateTime
