[Term]
id: HP:0025329
name: Anti-glutamic acid decarboxylase antibody positivity
synonym: "إيجابية الجسم المضاد للديكاربوكسيلاز حمض الجلوتاميك" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أجسام مضادة للديكاربوكسيلاز حمض الجلوتاميك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود الأجسام المضادة الذاتية (الغلوبولينات المناعية) في المصل التي تتفاعل ضد الديكاربوكسيلاز حمض الجلوتاميك.
def: "The presence of autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the serum that react against glutamic acid decarboxylase." [PMID:27356651]
comment: The enzyme called glutamate decarboxylase or glutamic acid decarboxylase (GAD) catalyyzes the conversion of glutamate to gamma aminobutyric acid (g-Amino butyric acid, GABA). Autoantibodies against GAD this antibody may block the conversion of glutamate to GABA. and lead to a reduction in the amount of GABA in the nervous system.
synonym: "Anti-GAD antibody positivity" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0030057 ! Autoimmune antibody positivity
property_value: dc:date "2017-02-11T11:15:35Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

