id: HP:0025376
name: Hyperglutaminuria
synonym: "فرط الجلوتامين في البول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "جلوتامين مرتفع في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تركيز الجلوتامين في البول.
def: "An increased concentration of glutamine in the urine." [PMID:11283793]
synonym: "Glutamine high in urine" EXACT []
synonym: "Glutaminuria" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0033093 ! Increased glutamine family amino acid level in urine
property_value: dc:date "2017-04-08T13:20:10Z" xsd:dateTime
