[Term]
id: HP:0025377
name: Triggered by exertion
synonym: "محفَّز بالمجهود" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "يحدث بسبب المجهود" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى علامة أو عَرَض يتم استفزازه أو تحفيزه بواسطة الجهد البدني أو التمارين الرياضية.
def: "Applies to a sign or symptom that is provoked or brought about by exertion or physical exercise." []
comment: For convenience, several HPO terms exist with the phrase 'Exercise-induced' in their label. This is meant to be logically equivalent to the combination of the basis term and this modifier.
synonym: "Exertion triggered symptoms" EXACT []
synonym: "Triggered by physical exercise" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025204 ! Triggered by
