[Term]
id: HP:0025379
name: Anti-thyroid peroxidase antibody positivity
synonym: "إيجابية الأجسام المضادة ضد بيروكسيداز الغدة الدرقية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أجسام مضادة ضد الغدة الدرقية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أجسام مضادة مناعية في المصل تتفاعل ضد أنزيم بيروكسيداز الغدة الدرقية.
def: "The presence of autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the serum that react against thyroid peroxidase." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3387-1836, PMID:33144894, PMID:33796145]
comment: Thyroid peroxidase (TPO) antibody positivity is found in most patients with chronic lymphocytic thyroiditis (Hashimoto disease) and over half of patients with Graves disease.
synonym: "Anti-TPO antibody positivity" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Antimicrosomal antibodies" EXACT []
synonym: "Antimicrosomal antibody positivity" EXACT []
synonym: "TPOAbs" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0430050 ! Anti-thyroid antibody positivity
property_value: dc:date "2017-04-20T10:42:32Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025380
name: Increased circulating androstenedione concentration
synonym: "زيادة تركيز الأندروستينيديون في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "أندروستينيديون مرتفع في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تركيز الأندروستينيديون في الدورة الدموية.
def: "Increased concentration of androstenedione in the blood circulation." []
comment: 4-Androstenedione is the common precursor of the androgen and estrogen sex hormones and is produced in the adrenal glands and the gonads.
synonym: "Increased serum androstenedione" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0030348 ! Increased circulating androgen concentration
is_a: HP:0033811 ! Abnormal circulating androstenedione concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-04-20T10:48:45Z" xsd:dateTime
