[Term]
id: HP:0025460
name: High myoinositol in brain by MRS
synonym: "ارتفاع المايوينوزيتول في الدماغ بواسطة التصوير الطيفي بالرنين المغناطيسي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع المايوينوزيتول في الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع مستوى المايوينوزيتول في الدماغ يتم تحديده عبر التصوير الطيفي بالرنين المغناطيسي.
def: "An elevated level of myoinositol in the brain identified by magnetic resonance spectroscopy (MRS)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0169-8159, PMID:20951217]
comment: Myo-Inositol (MI) is one of the most abundant metabolites in the human brain located mainly in glial cells and functions as an osmolyte. The concentration of MI is altered in many brain disorders including Alzheimer's disease and brain tumors.
synonym: "High myo-inositol in brain by MRS" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012705 ! Abnormal metabolic brain imaging by MRS
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-05T10:59:49Z" xsd:dateTime
