[Term]
id: HP:0025503
name: Anomalous coronary artery arising from the opposite sinus
synonym: "شريان تاجي شاذ ينشأ من الجيب المعاكس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شريان غير طبيعي من القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نشأة الشريان التاجي الأيمن (RCA) من الجيب الأيسر لفالسالفا أو الشريان التاجي الأيسر الرئيسي (LM) أو الشريان النازل الأمامي الأيسر (LAD) من الجيب الأيمن لفالسالفا.
def: "Origin of the right coronary artery (RCA) from the left sinus of Valsalva or of the left main (LM) or left anterior descending (LAD) coronary artery from the right sinus of Valsalva." [PMID:27358682, PMID:28374180]
comment: There are three sinus in the wall of the aorta just superior to the aortic semilunar valve. The right coronary artery normally arises from the right sinus of Valsalva (RSV) of the ascending aorta. The left main coronary artery (LMCA) normally arises from the left sinus of Valsava. The third sinus, the right posterior aortic sinus does not normally give rise to a coronary artery.
is_a: HP:0011636 ! Abnormal coronary artery origin
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-14T22:28:08Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025505
name: Anomalous origin of the circumflex artery from the right sinus of Valsalva
synonym: "نشأة الشريان الملتف من الجيب الأيمن لفالسالفا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شريان غير طبيعي من القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينشأ الشريان التاجي الملتف من الجيب الأيسر لفالسالفا.
def: "The circumflex coronary artery originates from the right aortic sinus of Valsalva." [PMID:25104986]
is_a: HP:0011636 ! Abnormal coronary artery origin
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-14T23:16:37Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025506
name: Coronary artery sandwich anomaly
synonym: "شذوذ شرياني تاجي بين الشرايين الكبرى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل شرياني تاجي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نشوء الشريان التاجي الأيمن (RCA) من الجيب الأبهر الأيسر أو الشريان التاجي الأيسر الرئيسي (LM) أو الشريان التاجي الأمامي الأيسر (LAD) من الجيب الأيمن مع ميزة إضافية بأن الشريان يمر بين الشرايين الكبرى. وهذا يشكل خطر ضغط الشريان من قبل هذين الوعائين.
def: "Origin of the right coronary artery (RCA) from the left sinus of Valsalva or of the left main (LM) or left anterior descending (LAD) coronary artery from the right sinus of Valsalva, with the additional feature that the artery passes between the two great arteries. This carries a risk of the artery being compressed by these two vessels," [PMID:24424336]
comment: Further synonyms include Anomalous origin of the coronary artery from the opposite sinus of Valsalva with an interarterial course and Anomalous origin of the coronary artery from the wrong sinus of Valsalva with a proximal course between the aorta and pulmonary artery
synonym: "Anomalous coronary artery with aortic origin and course between the great arteries" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025503 ! Anomalous coronary artery arising from the opposite sinus
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-14T23:20:37Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025507
name: Yellow papule
synonym: "حطاطة صفراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقطة صفراء على الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حطاطة ذات لون أصفر.
def: "A papule with yellow color." []
comment: The yellow color may be related to lipid accumulation such as xanthomata or sebaceous gland lesions. This term additionally includes lesions described as yellow-orange.
synonym: "Yellow-orange papule" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0200034 ! Papule
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-14T23:29:49Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025508
name: Gottron's papules
synonym: "حطاطات جوتترون" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقاط بارزة على المفاصل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حطاطات بنفسجية اللون تغطي الجوانب الظهرية والجانبية للمفاصل المشطية السلاميّة والمفاصل السلامية القريبة.
def: "Violaceous papules overlying the dorsal and lateral aspects of the metacarpophalangeal and proximal interphalangeal joints." [PMID:28058540]
synonym: "Gottron papules" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0200034 ! Papule
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-14T23:39:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025509
name: Piezogenic pedal papules
synonym: "حطاطات قدمية تنشأ من الضغط" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقاط بارزة على الكعب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حطاطات بلون اللحم أو صفراء، قطرها 2 مم أو أكبر، تحدث استجابة للضغط الميكانيكي الداخلي وضعف النسيج الضام في الأدمة، تظهر عادةً على الجانب الإنسي للكعب، وأحيانًا على الرسغين. يُعتقد أنها تمثل انزلاق النسيج الدهني من خلال حاجز اللفافة الأخمصية.
def: "Flesh-colored or yellowish papules, 2 mm or larger, that are responses to internal mechanical pressure and weakness in the connective tissue in the dermis, appear commonly over the medial aspect of the heel, but in some cases on the wrists. They are thought to represent herniations of adipose tissue through the plantar fascia retinaculum." []
is_a: HP:0200034 ! Papule
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-14T23:43:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

