id: HP:0025513
name: Scleral rupture
synonym: "تمزق الصلبة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تمزق في الغلاف الخارجي للعين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تمزق يحدث في الصلبة، وهي الغلاف الخارجي الأبيض للعين.
def: "Breakage of the sclera." []
comment: Scleral rupture may occur following trauma or may be observed with some types of Ehlers Danlos syndrome and other disorders. The rupture may be hidden by an intact conjunctiva.
is_a: HP:0000591 ! Abnormal sclera morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-15T01:54:50Z" xsd:dateTime
