[Term]
id: HP:0025518
name: Visual gaze preference
synonym: "تفضيل النظرة البصرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبة في تحريك العينين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هي حالة في مسار النظر تظهر بعد حدوث تلف دماغي فوق النواة، مثل الجلطة، حيث يكون هناك صعوبة حادة في توجيه النظرة بعيدًا عن الجانب المتأثر بالآفة ويميل العيون للانحراف باتجاه الجانب المصاب.
def: "An abnormality of gaze that can be observed following an acute supranuclear cerebral lesion (e.g., stroke) that is characterized by an acute inability to direct gaze contralateral to the side of the lesion and is accompanied by a tendency for tonic deviation of the eyes toward the side of the lesion." []
comment: With visual gaze preference due to an acute supranuclear cerebral lesion, the oculocephalic reflex (which can be elicited by the so called Doll's head maneuver) is intact. The head is briskly turned from side to side with the head held briefly at the end of each turn. If the brainstem and infranuclear pathways are intact, then the eyes rotate to the opposite side to the direction of head rotation. Stroke is the most common etiology of this finding.
is_a: HP:0000496 ! Abnormality of eye movement
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-17T01:15:33Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025519
name: Multiple biliary hamartomas
synonym: "أورام كاذبة صفراوية متعددة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشكيلات عقدية صغيرة في الكبد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة نادرة تتسم بوجود أورام كاذبة صغيرة وعقدية غالبًا أقل من 1.5 سم، وتوجد بصورة متعددة في الكبد.
def: "Multiple biliary hamartomas are a rare clinicopathologic entity, consisting of small (less than 1.5cm), usually multiple and nodular cystic lesions in the liver." [PMID:22110302]
comment: Multiple biliary hamartomas are part of the wider spectrum of ductal plate malformation where there is congenital malformation of the biliary duct. Multiple biliary hamartomas can be diagnosed using magnetic resonance imaging which shows multiple hyper-intense cystic nodules not communicating with the biliary tree. The diagnosis can be confirmed on liver histology. Multiple biliary hamartomas are usually an incidental finding without symptoms. There have been rare associations with development of cholangiocarcinoma.
synonym: "Biliary hamartoma" RELATED []
synonym: "Multiple bile duct hamartomas" EXACT []
synonym: "Von Meyenburg complexes" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0100574 ! Biliary tract neoplasm
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-17T12:34:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025520
name: Calcinosis cutis
synonym: "تكلس الجلد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ترسب الكالسيوم في الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ترسب الكالسيوم في الجلد.
def: "Deposition of calcium in the skin." []
comment: The lesions observed incalcinosis cutis are firm papules, plaues, or nodules that have a whitish or yellowish color. Lesions may be solitary but it is more common to observe multiple lesions. The lesions may develop ulceration with a discharge of a chalk-like substance. The lesions can be painful, especially if they are located on the fingertips. Lesions at other sites may limit joint mobility or stiffen the skin.
synonym: "Cutaneous calcification" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0010766 ! Ectopic calcification
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-17T22:39:47Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

