id: HP:0025533
name: Peau d'orange
synonym: "تحبب جلدي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "جلد قشر البرتقال" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة يُلاحظ فيها أن الجلد يصبح مثل جلد البرتقال في شكله ومظهره المرتفع.
comment: A swelling of the skin in which the skin is tethered by the sweat ducts it contains producing tiny dimples. THe overall appearance is said to resemble the skin (peal) of an orange.
