synonym: "زيادة تركيز الريبتيول في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة مستوى الريبتيول في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز الريبتيول في الدورة الدموية يفوق الحد الأعلى للطبيعي.
alt_id: HP:0034933
def: "The concentration of ribitol in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." []
synonym: "Increased circulating ribitol concentration" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased level of ribitol in serum" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011013 ! Abnormal circulating carbohydrate concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-07-09T13:01:59Z" xsd:dateTime
