[Term]
id: HP:0025624
name: Decreased CD4+ effector memory T cell proportion
synonym: "انخفاض نسبة خلايا الذاكرة المؤثرة CD4+ T" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص خلايا الذاكرة T" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في نسبة خلايا الذاكرة CD4+ T المؤثرة مقارنة بالعدد الكلي لخلايا T في الدم. هذه الخلايا الذاكرة تكون قصيرة العمر وتهاجر إلى موقع العدوى وتحاول القضاء على العامل الممرض. هذه الخلايا لها نمط ظاهري CD3-positive, CD4-positive, CD62L-negative, CCR7-negative, CD127-positive, CD45RA-negative, CD45RO-positive, و CD25-negative.
alt_id: HP:0410387
def: "An abnormally decreased proportion of effector memory CD4+ T cells compared to the total number of T cells in the blood. These are memory cells that are short-lived cells that migrate to the site of an infection and attempt to eliminate the pathogen. These cells have the phenotype CD3-positive, CD4-positive, CD62L-negative, CCR7-negative, CD127-positive, CD45RA-negative, CD45RO-positive, and CD25-negative." [PMID:22343568]
comment: Reduced proportion of CD4+ effector memory T cells
synonym: "Decreased proportion of CD4+ effector memory T cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased proportion of CD4-positive effector memory T cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased proportion of effector memory CD4-positive, alpha-beta T cells" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0410391 ! Increased CD4+ memory T cell proportion
property_value: dc:date "2019-04-09T00:13:00Z" xsd:dateTime
