[Term]
id: HP:0025625
name: Increased CD4+ effector memory T cell proportion
synonym: "زيادة نسبة خلايا الذاكرة المؤثرة CD4+ T" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة خلايا الذاكرة T" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في نسبة خلايا الذاكرة CD4+ T المؤثرة. هذه الخلايا الذاكرة تكون قصيرة العمر وتهاجر إلى موقع العدوى وتحاول القضاء على العامل الممرض. قد يكون لهذه الخلايا نمط ظاهري CD3/CD4/CD62L-/CD45RA.
def: "An abnormally increased proportion of effector memory CD4+ T cells. These are memory cells that are short-lived cells that migrate to the site of an infection and attempt to eliminate the pathogen. These cells may have a CD3/CD4/CD62L-/CD45RA phenotype." []
comment: Elevated proportion of CD4+ effector memory T cells
synonym: "Increased CD4+ effector memory T cell proportion" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased proportion of CD4+ effector memory T cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased proportion of CD4-positive effector memory T cells" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased proportion of effector CD4-positive, alpha-beta T cells" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0410391 ! Increased CD4+ memory T cell proportion
property_value: dc:date "2019-04-09T00:13:18Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

