[Term]
id: HP:0025638
name: Elevated urinary N-butyrylglycine
synonym: "ارتفاع مستوى ن-بوتيريل جليسين في البول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة ن-بوتيريل جليسين في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في مستوى ن-بوتيريل جليسين في البول.
def: "An increased level of N-butyrylglycine in the urine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8169-9049]
comment: Butyrylglycine is a N-acylglycine obtained by formal condensation of the carboxy group of butyric acid with the amino group of glycine. Its urinary excretion is increased in certain inborn errors of metabolism.
