synonym: "زيادة الجليكولات في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز الجليكولات في الدورة الدموية أعلى من الحد الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of glycolate in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9969-8610, PMID:2002628]
comment: Glycolate is a hydroxy monocarboxylic acid anion that is acetate in which the methyl group has been hydroxylated.
