[Term]
id: HP:0025769
name: Disordered formal thought process
synonym: "اضطراب عملية التفكير الرسمية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تفكير غير منظم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في نمط الديناميكية، المعدل، أو شكل عمليات التفكير كما يتم التعرف عليه من تدفق الأفكار المعبر عنها في الكلام. يتم تحويل الأفكار والكلام بسهولة بواسطة المؤثرات الخارجية أو الروابط الداخلية السطحية. يصبح غير قادرين على الحفاظ على مسار فكري ثابت ويفقدون أنفسهم في المواضيع الجانبية، ويخسرون الخيط ولا يستطيعون استعادته. تبدو الروابط السطحية دافعة للمادة الموضوعية.
alt_id: HP:5200235
def: "An abnormality in the dynamic mode, rate, or form of thought processes as recognized from the flow of ideas expressed in speech. Successive thoughts and speech are easily diverted by external stimuli or internal superficial associations. Unable to maintain a constant train of thought and loose themselves in side issues, losing the thread and are unable to recover it. Superficial connections appear to drive the subject matter." [PMID:30416391, PMID:31582814]
comment: Disordered thinking patterns and cognitive processes that are expressed in speech. Expressed speech reflects disorganized thoughts and may include idiosyncratic use of words with illogical meanings, disjointed or fragmented sentence structure that makes it difficult to follow the logic of statements. Also included are abnormalities in rate or speed, and intensity of thoughts as reflected in variations in rate and volume of expressed speech.
synonym: "Disordered formal thought processes" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Disorganized speech or communication" RELATED []
synonym: "Formal thought disorder" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025792 ! Abnormal cognitive process
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T12:48:31Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025770
name: 2-3 finger osseus syndactyly
synonym: "التحام عظمي لأصابع 2-3" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التحام الأصابع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التحام غير طبيعي للعظام بين الإصبع الثاني والثالث، مما يؤدي إلى التصاق جزئي أو كامل بينهما.
comment: Fusion of the second and third finger, involving soft parts and including fusion of individual finger bones.
is_a: HP:0010492 ! Osseous finger syndactyly
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-22T08:44:06Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025771
name: Ruminations
synonym: "اجترار الأفكار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أفكار متكررة لها نسيج موضوعي مألوف للفرد، وغالبًا ما تُستحضر عن طيب خاطر أو تحدث في سياق انشغال قلقي أو قلق حول موضوع ذو صلة قد يكون غير متناسب مع السياق. قد تكون هذه الأفكار ذات معدل تفكير طبيعي وتتميز بموضوع متكرر عادةً ما يكون له دلالة سلبية.
def: "Recurrent thoughts that have a thematic thread that is typically familiar to the individual and are often willfully brought forth or occur in the context of an anxious preoccupation or worry about a relevant concern which may be out of proportion to the context. Ruminations may be of normal thinking rate and are characterized by a recurring theme that usually has a negative connotation." []
comment: Ruminations are a disorder of thought content - similar to but distinct from preoccupations.
is_a: HP:0025785 ! Abnormal preoccupation
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T13:02:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025772
name: Abnormal lexical patterns
synonym: "اضطراب الانماط اللغوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "استعمال لغوي غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل مستمر في أنماط أو معاني اللغة المعبر عنها، حيث تتصف الكلمات والجمل بالفوضى في علاقتها بعضها البعض وتستخدم بشكل خاطئ أو غير ملائم للسياق والثقافة الخلفية للشخص.
def: "A persistent abnormality in patterns or meanings of expressed language. Words and phrases are disorganized in relationship to each other and often used incorrectly or inappropriately for the context and background culture of the person." []
is_a: HP:4000072 ! Abnormal language feature
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T13:32:54Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025773
name: Abnormal semantics
synonym: "اضطراب الدلالات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "استعمال كلمات غير ملائمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: استخدام غريب للكلمات خارج السياق وغير مناسب للموقف الاجتماعي.
def: "Odd use of words that are out of context and inappropriate for the social situation." []
is_a: HP:0025772 ! Abnormal lexical patterns
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T13:42:26Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025774
name: Idiosyncratic use of words
synonym: "استخدام كلمات غريب الأطوار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "استخدام غريب للكلمات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: استخدام الكلمات أو العبارات بطريقة غير متوافقة مع المعنى الحالي والمقبول للسياق والموقف الاجتماعي. وهذا لا ينطبق على الاستخدامات الجديدة للكلمات التي يقرها الأقران أو المجتمع الثقافي المحدد.
def: "Words or phrases and their expression that are used in a manner that is not consistent with the current and accepted meaning for the context and social circumstance. This does not apply to peer or culture driven novel uses of words that are accepted within the given social circles." []
synonym: "Ascribing novel meanings to words" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025773 ! Abnormal semantics
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T13:46:04Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025775
name: Tangential speech
synonym: "الكلام التشتتي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كلام غير واضح" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أنماط من التعبير الكلامي تحتوي على العديد من الكلمات لوصف خاصية معينة، لكنها غامضة ومجرد تقريبات. لا يصل الكلام إلى النقطة الأساسية، بل يتطرق إلى المواضيع بشكل غير مباشر ويكون غير دقيق مما يجعل من الصعب فهم القضية أو الغرض الأساسي من الكلمات المتواصلة.
def: "Patterns of expressed speech that have many words to describe a feature, but are themselves vague and approximations. The speech does not get to the point, but rather seems to go around and around and is inconcise and difficult to grasp the primary issue or purpose of the communicated words." []
synonym: "Circumstantiality" EXACT []
synonym: "Tangentiality" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025773 ! Abnormal semantics
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T13:50:50Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025776
name: Thought insertion
synonym: "إدخال الأفكار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور بأفكار غريبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشعور بأن الأفكار تُفرض على الوعي بواسطة جهات خارجية وغريبة. الشخص المتأثر غالباً لا يعترف بأن هذه الأفكار تأتي من نفسه وقد يطور أفكار وهمية ثانوية لشرح مصدر هذه العملية.
def: "The experience that thoughts are forced into the conscious awareness by external and foreign entities. The affected individual typically does not recognize the thoughts as coming from themselves and may develop secondary delusional ideas to explain the source of the process." []
is_a: HP:5200419 ! Disorder of thought control
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T14:00:47Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025777
name: Thought broadcasting
synonym: "بث الأفكار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور بأن الأفكار معلنة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشعور بأن الأفكار تُبث من رأسه أو تجربته الواعية، حيث قد يشعر البعض بأن أفكارهم تهرب، بينما قد يعتقد آخرون أن أفكارهم تلتقط بواسطة جهاز استقبال قريب ليتم نشرها. الشخص يعتقد لاحقاً أن الجميع يعرفون ما يفكر فيه ويشعر بعدم وجود خصوصية.
def: "The experience that thoughts are being broadcasted from their head/conscious experience, some report that their thoughts are escaping, while others may believe that their thoughts are being picked up by a nearby receiver only to be further propagated. The person subsequently believes that everyone knows what they are thinking and feels that they have no privacy." []
is_a: HP:5200419 ! Disorder of thought control
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T14:02:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025778
name: Thought echo
synonym: "صدى الأفكار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور بتكرار الأفكار" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التجربة الشخصية بأن الأفكار تتكرر من حوله ويسمع أفكاره الخاصة كما يجربها داخلياً.
def: "The personal experience that thoughts are echoing around them and that they are hearing their own thoughts as they are experiencing them internally." []
synonym: "Echo de pensee" EXACT []
synonym: "Gedankenlautverden" EXACT []
is_a: HP:5200419 ! Disorder of thought control
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T14:03:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025779
name: Disorder of thought content
synonym: "اضطراب محتوى الأفكار" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "أفكار غير طبيعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تتميز اضطرابات محتوى الأفكار بمعتقدات وقناعات غير طبيعية (التي يجب تقييمها بناءً على الثقافة والخلفية الشخصية للفرد المصاب).
alt_id: HP:5200269
def: "Thought content disorders are characterized by abnormal beliefs and convictions (that are to be assessed given the culture and personal background of the affected individual)." [PMID:36425242]
comment: Thought content disorders are determined by evaluating the meanings of thoughts. The most prominent thought content disorder seen in schizophrenia is delusions. There are overvalued thoughts at some point between normal thinking and delusion. Obsessions, mystical and metaphysical thoughts also reflect abnormal thought content.
synonym: "Abnormal thought pattern" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025792 ! Abnormal cognitive process
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T15:29:08Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025780
name: Abnormal volitional state
synonym: "اضطراب الحالة الإرادية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "افتقاد الدافع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في الحالات الداخلية للدوافع أو الحافز التي تؤدي إلى تضرر أو عرقلة قدرة الشخص على الحضور لأنشطة شخصية أو اجتماعية أو مهنية أساسية.
alt_id: HP:5200275
def: "An abnormality of internal states of motivation or drive that compromise, or interfere with, the ability of the person to attend to basic personal, social, or vocational activities." []
synonym: "Abnormal energy" RELATED []
synonym: "Abnormal motivation" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0025766 ! Abnormal affect
property_value: dc:date "2024-07-21T16:05:20Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025781
name: Abnormally rapid thought process
synonym: "تسارع غير طبيعي في عملية التفكير" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تسارع الأفكار" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في معدل أو سرعة الأفكار.
def: "Increased rate or speed of thoughts." []
synonym: "Abnormally rapid thought processes" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Rapid thought process" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025769 ! Disordered formal thought process
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-03T09:38:59Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025782
name: Abnormal syntax
synonym: "اضطراب البناء النحوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تركيب الجمل غير سليم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذات مستمرة في بناء الجمل تتعدى ما يناسب السياق والثقافة الخلفية للشخص.
def: "Persistent abnormalities in sentence structure exceeding that of the context and background culture of the person." []
comment: Syntax refers to the set of rules, principles, and processes that govern the structure of sentences in a particular language, including word order and the arrangement of phrases and clauses. Abnormal syntax occurs when the structure of a sentence deviates from the standard or expected patterns of word order and phrase arrangement in a given language. For example, in English, the typical word order for a declarative sentence is Subject-Verb-Object (SVO). An abnormal syntax could be: To the store I went (instead of I went to the store). In contrast, abnormal grammar would include a sentence such as She reading a books (the verb is is missing, and books should be singular).
is_a: HP:0025772 ! Abnormal lexical patterns
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-03T09:59:36Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025783
name: Diagnostic behavioral phenotype
synonym: "الأنماط السلوكية التشخيصية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشخيص السلوك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يوفر مصطلحات الأنماط الظاهرية البشرية لوصف التغيرات الظاهرية المحددة بدلاً من تشخيص الأمراض. ومع ذلك، من الشائع استخدام أوصاف مثل "التوحد" لوصف الأفراد المتأثرين بأشكال مندلية من الأمراض التطورية العصبية والعديد من الحالات الأخرى. إذا كان ذلك ممكناً، يوصى باستخدام مصطلحات محددة في فروع أخرى من شبه أنطولوجيا السلوك غير النموذجي، ولكن إذا لم يكن ذلك ممكناً، فيمكن استخدام المصطلحات من هذا الفرع.
def: "The Human Phenotype Ontology provides terms to describe specific phenotypic abnormalities rather than disease diagnoses. Nevertheless, it is common for descriptions such as 'Autism' to be used to describe individuals affected with Mendelian forms of neurodevelopmental disease and many other conditions. If possible, we recommend annotation using specific terms in other branchs of the Atypical behavior subontology, but if this is not possible, then terms from this branch may be used." []
is_a: HP:0000708 ! Atypical behavior
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-03T10:05:59Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025784
name: Word salad
synonym: "سلطة الكلمات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كلام غير مترابط" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كلام يتكون من سلسلة من الكلمات المعترف بها المرتبطة عشوائياً دون أي اتصال ذو مغزى.
def: "Speech that consists of a series of recognizable words that are randomly strung together with no meaningful connection." []
comment: Vocalizations that appear to be attempts to speak but are often incomprehensive, unique words may be vocalized but are seemingly random with no logical connection from one to the next.
synonym: "Random stream of words with no logic" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002463 ! Language impairment
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-03T10:08:53Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025785
name: Abnormal preoccupation
synonym: "شغل فكري غير طبيعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الانشغال بأمر معين بشكل مفرط" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير الانشغال الفكري إلى أن يكون الشخص مستغرقًا في فكر أو نشاط أو اهتمام معين يأخذ جل انتباهه، ويمكن أن يحمل دلالة إيجابية أو سلبية.
def: "Preoccupations refers to being absorbed in any particular thought, activity, or concern that captures the attention of the individual. It may have a positive or negative connotation." []
is_a: HP:0025779 ! Disorder of thought content
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-03T10:19:52Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025786
name: Intraosseous lipoma
synonym: "ورم شحمي داخل العظم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم دهني بالعظم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الأورام الشحمية داخل العظم هي آفات نادرة حميدة تتكون من نسيج دهني ناضج موجود داخل القناة النخاعية.
def: "Intraosseous lipomas are rare benign lesions composed of mature fat that reside within the intramedullary canal." [PMID:27298943]
comment: They account for an estimated 0.1% of primary bone tumours. No age or sex predilection has been reported. These tumours are often asymptomatic and generally are discovered incidentally on imaging, particularly MRI. Symptomatic intraosseous lipomas typically present with pain, local swelling, or tenderness. The metaphysis of long bones and the calcaneus are the most common locations.
synonym: "Bone lipoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Bony lipoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Intra-osseous lipoma" EXACT []
synonym: "Lipoma of bone" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012032 ! Lipoma
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-03T13:40:32Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025787
name: Paraphilia
synonym: "الشذوذ الجنسي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اهتمامات جنسية غير تقليدية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إثارة جنسية شديدة وعادة متكررة تجاه أشياء غير تقليدية أو خيالات أو أماكن أو أفراد وذلك بطريقة غير تقليدية في كثير من الأحيان، ولكنه قد يشمل أيضًا السلوكيات المعتادة وحتى غير القانونية التي تتضمن أفرادًا غير راغبين.
def: "Intense and typically recurring sexual arousal to atypical objects, fantasies, places, or individuals that frequently, but not always, lead to engagement of non-conventional sexual acts. This is a broad class of desires and behaviors that may include innocuous fetish behavior to illegal behaviors involving non-consenting individuals." []
synonym: "Paraphilias" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0008768 ! Abnormal sexual behavior
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-04T09:16:16Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025788
name: Radiographic modifier
synonym: "مُعدِل إشعاعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ميزة في الأشعة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خاصية للآفة الملاحظة في التصوير الشعاعي.
def: "A characteristic of a lesion on radiography." []
synonym: "Radiographic quality" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012823 ! Clinical modifier
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-06T06:13:18Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025789
name: Radiolucent
synonym: "شفافية إشعاعية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "يظهر داكن بالأشعة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على الآفة التي تسمح للأشعة السينية بالنفاذ من خلالها وإظهار المستقبل (الشفافية الإشعاعية). تظهر الأنسجة الرخوة باللون الأسود أو الداكن في الأشعة المُعالجة وتسمى شفافة إشعاعياً.
def: "Applies to a lesion that allows x-rays to penetrate through them and expose the receptor (radiolucency). Soft tissues appear black or dark on the processed radiograph and are called radiolucent." []
synonym: "Radiolucent appearance" EXACT []
synonym: "Radiolucent character" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025788 ! Radiographic modifier
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-06T06:15:47Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025790
name: Radiodense
synonym: "كثافة إشعاعية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "يظهر أبيض بالأشعة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على الآفة التي تخمد الأشعة السينية وتظهر كثيفة إشعاعياً (بيضاء) في الأشعة.
def: "Applies to a lesion that attenuates X-rays and appears radiodense (white) on a radiograph." []
is_a: HP:0025788 ! Radiographic modifier
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-06T06:19:10Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025791
name: Delusion of guilt
synonym: "توهم الذنب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور بالذنب غير مبرر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اعتقاد توهمي بذنبه الشخصي عن حدث ما، حقيقي أو متخيل، وأنه تسبب في نتيجة كارثية بطريقة ما. عادة ما يكون من المستحيل أو الخيالي أن يكون هذا قد حدث بالطريقة التي يعتقدها الشخص، بحيث يكون الاعتقاد بأنه مسؤول عن الحدث رغم كونه بعيداً عن مكان حدوثه.
def: "Delusional belief of one's personal guilt for an event, real or imagined, and that one caused an outcome that is somehow catastrophic. It is generally impossible or fantastical that this could have happened in the manner believed by the person, that they were somehow responsible for an event despite not be anywhere near where it allegedly occurred." []
is_a: HP:0000746 ! Delusion
property_value: dc:date "2024-08-06T06:59:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

