[Term]
id: HP:0025800
name: Wrist instability
synonym: "عدم استقرار المعصم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم ثبات رسغ اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشعور الذاتي أو الموضوعي بنقر أو صوت طقطقة في المعصم عند الحركة، أو ارتخاء الرسغ أو صعوبة في التواء الأشياء.
def: "Subjective or objective feeling of clunking/clicking in the wrist with movement, wrist giving way or difficulty twisting objects." []
comment: This finding may be observed with conditions such as perilunate dislocation, carpal instability nondissociative, and scapholunate advanced collapse.
