[Term]
id: HP:0025825
name: Decreased neutrophil adhesion
synonym: "انخفاض الالتصاق في العدلات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف التصاق العدلات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في قدرة خلايا العدلات على الالتصاق، وعادة ما يتم قياسها من خلال التعبير السطحي للبروتينات CD18 وCD11a أو CD11b باستخدام قياس التدفق الخلوي.
alt_id: HP:0033798
def: "Abnormal decrease of neutrophil adhesion capacity, commonly measured as surface expression of CD18, CD11a or CD11b using flow cytometry." [PMID:19037827, PMID:23351991, PMID:25045887]
comment: Neutrophil firm adhesion to endothelial cells (EC) is a highly regulated process and plays an essential role in inflammatory responses3,4. The firm adhesion of neutrophil follows initial neutrophil rolling and capture on the EC and ultimately can result in transmigration in vivo.
synonym: "Impaired leukocyte adhesion" RELATED []
