synonym: "انخفاض شديد في عدد العدلات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدد قليل جداً من العدلات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض شديد في عدد خلايا العدلات المتداولة في الدم، وعادة ما تكون أقل من 500 خلية لكل ميكرولتر.
def: "Severe decrease in circulating neutrophils, usually characterized as fewer than 500 neutrophils per microlitre." []
is_a: HP:0001875 ! Decreased total neutrophil count
property_value: dc:date "2025-04-27T05:31:54Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025827
name: Abnormal Th1 T cell proportion
synonym: "خلل نسبة خلايا Th1 T" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نسبة غير طبيعية لخلايا Th1 T" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة أو نقصان غير طبيعي في خلايا Th1، يتميز عادةً من خلال التوليف الداخلي للـ IFNg أو التعبير السطحي لـ CXCR3، ويقاس كنسبة من إجمالي خلايا CD3+CD4+ T، عادة بعد التحفيز.
def: "Abnormal increase or decrease of Th1 cells, commonly characterized through the intracellular synthesis of IFNg or surface expression of CXCR3, measured as proportion of total CD3+CD4+ T cells, usually after stimulation. The stimulation is usually unspecific and may include the use of anti-CD3 beads or antibodies or the use of phorbol-12-myristate-13-acetate (PMA) with ionomycin. Length of incubation and strength of stimulation may vary between laboratories." [PMID:10579123]
comment: Type 1 T helper (Th1) cells produce interferon-gamma, interleukin (IL)-2, and tumour necrosis factor (TNF)-beta, which activate macrophages and are responsible for cell-mediated immunity and phagocyte-dependent protective responses. This term is placed under physiology because the cells are typically measured following stimulation.
is_a: HP:0011840 ! Abnormal T cell physiology
property_value: dc:date "2025-04-27T06:18:16Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0025828
name: Increased Th1 T cell proportion
synonym: "زيادة نسبة خلايا T النوع Th1" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع نسبة خلايا Th1" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في نسبة خلايا Th1، والتي تُعرف من خلال إنتاج الإنترفيرون غاما داخل الخلايا أو التعبير السطحي لـ CXCR3، والذي يُقاس كنسبة من إجمالي خلايا CD3+CD4+، وعادة ما يتم ذلك بعد التحفيز.
def: "Abnormal increase of Th1 cells, commonly characterized through the intracellular synthesis of IFNg or surface expression of CXCR3, measured as proportion of total CD3+CD4+ T cells, usually after stimulation. The stimulation is usually unspecific and may include the use of anti-CD3 beads or antibodies or the use of phorbol-12-myristate-13-acetate (PMA) with ionomycin. Length of incubation and strength of stimulation may vary between laboratories." [PMID:10579123]
is_a: HP:0025827 ! Abnormal Th1 T cell proportion
property_value: dc:date "2025-04-27T06:20:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

