[Term]
id: HP:0030017
name: Vaginismus
synonym: "تشنج المهبل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تقلصات لا إرادية في المهبل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشنجات لا إرادية متكررة أو مستمرة في عضلات الثلث الخارجي من المهبل التي تعيق الاختراق المهبلي وتسبب ضيقًا شخصيًا.
def: "Recurrent or persistent involuntary spasms of the musculature of the outer third of the vagina that interferes with vaginal penetration, and which causes personal distress." [PMID:16391543]
comment: Vaginismus usually develops as a conditioned response to painful penetration, or secondary to psychological/emotional factors.
synonym: "Myalgia of pelvic floor" EXACT []
synonym: "Pelvic floor myalgia" EXACT []
