[Term]
id: HP:0030022
name: Question mark ear
synonym: "أذن علامة استفهام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الأذن على شكل علامة استفهام" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شق بين الحَلَقة وشحمة الأذن.
def: "Cleft between the helix and the lobe." [eom:cffbc3de49dbb172, PMID:19152421]
comment: Relatively few cases have been reported. Variation from a small notch to complete separation of the helix from the lobe is noted, there may be unilateral or bilateral involvement. The lobe is relatively laterally recessed compared to the upper portion of the ear and the scapha may be absent. This is distinct from a Cleft helix where the cleft is within the helix.
