def: "Lack of alpha sarcoglycan in muscle. Immunohistochemistry reveals absent alpha sarcoglycan protein in the muscle biopsy." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_htrang]
synonym: "Absent muscle fibre alpha sarcoglycan" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: UMLS:C4022644
is_a: HP:0030100 ! Abnormal muscle fiber alpha sarcoglycan

