id: HP:0030212
name: Collectionism
synonym: "الادخار القهري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تكديس الأشياء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ميل مفرط أو مرضي للاحتفاظ بالأشياء وجمعها بشكل زائد.
def: "Excessive or pathological tendency to save and collect possessions." []
synonym: "Collecting" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
