synonym: "خثار الوريد الحشوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "جلطة في الوريد البطني" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مصطلح خثار الوريد الحشوي يشمل متلازمة بود-خياري (خثار الوريد الكبدي)، انسداد الوريد البابي خارج الكبدي (EHPVO)، وخثار الوريد المساريقي؛ كلمة حشوي تستخدم للإشارة إلى الأعضاء الحشوية (التجويف البطني).
def: "The term splanchnic vein thrombosis encompasses Budd-Chiari syndrome (hepatic vein thrombosis), extrahepatic portal vein obstruction (EHPVO), and mesenteric vein thrombosis; the word splanchnic is used to refer to the visceral organs (of the abdominal cavity)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20532730]
synonym: "Blood clot in splanchnic vein" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
xref: UMLS:C4022560
is_a: HP:0004936 ! Venous thrombosis

[Term]
id: HP:0030248
name: Mesenteric venous thrombosis
synonym: "خثار الوريد المساريقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "جلطة في الوريد المعوي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: جلطة تعيق تدفق الدم في وريد مساريقي (الوريد المساريقي العلوي والسفلي يصرفان الدم من الأمعاء الدقيقة والكبيرة).
def: "A clot that obstructs blood flow in a mesenteric vein (the superior and the inferior mesenteric vein drain blood from the small and large intestine)." []
comment: Mesenteric venous thrombosis may be associated with abdominal pain and bloating, diarrhea, fever, gastrointestinal bleeding, and vomiting.
synonym: "Blood clot in mesentertic vein" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6908-9849]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:95446005
xref: UMLS:C0267412
is_a: HP:0030247 ! Splanchnic vein thrombosis

[Term]
id: HP:0030249
name: Enanthema
synonym: "التهاب الغشاء المخاطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح داخل الفم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ظهور مفاجئ (طفح) على سطح الغشاء المخاطي للفم أو البلعوم.
def: "A sudden eruption (rash) of the surface of a mucous membrane of the mouth or pharynx." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:5862001
xref: UMLS:C0014034
is_a: HP:0011830 ! Abnormal oral mucosa morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030250
name: Pulmonary granulomatosis
synonym: "التورم الحميد الرئوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب عقدي في الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود عدة تورمات عقدية (آفات التهابية صغيرة تحتوي على مجموعة من البلعميات أحادية النواة) في الرئة.
def: "The presence of multiple granulomata (small nodular inflammatory lesions containing grouped mononuclear phagocytes) in the lung." []
xref: UMLS:C0856628
is_a: HP:0006530 ! Abnormal pulmonary interstitial morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030251
name: obsolete Absence of memory B cells
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: HP:0010976

[Term]
id: HP:0030252
name: Absent circulating B cells
synonym: "غياب الخلايا البائية المنتشرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم وجود خلايا ب في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب الخلايا البائية المنتشرة القابلة للكشف، والتي عادة ما تُعرَّف على أنها خلايا ليمفاوية CD19+ أو CD20+، في الدم. عادة، يُعتبر وجود أقل من 20 خلية لكل ميكرولتر غياباً.
def: "Absence of detectable circulating B cells, commonly characterized as CD19+ or CD20+ lymphocytes, in the blood. Usually, less than 20 cells per microlitre is considered to be an absence." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:32569607]
synonym: "Absence of mature B cells" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4022558
is_a: HP:0025806 ! Abnormal total B cell count

[Term]
id: HP:0030253
name: obsolete Defective T cell proliferation
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: HP:0031379

[Term]
id: HP:0030254
name: Nail bed hemorrhage
synonym: "نزيف سرير الظفر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نزيف تحت الظفر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مناطق صغيرة من النزيف تحت الأظافر سواء في الأظافر أو أظافر القدمين.
def: "Small areas of bleeding (hemorrhage) under the fingernail or toenail." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Nail bed haemorrhage" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: UMLS:C0877087
is_a: HP:0001597 ! Abnormal nail morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030255
name: Large intestinal polyposis
synonym: "الورام الحميد المعوي الكبير" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أورام صغيرة عديدة في الأمعاء الغليظة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود العديد من الزوائد اللحمية في الأمعاء الغليظة.
def: "The presence of multiple polyps in the large intestine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022556
is_a: HP:0200008 ! Intestinal polyposis

[Term]
id: HP:0030256
name: Small intestinal polyposis
synonym: "الورام الحميد المعوي الصغير" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أورام صغيرة عديدة في الأمعاء الدقيقة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود العديد من الزوائد اللحمية في الأمعاء الدقيقة.
def: "The presence of multiple polyps in the small intestine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022555
is_a: HP:0200008 ! Intestinal polyposis

[Term]
id: HP:0030257
name: Freckled genitalia
synonym: "نمش الأعضاء التناسلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بقع بنية على الأعضاء التناسلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أو أكثر من بقع بنية نقطية على جلد الأعضاء التناسلية.
def: "One or more brown punctate macules on the skin of the genitalia." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23650202]
comment: This should be differentiated from Hyperpigmented genitalia in which an area larger than a freckle or the complete external genitalia are hyperpigmented. The description should be qualified by a description of the affected part(s).
synonym: "Freckled genitalia" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Genitalia, ephelides" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4021040
is_a: HP:0012293 ! Abnormal genital pigmentation

[Term]
id: HP:0030258
name: Hyperpigmented genitalia
synonym: "فرط التصبغ التناسلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة تصبغ المنطقة التناسلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تصبغ محلي أو عام في المنطقة التناسلية.
def: "Localized or generalized increased genital pigmentation." []
comment: This is an assessment of the relative pigmentation of the genitalia compared to the overall pigmentation of the individual. Hyperpigmentation can affect other parts of the body or be restricted to the genitalia. Genital hyperpigmentation can be generalized or localized. Localized areas of hyperpigmentation of the glans of the penis are especially common. This should be differentiated from Freckled genitalia in which one or more small, focal areas of hyperpigmentation are present. Localized hyperpigmentation can be objectively determined due to the difference from the immediate surrounding tissue color, while generalized hyperpigmentation may be more difficult to determine and is therefore a subjective manifestation. If the finding is localized, the description should be appended with a description of the affected part(s).
synonym: "Increased genital pigmentation" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Penile melanosis" RELATED []
xref: UMLS:C4020713
xref: UMLS:C4022554
is_a: HP:0012293 ! Abnormal genital pigmentation

[Term]
id: HP:0030259
name: Hypopigmented genitalia
synonym: "نقص التصبغ في الأعضاء التناسلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تصبغ أقل في الأعضاء التناسلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض موضعي أو عام في تصبغ الأعضاء التناسلية.
def: "Localized or generalized decreased genital pigmentation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23650202]
comment: This is an assessment of the relative pigmentation of the genitalia compared to the overall pigmentation of the individual. Hypopigmentation can affect other parts of the body or be restricted to the genitalia. Genital hypopigmentation can be generalized or localized. Localized hypopigmentation can be objectively determined due to the difference from the immediate surrounding tissue color, while generalized hypopigmentation may be more difficult to determine and is therefore a subjective manifestation.
synonym: "Decreased genital pigmentation" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4022553
is_a: HP:0012293 ! Abnormal genital pigmentation

[Term]
id: HP:0030260
name: Microphallus
synonym: "صغر القضيب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قضيب صغير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: طول القضيب أقل من 2 انحراف معياري عن المتوسط لعمر معين مصحوب بانقلاب مجرى البول.
def: "Length of penis more than 2 SD below the mean for age accompanied by hypospadias." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23650202]
comment: Traditionally a distinction is made between a Short penis, a short penis with otherwise normal anatomy, versus microphallus, a short penis with hypospadias. Penile length is the distance between the midline attachment of the gently stretched, flaccid penis above the pubic symphysis and tip of the glans. A short penis should be differentiated from an inconspicuous penis, for instance due to excessive suprapubic fat ("buried"). We also recognize that shortness of a penis is defined by some subspecialists as penile length more than 2.5 SD below the mean.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:276333003
xref: UMLS:C0240701
is_a: HP:0008736 ! Hypoplasia of penis

[Term]
id: HP:0030261
name: Absent penis
synonym: "غياب القضيب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "لا يوجد قضيب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الافتقار إلى هياكل القضيب القابلة للتعرف.
alt_id: HP:0040316
def: "Lack of recognizable penile structures." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23650202]
comment: Absence of the penis is always accompanied by abnormal position of the meatus (usually in the perineum, sometimes in the rectum), may be accompanied by Cryptorchidism, and is often associated with non-genital anomalies, which all should be coded separately. Absent penis should be differentiated from a penis concealed within pre-pubic fat tissue.
synonym: "Absent penis" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Aphallia" EXACT []
synonym: "Aplasia of the penis" EXACT []
synonym: "Penis aplasia" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:204908001
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:59981001
xref: UMLS:C0555231
is_a: HP:0000036 ! Abnormal penis morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030262
name: Narrow penis
synonym: "ضيق القضيب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عرض القضيب يكون أقل بأكثر من 2 انحراف معياري عن المتوسط لعمر المريض. أو محيط القضيب في حالة الارتخاء يكون أقل بأكثر من 2 انحراف معياري عن المتوسط لعمر المريض. أو يظهر القضيب بعرض أقل من المفترض لعمر المريض.
def: "Penile width more than 2 standard deviations (SD) below the mean for age. Alternatively circumference of the flaccid penis more than 2 SD below the mean for age. Alternatively, apparently decreased penile width for age." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23650202]
comment: Penile width is the distance between left and right side of the flaccid penis at the attachment to the skin above the pubic symphysis.
synonym: "Narrow penis" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4022552
is_a: HP:0000036 ! Abnormal penis morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030263
name: Torsion of the penis
synonym: "التواء القضيب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انحراف رأس القضيب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وضعية رأس القضيب الدوارة، مع أو بدون العمود، بزاوية 30 درجة أو أكثر.
def: "Rotated position of the glans, with or without the penile shaft, of 30 degrees or more." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23650202]
comment: Penile torsion is defined traditionally as being between 30 and 180 degrees rotation. Penile torsion is usually counter clockwise and is often associated with Chordee and Hypospadias, which should be coded separately.
xref: UMLS:C1407019
is_a: HP:0000036 ! Abnormal penis morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030264
name: Webbed penis
synonym: "القضيب المكسو" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قضيب مغطى بطيّة جلدية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: طي جلدية بطنية ممتدة من القضيب إلى الصفن.
def: "Ventral skinfold extending from penis to scrotum." [PMID:23650202]
comment: The distal limit of the skinfold can be located on the penile shaft or the tip of the penis.
synonym: "Webbed penis" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:253852007
xref: UMLS:C0431670
is_a: HP:0000036 ! Abnormal penis morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030265
name: Wide penis
synonym: "القضيب العريض" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اتساع في القضيب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: المسافة بين الجانب الأيسر والجانب الأيمن للقضيب المترهل عند الالتصاق بالجلد فوق الارتفاق العاني أكثر من 2 انحراف معياري فوق المتوسط لعمر معين.
def: "Distance between left and right side of the flaccid penis at the attachment to the skin above the pubic symphysis more than 2 standard deviations above the mean for age." [PMID:23650202]
synonym: "Wide penis" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4022551
is_a: HP:0000036 ! Abnormal penis morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030266
name: obsolete Abnormality of the sacroiliac notch
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: HP:0010456

[Term]
id: HP:0030267
name: Calcification of the interosseus membrane of the forearm
synonym: "تكلس الغشاء بين العظام للساعد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تكلس بين عظام الساعد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ترسب أملاح الكالسيوم في النسيج الليفي الذي يربط بين عظمتي الكعبرة والزند.
def: "Deposition of calcium salts in the fibrous sheet that connects the radius and the ulna." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Interosseous membrane calcification of forearm" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4022549
is_a: HP:0002973 ! Abnormal forearm morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030268
name: Hyperplastic callus formation
synonym: "تشكل الكالس المفرط" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نمو زائد للكالس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في نمو الكالس، وهو المادة العظمية والغضروفية التي تشكل جسراً يربط بين أجزاء العظام أثناء التئام الكسور.
def: "Increased growth of callus, the bony and cartilaginous material that forms a connecting bridge across a bone fracture during fracture healing." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12913845, PMID:17451374]
xref: UMLS:C4022548
is_a: HP:0011842 ! Abnormal skeletal morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030269
name: Increased circulating insulin-like growth factor 1 concentration
synonym: "ارتفاع تركيز عامل النمو الشبيه بالأنسولين 1 في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع مستوى IGF1 في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع مستوى عامل النمو الشبيه بالأنسولين 1 (IGF1) في الدورة الدموية.
def: "An elevated level of insulin-like growth factor 1 (IGF1) in the blood circulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:18436706]
comment: Growth hormone and IGF-I are important regulators of bone homeostasis throughout life. During the prepubertal period, GH and IGF-I are determinants of longitudinal bone growth, skeletal maturation, and acquisition of bone mass, whereas in adults they are important in the maintenance of bone mass.
synonym: "Elevated serum IGF1" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Increased serum IGF1" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased serum insulin-like growth factor 1" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C2676198
is_a: HP:0030352 ! Abnormal circulating insulin-like growth factor 1 concentration

[Term]
id: HP:0030270
name: Elevated red cell adenosine deaminase activity
synonym: "ارتفاع نشاط الأدينوزين دياميناز في خلايا الدم الحمراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة نشاط إنزيم في خلايا الدم الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في مستوى إنزيم الأدينوزين دياميناز (ADA)، وهو إنزيم مشارك في استقلاب البيورين داخل الخلايا الحمراء. ADA ضالع في استقلاب الأدينوزين.
def: "Increase in the level of adenosine deaminase (ADA), an enzyme involved in purine metabolism, within erythrocytes. ADA is involved in the catabolism of adenosine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:3348976]
xref: UMLS:C4022547
is_a: HP:4000209 ! Abnormal erythrocyte adenosine deaminase activity

[Term]
id: HP:0030271
name: Reduced erythrocyte 2,3-diphosphoglycerate concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز 2,3-ثنائي فوسفوغليسرات في كريات الدم الحمراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى منخفض من 2,3-DPG في خلايا الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير هذا المصطلح إلى انخفاض غير مناسب في تركيز 2,3-ثنائي فوسفوغليسرات (2,3-DPG) في كريات الدم الحمراء. يعمل 2,3-DPG على التحكم في نقل الأكسجين من خلايا الدم الحمراء إلى الأنسجة. عادةً ما يصاحب فقر الدم مستوى مرتفع من 2,3-DPG لتعزيز توفير الأكسجين للأنسجة.
def: "This term refers to an inappropriate low 2,3-DPG concentration in erythrocytes. 2,3-diphosphoglycerate (2,3-DPG) controls the movement of oxygen from red blood cells to tissues. Anemia is usually accompanied by an increased level of 2,3-DPG in order to promote tissue oxygenation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022546
is_a: HP:0034737 ! Abnormal erythrocyte metabolite concentration

[Term]
id: HP:0030272
name: Abnormal erythrocyte enzyme concentration or activity
synonym: "خلل في تركيز أو نشاط إنزيمات كريات الدم الحمراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى غير طبيعي للإنزيمات في كريات الدم الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مستوى متغير لأي إنزيم يعمل كمحفز داخل خلايا الدم الحمراء. يشمل هذا المصطلح التغيرات الناتجة عن النشاط المتغير لإنزيم.
def: "An altered level of any enzyme to act as catalysts within erythrocytes. This term includes changes due to altered activity of an enzyme." []
synonym: "Abnormal erythrocyte enzyme level" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4022545
is_a: HP:0001877 ! Abnormal erythrocyte morphology
is_a: HP:0034684 ! Abnormal enzyme concentration or activity

[Term]
id: HP:0030273
name: Reduced red cell adenosine deaminase level
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى الأدينوزين دياميناز في كريات الدم الحمراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض إنزيم في خلايا الدم الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في مستوى إنزيم الأدينوزين دياميناز (ADA)، وهو إنزيم مشارك في استقلاب البيورين داخل الخلايا الحمراء. ADA ضالع في استقلاب الأدينوزين.
def: "Decrease in the level of adenosine deaminase (ADA), an enzyme involved in purine metabolism, within erythrocytes. ADA is involved in the catabolism of adenosine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022544
is_a: HP:4000209 ! Abnormal erythrocyte adenosine deaminase activity

[Term]
id: HP:0030274
name: Accessory scrotum
synonym: "كيس صفني إضافي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كيس صفني زائد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كيس صفني إضافي، أو جزء من كيس صفني في موقع غير اعتيادي.
def: "Additional scrotum, or part of a scrotum in an abnormal location." [PMID:23650202]
comment: An accessory scrotum is typically located on the perineum, frequently associated with perineal lipoma, and occasionally with Hypospadias or Bifid penis, which should be coded separately.
synonym: "Extra scrotum" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4022543
is_a: HP:0000045 ! Abnormal scrotum morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030275
name: Ectopic scrotum
synonym: "كيس صفني شاذ الموقع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "موقع غير طبيعي لكيس الصفن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كيس الصفن في موقع غير الموقع المعتاد أسفل قاعدة القضيب.
def: "Scrotum in a position other than the usual position inferior to the base of the penis." [PMID:23650202]
comment: This term is distinguished from Accessory scrotum, as there is no significant scrotal tissue in the normal position in ectopic scrotum. This definition excludes the finding of Penoscrotal transposition or Overriding scrotum. Usually the scrotum is split and there is unilateral ectopia. The ectopic scrotum is typically located supra-inguinally, but may be located elsewhere such as on the upper thigh. A testis is commonly present in the ectopic scrotum. Ectopic scrotum can be accompanied by Chordee or Bifid penis, which should be coded separately, and by renal and non-urogenital malformations.
synonym: "Abnormal scrotum position" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: UMLS:C4022542
is_a: HP:0000045 ! Abnormal scrotum morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030276
name: obsolete Small scrotum
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: HP:0000046

[Term]
id: HP:0030277
name: Abnormal vertebral pedicle morphology
synonym: "شذوذ مورفولوجيا السويقة الفقرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شكل غير طبيعي للسويقة الفقرية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في مورفولوجيا السويقة الفقرية.
def: "Abnormal morphology of a vertebral pedical." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_bgallinger]
comment: The pedicle is part of the lumbar vertebrae - each lumbar vertebra consists of a vertebral body and a vertebral arch. The vertebral arch, consisting of a pair of pedicles and a pair of laminae, encloses the vertebral foramen.
xref: UMLS:C4022541
is_a: HP:0008438 ! Vertebral arch anomaly

[Term]
id: HP:0030278
name: Hypoplastic vertebral pedicle
synonym: "قنطرة الفقرة ناقصة التنسج" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قنطرة فقرة غير مكتملة النمو" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: قنطرة الفقرة غير مكتملة النمو.
def: "Underdeveloped vertebral pedicle." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
xref: UMLS:C4022540
is_a: HP:0030277 ! Abnormal vertebral pedicle morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030279
name: Hypoplastic L5 vertebral pedicle
synonym: "قنطرة الفقرة الخامسة القطنية ناقصة التنسج" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قنطرة الفقرة الخامسة القطنية غير مكتملة النمو" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: القنطرة غير مكتملة النمو للفقرة الخامسة القطنية.
def: "Underdeveloped pedicle of the fifth lumbar vertebra." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_bgallinger]
xref: UMLS:C4022539
is_a: HP:0030278 ! Hypoplastic vertebral pedicle

[Term]
id: HP:0030280
name: Rib gap
synonym: "ثغرة في الضلع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فجوة في الضلع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيب موضعي شعاعي شفاف في جسم الضلع.
def: "Radiolucent focal defect of a rib shaft." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: A rib gap can be congenital or acquired. If congenital this feature is nearly pathgnomonic for Cerebrocostomandibular syndrome (MIM:117650). Acquired rib gaps can be seen after surgical procedures or with fractures or infections.
synonym: "Rib gap" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:249705009
xref: UMLS:C0426827
is_a: HP:0000772 ! Abnormal rib morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030281
name: Cervical C3/C4 vertebral fusion
synonym: "التحام الفقرة العنقية C3/C4" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التحام الفقرات العنقية الثالثة والرابعة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التحام الفقرات العنقية عند الفقرات C3 و C4، ناتج عن فشل في التقسيم الطبيعي للفقرات العنقية خلال الأسابيع الأولى من التطور الجنيني.
def: "Fusion of cervical vertebrae at C3 and C4, caused by a failure in the normal segmentation or division of the cervical vertebrae during the early weeks of fetal development." []
xref: UMLS:C4022538
is_a: HP:0002949 ! Fused cervical vertebrae

[Term]
id: HP:0030282
name: Posterior rib gap
synonym: "ثغرة في الجزء الخلفي من الضلع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فجوة في الجزء الخلفي من الضلع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عيب موضعي شعاعي شفاف في الجزء الخلفي من جسم الضلع. قد تؤدي 'الفجوات' إلى الفشل الصدري.
def: "Radiolucent focal defect of the posterior portion of a rib shaft. The 'gaps' may lead to flail chest." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_bgallinger]
synonym: "Dorsal rib defect" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C1842696
is_a: HP:0030280 ! Rib gap

[Term]
id: HP:0030283
name: Partial absence of the septum pellucidum
synonym: "غياب جزئي للحاجز الشفاف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "جزء مفقود من الحاجز الشفاف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود جزء فقط من الحاجز الشفاف (وهو غشاء رقيق مثلثي رأسي يفصل بين البطينين الجانبيين للدماغ). يمكن ملاحظة هذه الخاصية عبر التصوير بالرنين المغناطيسي أو التصوير المقطعي المحوسب للدماغ.
def: "Only part of the septum pellucidum (a thin, triangular, vertical membrane separating the lateral ventricles of the brain) is present. This feature can be appreciated on magnetic resonance tomography or computed tomography of the brain." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_bgallinger]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:422474003
xref: UMLS:C1827299
is_a: HP:0007375 ! Abnormal septum pellucidum morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0030284
name: Triangular tongue
synonym: "لسان مثلثي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "لسان بشكل مثلث" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل من تضخم اللسان (زيادة في حجم اللسان) يتميز بقاعدة عريضة لجذر اللسان لكن طرف اللسان صغير، مما يعطي مظهر مثلث.
def: "A form of macrogloassia (increased size of the tongue) characterized by a broad based root of the tongue but a small tongue tip, giving the appearance of a triangle." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UToronto_bgallinger]
synonym: "Triangle shaped tongue" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Triangular tongue" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4022537
is_a: HP:0000158 ! Macroglossia

