def: "An anomaly of the metaphysis of the distal femur (close to the knee)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormality of wide portion of outermost thighbone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
