comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من سرطان الفرج الذي ينشأ من الخلايا الصباغية في الفرج.
def: "A type of vulvar cancer that originates from melanocytes of the vulva." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:8723827]
comment: The first symptoms typically noticed by the patients are bleeding, pruritus, or a mass in the groin. Vulvar melanomas are mostly located at the labia minora.
