[Term]
id: HP:0030645
name: Central
synonym: "مركزي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "في الوسط" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على شذوذ يقع بالقرب من السطح المتوسط أو الخط الأوسط للجسم أو للهيكل المشار إليه.
def: "Applies to an abnormality that is located close to the median plane or midline of the body or of the referenced structure." []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:26216008
xref: UMLS:C0205099
