is_a: HP:0030687 ! Abnormal glucagon level

[Term]
id: HP:0030690
name: Gingival cleft
synonym: "شق اللثة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شروخ في اللثة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شق في اللثة (اللثة)، وهي النسيج الغشائي الذي يغطي الفك العلوي والفك السفلي.
def: "A fissure in the gingiva (gums), i.e., the mucosal tissue that lies over the mandible and maxilla." []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:109622003
xref: UMLS:C0426489
is_a: HP:0000168 ! Abnormality of the gingiva

[Term]
id: HP:0030691
name: Divergence nystagmus
synonym: "الرأرأة التباعدية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حركة غير طبيعية للخارج للعيون" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة تتحرك فيها العينان نحو الخارج في نفس الوقت.
def: "A condition in which both eyes beat outward simultaneously." []
comment: This is a rare condition that may be related to posterior foass abnormalities and can occur with spinocerebellar degeneration.
xref: UMLS:C4073130
is_a: HP:0000639 ! Nystagmus

