name: Enlarged tonsils
synonym: "تضخم اللوزتين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "لوزتان كبيرتان" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في حجم اللوزتين، وهما كتلتان صغيرتان من النسيج اللمفاوي توجه نحو الجهاز التنفسي والهضمي على كل جانب من الجزء الخلفي للحلق.
def: "Increase in size of the tonsils, small collections of lymphoid tissue facing into the aerodigestive tract on either side of the back part of the throat." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Enlargement of tonsils" EXACT []
synonym: "Tonsillar hypertrophy" EXACT []
synonym: "tonsils large/hypertrophy" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:46689006
xref: UMLS:C0272386
is_a: HP:0100765 ! Abnormality of the tonsils

