[Term]
id: HP:0030863
name: Nasal flaring
synonym: "اتساع فتحتي الأنف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اتساع فتحات الأنف عند التنفس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اتساع فتحتي الأنف عند الشهيق كعلامة على ضيق التنفس.
def: "Widening of the nostrils upon inhalation as a manifestation of respiratory distress." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0003-6754, PMID:25274969]
comment: Nasal flaring is a compensatory symptom that increases upper airway diameter and reduces resistance and work of breathing.
