[Term]
id: HP:0030870
name: Abnormality of spinal facet joint
synonym: "شذوذ المفصل الوجهي الفقري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مشكلة في مفاصل العمود الفقري الصغيرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو شذوذ في المفاصل الصغيرة الواقعة بين وخلف الفقرات المتجاورة.
def: "An anomaly of the small joints located between and behind adjacent vertebrae." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The spinal facet joints represent a set of synovial, plane joints between the articular processes of each two adjacent vertebrae. Each pair of facet joints functions to guide and limit the movement of the corresponding spinal motion segment.
synonym: "Abnormality of apophyseal joint" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of Z-joint" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of zygapophyseal joint" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormality of zygapophysial joint" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280735
is_a: HP:0003312 ! Abnormal form of the vertebral bodies

[Term]
id: HP:0030871
name: Facet joint arthrosis
synonym: "التهاب مفصل الوجه الفقري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب المفاصل في العمود الفقري" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الفصال العظمي لمفاصل الوجه في العمود الفقري. ينتج عن تدهور الغضاريف في هذه المفاصل احتكاك العظام ببعضها وتشكّل عظم جديد يظهر بالأشعة السينية.
def: "Osteoarthritis of facet joints in the spine. Degeneration of cartilage in the facet joints results in bone rubbing on bone and reactive new bone formation visible on X-ray." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Facet joint osteoarthritis (FJ OA) is intimately linked to degenerative disk disease, which affects structures in the anterior aspect of the vertebral column. FJ OA and degenerative disk disease are both common causes of back and neck pain.
synonym: "Facet arthritis" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280734
is_a: HP:0030870 ! Abnormality of spinal facet joint

