[Term]
id: HP:0030876
name: Increased pulmonary capillary wedge pressure
synonym: "زيادة ضغط إسفين الشعيرات الرئوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة ضغط الشعيرات الرئوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في ضغط إسفين الشعيرات الرئوية إلى أكثر من 15 ملليمتر زئبق.
def: "Pulmonary capillary wedge pressure (PCWP) above 15mmHg." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4546-6667]
comment: The pulmonary capillary wedge pressure refers to the pressure measured by wedging a pulmonary catheter with an inflated balloon into a small pulmonary arterial branch.
synonym: "Increased pulmonary arterial wedge pressure" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased pulmonary artery occlusion pressure" EXACT []
