[Term]
id: HP:0030946
name: Conjunctival papillae
synonym: "حليبات الملتحمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نتوءات تحت الجفن العلوي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كتل نسيجية مرتفعة تقع على ملتحمة الجفن والتي تحتوي على وعاء دموي مركزي. تُنشأ الحليبات بواسطة تغلغل مركز للخلية الالتهابية.
def: "Raised tissue masses located on the palpebral conjunctiva with a central vessel. Papillae are created by a focal infiltration of inflammatory cells." []
comment: Papillae may be observed with papillary conjunctivitis. The inflammatory cells in the papillae may differ according to the cause. For instance, eosinophils predominate in allergic conditions and neutrophils in bacterial disease.
synonym: "Bumps under the upper eyelid" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Tarsal papillae" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000502 ! Abnormal conjunctiva morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-01-13T20:21:47Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0030947
name: Conjunctival follicles
synonym: "حويصلات الملتحمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عقد صغيرة على الملتحمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عقيدات صغيرة على شكل قباب بدون وعاء مركزي بارز تقع في الملتحمة. تقع الحويصلات اللمفاوية في منطقة ما تحت البطانة للملتحمة وتتكون من مركز نشوء يحتوي على الخلايا اللمفاوية غير الناضجة والمتكاثرة، وكذلك الإكليل الذي يحتوي على الخلايا اللمفاوية الناضجة والخلايا البلازمية.
def: "Small, dome-shaped nodules without a prominent central vessel located on the conjunctiva. The lymphoid follicles are located in the subendothelial region of the conjunctiva. They consist of a germinal center that contains immature, proliferating lymphocytes, as well as a corona that contains mature lymphocytes and plasma cells." []
comment: The follicles in follicular conjunctivitis are usually most prominent in the inferior palpebral and forniceal conjunctiva. As compared to conjunctival papillae, conjunctival follicles appear more pale on the surface and redder at the base.
is_a: HP:0000502 ! Abnormal conjunctiva morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-01-13T20:23:46Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0030948
name: Elevated gamma-glutamyltransferase level
synonym: "زيادة مستوى الغاما جلوتاميل ترانسفيراز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في الأنزيم GGT" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في مستوى أنزيم الغاما جلوتاميل ترانسفيراز (GGT). يتواجد GGT بشكل رئيسي في خلايا الكلى والكبد والبنكرياس، لكن توجد كميات صغيرة في أنسجة أخرى.
def: "Increased level of the enzyme gamma-glutamyltransferase (GGT). GGT is mainly present in kidney, liver, and pancreatic cells, but small amounts are present in other tissues." [PMID:26543300]
comment: Gamma-glutamyl transferase (GGT) is elevated with most liver diseases and with bile duct damage. Its main clinical use is in the evaluation of patients with isolated elevation in alkaline phosphatase (which can be of hepatic or bone origin). However, there are extrahepatic causes of GGT elevation including pancreatitis, prostate carcinoma, breast carcinoma, lung carcinoma, systemic lupus erythematosus, and congestive heart failure.
synonym: "Elevated serum GGT" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0034444 ! Abnormal gamma-glutamyltransferase level
property_value: dc:date "2017-01-13T21:20:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0030949
name: Glomerular deposits
synonym: "ترسبات كبيبية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تجمع بروتينات في الكلى" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تراكم غير طبيعي للبروتين في الكبيبة.
def: "An abnormal accumulation of protein in the glomerulus." []
