[Term]
id: HP:0031015
name: Intrahepatic portal vein sclerosis
synonym: "تصلب الوريد البابي داخل الكبد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انسداد الأوعية الكبدية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تصلب في الأوردة البابية داخل الكبد وعادة ما يكون مصحوبًا بفرط ضغط الدم البابي غير المترافق بتليف، تشمل علاماته تضخم الطحال ودوالي المريء.
def: "Sclerosis of the intrahepatic portal veins of the liver and generally accompanied by non-cirrhotic portal hypertension, features of which may include splenomegaly and varices." [PMID:25796481]
comment: The diagnosis is based on histological examination of the liver. Clinical manifestations include encephalopathy, ascites and variceal bleeding.
synonym: "Idiopathic non-cirrhotic portal hypertension" RELATED []
synonym: "Incomplete septal cirrhosis" RELATED []
synonym: "Non cirrhotic portal fibrosis" RELATED []
synonym: "Obliterative portal venopathy" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0031941 ! Abnormal portal venous system morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-20T11:15:20Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031016
name: Alternating radiolucent and radiodense metaphyseal lines
synonym: "خطوط كردوسية متبادلة شفافة ومعتمة شعاعياً" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خطوط كالحمار الوحشي في العظام" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مناطق ذات أشرطة متصلبة شعاعياً تتناوب مع تلك ذات الشفافية الطبيعية تُعطي مظهراً مشابهاً لخطوط الحمار الوحشي.
def: "Areas of radio-opaque sclerotic bands alternating with those of normal lucency give rise to stripes akin to a zebra." [PMID:28384951]
comment: In cases where this sign arises in children treated with bisphosphonates, the sign is known as the zebra stripe sign, which is radiological manifestation of cyclical bisphosphonate therapy prior to closure of epiphyseal growth plates.
synonym: "Zebra stripe sign" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0000944 ! Abnormal metaphysis morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-20T11:32:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031017
name: Swiss cheese atrial septal defect
synonym: "عيب حاجز أذيني مثل الجبن السويسري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدة ثقوب في الحاجز الأذيني" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود عدة عيوب (ثقوب) في الحاجز الأذيني.
def: "Multiple defects in the atrial septum." [PMID:18559707]
comment: The label derives from the resemblance of the multiple atrial defects to Emmental cheese, a medium-hard cheese of Swiss origin that features characteristic holes.
is_a: HP:0001631 ! Atrial septal defect
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-20T11:43:29Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031018
name: Eccrine syringofibroadenoma
synonym: "ورم ليفي غدّي عرقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم جلدي حميد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الورم الليفي الغدّي العرقي هو ورم حميد في الزوائد الجلدية يظهر غالبًا عند الأطراف لدى المسنين، ويتميز بوجود حبال متصلة من الخلايا الظهارية المكعبة محاطة بكِساب وعائي ليفي يحتوي على خلايا البلازما والهياكل القنوية. يصبغ الورم بشكل إيجابي للمستضدات الغشائية الظهارية والمستضد السرطاني الجنيني.
def: "Eccrine syringofibroadenoma (ESFA) is a benign adnexal tumor arising most often on the extremities of elderly individuals characterized by anastomosing cords of cuboidal epithelial cells surrounded by a fibrovascular stroma containing plasma cells and ductal structures. ESFA stains positively with epithelial membrane antigen (EMA) and carcinoembryonic antigen (CEA)." [NCIT:CL017969, PMID:26937300]
synonym: "Acrosyringeal adenomatosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Eccrine syringofibroadenomatous hyperplasia" EXACT []
synonym: "Syringofibroadenoma" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0008069 ! Neoplasm of the skin
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-31T00:32:10Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031019
name: Pyknotic bone marrow neutrophils
synonym: "نيوتروفيلات نخاع العظم البكنوتية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تجمع غير طبيعي في خلايا الدم البيضاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فصوص نوى النيوتروفيلات في نخاع العظم تكون متضخمة ومكثفة، وتربط الفصوص بشكل غير طبيعي خيوط من الكروماتين طويلة جدًا.
def: "Nuclear lobes of neutrophils in the bone marrow are thickened and condensed, and individual lobes are connected by unusually long chromatin filaments." []
is_a: HP:0011992 ! Abnormal neutrophil morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-14T16:30:54Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031020
name: Bone marrow hypercellularity
synonym: "فرط الخلوية في نخاع العظم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة عدد الخلايا في نخاع العظم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود كمية أو نسبة كبيرة أكثر من الخلايا المكونة للدم مقارنة بالدهون في النخاع.
def: "A larger than normal amount or percentage of hematopoietic cells relative to marrow fat." []
synonym: "Myeloid hyperplasia" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012145 ! Abnormality of multiple cell lineages in the bone marrow
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-14T16:35:25Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031021
name: Squamous Papilloma
synonym: "الورم الحليمي الحرشفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نمو غير طبيعي في الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم طلائي حميد يتميز بنمط نمو حليمي وتكاثر خلايا حرشفية جديدة دون وجود دلائل شكلية على الخباثة.
def: "A benign epithelial neoplasm characterized by a papillary growth pattern and a proliferation of neoplastic squamous cells without morphologic evidence of malignancy [NCI thesaurus]." []
xref: NCIT:C3712
is_a: HP:0012740 ! Papilloma
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-21T13:13:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031022
name: Oropharyngeal squamous papilloma
synonym: "الورم الحليمي الحرشفي في الفم والبلعوم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نمو غير طبيعي في الفم والبلعوم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم بارز حميد ينشأ من الفم والبلعوم. يتميز بوجود نسيج رابط مغطى بطبقة من الظهارة الحرشفية المتعددة.
def: "A benign exophytic neoplasm that arises from the oropharynx. It is characterized by the presence of a connective tissue core covered by stratified squamous epithelium [NCI thesaurus]." []
synonym: "Squamous papilloma of the uvula" NARROW []
xref: NCIT:C6038
is_a: HP:0031021 ! Squamous Papilloma
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-21T13:15:14Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031023
name: Multiple mucosal neuromas
synonym: "الأورام العصبية المخاطية المتعددة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نتوءات مؤلمة في الفم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نتوءات مؤلمة متعددة، لها شكل قبة وشفافة وذات لون وردي حتى لون الجلد على الغشاء المخاطي للفم. تحت المجهر، قد تظهر الآفات تكاثر الألياف العصبية المحددة المرتبطة بوجود كمية وفيرة من المخاط ومحاطة بغمد محيطي مميز.
def: "Multiple painful, dome-shaped, translucent pink to skin-colored papules on oral mucosa. Histologically, the lesions may demonstrate dermal proliferation of well-demarcated nerve bundles associated with abundant mucin and surrounded by a distinct perineural sheath." [PMID:16702501]
xref: NCIT:C6559
is_a: HP:0030430 ! Neuroma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
creation_date: 2017-05-21T13:18:01Z

[Term]
id: HP:0031024
name: Cylindroma
synonym: "الورم الأسطواني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم جلدي حميد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم جلدي حميد مشتق من الغدد العرقية.
def: "A benign skin adnexal tumor of eccrine differentiation." [NCIT:C27094, PMID:27294061]
comment: Cylindromas can be single or multiple and commonly involve the scalp (turban tumor) and face. Multiple cylindromas can have a syndromic association as seen in Brooke-Spiegler syndrome and familial cylindromatosis.
is_a: HP:0012842 ! Skin appendage neoplasm
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-21T13:32:29Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031025
name: Gastric leiomyosarcoma
synonym: "الساركومة العضلية الملساء في المعدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم خبيث في المعدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم خبيث في المعدة ينمو تحت الغشاء المخاطي في جدار المعدة. قد تكون النخر والنزيف مرئيين في الصور الشعاعية. تحت المجهر، قد تتواجد خلايا مغزلية بنشاط انقسامي غير طبيعي.
def: "A malignant neoplasm of the stomach that grows submucosally in the gastric wall. Necrosis and hemorrhage may be visible radiologically. Histologically, spindle cells with abnormal mitotic activity may be visible." [NCIT:C27200, PMID:25069607]
comment: Gastric leiomyosarcomas are often clinically silent until they reach a large size, bleed or rupture. Thus, the diagnosis is rarely made preoperatively. Since in many cases the mucosa is normal, a definitive diagnosis for resectable tumor is often made after surgery. Seeding of tumor deposits into the serosa or omentum is almost invariably a sign of malignancy.
is_a: HP:0006753 ! Neoplasm of the stomach
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-21T13:42:26Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031026
name: Snail-like ilia
synonym: "حوض عظم الورك الحلزوني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشوه عظم الورك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يكون عظم الحرقفة مستديرًا وقليل النمو مع سقف صغير جدًا للمفصل وشكل غير عادي لامتداد العظم الذي يشبه رأس الحلزون.
def: "The ilia is round and hypoplastic with a very flat acetabular roof and a very unusual medial projection of bone that is said to resemble the head of a snail. Figure 4 of PMID:3799723 illustrates this feature." [PMID:3799723]
comment: This feature was first observed in a condition that was termed Schneckenbecken dysplasia, Schneckenbecken is a German word that means snail-like pelvis.
synonym: "Schneckenbecken dysplasia" RELATED []
synonym: "Snail-like pelvis" EXACT []
synonym: "Snail-shaped ilia" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002867 ! Abnormal ilium morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-21T15:50:25Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031027
name: Internal notch of the femoral head
synonym: "ثلمة داخلية في رأس عظم الفخذ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ثلمة في رأس عظم الفخذ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فجوة صغيرة على شكل حرف V في الجهة الداخلية لرأس عظم الفخذ.
def: "A small V-shaped indentation on the internal aspect of the femoral head. This feature is well illustrated in Figure 5 of PMID:11694546." [PMID:11694546, PMID:24339047]
is_a: HP:0003368 ! Abnormal femoral head morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-21T16:09:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031028
name: Lactescent serum
synonym: "مصل لبني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مصل يشبه الحليب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عينة مصل ذات مظهر أبيض بشكل واضح (يشبه الحليب أو اللبني). هذا المظهر يشير إلى مستوى مرتفع جدًا من الدهون الثلاثية في المصل.
def: "Serum sample with a grossly white (milk-like, i.e., lactescent) appearance. This feature is indicative of an extremely elevated serum triglyceride level." [PMID:15368719]
comment: The normal range for serum triglycerides can be taken to be 40 to 150 mg per dL (0.45 to 1.69 mmol per L). Lactescent serum can be seen with triglyceride levels of several thousand mg per dL.
synonym: "Milk-like serum" EXACT []
synonym: "Plasma lactescence" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002155 ! Hypertriglyceridemia
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-27T10:37:46Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031029
name: Elevated circulating CEA concentration
synonym: "تركيز مرتفع لمستضد سرطاني جنيني في الدوران الدموي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى مرتفع لمستضد سرطاني في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز مستضد سرطاني جنيني (CEA) في الدم أعلى من الحد الأعلى الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of CEA (carcinoembryonic antigen) in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." []
comment: Carcinoembryonic antigen (CEA) is a member of the immunoglobulin supergene family. The human CEA gene family is clustered on chromosome 19q and comprises 29 genes. CEA is highly expressed in embryonic tissue and in some cancers, and is a widely used tumor marker.
synonym: "Elevated carcinoembryonic antigen level" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased plasma CEA" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0010876 ! Abnormal circulating protein concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-27T10:48:16Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031030
name: Elevated circulating carcinoma antigen 125 concentration
synonym: "تركيز مرتفع لمستضد السرطان 125 في الدوران الدموي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى مرتفع لمستضد السرطان 125 في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في تركيز مستضد السرطان 125 (CA-125) في الدم. يمكن أن يظهر CA-125، المعروف أيضًا باسم مخاط 16، بمستويات مرتفعة في الدم في أنواع معينة من السرطان.
def: "An increased blood concentration of carcinoma antigen 125 (CA-125). CA-125, also known as mucin 16, can exhibit increased blood levels in certain types of cancer." [PMID:16343244, PMID:22542127, PMID:22729278]
comment: Cancer-antigen 125 (CA-125) is used as a biomarker for ovarian and other cancers. Mucin 16 (cancer antigen 125) is a cell surface glycoprotein that plays a role in promoting cancer cell growth in ovarian cancer.
synonym: "Elevated carcinoma antigen 125 level" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased plasma CA125" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0010876 ! Abnormal circulating protein concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-27T10:54:15Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031031
name: Abnormal circulating retinol-binding protein concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز بروتين ربط الريتينول المتداول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في مستوى بروتين ربط الريتينول في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن التركيز الطبيعي لبروتين ربط الريتينول في الدم.
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of retinol-binding protein in the blood circulation." []
comment: The most commonly used indicator of vitamin A status is the serum retinol concentration (retinol is one of the several compounds known as vitamin A). The serum retinol-binding protein (RBP) concentration is used as a surrogate measure for serum retinol.
is_a: HP:0010876 ! Abnormal circulating protein concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-05-27T10:59:35Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031032
name: Decreased circulating retinol-binding protein concentration
synonym: "تركيز منخفض لبروتين ربط الريتينول في الدوران الدموي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى منخفض لبروتين ربط الريتينول في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز بروتين ربط الريتينول في الدم أقل من الحد الأدنى الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of retinol-binding protein in the blood circulation is below the lower limit of normal." []
