def: "Reduced bone mineral density of the femur." [PMID:19580459]
comment: Osteopenia is defined as BMD between 1 standard deviation (SD) and 2.5 SD below the mean of the young reference group. Osteoporosis is defined as BMD 2.5 SD or more below the mean of the young reference group.
