[Term]
id: HP:0031174
name: Double-layered patella
synonym: "رضفة ذات طبقتين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في الرضفة يتميز بوجود طبقتين ظاهرتين في صور الأشعة الجانبية للركبة، حيث تظهر طبقة أمام الأخرى في الاتجاه السهمي. يستمر هذا الوضع في سن البلوغ.
def: "An anomaly of the patella characterized by two layers visible on lateral knee X-ray such that one layer is in front of the other in the sagittal orientation (See Figure 2A and 3B of PMID:12966518). This finding persists into adulthood." [PMID:12525546, PMID:12966518]
comment: This feature can be observed in Multiple epiphyseal dysplasia type 4. It is distinct from bipartite patella, which is characterized by an unfused accessory ossification center at the superolateral aspect of the patella. Double layer patella appears to be caused by the presence of several patellar ossification centers.
is_a: HP:0003045 ! Abnormal patella morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-18T20:08:32Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

