[Term]
id: HP:0031179
name: Nuchal rigidity
synonym: "تيبس قفوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تيبس الرقبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مقاومة عضلات طويلة الظهر للانحناء للأمام نتيجة التشنج العضلي لعضلات الرقبة. التيبس القفوي ليس صلابة ثابتة. تم استخدامه كاختبار بجانب الفراش للاشتباه في التهاب السحايا، على الرغم من مناقشة حساسيته لهذا الغرض.
def: "Resistance of the extensor muscles of the neck to being bent forwards (i.e., impaired neck flexion) as a result of muscle spasm of the extensor muscles of the neck. Nuchal rigidity is not a fixed rigidity. Nuchal rigidity has been used as a bedside test for meningism, although its sensitivity for this purpose has been debated." [PMID:12060874]
comment: Meningism is resistance to neck flexion due to painful spasm of extensor muscles resulting from meningeal irritation. The diagnosis of meningism is made in someone whose symptoms simulate meningitis, but in which no actual inflammation of these membranes is present. Nuchal rigidity can thus be observed in individuals with meningitis or with meningism.
synonym: "Meningism" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0005986 ! Limitation of neck motion
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-18T20:41:44Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031180
name: Erythema migrans
synonym: "حمامى مهاجرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح جلدي أحمر ينتشر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: آفة جلدية حمامية (حمراء) متوسعة، عادة ما تكون دائرية أو بيضاوية، ويبلغ حجمها حسب التعريف 5 سم على الأقل (في أكبر قطر).
def: "An expanding erythematous (red) skin lesion, usually round or oval, by definition at least 5 cm in size (in largest diameter)." [PMID:18452799]
comment: Erythema migrans develops at the site of the deposition of Borrelia burgdorferi 7 to 14 days (range, 1-36 days) following the detachment of certain Ixodes ticks. The most important differential diagnosis is a localized and transient inflammatory reaction to the bite of an arthropod that is not associated with infection and resolves spontaneously within a day or two, and is usually less than 5 cm in size.
synonym: "Erythema chronicum migrans" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0010783 ! Erythema
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-18T20:57:08Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031181
name: Necrolytic migratory erythema
synonym: "حمامى نخرية مهاجرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "آفات جلدية متحركة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: آفات طرفية أو حول الفموية تتطور في مجموعات متكررة، مع توزيع حلقي ومهاجر.
def: "Acral or periorificial lesions that evolve in recurrent crops, with an annular and migratory distribution." [PMID:20054043]
comment: This feature can be a manifestation of glucagonoma and other cancers.
is_a: HP:0010783 ! Erythema
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-18T21:02:25Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031185
name: Elevated circulating NT-proBNP concentration
synonym: "ارتفاع تركيز NT-proBNP في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة مستوى NT-proBNP في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز NT-proBNP (الناقل الأميني النهائي للببتيد المدر للصوديوم من نوع الدماغ) في الدورة الدموية يتجاوز الحد الأعلى الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of NT-proBNP (= N-terminal pro-B-type natriuretic peptide, = N-terminal prohormone of brain natriuretic peptide) in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." []
synonym: "Increased NT-proBNP level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031138 ! Abnormal circulating B-type natriuretic peptide concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-21T10:30:21Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031186
name: Abnormal circulating deoxycorticosterone level
synonym: "خلل في مستوى الديوكسيكورتيكوستيرون في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير مستوى هرمون الديوكسيكورتيكوستيرون في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في تركيز الديوكسيكورتيكوستيرون في الدم. يتضمن الديوكسيكورتيكوستيرون كلاً من 11-ديوكسيكورتيكوستيرون و21-ديوكسيكورتيكوستيرون.
def: "An abnormality of the concentration of deoxycorticosterone in the blood. Deoxycorticosterone comprises 11-deoxycorticosterone and 21-deoxycorticosterone." []
is_a: HP:0012112 ! Abnormal circulating corticosterone level
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-21T10:39:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031187
name: Abnormal circulating pregnenolone concentration
synonym: "خلل في تركيز البرينينولون في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير مستوى البرينينولون في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في تركيز البرينينولون في الدم.
def: "An abnormality of the concentration of pregnenolone in the blood." [PMID:24849255]
comment: Neurosteroids are steroids synthesized within the central nervous system as well as in other steroidogenic organs/tissues. In contrary with the classical actions through intracellular receptors, extensive evidence has established that neurosteroids can exert rapid, potent actions at the cell membrane via allosteric interactions with the GABAA receptor. Pregnenolone is a naturally occurring neurosteroid directly metabolized from cholesterol and the precursor of virtually all neurosteroids.
synonym: "Abnormality of circulating pregnenolone level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0033799 ! Abnormal circulating sex hormone concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-21T10:45:33Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031188
name: Genital edema
synonym: "وذمة الأعضاء التناسلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تورم في المنطقة التناسلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تراكم السوائل الذي يسبب تورم في الأنسجة الرخوة في منطقة الأعضاء التناسلية.
def: "A buildup of fluid that causes swelling in the soft tissues of the genital area." []
synonym: "Genital oedema" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0000969 ! Edema
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-24T12:59:46Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031189
name: Wrist drop
synonym: "هبوط في الرسغ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم القدرة على رفع المعصم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة لا يستطيع المصاب فيها تمديد الرسغ، الذي يتدلى بشكل رخو.
def: "A condition in which the affected individual cannot extend the wrist, which hangs flaccidly." []
comment: Wrist drop can be caused by radial nerve palsy.
is_a: HP:0003484 ! Upper limb muscle weakness
property_value: dc:date "2017-06-24T13:25:58Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031190
name: Superficial dermal perivascular inflammatory infiltrate
synonym: "ارتشاح التهابي محيطي وعائي سطحي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب جلدي سطحي حول الأوعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
