[Term]
id: HP:0031233
name: Horizontal inferior border of scapula
synonym: "الحد السفلي الأفقي للكتف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الشكل المربع للكتف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في الشكل التشريحي للكتف يظهر فيه الحد السفلي بشكل مسطح (أفقي)، مما يجعل الكتف يبدو مربع الشكل. يُشار إلى هذا التشوه أحيانًا بضلع الكتف المربع.
def: "A morphological abnormality of the scapula in which there is a flat (horizontal) inferior edge of the scapula. The entire scapula is said to resemble a square, leading to the designation sqaring of the scapula (in Figure 1 of PMID:24706940 the scapulae have a roughly rectangular shape)." [PMID:24706940]
synonym: "Squaring of the inferior scapulae" EXACT plural_form []
synonym: "Squaring of the scapula" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000782 ! Abnormal scapula morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-07-02T13:23:17Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031234
name: Neutrophilic infiltration of the skin
synonym: "تسلل العدلات في الجلد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تسلل خلايا مناعية في الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تسلل كثيف للعدلات في الأدمة والبشرة، حيث يُعتقد أن العدلات قد هاجرت بكثرة إلى الجلد.
def: "A predominantly neutrophilic infiltrate of the dermis and or epidermis (i.e., a large number of neutrophils inferred to have migrated into the skin)." []
is_a: HP:0011123 ! Inflammatory abnormality of the skin
property_value: dc:date "2017-07-02T19:34:51Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031235
name: Predominantly epidermal neutrophilic infiltrate
synonym: "تسلل عدلي بشروي غالب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تجمع خلايا مناعية في الطبقة الخارجية من الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تجمع خلايا من نوع العدلات في طبقة البشرة للجلد.
def: "Collection of neutrophils in the epidermis." [PMID:17675728]
comment: This feature can be seen in a variety of conditions ranging from inflammatory dermatosis like psoriasis, neonatal disorders e.g. transient neonatal pustular melanosis to neoplasms viz. keratoacanthoma.
is_a: HP:0031234 ! Neutrophilic infiltration of the skin
property_value: dc:date "2017-07-02T19:36:13Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

