[Term]
id: HP:0031247
name: Whooping cough
synonym: "السعال الديكي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من السعال يتميز بنوبات عديدة وسريعة من السعال يليها جهد شهيق طويل مصحوب بصوت صفير عالي النبرة ناتج عن استنشاق الهواء.
def: "A type of cough characterized by a burst of numerous and rapid coughs followed by a long inhaling effort that is accompanied by a high-pitched whooping sound produced by the inhalation of air." [PMID:24219484]
comment: The term whooping cough is usually used to describe the disease caused by infection of the respiratory tract with Bordatella pertussis. This HPO term refers to the major symptom of that disease.
is_a: HP:0012735 ! Cough
property_value: dc:date "2017-08-12T13:22:51Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031248
name: Palmar pruritus
synonym: "حكة راحة اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حكة في راحة اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الحكة هي إحساس يجعل الشخص يرغب في الحك، ويشير هذا المصطلح إلى الإحساس المرتفع بشكل غير عادي للحكة في راحة اليد أو راحات اليد.
def: "Pruritus is an itch or a sensation that makes a person want to scratch. This term refers to an abnormally increased sensation of itching over the palm(s) of the hand." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Itchy palm" EXACT layperson []
