[Term]
id: HP:0031271
name: Absent ankle pulse
synonym: "غياب النبض في الكاحل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم وجود نبض عند الكاحل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: لا يمكن الكشف عن نبض الشريان الظنبوبي الخلفي خلف الكعب الداخلي، أو من الشريان الظهري للقدم، عند الفحص الجسدي.
def: "The pulsation of the posterior tibial artery behind the internal malleolus, or of the dorsalis pedis artery, cannot be detected on physical examination." []
comment: While examining the pulse, the observer should note its intensity, rate, rhythm, and if any blood vessel tenderness, tortuosity, or nodularity exists.
is_a: HP:0032554 ! Absent pulse
property_value: dc:date "2017-08-12T20:39:39Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031272
name: Pulmonary arterial atherosclerosis
synonym: "تصلب الشرايين الرئوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تصلب شرايين الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تراكم الدهون والخلايا الالتهابية على طول الجدران الداخلية للشريان الرئوي.
def: "Accumulation of lipids and inflammatory cells along the inner walls of the pulmonary artery." []
comment: Pulmonary artery atherosclerosis is less common than systemic arterial atherosclerosis.
