[Term]
id: HP:0031287
name: Seborrheic keratosis
synonym: "التقران الدهني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ثؤلول الشيخوخة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمو مرتفع على جلد الأفراد الأكبر سنًا. عادة ما يكون الآفة ذات لون بني فاتح وتصبح أغمق لتصل إلى البني الداكن أو الأسود تقريبًا. السمة المميزة للتقران الدهني هي مظهره الشمعي، الملصق.
def: "A raised growth on the skin of older individuals. The lesion usually is initially light tan and may darken to dark brown or nearly black. The consistent feature of seborrheic keratoses is their waxy, pasted-on or stuck-on look." []
comment: Seborrheic keratosis is a benign lesion of the skin that occurs more frequently in sunlight exposed areas. The lesions can appear anywhere on the body, but most often occur on the face, chest, and back. There may be just one or clusters of dozens.
synonym: "Basal cell papilloma" EXACT []
synonym: "Seborrheic verruca" EXACT []
synonym: "Senile wart" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0008069 ! Neoplasm of the skin
property_value: dc:date "2017-08-13T20:33:04Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031288
name: Cobblestone-like hyperkeratosis
synonym: "فرط التقرن كالحصى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نتوءات جلدية شبيهة بالحصى" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود حطاطات وعقد ثؤلولية تشبه الحصى في منطقة من الجلد توصف بأن لها مظهر كالحصى.
def: "The presence of verrucous, cobblestone-like papules and nodules in a region of skin that is said to have an appearance like that of cobblestones." [PMID:18809899]
is_a: HP:0000962 ! Hyperkeratosis
property_value: dc:date "2017-08-13T20:43:09Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

