def: "Abnormal increase in size of the coronary sinus." []
comment: The coronary sinus is rarely seen on echocardiography in healthy persons. The differential diagnosis of dilated coronary sinus includes right ventricular dysfunction, right atrial hypertension, and anomalous venous drainage into the coronary sinus.
