def: "Presence of an increased amount of fat tissue within a cardiac ventricle with corresponding reduction of muscle tissue." []
synonym: "Fatty infiltration of cardiac ventricle" EXACT []
synonym: "Intramyocardial fat infiltration" EXACT []
