[Term]
id: HP:0031318
name: Myofiber disarray
synonym: "تشوش الألياف العضلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في ترتيب ألياف القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ترتيب غير متوازٍ لخلايا عضلة القلب.
def: "A nonparallel arrangement of cardiac myocytes." [PMID:7890275]
comment: The presence of a sufficient quantity of myocardial fibers showing this change is considered to be a specific histological feature of hypertrophic cardiomyopathy.
synonym: "Myocardial fiber disarray" EXACT []
synonym: "Myocardial fibre disarray" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0001637 ! Abnormal myocardium morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-08-27T11:50:24Z" xsd:dateTime
