[Term]
id: HP:0031319
name: Cardiomyocyte hypertrophy
synonym: "تضخم في خلايا عضلة القلب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة حجم خلايا القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو زيادة في حجم الخلايا، وتعزيز تكوين البروتين، وتنظيم أكبر للهيكل الخلوي داخل الخلايا العضلية القلبية.
def: "An increase in cell size, enhanced protein synthesis, and heightened organization of the sarcomere within cardiac myocytes." [PMID:15066961, PMID:7626345]
comment: Adult cardiac myocytes are highly specialized, terminally differentiated cells which have lost the ability to divide. The increase in heart muscle mass seen in cardiac hypertrophy occurs predominantly through an increase in myocyte size rather than number. Hypertrophy is the principal response of the heart to overload from any cause, including hypertension, myocardial infarction, valvar heart disease, and dilated cardiomyopathy.
synonym: "Myocyte cellular hypertrophy" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031331 ! Abnormal cardiomyocyte morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-08-27T11:58:21Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031320
