[Term]
id: HP:0031384
name: Reduced T cell CD40 expression
synonym: "انخفاض في تعبير الخلايا التائية CD40" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض التعبير السطحي لخلايا تائية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص في تعبير الليجاند CD40 على سطح الخلايا التائية المنشطة.
def: "A deficiency in the expression of the CD40 ligand on the surface of activated T-lymphocytes." []
comment: This feature can be observed with X-linked Hyper IgM (XHIGM) syndrome. As a consequence of the deficiency in CD40 ligand, T-lymphocytes in patients with XHIGM are unable to instruct B-lymphocytes to switch their production of immunoglobulins from IgM to IgG, IgA and IgE.
