property_value: dc:date "2017-09-02T16:16:13Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031385
name: Megakaryocyte nucleus hypolobulation
synonym: "نقص الفصوص في نواة الخلية النواء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة الفصوص في نواة الخلية النواء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود خلايا نواء في نخاع العظم تكون أنويتها أقل تفرعاً مما هو متوقع بالنسبة لحجم النواة.
def: "The presence of megakaryocytes in the bone marrow whose nuclei are less lobulated than expected for the size of the nucleus." [PMID:27107657]
comment: Megakaryocytes with a hypolobulated nucleus can be seen in normal bone marrow but numbers are increased in some patients with myelodysplastic syndrome.
is_a: HP:0012143 ! Abnormal megakaryocyte morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-02T16:33:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031386
name: Increased micromegakaryocyte count
synonym: "زيادة عدد الميكروخلية النواء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في عدد خلايا النواء الصغيرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود عدد مرتفع بشكل غير طبيعي من الميكروخلايا النواء في نخاع العظم. الميكروخلايا النواء هي خلايا ثنائية الصبغة أحادية النواة، بحجم نواة مشابهة لحجم نواة الأرومة النقوية أو المطابقة للأرومة النخاعية ويكون قطر الخلية أقل من 30 ميكرومتر.
def: "The presence of abnormally high numbers of micromegakaryocytes in the bone marrow. Micromegakaryocytes are mononuclear diploid cells, with a nucleus similar in size to that of a myeloblast or promyelocyte with the cell being less than 30 micrometers in diameter." [PMID:27107657]
comment: Micromegakaryocytes are characteristic of myelodysplastic syndromebut may be seen in other conditions.
is_a: HP:0012143 ! Abnormal megakaryocyte morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-02T16:35:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031387
name: Increased multinucleated megakaryocyte count
synonym: "زيادة عدد الخلايا النواء متعددة النوى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في عدد خلايا النواء متعددة النوى" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود عدد مرتفع بشكل غير طبيعي من الخلايا النواء متعددة النوى في نخاع العظم.
def: "The presence of abnormally high numbers of multinucleated megakaryocytes in the bone marrow." [PMID:27107657]
comment: A multinucleated megakaryocyte is a cell of normal size with two or more nuclei. Binucleated micromegakaryocytes should be categorized as such rather than as multinucleated megakaryocytes since the restricted size is of more diagnostic significance than the presence of two nuclei. Multinucleated megakaryocytes are seen in small numbers in normal bone marrow aspirates but in larger numbers in some patients with MDS.
is_a: HP:0012143 ! Abnormal megakaryocyte morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-02T16:37:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031388
name: Megakaryocyte nucleus hyperlobulation
synonym: "زيادة الفصوص في نواة الخلية النواء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في الفصوص في نواة الخلية النواء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود خلايا نواء في نخاع العظم تكون أنويتها أكثر تفرعاً مما هو متوقع بالنسبة لحجم النواة.
def: "The presence of megakaryocytes in the bone marrow whose nuclei are more lobulated than expected for the size of the nucleus." [PMID:27107657]
comment: A large megakaryocyte with a hyperlobulated nucleus is a cell that is larger than average size and has more nuclear lobulation than average. Some such megakaryocytes are seen in normal bone marrows but when they are present as an increased proportion they should be commented on. Increased numbers are seen sometimes in myelodysplastic syndrome but they are more frequent in myelodysplastic/myeloproliferative neoplasms (MDS/MPN) and in MPN, particularly essential thrombocythemia.
is_a: HP:0012143 ! Abnormal megakaryocyte morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-02T16:40:09Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

