[Term]
id: HP:0031432
name: Restricted or repetitive behaviors or interests
synonym: "السلوكيات أو الاهتمامات المقيدة أو المتكررة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "سلوكيات أو اهتمامات متكررة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مجموعة متنوعة من السلوكيات القسرية المتكررة، بما في ذلك الحركات النمطية البسيطة والعرات، وكذلك الحركات المتكررة أو الاضطرارية أكثر تعقيدًا.
def: "A broad range of compulsive behaviors are repeated, including simple motor stereotypies and tics, as well as more complex repetitive movements or compulsions." []
comment: Simple motor stereotypies often involve rhythmic or repetitive movements of specific components of the body including upper extremities or head and face, whereas more complex repetitive movements often include whole body movements (e.g., body rocking, self-hugging).
