[Term]
id: HP:0031436
name: Singsong Intonation
synonym: "تنغيم إنشاد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت مائل كالأنشودة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمط كلام يتميز بتقلبات غير طبيعية في شدة الصوت.
def: "A speech pattern characterized by abnormal fluctuations in the pitch of the voice." []
comment: Often accompanied by altered speech rate and rhythm.
synonym: "Melodic speech" EXACT []
synonym: "Sing song intonation" EXACT []
synonym: "Sing-song intonation" EXACT []
