[Term]
id: HP:0031505
name: Abnormal circulating T4 concentration
synonym: "خلل في تركيز T4 في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في مستوى هرمون الغدة الدرقية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف عن التركيز الطبيعي لهرمون الثيروكسين (T4) في الدم. الثيروكسين هو الهرمون الرئيسي الذي تفرزه الغدة الدرقية إلى الدم ويمكن تحويله إلى الشكل النشط ثلاثي يودو ثيرونين (T3).
def: "A deviation from the normal concentration of thyroxine in the blood. Thyroxine (also known as T4) is the main hormone secreted by the thyroid gland into the blood. It can be converted into the active form triiodothyronine (also known as T3)." []
synonym: "Abnormal circulating T4 level" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormal circulating thyroxine level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031508 ! Abnormal circulating thyroid hormone concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-21T01:52:52Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031506
name: Increased circulating T4 concentration
synonym: "زيادة في تركيز T4 في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة مستوى هرمون الغدة الدرقية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع فوق التركيز الطبيعي لهرمون الثيروكسين (T4) في الدم. الثيروكسين هو الهرمون الرئيسي الذي تفرزه الغدة الدرقية إلى الدم ويمكن تحويله إلى الشكل النشط ثلاثي يودو ثيرونين (T3).
def: "An elevation above the normal concentration of thyroxine in the blood. Thyroxine (also known as T4) is the main hormone secreted by the thyroid gland into the blood. It can be converted into the active form triiodothyronine (also known as T3)." []
synonym: "Increased circulating T4 level" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased circulating thyroxine level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031505 ! Abnormal circulating T4 concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-21T01:54:51Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031507
name: Decreased circulating T4 concentration
synonym: "انخفاض في تركيز T4 في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى هرمون الغدة الدرقية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض تحت التركيز الطبيعي لهرمون الثيروكسين (T4) في الدم. الثيروكسين هو الهرمون الرئيسي الذي تفرزه الغدة الدرقية إلى الدم ويمكن تحويله إلى الشكل النشط ثلاثي يودو ثيرونين (T3).
def: "A reduction below the normal concentration of thyroxine in the blood. Thyroxine (also known as T4) is the main hormone secreted by the thyroid gland into the blood. It can be converted into the active form triiodothyronine (also known as T3)." []
synonym: "Decreased circulating T4 level" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased circulating thyroxine level" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced T4 plasma level" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0031505 ! Abnormal circulating T4 concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-21T01:55:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031508
name: Abnormal circulating thyroid hormone concentration
synonym: "خلل في تركيز هرمون الغدة الدرقية في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في هرمونات الغدة الدرقية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن المدى الطبيعي للهرمونات التي تنتجها الغدة الدرقية.
def: "Any deviation from the normal range of the hormones produced by the thyroid gland." [PMID:28932413]
comment: Thyroid hormones (TH) are involved in the regulation of metabolism, proliferation, and growth of most tissues. Serum TH levels are tightly controlled by the hypothalamic, pituitary, and thyroid (HPT) axis to deliver appropriate amounts of TH to target tissues. The two major THs (T3 and T4) are iodothyrosines synthesized by the thyroid gland under the control of thyrotropin/thyroid stimulating hormone (TSH), a glycoprotein heterodimer that is produced by the pituitary gland. TSH, in turn, is regulated by thyrotropin releasing hormone (TRH), a tripeptide generated by the hypothalamus that is released into its own portal system to reach the pituitary. Both the production of TRH and TSH are under negative feedback control determined by the circulating free TH concentrations.
synonym: "Abnormal thyroid hormone level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002926 ! Abnormality of thyroid physiology
is_a: HP:0003117 ! Abnormal circulating hormone concentration
property_value: dc:date "2017-09-21T01:56:23Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

