[Term]
id: HP:0031628
name: Aborted sudden cardiac death
synonym: "وفاة قلبية مفاجئة تم معالجتها" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "توقف القلب المفاجئ تمت معالجته" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توقف القلب الذي كان سيؤدي إلى الوفاة السريعة والمفاجئة لولا تدخل ما حال دون ذلك.
def: "Cardiac arrest that would have led to rapid and unexpected death had an intervention not taken place to prevent it." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5835-5515, PMID:25187745]
synonym: "Sudden cardiac arrest" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0001695 ! Cardiac arrest
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-17T00:22:44Z" xsd:dateTime
