def: "An unusually severe Epstein Barr virus (EBV) infection." []
synonym: "Fulminant infectious mononucleosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Severe EBV infection" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031691 ! Severe viral infection
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-17T22:35:16Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031694
name: Severe adenovirus infection
synonym: "عدوى شديدة بفيروس الأدينو" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى قوية بفيروس الأدينو" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدوى شديدة بشكل غير اعتيادي بفيروس الأدينو.
def: "An unusually severe adenovirus infection." [PMID:24678403]
comment: Adenoviruses can cause an array of clinical diseases, including conjunctivitis, gastroenteritis, hepatitis, myocarditis, and pneumonia. Most of these occur in children younger than the age of 5 years and are generally self-limiting illnesses.
is_a: HP:0031691 ! Severe viral infection
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-17T22:36:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

