[Term]
id: HP:0031699
name: Disseminated cryptosporidium infection
synonym: "عدوى منتشرة بـ Cryptosporidium" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انتشار عدوى كريبتوسبوريديوم في الجسم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فشل في احتواء عدوى بطفيلي من جنس الكريبتوسبوريديوم، مما يؤدي إلى انتشاره إلى أجزاء عديدة من الجسم.
def: "Failure to contain infection by a protozoan of the genus Cryptosporidium, leading to spread to many parts of the body." []
is_a: HP:0020104 ! Unusual protozoan infection
is_a: HP:0031690 ! Opportunistic infection
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-17T22:46:38Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031700
name: Invasive parasitic infection
synonym: "عدوى طفيلية اجتياحية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى طفيلية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدوى طفيلية يتم فيها اجتياح الطفيلي لأنسجة العائل المصاب.
def: "A parasitic infection whereby the parasite invades (migrates through) tissues of the infected host." []
is_a: HP:0020108 ! Unusual parasitic infection
is_a: HP:0031690 ! Opportunistic infection
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-17T22:50:23Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031701
name: Anterior chamber inflammatory cells
synonym: "خلايا التهابية في الغرفة الأمامية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلايا ملتهبة في العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود خلايا التهابية في الخلط المائي للغرفة الأمامية للعين.
def: "The presence of inflammatory cells in the aqueous humor of the anterior chamber of the eye." []
comment: The terms for anterior chamber cells can be used to select the grade (total number of cells) and then Anterior chamber red blood cells or inflammatory cells can be chosen to specify whether one or both cells are present. In some scenarios, both cell types may be observed, e.g., followiong trauma.
is_a: HP:0000593 ! Abnormal anterior chamber morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-18T00:14:18Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031702
name: Anterior chamber red blood cells
synonym: "خلايا الدم الحمراء في الغرفة الأمامية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود دم في العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود كريات الدم الحمراء في الخلط المائي للغرفة الأمامية للعين.
def: "The presence of erythrocyte in the aqueous humor of the anterior chamber of the eye." []
comment: The terms for anterior chamber cells can be used to select the grade (total number of cells) and then Anterior chamber red blood cells or inflammatory cells can be chosen to specify whether one or both cells are present. In some scenarios, both cell types may be observed, e.g., followiong trauma.
synonym: "Anterior chamber RBCs" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0000593 ! Abnormal anterior chamber morphology
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-18T00:15:42Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031703
name: Abnormal ear morphology
synonym: "شذوذ شكل الأذن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شكل غير طبيعي للأذن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي خلل هيكلي في الأذن.
def: "Any structural anomaly of the ear." []
xref: Fyler:4867
is_a: HP:0000598 ! Abnormality of the ear
property_value: dc:date "2017-12-18T00:20:14Z" xsd:dateTime
