[Term]
id: HP:0031811
name: Bilirubinuria
synonym: "بيليروبينوريا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود بيليروبين في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود البيليروبين المقترن في البول.
def: "Presence of conjugated bilirubin in the urine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9969-8610]
comment: Bilirubinuria may lead to a dark yellow to orange color of the urine. Conjugated bilirubin is excreted in the urine and thus conjugated hyperbilirubinemia may lead to bilirubinuria.
