comment: Arabic Definition: خلل وظيفي في الفم (الذي يعرف أيضا بالتجويف الفموي).
def: "A functional anomaly of the mouth (which is also known as the oral cavity)." []
comment: The physiological functions of the mouth include salivary gland secretory function, mastication (chewing) and preparation of food for swallowing.
