[Term]
id: HP:0031838
name: Presence of xenobiotic
synonym: "وجود مادة كيميائية غريبة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مادة غريبة في الجسم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود مادة كيميائية داخل الفرد ليست منتجة بشكل طبيعي أو متوقعة أن تكون موجودة في أنسجة أو سوائل الجسم البشرية.
def: "Presence of a chemical substance found within an individual that is not naturally produced or expected to be present in human tissues or bodily fluids." []
comment: The presence of a xenobiotic in body tissues or fluids can be the result of ingestion of or exposure to substances such as drugs, environmental pollutants, food additives, hydrocarbons, and pesticides.
is_a: HP:0001939 ! Abnormality of metabolism/homeostasis
property_value: dc:date "2018-05-05T13:07:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

