[Term]
id: HP:0031841
name: Positive urine methadone test
synonym: "اختبار الميثادون الإيجابي في البول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود ميثادون في البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كشف الميثادون أو مستقبله 2-إيثيلدين-1،5-ثنائي ميثيل-3،3- ثنائي فينيل بيروليدين (EDDP) في البول.
def: "Detection of methadone or its metabolite 2-ethylidene-1,5-dimethyl-3,3- diphenylpyrrolidine (EDDP) in urine." []
comment: Methadone is an opioid drug that is used to treat severe pain or in the treatment of individiuals with opioid dependency.
is_a: HP:0031840 ! Urine xenobiotic
property_value: dc:date "2018-05-05T14:18:14Z" xsd:dateTime
