[Term]
id: HP:0031850
name: Abnormal hematocrit
synonym: "خلل في الهيماتوكريت" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في نسبة خلايا الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن النسبة الطبيعية لحجم خلايا الدم الحمراء بالنسبة إلى الحجم الكلي للدم.
def: "Any deviation from the normal ratio of the volume of red blood cells to the total volume of blood." []
comment: Note that the hematocrit is one of the measurements that can contribution to the diagnosis of anemia or polycythemia, which is coded separately.
synonym: "Abnormal Hct" EXACT abbreviation []
