synonym: "فرط التوتر العنقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شد في عضلات الرقبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في الصلابة أو التصلب السلبي لعضلات الرقبة.
def: "Increased passive stiffness or tightness of the neck musculature." []
is_a: HP:0001276 ! Hypertonia
property_value: dc:date "2018-05-05T21:31:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031868
name: Optic ataxia
synonym: "ترنح بصري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبة في التنسيق البصري" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: صعوبة في الوصول إلى أهداف موجهة بصريًا في الرؤية الطرفية، بينما تبقى حركات العين الإرادية غير متأثرة في الغالب.
def: "Difficulty reaching visually guided goals in peripheral vision, with the deficit, leaves voluntary eye movements largely unaffected." []
comment: Optic ataxia is related to a cortical neurological deficit that results from a lesion in the superior parietal lobule (SPL) and areas surrounding the intraparietal sulcus (IPS). The phenomenon is not considered apraxia (a disorder in executing learned behaviors), but rather a lack of coordination between visual input and motor outputs. Therefore, the term "ataxia," derived from the Greek word for "lack of order," is used.
is_a: HP:0001251 ! Ataxia
property_value: dc:date "2018-05-06T13:12:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

