[Term]
id: HP:0031990
name: Chvostek sign
synonym: "علامة شوستيك" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تقلص الوجه عند النقر على العصب الوجهي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تقلص في عضلات الوجه المقابلة بعد النقر على العصب الوجهي.
def: "A contraction of ipsilateral facial muscles subsequent to percussion over the facial nerve." [PMID:22970971, PMID:29443134]
comment: The Chvostek sign is considered to be a clinical indicator of hypocalcemia.
