[Term]
id: HP:0031992
name: Apical hypertrophic cardiomyopathy
synonym: "اعتلال العضلة القلبية الضخامي القمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضخم في قمة القلب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اعتلال العضلة القلبية الضخامي القمي هو خلل انبساطي ناجم عن تيبس غير طبيعي للبطين الأيسر خلال الانبساط، مع اضطراب لملء البطين. في هذا الاعتلال، تؤدي الأجزاء القمية السميكة إلى إنتاج تجويف قمي صغير يشبه مجرفة.
def: "Apical hypertrophic cardiomyopathy (AHCM) is diastolic dysfunction due to abnormal stiffness of the left ventricle during diastole, with resultant impaired ventricular filling. In AHCM thickened apical segments produce a crowded, spade-shaped, small apical cavity." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5835-5515, PMID:23109785, PMID:8685759]
is_a: HP:0001639 ! Hypertrophic cardiomyopathy
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-09T15:40:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031993
name: Hoffmann sign
synonym: "علامة هوفمان" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اختبار هوفمان" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يتم أداء اختبار هوفمان عن طريق نقر الظفر الطويل من الظهر إلى راحة اليد في كل يد بينما يدعم يد الشخص الممتحن المختبر. يتم إجراء الاختبار مع الرقبة في وضعها الطبيعي ثم مع انحناء الرقبة للأمام بأقصى حد. أي انحناء لإبهام اليد المتقابل أو إصبع السبابة يُفسر على أنه اختبار إيجابي.
def: "A Hoffmann test is performed by flicking the fingernail of the long finger, from dorsal to volar, on each hand while the hand was supported by the examiner's hand. The test was done with the neck in the neutral position and then with the neck maximally forward flexed. Any flexion of the ipsilateral thumb and/or index finger was interpreted as a positive test." [PMID:11813951, PMID:20229121]
comment: The Hoffmann sign is regarded to be test for disease of the corticospinal pathways.
synonym: "Hoffmann's sign" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0007256 ! Abnormal pyramidal sign
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T18:58:09Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031994
name: Bronchial breath sound
synonym: "الأنفاس الشعبية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت الأنفاس الشعبية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الأنفاس الشعبية تحتوي على مكونات تردد أعلى بكثير من الأنفاس العادية بسبب تغير وظيفة التصفية المنخفضة من الحويصلات الهوائية، كما يحدث في التكاثف. يكون الصوت عاليًا، وجوفاء، ونبرة مرتفعة. مدة الزفير أطول من الشهيق بنسبة 1:2 مقارنة بنسبة 3:1 الطبيعية. يوجد توقف مميز بين الشهيق والزفير بسبب غياب المرحلة الحويصلية. يرتبط مع وجود الهمسات القصوية.
def: "Bronchial breath sounds contain much higher frequency components than normal breath sounds due to alteration of the low pass filtering function of the alveoli, as occurs in consolidation. It is loud, hollow, and high pitch. Expiratory phase is longer than inspiratory phase with the inspiratory-expiratory ratio (I:E) changing from normal 3:1 to 1:2. There is distinct pause between inspiration and expiration due to absent alveolar phase. It is associated with whispering pectoriloquy." [PMID:26229557]
is_a: HP:0030829 ! Abnormal breath sound
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T19:45:30Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031995
name: Squawks
synonym: "الصراخات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت الصراخات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الصراخات هي أزيز داخل الشهيق تكون مدته أقل من 200 مللي ثانية وتعرف أيضًا بالصراخات. تُظهر التحليلات الصوتية أن التردد الأساسي يتراوح بين 200 و300 هرتز. عادة ما تحدث الصراخات في نهاية الشهيق وغالبًا ما تسبقها فرقعة شهيقية متأخرة.
def: "Squawks are short inspiratory wheezes of less than 200 ms duration and are also known as squeaks. Acoustic analysis shows the fundamental frequency varying between 200 and 300 Hz. Squawks usually occur in late inspiration and are often preceded by late inspiratory crackles." [PMID:26229557]
comment: Squawks are found in pulmonary fibrosis of various causes, particularly in hypersensitivity pneumonitis. Other causes are detected in pneumonia and bronchiolitis obliterans.
is_a: HP:0030828 ! Wheezing
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T19:48:18Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031996
name: Inspiratory crackles
synonym: "فرقعات شهيقية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت فرقعات شهيقية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الفرقعات التي تُسمع خلال مرحلة الشهيق.
def: "Crackles that are heard during the inspiratory phase." [PMID:26229557]
is_a: HP:0030830 ! Crackles
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T21:46:52Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031997
name: Early inspiratory crackles
synonym: "فرقعات شهيقية مبكرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت فرقعات شهيقية مبكرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الفرقعات التي تظهر في بداية الشهيق وتنتهي قبل منتصف الشهيق.
def: "Crackles that appear at the beginning of inspiration and end before mid-inspiration." [PMID:26229557]
comment: Early inspiratory crackles may be observed, for example, in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD). Crackles in COPD patients are scanty, gravity-independent, usually audible at the mouth, and strongly associated with severe airway obstruction. Crackles start early in inspiration and usually end before the midpoint of inspiration.
is_a: HP:0031996 ! Inspiratory crackles
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T21:47:37Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031998
name: Late inspiratory crackles
synonym: "فرقعات شهيقية متأخرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت فرقعات شهيقية متأخرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الفرقعات التي تظهر في أي وقت بعد بداية الشهيق وتستمر حتى نهاية الشهيق.
def: "Crackles that appear any time after the beginning of inspiration and last till the end of inspiration." [PMID:26229557]
comment: Late inspiratory crackles may be observed, for example, in diffuse parenchymal lung disease (DPLD). Crackles are commonly seen in patients with IPF/usual interstitial pneumonia (UIP), asbestosis, and desquamative interstitial pneumonia (DIP).
is_a: HP:0031996 ! Inspiratory crackles
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T21:49:08Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0031999
name: Expiratory crackles
synonym: "فرقعات زفيرية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت فرقعات زفيرية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الفرقعات التي تحدث خلال مرحلة الزفير.
def: "Crackles that occur during expiration." [PMID:26229557]
comment: Crackles are predominantly inspiratory in nature, but can also occur during expiration. It has been described in COPD, bronchiectasis, and IPF. One theory of the pathogenesis of expritory crackles states that some airways collapse during early expiration and air trapping develops. As expiration progresses, the pressure in the trapped region gradually increase, leading to a widened pressure difference across the airways. Once this pressure difference reaches the critical opening pressure, the airway pops open during expiration, producing crackles.
is_a: HP:0030830 ! Crackles
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T21:50:28Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032000
name: Pleural rub
synonym: "احتكاك الجنبي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت احتكاك الجنبي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: صوت تنفسي غير طبيعي وقصير وانفجاري. يكون الصوت خشنًا ومحتكًا أو يشبه صوت الجلد ويتواجد في كلا المرحلتين التنفسيتين. عادة يكون جزء الزفير معكوسًا لجزء الشهيق. يحدث بسبب احتكاك الأسطح الجنبي الملتهبة مع بعضها أثناء التنفس. من المهم تفريقه سريريًا عن الفرقعات.
def: "An abnormal breath sound that is nonmusical, short and explosive. It is grating, rubbing, creaky, or leathery in character and present in both phases of respiration. Typically the expiratory component mirrors the inspiratory component. It occurs due to inflamed pleural surface rubbing each other during breathing. Clinically, it is important to differentiate it from crackles" [PMID:26229557]
is_a: HP:0030829 ! Abnormal breath sound
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-15T21:53:13Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

