synonym: "لون البول وردي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: لون غير طبيعي للبول يتميز باللون الوردي.
def: "An abnormal pink color of urine." []
comment: Pink urine color may indicate blood or be a consequence of the ingestion of certain food such as beets, blackberries and rhubarb.
