[Term]
id: HP:0032005
name: Hemidystonia
synonym: "نصف توترية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل الحركة في نصف الجسم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تُشير نصف التوترية إلى الخلل التوتري الذي يشمل الوجه والذراع والساق في نفس الجانب من الجسم.
def: "Hemidystonia refers to dystonia which involves the ipsilateral face, arm, and leg." [PMID:11784827, PMID:4031909]
comment: In most cases of hemidystonia, a contralateral structural lesion of the basal ganglia or thalamus can be demonstrated by neuroimaging. Common aetiologies include stroke and trauma, and younger patients seem to have a greater propensity to develop hemidystonia after cerebral insults. There is often a latency between cerebral injury and the onset of dystonia. Hemidystonia may be preceded by ipsilateral hemiparesis which often resolves as hemidystonia develops.
is_a: HP:0001332 ! Dystonia
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-17T12:51:59Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032006
name: Lip tremor
synonym: "رعشة الشفاه" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "رعشة في الشفاه" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حركة عضلية غير مقصودة، تتأرجح ذهابًا وإيابًا، تؤثر على الشفاه.
def: "An unintentional, oscillating to-and-fro muscle movement affecting the lip." []
is_a: HP:0030188 ! Tremor by anatomical site
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-17T13:06:59Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032007
name: Maceration
synonym: "تخمر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تلف الجلد بسبب الرطوبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نعومة وتحلل الجلد الناتج عن التعرض الطويل للرطوبة. يصبح الجلد المُخمر ناعماً ومتجعداً ويأخذ لوناً أبيض.
def: "A softening and breaking down of skin resulting from prolonged exposure to moisture. Macerated skin becomes soft and wrinkly and takes on a whitish hue." [PMID:12192848]
synonym: "Maceration of the skin" EXACT []
synonym: "Skin maceration" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011121 ! Abnormal skin morphology
property_value: dc:date "2018-07-17T13:09:36Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032008
name: Pulmonary fat embolism
synonym: "انصمام شحمي رئوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انسداد رئوي بسبب الدهون" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تحرر كريات الدهون في الدورة الدموية الوريدية مما يؤدي إلى انسداد الدورة الدموية إلى الرئة.
def: "The release of fat globules into the venous circulation, thereby blocking blood circulation to the lung." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, PMID:24468004]
synonym: "Fat embolism" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002204 ! Pulmonary embolism
