[Term]
id: HP:0032016
name: Abnormal sputum
synonym: "شذوذ في البلغم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بلغم غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الشكل غير الطبيعي للمادة التي تُخرج (تُسعل) من الجهاز التنفسي والمكونة من المخاط وقد تحتوي على مواد أخرى مثل القيح، الدم، الكائنات الدقيقة، والفايبرين.
def: "Abnormal appearance of material expectorated (coughed up) from the respiratory system and that is composed of mucus but may contain other substances such as pus, blood, microorganisms, and fibrin." []
synonym: "Abnormal sputum morphology" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012252 ! Abnormal respiratory system morphology
property_value: dc:date "2018-08-25T12:36:36Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032017
name: Sputum eosinophilia
synonym: "زيادة اليوزينيات في البلغم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة خلايا الدم البيضاء في البلغم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في نسبة اليوزينيات في البلغم في تعداد الخلايا المتمايزة.
def: "An increased proportion of eosinophils in sputum in the differentiated cell count." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:23741092, PMID:29146301]
comment: Sputum eosinophilia can be measured in various ways including measuring the mean percentage of eosinophils in the cell count of sputum induced by application of saline. The threshold chosen differs between studies, typically ranging from 1.25 to 3 percent. Increased sputum eosinophil counts may indicate a risk for severe chronic obstructive pulmonary disease or severe asthma.
is_a: HP:0032016 ! Abnormal sputum
property_value: dc:date "2018-08-25T12:39:58Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032018
name: Multiple mononeuropathy
synonym: "اعتلال العصب الأحادي المتعدد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تلف الأعصاب في مناطق متعددة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الاعتلال العصبي المحيطي يحدث عندما يكون هناك تلف في منطقتين أو أكثر من المناطق العصبية المختلفة يتميز باعتلال عصبي محيطي للأعصاب الحركية والحسية في جذوع عصبية مختلفة على الأقل. تتأثر الأعصاب المختلفة إما في نفس الوقت أو بالتتابع.
def: "A type of peripheral neuropathy that happens when there is damage to two or more different nerve areas characterized by peripheral neuropathy of both the motor and sensory nerves of at least two different nerve trunks. Different nerves are affected either simultaneously or sequentially." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:25494723]
comment: Mononeuritis multiplex can be a manifestation of several disorders including infectious, inflammatory, neoplastic, toxic, metabolic and hereditary conditions.
synonym: "Mononeuritis multiplex" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0009830 ! Peripheral neuropathy
property_value: dc:date "2018-08-25T15:36:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032019
name: Muscle eosinophilia
synonym: "تواجد اليوزينيات في العضلات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تواجد خلايا اليوزينيات في العضلات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تسلل خلايا اليوزينيات إلى العضلات الهيكلية بشكل غير طبيعي.
def: "Eosinophil infiltration of skeletal muscle." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:24424174, PMID:24803842]
comment: This phenotype can be measured by determining the number and location of eosinophils in skeletal muscle biopsies by Giemsa and modified hematoxylin/eosin staining. However, infiltrating eosinophils are not always identified in conventional muscle histologic examination, but the eosinophil major basic protein, whose extracellular diffusion is considered a hallmark of eosinophilic cytotoxicity, is usually detected by immunostaining in muscle biopsy.
synonym: "Eosinophilic infiltration of skeletal muscle" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011805 ! Abnormal skeletal muscle morphology
property_value: dc:date "2018-08-25T15:42:46Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032020
name: Eosinophilic bladder infiltration
synonym: "تسلل اليوزينيات في المثانة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تواجد خلايا اليوزينيات في المثانة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب شامل لجدار المثانة يغلب عليه تواجد اليوزينيات، يترافق مع تليف وقد يحدث ضرر للأنسجة العضلية.
def: "Transmural inflammation of the bladder predominantly with eosinophils, associated with fibrosis with or without muscle necrosis." [PMID:15857336, PMID:28829677]
synonym: "Eosinophilic cystitis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025487 ! Abnormal bladder morphology
property_value: dc:date "2018-08-25T15:48:26Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032021
name: Eosinophilic liver infiltration
synonym: "تسلل اليوزينيات في الكبد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تواجد خلايا اليوزينيات في الكبد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تسلل الخلايا في نسيج الكبد الأساسي مع غلبة خلايا اليوزينيات.
def: "Cellular infiltration of the liver parenchyma with a preponderance of eosinophils." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:20457690, PMID:7835024]
synonym: "Eosinophilic hepatitis" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0030146 ! Abnormal liver parenchyma morphology
is_a: HP:0032064 ! Gastrointestinal eosinophilia
property_value: dc:date "2018-08-25T15:51:03Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032022
name: Eosinophilic dermal infiltration
synonym: "تسلل اليوزينيات في الأدمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تواجد خلايا اليوزينيات في الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود زيادة غير طبيعية في الخلايا الالتهابية داخل البشرة مع غلبة خلايا اليوزينيات.
def: "Presence of abnormally increased amounts of intraepidermal inflammatory cells with a predominance of eosinophils." [PMID:23730155, PMID:6724778]
synonym: "Eosinophilic dermatitis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011123 ! Inflammatory abnormality of the skin
property_value: dc:date "2018-09-01T13:38:35Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032023
name: Eosinophilic gallbladder infiltration
synonym: "تسلل اليوزينيات في المرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تواجد خلايا اليوزينيات في المرارة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تأكد من خلال التفحص النسيجي لجدار المرارة بتواجد خلايا اليوزينيات بشكل أساسي.
def: "Cellular infiltrate confirmed by a cellular infiltrate comprised of mainly eosinophils in the gallbladder wall on histological examination." [PMID:27872806]
synonym: "Eosinophilic cholecystitis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012437 ! Abnormal gallbladder morphology
is_a: HP:0032064 ! Gastrointestinal eosinophilia
property_value: dc:date "2018-09-01T13:49:40Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032024
name: Ileal ulcer
synonym: "قرحة في اللفائفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قرحة في الأمعاء الدقيقة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تآكل في الغشاء المخاطي لجزء من الأمعاء الدقيقة.
def: "An erosion of the mucous membrane in a portion of the ileum." [PMID:28670609]
is_a: HP:0001549 ! Abnormal ileum morphology
is_a: HP:0034274 ! Gastrointestinal ulcer
property_value: dc:date "2018-09-01T14:06:31Z" xsd:dateTime
