[Term]
id: HP:0032130
name: Mycobacterium abscessus abscessus infection
synonym: "عدوى المتفطرة الخراجية الخراجية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى المتفطرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشمل مجمع المتفطرة الخراجية الخراجية مجموعة من المتفطرات اللابدرية سريعة النمو والمقاومة للأدوية المتعددة والتي تسبب مجموعة واسعة من الأمراض الجلدية والأنسجة الرخوة، والتهابات الجهاز العصبي المركزي، وتجرثم الدم والتهابات العيون وغيرها.
def: "Mycobacterium abscessus complex comprises a group of rapidly growing, multidrug-resistant, nontuberculous mycobacteria that are responsible for a wide spectrum of skin and soft tissue diseases, central nervous system infections, bacteremia, and ocular and other infections." [PMID:26295364]
is_a: HP:0032260 ! Opportunistic bacterial infection
property_value: dc:date "2018-11-22T13:30:48Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032131
name: Cervical dysplasia
synonym: "خلل تنسجي في عنق الرحم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في خلايا عنق الرحم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الخلل التنسجي في عنق الرحم هو مقدمة لسرطان عنق الرحم. يحدث بسبب العدوى المستمرة بفيروس الورم الحليمي البشري (HPV) في نسيج عنق الرحم. تطور الخلايا المصابة ميزات مورفولوجية مع خلايا قاعدية غير ناضجة ونشاط انقسامي في النصف العلوي من الظهارة العنقية.
def: "Cervical dysplasia is the precursor to cervical cancer. It is caused by the persistent infection of the human papillomavirus (HPV) into the cervical tissue. Affected cells develop morphologic features with immature basaloid- type squamous cells and mitotic figures in the upper half of the cervical epithelium." [PMID:12525422]
synonym: "Uterine cervix dysplasia" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012888 ! Abnormal uterine cervix morphology
property_value: dc:date "2018-11-22T13:45:16Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032132
name: Decreased circulating total IgG concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز إجمالي الأجسام المضادة IgG في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض الأجسام المضادة IgG" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض أقل من المستوى الطبيعي لمجموع الجلوبولين المناعي G (IgG) في الدم.
def: "A reduction beneath the normal level of total immunoglobulin G (IgG) in the blood." [PMID:17910333]
comment: Reductions in total IgG levels in adolescents or adults may be classified as mild-moderate (300-600 mg/dL), significant (100-299 mg/dL), or profoundly reduced (less than 100 mg/dL). In adolescents and adults, a total immunoglobulin (IgG + IgM + IgA) level greater than 600 mg/dL, with confirmed normal antibody responses, probably excludes humoral deficiency. Total immunoglobulin levels of 400 to 600 mg/dL or IgG levels of 200 to 400 mg/dL may contain adequate amounts of antibody; this becomes less likely if total immunoglobulin levels are less than 400 mg/dL or serum IgG levels are less than 200 mg/dL.
synonym: "Decreased circulating total IgG" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0004315 ! Decreased circulating IgG concentration
property_value: dc:date "2018-11-22T14:04:50Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032133
name: Transient decreased circulating total IgG
synonym: "انخفاض مؤقت في تركيز إجمالي IgG في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض مؤقت للأجسام المضادة IgG" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض مؤقت أقل من المستوى الطبيعي لمجموع الجلوبولين المناعي G (IgG) في الدم.
def: "A temporary reduction beneath the normal level of total immunoglobulin G (IgG) in the blood." []
is_a: HP:0032132 ! Decreased circulating total IgG concentration
property_value: dc:date "2018-11-22T14:08:44Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032134
name: Chronic decreased circulating total IgG
synonym: "انخفاض مزمن في تركيز إجمالي IgG في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض مزمن للأجسام المضادة IgG" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض مستمر أقل من المستوى الطبيعي لمجموع الجلوبولين المناعي G (IgG) في الدم.
def: "A lasting reduction beneath the normal level of total immunoglobulin G (IgG) in the blood." []
synonym: "Chronic decreased total IgG in blood" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032132 ! Decreased circulating total IgG concentration
property_value: dc:date "2018-11-22T14:09:15Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032135
name: Decreased circulating IgG subclass concentration
synonym: "انخفاض تركيز فئات الأجسام المضادة IgG في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض فئات الأجسام المضادة IgG" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض تحت التركيز الطبيعي لفئة من الجلوبولين المناعي G (IgG) في الدم.
def: "A reduction below the normal concentration of a subclass of immunoglobulin G (IgG) in the blood." [PMID:17910333]
comment: IgG subclass deficiency is defined as a reduction in 1 or more subclasses of IgG (IgG1 and IgG2 in particular) by more than 2 SDs below the mean for age-matched controls. Deficiencies in IgG1 or IgG2 are more likely to cause low serum IgG levels because these are the major components. IgG1 levels stabilize by the age of 5 years; however, adult levels of IgG2, IgG3, and IgG4 may not be achieved until adolescence. Thus, the interpretation of subclass levels is additionally problematic because levels of each subclass increase at different rates during development.
synonym: "Decreased circulating IgG subclass level" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased IgG subclass level in blood" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0004315 ! Decreased circulating IgG concentration
property_value: dc:date "2018-11-22T14:26:10Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

