synonym: "انخفاض نوع معين من الأجسام المضادة في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في مستويات الجلوبولين المناعي من النوع IgG1 في الدورة الدموية.
def: "A reduction in immunoglobulin levels of the IgG1 subclass in the blood circulation." []
synonym: "Decreased circulating IgG1 level" EXACT []
synonym: "Decreased IgG1 level in blood" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032135 ! Decreased circulating IgG subclass concentration
property_value: dc:date "2018-11-22T14:29:21Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032137
