[Term]
id: HP:0032169
name: Severe infection
synonym: "عدوى شديدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى قوية جدًا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من العدوى يعتبر مؤشرًا على حساسية مرضية للإصابة لأن العدوى تكون غير عادية في شدتها أو كثافتها.
def: "A type of infection that is regarded as a sign of a pathological susceptibility to infection because of unusual severity or intensity of the infection." []
synonym: "Unusual course of infection" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032101 ! Unusual infection
property_value: dc:date "2018-12-16T15:11:20Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032170
name: Severe varicella zoster infection
synonym: "عدوى شديدة بالحماق النطاقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى حادة بفيروس الحماق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل غير عادٍ حاد من عدوى فيروس الحماق النطاقي (VZV). في الأغلبية، خاصة الأطفال، يكون المرض خفيفًا يتميز بالآفات الجلدية وحمى خفيفة وتعب. العدوى الشديدة تتصف بظهور أعراض تشمل الالتهاب الرئوي VZV و التهاب الكبد و التهاب السحايا والحماق المنتشر.
def: "An unusually severe form of varicella zoster virus (VZV) infection. In the majority of the cases, especially in children, varicella is a very mild infection characterized by skin lesions, low grade fever and malaise. Severe infection is characterized by manifestations including VZV pneumonia, hepatitis, meningitis, and disseminated varicella." [PMID:21748081, PMID:23248376]
comment: Varicella-zoster virus (VZV) is one of eight herpes viruses known to cause human infection and is distributed worldwide. Varicella zoster infections are considered to be mild and ubiquitous infections predominantly affecting the pediatric population. However, in adults and in specific groups of patients, such as those who are immunosuppressed, varicella infections can be fulminant and life threatening.
is_a: HP:0031691 ! Severe viral infection
property_value: dc:date "2018-12-16T15:12:18Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032171
name: Bladder pain
synonym: "ألم المثانة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجع في المثانة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير مريح يتميز بانزعاج جسدي (مثل الوخز أو النبض أو الألَم) متمركز في المثانة البولية. قد يشتد ألم المثانة عند امتلائها ويختفي بعد التبول، ولكن ليس دائمًا.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the urinary bladder. Bladder pain may be more pronounced with a full bladder and relieved upon urination, but this is not always the case." []
is_a: HP:0012531 ! Pain
property_value: dc:date "2018-12-16T15:23:31Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

