[Term]
id: HP:0032276
name: Prominent subcalcaneal fat pad
synonym: "وسادة دهنية تحت العقبي البارزة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وسادة دهنية سميكة تحت الكعب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في بروز الوسادة الدهنية تحت الكعب. يمكن ملاحظة هذه الخاصية في الشكل 1 من PMID:26769062.
def: "Abnormally increased prominence of the fat pad underneath the heal. This feature can be appreciated in figure 1 of PMID:26769062." [PMID:26769062]
comment: This pad normally protects the foot against the forces to which it is exposed during the ground contact phase of each step.
