[Term]
id: HP:0032296
name: Increased circulating IgG subclass
synonym: "زيادة فئة فرعية منتشرة للـ IgG" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع في نوع معين من الأضداد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في مستوى الـ IgG المنتشر بشكل رئيسي متعلقة بزيادة واحدة من الفئات الفرعية الأربعة للـ IgG.
def: "An elevation of circulating IgG level predominantly related to an elevation of one of the four IgG subclasses." [PMID:25368619]
comment: The four subclasses, IgG1, IgG2, IgG3, and IgG4, which are highly conserved, differ in their constant region, particularly in their hinges and upper CH2 domains. These regions are involved in binding to both IgG-Fc receptors (Fc-gammaR) and C1q. As a result, the different subclasses have different effector functions,
is_a: HP:0003237 ! Increased circulating IgG concentration
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-12T22:46:56Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032297
name: Increased circulating IgG3 level
synonym: "زيادة مستوى IgG3 المنتشر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع في IgG3" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في تركيز النوع الفرعي IgG3 في الدورة الدموية.
def: "An abnormally increased concentration of the IgG3 subtype in the blood circulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8169-9049, PMID:25368619]
comment: IgG3 antibodies are particularly effective in the induction of effector functions.
is_a: HP:0032296 ! Increased circulating IgG subclass
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-12T22:50:02Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032298
name: Increased circulating IgG1 level
synonym: "زيادة مستوى IgG1 في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في IgG1 في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في تركيز النمط الفرعي IgG1 في الدورة الدموية.
def: "An abnormally increased concentration of the IgG1 subtype in the blood circulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8169-9049, PMID:25368619]
comment: Antibody responses to soluble protein antigens and membrane proteins primarily induce IgG1, but are accompanied with lower levels of the other subclasses, mostly IgG3 and IgG4. Because IgG1 is normally the most abundant subclass, a lack of IgG1 seen in a variety of primary and secondary antibody deficiencies, can result in decreased total IgG levels (hypogammaglobulinemia). IgG1 deficiencies, sometimes in combination with other IgG subclass deficiencies, are associated with recurrent infections.
is_a: HP:0032296 ! Increased circulating IgG subclass
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-12T22:52:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032299
name: Increased circulating IgG2 level
synonym: "زيادة مستوى IgG2 في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في IgG2 في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في تركيز النمط الفرعي IgG2 في الدورة الدموية.
def: "An abnormally increased concentration of the IgG2 subtype in the blood circulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8169-9049, PMID:25368619]
comment: Immunoglobulin G-antibody responses to bacterial capsular polysaccharide antigens can be almost completely restricted to IgG2.
is_a: HP:0032296 ! Increased circulating IgG subclass
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-12T22:55:31Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032300
name: Increased circulating IgG4 level
synonym: "زيادة مستوى IgG4 في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في IgG4 في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في تركيز النمط الفرعي IgG4 في الدورة الدموية.
def: "An abnormally increased concentration of the IgG4 subtype in the blood circulation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8169-9049, PMID:25368619]
comment: Allergens are often good inducers of IgG1 and IgG4, in addition to IgE. IgG4 antibodies are often formed following repeated or long-term exposure to antigen in a non-infectious setting and may become the dominant subclass.
is_a: HP:0032296 ! Increased circulating IgG subclass
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-12T22:56:05Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032301
name: Genital warts
synonym: "ثآليل تناسلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ثآليل في المنطقة الحساسة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الثآليل التي تؤثر على الجلد في المنطقة التناسلية (جذع القضيب، الصفن، المهبل أو الشفرتين الكبيرتين). يمكن أن تبدأ الثآليل صغيرة بحجم رأس الدبوس وقد تكبر وتصبح ذات مظهر حامل. يمكن أن تنتشر الثآليل وتندمج في كتل كبيرة في المنطقة التناسلية أو الشرجية. لونها يمكن أن يكون مختلفاً ولكن يميل لأن يكون بلون الجلد أو أغمق، وقد تنزف أحياناً. قد تسبب الثآليل حكة، واحمرار، أو عدم ارتياح. حدوث ثآليل تناسلية قد يسبب ضغوطاً نفسية.
def: "Warts affecting the skin in the genital area (penile shaft, scrotum, vagina, or labia majora). Warts can be small, beginning as a pinhead-size swelling that may become larger and take on a pedunculated appearance. Warts can spread and coalesce into large masses in the genital or anal area. Their color is variable but tends to be skin colored or darker, and they may occasionally bleed. Warts may cause itching, redness, or discomfort. An outbreak of genital warts may also cause psychological distress." [PMID:28722914]
comment: Genital warts are the clinical manifestations of a sexually transmitted disease caused by some types of human papillomavirus (HPV).
is_a: HP:0200043 ! Verrucae
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-12T23:10:40Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

