[Term]
id: HP:0032304
name: Abnormal circulating mannose-binding protein concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز بروتين ربط المانوز في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى غير طبيعي لبروتين ربط المانوز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن التركيز الطبيعي لبروتين ربط المانوز في الدورة الدموية.
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of mannose-binding protein in the blood circulation." []
comment: Mannose-binding protein is encoded by the MBL2 gene. It is a calcium-dependent lectin involved in innate immune defense and that binds mannose, fucose and N-acetylglucosamine on different microorganisms and activates the lectin complement pathway.
is_a: HP:0010876 ! Abnormal circulating protein concentration
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-12T23:27:46Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

