def: "An abnormal reduction in the amount of air a person can forcefully expel in one second." []
synonym: "Reduced FEV1" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0030878 ! Abnormality on pulmonary function testing
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-21T12:54:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

