[Term]
id: HP:0032416
name: Retinal microaneurysm
synonym: "تمدد الأوعية الدموية الدقيقة في الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضخم في شرايين الشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توسع موضعي أو انتفاخ في الأوعية الدموية الدقيقة الناجم عن تمزق جدار الوعاء الدموي في شعيرات دموية شبكية. تظهر الآفات كنقاط حمراء صغيرة ذات حدود واضحة ولا يتجاوز حجمها عرض وعاء دموي عند حافة القرص.
alt_id: HP:0008014
alt_id: HP:0030494
def: "A localized dilation or outpouching of microvasculature formed due to disruption of the vessel wall of a retinal capillary blood vessel. The lesions present as small red dots with distinct margins and are not larger than a blood vessel width at the disk margin." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, PMID:23371018, PMID:24425852]
comment: A microaneurysm may be a focal bulge or have a saccular, fusiform, or mixed appearance. Multiple microaneurysm may be observed in any part of the fundus.
is_a: HP:0008046 ! Abnormal retinal vascular morphology
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-26T13:58:30Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032417
name: Periglomerular fibrosis
synonym: "التليف المحيطي حول الكبيبي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تليف حول كبسولة بومان" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تليف دائري في النسيج الخلالي المحيط بكبسولة بومان.
def: "Circumferential fibrosis in the interstitium surrounding Bowman's capsule" [PMID:21204717, PMID:32866505]
comment: Periglomerular fibrosis is characterized by glomeruli with open capillaries, but lamellated, frequently wrinkled, Bowman capsular basement membrane and circumferential layers of interstitial-type collagen around, within, or between the usually thickened, frequently lamellated, Bowman capsule basement membrane.
synonym: "Periglomerular fibrotic thickening" EXACT []
xref: PMID:32866505
is_a: HP:0031264 ! Abnormal Bowman capsule morphology
property_value: dc:date "2019-02-26T14:20:31Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032418
name: Abnormal HDL subfraction concentration
synonym: "خلل في تركيز الجزء الفرعي من HDL" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في جزء من الكوليسترول الجيد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في تركيز جزء فرعي من جزيئات HDL، ويمكن تحديده بطرق مثل الفصل الكهربائي يليه تحديد كثافة المناطق تحت الذروة.
def: "An abnormal concentration of an HDL subfraction, which can be determined by methods such as electrophoresis followed by densitometric determination of the areas under the peaks. Large HDL subfractions are defined as HDL1 (greater than 12 nm), HDL2b (9.7-12 nm), and HDL2a (8.8-9.69 nm). Small HDL subfractions are defined as HDL3a (8.2-8.79 nm), HDL3b (7.8-8.19 nm), and HDL3c (7.20-7.79 nm)." [PMID:17291473]
comment: Traditionally, HDL is separated into two major subclasses (HDL2 and HDL3), but depending on the separation method used, u[ to 10 subfractions have been reported.
is_a: HP:0031888 ! Abnormal HDL cholesterol concentration
property_value: dc:date "2019-03-02T13:28:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032419
name: Abnormal HDL2a concentration
synonym: "خلل في تركيز HDL2a" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في جزء معين من الكوليسترول الجيد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن التركيز الطبيعي للجزء الفرعي HDL2a في الدوران الدموي، حيث تُعرف جزئيات HDL2a بأنها ذات حجم يتراوح من 8.80 إلى 9.69 نانومتر.
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of the HDL2a subfraction in the blood circulation. An HDL2a particle is defined as an HDL particle with a size of 8.80-9.69 nm." [PMID:17291473]
is_a: HP:0032418 ! Abnormal HDL subfraction concentration
property_value: dc:date "2019-03-02T13:30:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032420
name: Increased HDL2a concentration
synonym: "زيادة تركيز HDL2a" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في HDL2a" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع فوق التركيز الطبيعي للجزيء الفرعي HDL2a في الدورة الدموية. يتم تعريف جسيم HDL2a كجسيم به حجم 8.80-9.69 نانومتر.
def: "An elevation above the normal concentration of the HDL2a subfraction in the blood circulation. An HDL2a particle is defined as an HDL particle with a size of 8.80-9.69 nm." [PMID:17291473]
is_a: HP:0032419 ! Abnormal HDL2a concentration
property_value: dc:date "2019-03-02T13:40:40Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

