comment: Arabic Definition: نتوءات عضلية تبرز داخل تجويف المثانة، تعبر جدران المثانة على سطحها الداخلي.
def: "Muscular projections that protrude into the lumen of the bladder, criss-crossing the walls of the bladder on its inner surface." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, PMID:28904941]
comment: Bladder trabeculation is caused by morphological and histological changes due to hypertrophy and hyperplasia of the bladder muscle and the infiltration of the connective tissue.
