comment: Arabic Definition: يتميز هوس قضم الأظافر بالرغبة القهرية أو التي لا تقاوم لدى المرضى للعبث بالأظافر وسحبها أو قضمها بطريقة مؤذية.
def: "Onychotillomania is characterized by the compulsive or irresistible urge in patients to pick at, pull off, or harmfully bite or chew their nails." []
comment: Onychotillomania should not be confused with onychophagia, which refers to self-induced damage to nails caused by nail biting.
