[Term]
id: HP:0032537
name: Delayed fracture healing
synonym: "تأخر التئام الكسور" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الشفاء من الكسر يستغرق وقتًا أطول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تأخر في شفاء الكسر بعد المدة المتوقعة.
def: "A delay in healing of a fracture past the expected duration." [PMID:24857030]
comment: Initially, after injury a hematoma forms and this is followed by inflammatory cells arriving at the fracture site to debride the wound. During the soft callus phase of healing a collar of bone forms at the periosteum adjacent to the fractured bone, and cells in the periosteum proliferate and differentiate into chondrocytes that form cartilage that bridges the fracture gap. During the hard callus phase, the cartilage is replaced by bone through endochondral ossification, possibly by transformation of some of the chondrocytes into osteoblasts. Finally, through remodeling, newly formed bone is restored to its pre-injured state. Depending on the site of the fracture, healing usually takes from 3 to 12 weeks in healthy adults.
is_a: HP:0011843 ! Abnormal musculoskeletal physiology
property_value: dc:date "2019-05-27T13:23:40Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032538
name: Pretibial dimple
synonym: "ثلم أمام الظنبوب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تجويف على الساق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أخدود أو تجويف على الساق أمام عظم الظنبوب. الثلمات أمام الظنبوب قد تكون واضحة عند الولادة وتتراوح من 3 سم إلى أكثر من 15 سم بالطول وتزداد طولاً مع نمو الطرف. تظهر كتجويف مطول بسبب تعلق الجلد بالنسيج العلوي (مثل الظنبوب). يزداد التجويف أو الأخدود طولاً متناسباً مع نمو الساق.
def: "A groove or crease on the shins (pretibial, i.e., over the shin bone). Pretibial creases may be obvious at birth and may range from 3 cm to over 15 cm in length and lengthen as the limb grows. They appear as an elongated dimple because of the attachment of skin to underlying tissue (e.g., to the tibia). The dimple or crease grows in proportion to the growth of the leg." [PMID:23444103]
is_a: HP:0010781 ! Skin dimple
property_value: dc:date "2019-05-27T13:33:38Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

