comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة معرفية بؤرية تتميز بعسر القراءة أو فقدان القدرة على القراءة كتجلي أولي.
def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by dyslexia / alexia as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Dyslexia / alexia is the inability to read due to an impairment in understanding written words rather than visual impairment. This seizure type is seen in seizures involving the dominant hemisphere parieto-temporal lobe region.
is_a: HP:0032680 ! Focal cognitive seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

