def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by dysgraphia / agraphia as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Dysgraphia / agraphia is difficulty in writing. This seizure type is seen in seizures involving the dominant hemisphere parieto-temporal lobe region.
