def: "A focal cognitive seizure characterized by expressive dysphasia / aphasia as the initial semiological manifestation." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Expressive dysphasia / aphasia is the inability to express one's thoughts despite being aware of what they wished to say because of a disorder of language rather than articulation.
