def: "A focal atonic seizure in which awareness is partially or fully impaired at some point during the seizure." [PMID:11580774, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
is_a: HP:0020220 ! Focal atonic seizure
is_a: HP:0032712 ! Focal impaired awareness motor seizure
