def: "Focal emotional seizure with anger is characterized by the presence of anger, as an expressed or observed emotion, at the outset of the seizure. It may be accompanied by aggressive behavior." [PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
comment: This seizure type localizes to prefrontal or mesial temporal regions of the brain.
