def: "A focal cognitive seizure with dysgraphia / agraphia characterized by impairment of awareness at some point during the seizure." [PMID:28276060]
is_a: HP:0032699 ! Focal cognitive seizure with dysgraphia/agraphia
is_a: HP:0032756 ! Focal impaired awareness cognitive seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032804
name: Focal impaired awareness sensory seizure with olfactory features
synonym: "النوبة الحسية البؤرية مع التأثر الحسي وفقدان الوعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "النوبة البؤرية مع شعور بالرائحة وفقدان جزئي أو كامل للوعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبة حسية بؤرية تتعلق بحاسة الشم حيث يتأثر الوعي جزئيًا أو كليًا خلال النوبة.
def: "A focal sensory seizure with olfaction in which awareness is partially or fully impaired at some point during the seizure." [PMID:28276060]
is_a: HP:0011161 ! Focal sensory seizure with olfactory features
is_a: HP:0032787 ! Focal impaired awareness sensory seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

