synonym: "تشنجات تؤثر على الجسم كله" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من التشنجات الصرعية التي تبدأ بشكل عام في الجسم.
def: "A type of epileptic spasm of generalized onset." [PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
synonym: "Generalised onset epileptic spasm" EXACT []
synonym: "Generalised-onset epileptic spasm" EXACT []
synonym: "Generalized onset epileptic spasm" EXACT []
