comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من التشنجات الصرعية التي تبدأ بؤريًا.
def: "A type of epileptic spasm of focal onset." [PMID:11580774, PMID:28276060, PMID:28276064]
comment: The degree of awareness during the seizure is rarely known.
synonym: "Focal onset epileptic spasm" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011097 ! Epileptic spasm
