[Term]
id: HP:0032860
name: Generalized non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma
synonym: "حالة صرعية غير تشنجية معممة بدون غيبوبة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة بدون تشنج وغيبوبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الحالة الصرعية غير التشنجية المعممة بدون غيبوبة هي نوع من الحالة الصرعية دون علامات حركية بارزة، وهي معممة كهربائياً. تعتبر نوبة غياب طويلة.
def: "Generalized non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma is a type of status epilepticus without prominent motor signs, which is electrographically generalized. It is a prolonged absence seizure." [PMID:26336950]
synonym: "Absence status epilepticus" EXACT []
synonym: "Generalised non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma" EXACT []
synonym: "Petit mal status epilepticus" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032671 ! Non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032861
name: Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus with impairment of consciousness
synonym: "حالة الصرع البؤرية غير التشنجية مع اختلال الوعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صرع مع اختلال الوعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة الصرع البؤرية غير التشنجية مع اختلال الوعي هي نوع من أنواع الصرع البؤري غير التشنجي حيث يكون الوعي مختلاً.
def: "Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus with impairment of consciousness is a type of focal non-convulsive status epilepticus in which awareness is impaired." [PMID:28276060]
comment: Semiology may include autonomic, sensory, visual, olfactory, gustatory, emotional/psychic/experiential, or cognitive symptoms, depending on the fluctuation of consciousness. In 2015, the ILAE Task Force on Classification of Status Epilepticus proposed that time t1 (indicating the time that emergency treatment should be started because the seizure is unlikely to terminate spontaneously) is 10 minutes and t2 (the time at which long-term consequences of the seizure may be expected) is at least 60 minutes for focal status epilepticus with impaired consciousness.
synonym: "Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus with impairment of awareness" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032673 ! Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032862
name: Status epilepticus with ictal paresis
synonym: "حالة الصرع مع الشلل النشبي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صرع مع شلل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من حالة الصرع البؤري الحركي يتميز بوجود شلل نشبي طويل الأمد أو نوبات حركية مُثبِطة.
def: "A type of focal motor status epilepticus characterized by prolonged ictal paresis or inhibitory motor seizures." [PMID:17116038, PMID:25667883, PMID:26336950]
comment: Ictal paresis or inhibitory motor seizures are a relatively rare type of seizure characterized by an inability to initiate or continue movements despite retained awareness, which could last for many hours or even days. These manifest with paresis/paralysis of 1 side of the body (hemiplegia with or without facial involvement) or 1 extremity (upper or lower monoplegia) and are often preceded by other objective or subjective ictal symptoms, which may also occur concomitantly with the paresis or independently.
synonym: "Focal inhibitory status epilepticus" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032663 ! Focal motor status epilepticus
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032863
name: Typical absence status epilepticus
synonym: "حالة الغياب النمطي من الصرع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حالة الغياب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة الغياب النمطي من الصرع هي نوع من أنواع الصرع غير التشنجي العام حيث لا يحدث غيبوبة لكن يظهر على شكل نوبة غياب نمطية طويلة.
def: "Typical absence status epilepticus is a type of generalized non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma that is semiologically a prolonged typical absence seizure." [PMID:26336950]
comment: This may occur as a consequence of medication withdrawal in absence epilepsy syndromes.
synonym: "Simple absence status epilepticus" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032860 ! Generalized non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032864
name: Focal aware sensory seizure with auditory features
synonym: "نوبة حسية بؤرية واعية مع ميزات سمعية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة حسية سمعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من النوبات الحسية البؤرية مع ميزات سمعية يحتفظ فيها المريض بالوعي طوال مدة النوبة.
def: "A type of focal sensory seizure with auditory features during which awareness is retained throughout the seizure." [PMID:28276060]
comment: This type of seizure is characterized by elementary auditory phenomena including buzzing, ringing, drumming or single tones. More complex auditory hallucinations such as voices are considered a focal cognitive seizure. Focal sensory auditory seizures involve auditory cortex in the lateral superior temporal lobe.
is_a: HP:0011158 ! Focal sensory seizure with auditory features
is_a: HP:0032754 ! Focal aware sensory seizure
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032865
name: Myoclonic absence status epilepticus
synonym: "حالة الصرع الغيابي الرمعي العضلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة صرع رمعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة الصرع الغيابي الرمعي العضلي هي نوع من الصرع غير التشنجي العام حيث لا يحدث غيبوبة ولكنه يظهر على شكل نوبة غياب رمعية عضلية طويلة. تتضمن هذه الحالة هزات عضلية في الأطراف العلوية تتزامن مع تفريغ موجات مسمارية بمعدل 3 هرتز على رسم المخ الكهربائي.
def: "Myoclonic absence status epilepticus is a type of generalized non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma that is semiologically a prolonged myoclonic absence seizure. Myoclonic absence status epilepticus consists of proximal, predominantly upper extremity myoclonic jerks corresponding with 3 Hz spike-wave discharges in the EEG." [PMID:26336950]
is_a: HP:0032860 ! Generalized non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032866
name: Oculoclonic status epilepticus
synonym: "حالة الصرع العين العضلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صرع حركي في العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من حالة الصرع الحركي البؤري الذي يتميز بحركات متكررة وسريعة لحدقة العين، بالتزامن مع تفريغات صرعية.
def: "A type of focal motor status epilepticus characterized by repetitive and rapid saccades, in association with epileptic discharges." [PMID:11967176, PMID:26336950, PMID:2912713]
is_a: HP:0032663 ! Focal motor status epilepticus
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032867
name: Refractory status epilepticus
synonym: "حالة الصرع المقاومة للعلاج" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صرع لا يستجيب للعلاج" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تُعرّف حالة الصرع المقاومة للعلاج بأنها حالة صرع تستمر بالرغم من استخدام دوائين مضادين للصرع يتم اختيارهما وتحديد جرعاتهما بعناية، بما في ذلك أحد البنزوديازيبينات.
def: "Refractory status epilepticus is defined as status epilepticus continuing despite two appropriately selected and dosed antiepileptic drugs, including a benzodiazepine." [PMID:19817823]
is_a: HP:0002133 ! Status epilepticus
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032868
name: Super-refractory status epilepticus
synonym: "حالة الصرع فوق المقاومة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صرع شديد المقاومة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تُعرّف حالة الصرع فوق المقاومة بأنها حالة صرع مقاومة تستمر لمدة 24 ساعة أو أكثر بعد بداية استخدام الأدوية المخدرة، بما في ذلك الحالات التي يتم فيها السيطرة على النوبة بعد بداية استخدام الأدوية المخدرة ولكن تعود النوبة عند تقليل الجرعة المخدرة.
def: "Super-refractory status epilepticus is defined as refractory status epilepticus continuing for 24 h or more following initiation of anesthetic medications, including cases in which seizure control is attained after induction of anesthetic drugs but recurs on weaning the patient off the anesthetic agent." [PMID:21914716]
is_a: HP:0032867 ! Refractory status epilepticus
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0032869
name: Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus without impairment of consciousness
synonym: "حالة الصرع البؤرية غير التشنجية مع الوعي الكامل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صرع بؤري مع وعي كامل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة الصرع البؤرية غير التشنجية مع الوعي الكامل هي نوع من أنواع الصرع البؤري غير التشنجي حيث يظل الوعي سليماً.
def: "Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus without impairment of consciousness is a type of focal non-convulsive status epilepticus in which awareness remains intact." [PMID:26336950]
comment: Semiology may include autonomic, sensory, visual, olfactory, gustatory, emotional/psychic/experiential, or cognitive symptoms. In 2015, the ILAE Task Force on Classification of Status Epilepticus did not propose a specific time t1 (indicating the time that emergency treatment should be started because the seizure is unlikely to terminate spontaneously) or t2 (the time at which long-term consequences of the seizure may be expected) for focal status epilepticus without impaired consciousness.
synonym: "Aura continua" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus with retained awareness" EXACT []
synonym: "Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus without impairment of awareness" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032673 ! Focal non-convulsive status epilepticus without coma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

