def: "A type of focal automatism seizure characterized by inappropriate continuation of pre-seizure movement or behavior at onset and during which awareness is fully retained throughout." [PMID:28276060]
is_a: HP:0032902 ! Focal perseverative automatism seizure
is_a: HP:0032910 ! Focal aware automatism seizure
