[Term]
id: HP:0033030
name: Anti-glomerular basement membrane-antibody positivity
synonym: "إيجابية الأجسام المضادة لغشاء القاعدة الكبيبية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "إيجابية الأجسام المضادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أجسام مضادة ذاتية في السيروم تتفاعل مع غشاء القاعدة الكبيبية.
def: "The presence of autoantibodies in the serum that react to the glomerular basement membrane." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0104-692X, PMID:20660402]
comment: Anti-GBM-antibodies are found in Goodpasture syndrome. Circulating antibodies are directed against the collagen of the part of the kidney known as the glomerular basement membrane (GBM), resulting in acute or rapidly progressive glomerulonephritis. Antibodies also attack the collagen of the air sacs of the lung (alveoli) resulting in bleeding of the lung (pulmonary hemorrhage).
synonym: "Anti-GBM-antibody positivity" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0030057 ! Autoimmune antibody positivity
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033031
name: Hyperpyrexia
synonym: "فرط الحرارة الشديد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حرارة شديدة جداً" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع مفرط في درجة حرارة الجسم الأساسية فوق المعدل الطبيعي، ويتم تحديدها كدرجة حرارة شرجية تبلغ 41.1 درجة مئوية (106 درجة فهرنهايت).
def: "An extreme elevation of core body temperature above normal defined as a rectal temperature of 41.1 degrees Celsius (106 degrees Fahrenheit)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, PMID:16818546]
comment: Hyperpyrexia is considered a medical emergency and typically results in referral for emergency care.
is_a: HP:0001945 ! Fever
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

