def: "Applies to a sign or symptom that is induced by an abusive adult (usually a parent)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7371-8158, PMID:29938745]
comment: Munchausen syndrome by proxy is not a pediatric condition, but the outward manifestation of an adult psychiatric disorder.
synonym: "Munchausen syndrome by proxy" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025204 ! Triggered by
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033033
