comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب ينتقل بين المفاصل المختلفة بمرور الوقت.
comment: A form of arthritis characterized by gradual involvement of several joints, with involvement of some joints occurring following partial or full resolution of arthritis in joints with an earlier onset. {xref="PMID:31657698", xref="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7440-8864"}
synonym: "Migratory polyarthritis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0001369 ! Arthritis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

