property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033113
name: Gallop rhythm
synonym: "إيقاع قلب منتظم ثلاثي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "إيقاع قلب مثل جريان الحصان" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: في الدورة القلبية الطبيعية، يمكن سماع صوتين للقلب عن طريق السماعة لكل دورة: S1 و S2. يشير إيقاع الجريان إلى وجود ثلاثة أو أربعة أصوات قلب لكل دورة قلبية، يقال أنه يشبه جريان الحصان.
def: "In the normal heart cycle, two heart sounds can be heard by auscultation per cycle: S1 and S2. A gallop rhythm refers to the presence of three or four heart sounds per cardiac cycle, which is said to resemble the gallop of a horse." [PMID:15886379]
synonym: "Triple rhythm" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031657 ! Abnormal heart sound
property_value: dc:date "2020-08-30T11:33:21Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033114
name: Quadruple gallop rhythm
synonym: "إيقاع قلب منتظم رباعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "إيقاع قلب غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من إيقاع القلب المنتظم حيث يكون كلا الصوتين الثالث والرابع موجودين.
def: "A type of gallop rhythm in which both the third and the fourth sounds are present." [PMID:15886379]
is_a: HP:0033113 ! Gallop rhythm
property_value: dc:date "2020-08-30T12:35:42Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033115
name: Elevated circulating tenascin-C concentration
synonym: "زيادة تركيز التيناسيين-سي في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة بروتين خاص في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز التيناسيين-سي في الدورة الدموية يكون أعلى من الحد الأعلى الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of tenascin-C in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." []
comment: Tenascin-C is a pro-inflammatory glycoprotein. The expression of tenascin-C in adults is limited to the site of tissue injury, usually temporary, and the expression level of tenascin-C returns to normal after tissue repair is completed. In contrast, the sustained high expression of tenascin-C is common in inflammation, tissue remodeling, and autoimmune diseases. Elevated serum tenascin-C may be associated with severity and poor prognosis in septic patients.
is_a: HP:0010876 ! Abnormal circulating protein concentration
property_value: dc:date "2020-09-03T11:21:59Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033116
name: Duodenal gastric metaplasia
synonym: "التحول المعدي الاثناعشري" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغيّر خلايا الاثني عشر إلى خلايا معدية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود بؤر من الخلايا المفرزة للمخاط بنمط معدي متداخلة بين الخلايا المعوية الاثناعشرية. تحتوي هذه البؤر المعدية على المخاط المتعادل الإيجابي بحمض البيريوديك-شيف (PAS) وتفتقد للحافة الهدبية.
def: "Foci of gastric-type mucus-secreting cells interspersed between duodenal enterocytes. These foci of gastric epithelial cells contain Periodic acid-Schiff (PAS)-positive neutral mucin and lack a brush border." [PMID:16679353]
comment: Despite structural analogy, the epithelium in the duodenal gastric metaplasia (DGM) differs from true gastric epithelium with respect to lectin composition. DGM is considered to be an acquired condition related to gastric acid injury and H pylori may also be associated in its pathogenesis
is_a: HP:0002246 ! Abnormal duodenum morphology
property_value: dc:date "2020-09-03T11:59:20Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033117
name: Duodenitis
synonym: "التهاب الاثني عشر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب جدار الاثني عشر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب الطبقة الداخلية للأمعاء الدقيقة العلوية (الاثني عشر).
def: "Inflammation of the lining of the upper small intestine (duodenum)." [PMID:16679353]
comment: The diagnosis of duodenitis is made when there is infiltration by inflammatory cells with changes in villous architecture and surface and crypt epithelium. Duodenitis can be graded according to the amount of neutrophilic and plasma cell infiltration, villous height, Brunner's gland hyperplasia with prolapse into the lamina propria and gastric metaplasia.
synonym: "Duodenal inflammation" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002246 ! Abnormal duodenum morphology
property_value: dc:date "2020-09-03T12:01:20Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

