[Term]
id: HP:0033122
name: Absent P wave
synonym: "غياب موجة P" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "غياب موجة في التخطيط القلبي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدم وجود موجة P التي تسبق عادةً كل مركب QRS بفاصل زمني ثابت PR يتراوح بين 120 إلى 200 ميللي ثانية.
def: "The P wave that normally precedes each QRS complex by a fixed PR interval of 120 to 200 milliseconds is not present." []
comment: Absent P wave can be observed with conditions including atrial fibrillation and sinoatrial arrest,
synonym: "Absence of P wave on electrocardiography" EXACT []
