[Term]
id: HP:0033148
name: Increased circulating isovaleric acid concentration
synonym: "زيادة تركيز حمض الإيزوفاليريك في الدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة حمض الإيزوفاليريك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تركيز حمض الإيزوفاليريك، وهو حمض دهني متشبع ذو سلسلة متفرعة من نوع C5، في تركيز الدم.
def: "Increased concentration of isovaleric acid, a C5, branched-chain saturated fatty acid, in the blood concentration." [PMID:16602101]
comment: In individuals with the disease isovaleric acidemia (OMIM:243500), free isovaleric acid in blood during episodes of acute metabolic decompensation can reach several hundred times normal values but is not readily seen in blood and urine due to its rapid conjugation to other compounds. Thus, isovalerylcarnitine and isovalerylglycine are the hallmarks of this disorder in plasma and urine, respectively, and are elevated regardless of the metabolic condition of the affected individual.
synonym: "Increased circulating isovalerate" EXACT []
synonym: "Isovalericacidemia" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0033147 ! Abnormal circulating short-chain fatty-acid concentration
property_value: dc:date "2020-09-19T11:42:45Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

