def: "Concentration of L-pyroglutamic acid in the blood is above the upper limit of normal." [PMID:8789605]
comment: 5-oxoproline is an oxoproline having the oxo group placed at the 5-position. It is an intermediate metabolite in the glutathione cycle.
synonym: "Elevated circulating L-pyroglutamic acid concentration" EXACT []
