[Term]
id: HP:0033334
name: Abnormal embryonic development
synonym: "شذوذ النمو الجنيني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في نمو الجنين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في تطور الجنين، وهو المرحلة المبكرة من التطور التي تلي إخصاب البويضة بالحيوانات المنوية.
def: "An anomaly in the development of the embryo, that is, of the early developmental stage of development that follows the fertilization of an egg by sperm." [PMID:32680920]
is_a: HP:0001197 ! Abnormality of prenatal development or birth
property_value: dc:date "2020-11-29T17:48:10Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033335
name: Abnormal preimplantation embryonic development
synonym: "شذوذ تطور الجنين قبل الانغراس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في نمو الجنين قبل الانغراس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في تطور الجنين في مرحلة تسبق الانغراس.
def: "An anomaly in the development of the embryo in a stage prior to implantation." []
comment: Human embryo development begins in relative transcriptional silence with an oocyte to embryo transition that lasts for about 3 days and encompasses fusion of the egg and sperm, migration and fusion of the germ cell pronuclei, genetic and epigenetic reprogramming. The embryo subsequently undergoes compaction to form a morula that marks the first morphological indication of a break in radial symmetry. Subsequent cell divisions lead to the development of a blastocyst that comprises a fluid-filled blastocyst cavity and an inner cell mass, surrounded by trophectoderm cells. Implantation, which in humans occurs at approximately day 7 of development, is required for further development of the embryo proper.
is_a: HP:0033334 ! Abnormal embryonic development
property_value: dc:date "2020-11-29T17:49:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033336
name: Zygotic cleavage failure
synonym: "فشل انقسام اللاقحة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فشل انقسام البويضة المخصبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فشل البويضة المخصبة في إتمام أول جولة من الانقسام الخلوي.
def: "Failure of a fertilized oocyte to undergo the first round of cell division." [PMID:32502391]
comment: A zygote undergoes rapid cell divisions referred to as cleavage because they are not are not associated with significant growth of the embryo. The iniital round of cleavage forms a spherical ball of cells called the blastula, which then develops into a blastocyst.
synonym: "Failure of zygotic cell division" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0033335 ! Abnormal preimplantation embryonic development
property_value: dc:date "2020-11-29T17:54:41Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033337
name: Abnormal gametogenesis
synonym: "شذوذ تكون الأمشاج" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في تكوين الأمشاج" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في العملية التي يتم فيها تكوين خلية أحادية الصيغة الصبغية من خلايا ثنائية الصيغة الصبغية من خلال الانقسام الميوزي. في الذكور، تقوم الخلايا المنوية الثنائية الصبغية بإنتاج خليتين أحاديتين الصبغيات خلال الانقسام الميوزي الأول وأربعة خلايا منوية خلال الانقسام الميوزي الثاني. في الإناث، تمر الخلايا الجرثومية الأولية خلال الانقسام الميوزي الثاني قبل الولادة لتكوين البويضات الأولية. عند بدء البلوغ هذه الخلايا تتكون البويضات الثانوية خلال الانقسام الميوزي الثاني.
def: "An anomaly in the process by a a haploid cell is formed from a diploid cells through meiosis. In males, diploid spermatogonia produce two haploid cells (secondary spermatocytes) in meiosis I and four haploid spermatids in meiosis II. In females, primordial germ cells under meiosis II before birth to form primary oocytes. Once puberty cell begins, these cells form secondary oocytes through meiosis II." []
is_a: HP:0000080 ! Abnormality of reproductive system physiology
property_value: dc:date "2020-11-29T18:23:09Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

