[Term]
id: HP:0033391
name: Bronchial artery hypertrophy
synonym: "تضخم الشريان الرئوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في حجم الشريان الرئوي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في حجم جدار الشريان الشعبوي نتيجة لتضخم خلاياه المكونة.
def: "Increase in the volume of bronchial artery wall due to the enlargement of its component cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4095-8489, PMID:25590386]
comment: The bronchial circulation and other collateral vessels (eg, the intercostal, internal mammary, and inferior phrenic arteries) respond to chronic pulmonary ischemia and decreased pulmonary blood flow through hypertrophy or enlargement in an effort to maintain blood flow to the affected lung and participate in gas exchange through systemic-pulmonary arterial anastomoses that develop beyond the pulmonary artery obstruction.
