[Term]
id: HP:0033583
name: Follicular bronchiolitis
synonym: "التهاب القصيبات الجريبي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب في القصيبات نتيجة لنمو الخلايا اللمفاوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب القصيبات الجريبي هو تضخم متعدد النسلات في النسيج اللمفاوي المرتبط بالقصيبات ويتصف بتطور الجريبات اللمفاوية مع مراكز جنينية في جدران القصيبات الصغيرة.
def: "Follicular bronchiolitis is a polyclonal hyperplasia of bronchiolar associated lymphoid tissue characterized by the is characterized by the development of lymphoid follicles with germinal centers in walls of the small airways." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0113-912X, PMID:32040879, PMID:32047693]
comment: Lymphocytic interstitial pneumonia (LIP) and follicular bronchiolitis (FB) are assumed to be pathological immunologic responses to different triggers and are particularly associated with autoimmune and infectious diseases as well as immunodeficiency. LIP can be defined as a dense, predominantly lymphocytic interstitial infiltrate that expands alveolar septa. In contrast, FB can be defined as a pattern of numerous lymphoid follicles associated with bronchioles and the immediate peribronchiolar interstitium. A grading system can be use to assess presence and extent of LIP and FB. Lymphocyte aggregates are defined as the aggregation of 50 or more lymphocytes per high-power field. Tissue was scored as grade 0 in the absence of lymphocyte aggregates, grade 1 with 0 to 1 aggregate/10 mm 2 , grade 2 with greater than 1 aggregate/10 mm 2 , grade 3 with greater than 1 aggregate/10 mm 2 and the presence of focal lymphoid interstitial pneumonia, and grade 4 with greater than 1 aggregate/10 mm 2 and the presence of diffuse LIP.
is_a: HP:0033582 ! Pulmonary interstitial lymphocyte infiltration
property_value: dc:date "2021-01-27T20:37:56Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033584
name: Nonspecific interstitial pneumonia
synonym: "التهاب رئوي بيني غير نوعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب رئوي بيني" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمط موحد زمنيًا (كل الآفات في نفس مرحلة التطور) من العملية الالتهابية البينية المنتشرة، يكون في العادة متماثلًا في كامل الرئة، ويشمل بشكل رئيسي الحواجز السنخية.
def: "Temporally uniform (all lesions are in the same stage of evolution) pattern of diffuse inflammatory interstitial process, mostly symmetric over the entire lung, involving mainly the alveolar septa." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0113-912X, PMID:30085516]
synonym: "Nonspecific interstitial pneumonitis" EXACT []
synonym: "NSIP" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Temporally uniform pulmonary inflammation" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0006515 ! Interstitial pneumonitis
property_value: dc:date "2021-01-27T20:40:09Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033585
name: Fibrotic non-specific interstitial pneumonia
synonym: "التهاب رئوي بيني غير نوعي ليفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب رئوي ليفي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الالتهاب الرئوي بيني غير نوعي حيث يكون التثخن البيني ناتجاً عن التليف الكثيف أو الضعيف المتجانس والالتهاب المزمن الخفيف.
def: "A type of non-specific interstitial pneumonia in which interstitial thickening is due to uniform dense or loose fibrosis and mild chronic inflammation." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0113-912X, PMID:30085516]
is_a: HP:0033584 ! Nonspecific interstitial pneumonia
property_value: dc:date "2021-01-27T20:44:16Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033586
name: Cellular non-specific interstitial pneumonia
synonym: "ذات الرئة الخلالي غير النوعية الخلوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوع من التهاب الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من ذات الرئة الخلالي غير النوعي حيث يؤدي سماكة النسيج الخلالي بشكل رئيسي إلى تغلغل الخلايا الالتهابية وتضخم الخلايا الرئوية من النوع الثاني.
def: "A type of non-specific interstitial pneumonia in which interstitial thickening is mainly due to infiltration of inflammatory cells and type II pneumocyte hyperplasia." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0113-912X]
is_a: HP:0033584 ! Nonspecific interstitial pneumonia
property_value: dc:date "2021-01-27T20:46:02Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

