[Term]
id: HP:0033660
name: Hand paresthesia
synonym: "تنمل اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وخز في اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وخز (غالبًا يشعر به كإحساس بالوخز بالإبر والدبابيس) وتنميل في اليد.
def: "Tingling (often referred to as a pins and needles feeling) and numbness in the hand." []
synonym: "Hand tingling" EXACT layperson []
