[Term]
id: HP:0033677
name: Acute respiratory distress syndrome
synonym: "متلازمة الضائقة التنفسية الحادة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضائقة تنفسية حادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تُعرف متلازمة الضائقة التنفسية الحادة (ARDS) بأنها اضطراب حاد يبدأ في غضون سبعة أيام من الحدث المسبب، ويتميز بتسللات رئوية ثنائية الجانب ونقص حاد في الأكسجين المتدرج في غياب أدلة على وذمة رئوية قلبية المنشأ. يتم تعريف ARDS بواسطة نسبة الأكسجين في الدم الشرياني (PaO2) إلى تركيز الأكسجين في الهواء المستنشق (FiO2)، حيث تكون هذه النسبة أقل من 300.
def: "Acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS) is defined as an acute disorder that starts within seven days of the inciting event and is characterized by bilateral lung infiltrates and severe progressive hypoxemia in the absence of any evidence of cardiogenic pulmonary edema. ARDS is defined by the patient's oxygen in arterial blood (PaO2) to the fraction of the oxygen in the inspired air (FiO2). These patients have a PaO2/FiO2 ratio of less than 300." [PMID:28613773]
comment: Acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS) is a life-threatening condition of seriously ill patients, characterized by poor oxygenation, pulmonary infiltrates, and acuity of onset. On a microscopic level, the disorder is associated with capillary endothelial injury and diffuse alveolar damage. Once ARDS develops, patients usually have varying degrees of pulmonary artery vasoconstriction and may subsequently develop pulmonary hypertension. ARDS carries a high mortality, and few effective therapeutic modalities exist to combat this condition. ARDS can be observed as a complication of many diseases including pulmonary infection or aspiration, sepsis, trauma, massive transfusion, drowning, drug overdose, fat embolism, inhalation of toxic fumes, and pancreatitis.
synonym: "ARDS" EXACT abbreviation []
is_a: HP:0004887 ! Respiratory failure requiring assisted ventilation
property_value: dc:date "2021-03-03T20:15:47Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033678
name: Acute coronary syndrome
synonym: "متلازمة الشريان التاجي الحادة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبة قلبية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشير متلازمة الشريان التاجي الحادة (ACS) إلى أي مجموعة من الأعراض السريرية التي تتلاءم مع نقص التروية العضلية الحادة وتشمل الذبحة الصدرية غير المستقرة، واحتشاء عضلة القلب غير المرتبط بارتفاع قطعة ST، واحتشاء عضلة القلب المرتبط بارتفاع قطعة ST.
def: "The term acute coronary syndrome (ACS) refers to any group of clinical symptoms compatible with acute myocardial ischemia and includes unstable angina (UA), non-ST-segment elevation myocardial infarction (NSTEMI), and ST-segment elevation myocardial infarction (STEMI)." [PMID:19797781]
comment: A diagnosis of NSTEMI can be made when the ischemia is sufficiently severe to cause myocardial damage that results in the release of a biomarker of myocardial necrosis into the circulation (cardiac-specific troponins T or I, or muscle and brain fraction of creatine kinase [CK-MB]). In contrast, the patient is considered to have experienced UA if no such biomarker can be detected in the bloodstream hours after the initial onset of ischemic chest pain. Unstable angina exhibits 1 or more of 3 principal presentations: (1) rest angina (usually lasting >20 minutes), (2) new-onset (<2 months previously) severe angina, and (3) a crescendo pattern of occurrence (increasing in intensity, duration, frequency, or any combination of these factors).
is_a: HP:0011025 ! Abnormal cardiovascular system physiology
property_value: dc:date "2021-03-03T20:22:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033679
name: Abnormal red nucleus morphology
synonym: "شذوذ في شكل النواة الحمراء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تشوه النواة الحمراء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي خلل هيكلي في النواة الحمراء، وهي جزء من الدماغ المتوسط يشارك في التحكم في الحركة.
def: "Any structural anomaly of the red nucleus, a part of the midbrain involved in control of movement." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178]
is_a: HP:0002418 ! Abnormal midbrain morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-03-06T13:01:58Z" xsd:dateTime
