[Term]
id: HP:0033715
name: Hippocampal sclerosis
synonym: "تصلب الحُصين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تصلب في منطقة الحُصين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تصلب الحُصين هو نتيجة مرضية عصبية تتميز بفقدان الخلايا العصبية وتليف في منطقة CA-1 والفرع السفلي للحُصين.
def: "Hippocampal sclerosis is a neuropathologic finding characterized by neuronal loss and gliosis in the CA-1 and subiculum of the hippocampus." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1735-8178, PMID:12117357, PMID:24762203, PMID:26060898]
comment: Hippocampal sclerosis is now recognized as one of the main causes of focal epilepsy and is present in approximately 10% of adults with new-onset focal epilepsy.
synonym: "Mesial temporal sclerosis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002171 ! Gliosis
is_a: HP:0025100 ! Abnormal hippocampus morphology
