def: "An abnormal reduction in the volume remaining in the lungs after a normal, passive exhalation." [PMID:29763183]
is_a: HP:0033749 ! Abnormal functional residual capacity
property_value: dc:date "2021-04-21T15:49:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

