[Term]
id: HP:0033772
name: Abnormal RV/TLC ratio
synonym: "خلل في نسبة RV/TLC" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن النسبة الطبيعية للحجم المتبقي (RV) إلى السعة الكلية للرئة (TLC) عند اختبار وظيفة الرئة. RV هو كمية الهواء المتبقية بعد الزفير الأقصى وTLC هي الكمية الإجمالية من الهواء في الرئة عند الشهيق الكامل. لا يمكن تحديد هذه الأحجام بواسطة قياس التنفس، ولكن يمكن قياسها بواسطة تخفيف الغاز الخامل، وغسل النتروجين، وتخطيط الابطان.
def: "Any deviation from the normal ratio of residual volume (RV) to total lung capacity (TLC) on pulmonary function testing. RV is the amount of air remaining aftermaximal expiration and TLC is the total amount of air in theungs at full inspiration. These volumes cannot be determined by spirometry, but can be measured by inert gas dilution, nitrogen washout, and body plethysmography." [PMID:12934788]
is_a: HP:0030878 ! Abnormality on pulmonary function testing
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-01T15:42:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033773
name: Decreased RV/TLC ratio
synonym: "انخفاض نسبة حجم الرئة المتبقي إلى السعة الرئوية الكلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض نسبة الهواء المتبقي في الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نسبة منخفضة بشكل غير طبيعي بين الحجم المتبقي في الرئة (RV) والسعة الرئوية الكلية (TLC) في اختبارات وظيفة الرئة. RV هو كمية الهواء المتبقية بعد الزفير الأقصى وTLC هي الكمية الإجمالية للهواء في الرئة عند الاستنشاق الكامل. لا يمكن تحديد هذه الأحجام عن طريق قياسات التنفس، لكن يمكن قياسها بواسطة تخفيف الغاز الخامل، وغسل النيتروجين، والبلثيزموجرافيا الجسدية.
def: "An abnormally low ratio of residual volume (RV) to total lung capacity (TLC) on pulmonary function testing. RV is the amount of air remaining after maximal expiration and TLC is the total amount of air in the lungs at full inspiration. These volumes cannot be determined by spirometry, but can be measured by inert gas dilution, nitrogen washout, and body plethysmography." [PMID:12934788]
is_a: HP:0033772 ! Abnormal RV/TLC ratio
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-01T15:44:00Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033774
name: Impaired renal tubular reabsorption of uric acid
synonym: "ضعف في إعادة امتصاص أنبوبي للحمض البولي في الكلى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف في امتصاص الكلى للحامض البولي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص في إعادة الامتصاص الأنبوبي للحمض البولي في الكلى.
def: "Decreased renal tubular reabsorption of uric acid." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2234-4248, PMID:27105641, PMID:31474092]
comment: Uric acid excretion rate is the product of the filtered load (which can be approximated as plasma ultrafilterable urate multiplied by the glomerular filtration rate) and fractional excretion of urate (FEUA), which represents the percentage of filtered urate that is excreted in the final urine.
is_a: HP:0011038 ! Abnormal renal tubular resorption
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-04T14:21:45Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033775
name: Pulmonary imaging sign
synonym: "علامة تصوير شعاعي رئوي غير طبيعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صورة أشعة غير طبيعية للرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نتيجة غير طبيعية في التصوير الشعاعي الرئوي يتم تعريفها باسم معين أو إشارة إلى علامات أو رموز أو صور طبيعية.
def: "An abnormal pulmonary imaging finding defined by eponym or reference to signs, symbols, or naturalistic images." [PMID:31802270]
is_a: HP:0031983 ! Abnormal pulmonary thoracic imaging finding
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-04T14:47:16Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033776
name: Enamel pearls
synonym: "لآلئ المينا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عقد صغيرة من المينا على جذر السن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عقد صغيرة من المينا على جذر السن.
def: "Small nodules of enamel on the root of a tooth." [PMID:31468724]
comment: Enamel pearls can typically not be seen on X-rays but need direct visualization. The pearls can be present on the surface of the dentine or cement of deciduous teeth, with a frequency of 33% or on the roots of maxillary molars, with a frequency of 1.2%.
is_a: HP:0000682 ! Abnormal dental enamel morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-07T09:49:37Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033777
name: Supernumerary cusp
synonym: "الحدبة الزائدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حدبة إضافية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حدبات إضافية على تاج السن.
def: "Additional cusps of a dental crown." [PMID:31468724]
comment: The crown is the part of the tooth that is visible in the oral cavity. Supernumerary cusps can occur on any tooth with cusps. Canines possess a single cusp, premolars two (bicuspid), and molars three to five cusps. Supernumerary cusps are frequently seen in patients with other dental anomalies. Prevalence varies by geographical region. A tubercle on the lingual surface of the maxillary first permanent molar is sometimes referred to as a Carabelli cusp. A supernumerary cusp on the lingual or palatal side of anterior teeth is called Talon cusp, and an additional cusp on the occlusal surface of a premolar is called Leung cusp.
synonym: "Additional cusp" EXACT []
synonym: "Extra cusp" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011063 ! Abnormal incisor morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-07T09:52:32Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033778
name: Leung cusp
synonym: "الحدبة اللوونغية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حدبة إضافية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حدبة إضافية تقع في وسط سطح الإطباق.
def: "An additional cusp located in the middle of the occlusal surface." [PMID:31468724]
comment: A Leung cusp is present on premolars only. In radiographs, a pulp extension may be seen inside the cusp.
is_a: HP:0033777 ! Supernumerary cusp
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-07T09:59:19Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033779
name: Barrel-shaped tooth
synonym: "السن البرميلي الشكل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "السن البرميلي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تاج السن ذو أسطح ميسالية وقاصية مقعرة.
def: "A tooth crown with convex mesial and distal surfaces." [PMID:31468724]
comment: A barrel shape of a tooth occurs in incisors and canines only. The incisal edge is not pointed. Barrel-shaped teeth are frequently observed in association with hypodontia and oligodontia.
is_a: HP:0006482 ! Abnormal dental morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-07T10:08:15Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033780
name: Bulbous tooth
synonym: "السن المنتفخ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تاج السن ذو تضيق ملحوظ في منطقة عنق السن.
def: "A tooth crown with a marked cervical area constriction." [PMID:31468724]
is_a: HP:0006482 ! Abnormal dental morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-07T10:09:42Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033781
name: Tapered tooth
synonym: "السن المدبب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: السن ذو تاج يضيق من القريب إلى الحافة القاطعة. عادةً ما يكون الشدق المدبب في القواطع.
def: "A tooth with a crown that narrows from proximal toward the incisal edge. Tapering of teeth typically involves incisors." [PMID:31468724]
is_a: HP:0011063 ! Abnormal incisor morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-07T10:14:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0033782
name: Semilunar tooth
synonym: "السن الهلالي الشكل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "السن الهلالي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: قاطع ذو حافة قاطعة ذات شكل نصف قمر.
def: "An incisor with a half-moon shape incisal edge." []
comment: If a notch occupies most of incisal edge, it has been indicated as semilunar teeth or crescent-shaped.
synonym: "Crescent-shape tooth" EXACT []
synonym: "Hutchinson incisor" EXACT []
synonym: "Semicircular tooth" EXACT []
synonym: "Tooth, semilunar" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011063 ! Abnormal incisor morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-05-07T10:21:03Z" xsd:dateTime
