[Term]
id: HP:0033838
name: Dysphoria
synonym: "اكتئاب دائم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شعور مستمر بالانزعاج" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة مستمرة من عدم الراحة والتشاؤم العاطفي والشعور بالاستياء الداخلي الذي هو أكبر من الظروف الخارجية وقد يشمل رد فعل عاطفي مبالغ به. يرتبط بمزيج من العواطف السلبية المتشابكة التي يصعب فصلها.
def: "A pervasive state of negatively valenced emotional unease and dissatisfaction along with an inner discomfort that is disproportionate to external circumstances and may include heightened emotional reactivity. It is associated with a mixture of overlapping negative emotions that are difficult to disentangle." [PMID:30439852]
comment: Dysphoria has a mixed and unstable nonspecific quality and is a complex negative emotional state with multiple vague symptoms. Recent literature uses include gender dysphoria, but prior use was interchangeable with depression. The central features are dissatisfaction and resentment with a pronounced negative emotional experience.
synonym: "Dysphoric mood" EXACT []
synonym: "Emotional discomfort" BROAD layperson []
synonym: "Emotional discontent" BROAD []
synonym: "Emotional discord" BROAD []
synonym: "Emotional unrest" RELATED []
synonym: "Emotionally unsettled" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Feeling off inside" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Ill at ease" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Inner distress" BROAD []
synonym: "Inner turmoil" BROAD []
synonym: "Psychological unease" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0031467 ! Dysregulated negative emotional state
