[Term]
id: HP:0033847
name: Phantageusia
synonym: "خداع الذوق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طعم وهمي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شكل من أشكال الإحساس بالطعم المتغير، حيث يشعر الشخص المصاب بطعم، عادةً غير سار، في ظل غياب منبه متوافق في البيئة.
def: "A form of altered taste sensation in which the affected person perceives a taste, usually an unpleasant one, in the absence of a corresponding stimulus in the environment." []
comment: In contrast to parageusia, phantageusia is not triggered by an environmental stimulus.
synonym: "Phantom taste" EXACT layperson []
