def: "Enlargement of endothelial cells of the cortical radial arteries (also known as the interlobular arteries) of the kidney because of cytoplasmic swelling." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X]
synonym: "Endotheliosis within interlobular arteries" EXACT []
