def: "Myointimal hyperplasia of the inner and middle layer of the cortical radial artery (also known as the interlobular artery) of the kidney, arranged in multiple concentric layers." [https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2356-950X]
synonym: "Cortical radial artery intima/media onion skinning" EXACT []
