[Term]
id: HP:0034043
name: Increased fecal bile acid
synonym: "زيادة حمض الصفراء في البراز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع نسبة أحماض المرارة في البراز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع نسبة أحماض الصفراء في البراز.
def: "Elevated amount of bile acids in the feces." [PMID:9109432]
comment: Bile acids are synthesized from cholesterol in the liver and have major roles in the absorption of lipids in the small intestine. After their involvement in micelle formation in the small intestine, they are usually effectively reabsorbed in the terminal ileum, and efficiently (over 95%) reabsorbed by the liver from the portal venous blood, and resecreted.
is_a: HP:0031685 ! Abnormal stool composition
property_value: dc:date "2021-10-15T13:54:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034044
name: Trident pelvis
synonym: "حوض ثلاثي الشعب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حوض على شكل رمح ثلاثي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: بروزات في الهامش الإنسي والجانبي للحق وفي مركز الحق تعطي شكلاً يشبه رمح ثلاثي الشعب يعرف باسم حوض ثلاثي الشعب.
def: "Spurs at the medial and lateral acetabular margin and in the center of the acetabulum gives rise to shape resembling a three-pronged spear known as trident." [PMID:28744080]
comment: This sign is seen in achondroplasia, Jeune's asphyxiating thoracic dystrophy, Ellis-van Creveld syndrome, and thanatophoric dysplasia. See Figures 2 and 4A in PMID:28744080.
synonym: "Trident sign" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0001384 ! Abnormal hip joint morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-10-15T14:26:57Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034045
name: Angulated muscle fibers
synonym: "ألياف عضلية ذات زوايا" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألياف عضلية غير طبيعية الشكل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الألياف العضلية الطبيعية تكون متعددة الأضلاع في المقطع العرضي، متعددة النوى، وتحتوي على كميات قليلة من النسيج الضام. بالمقابل، تتميز الألياف العضلية الزاوية بأطراف طويلة وضيقة ذات حواف حادة ونهايات مدببة.
def: "Normal muscle fibers are polygonal-shaped in cross section, are multinucleated, and have minimal amounts of endomysial connective tissue. In contrast, angulated (also known as angular) muscle fibers have long and narrow vertices (corners) with sharp edges and a pointed tip." [PMID:22938878, PMID:32529201]
comment: Muscle fibers showing neurogenic atrophy are compressed by neighboring non-atrophic fibers and may show an angulated appearance on a transverse section. See Figure 3A in PMID:32529201.
synonym: "Angular muscle fibers" EXACT []
synonym: "Angular muscle fibres" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0004303 ! Abnormal muscle fiber morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-10-19T16:38:38Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034046
