def: "Presence of IgM antibodies against beta 2 glycoprotein I in the circulation. Beta-2 glycoprotein I (beta2GPI) is the principal target of autoantibodies in the antiphospholipid syndrome." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3387-1836, PMID:33957795, PMID:34218350]
