def: "The presence of autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the serum that react against thyroid-stimulating hormone." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3387-1836, PMID:10874533, PMID:26293122, PMID:3018097, PMID:30224035, PMID:32459722]
synonym: "Anti-thyrotropin receptor antibody" EXACT []
synonym: "Anti-TSH receptor antibody positivity" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "TRAbs" EXACT abbreviation []
