comment: Arabic Definition: خلل وظيفي في نظام القلب والأوعية الدموية للجنين.
def: "Abnormal functionality of the fetal cardiovascular system." []
is_a: HP:0011025 ! Abnormal cardiovascular system physiology
is_a: HP:0034059 ! Abnormal fetal physiology
property_value: dc:date "2022-03-12T23:26:42Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034191
name: Elevated fetal middle cerebral artery peak systolic velocity
synonym: "زيادة سرعة القمة الانقباضية في الشريان الدماغي الأوسط للجنين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة سرعة الدم في شريان دماغ الجنين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة سرعة القمة الانقباضية في الشريان الدماغي الأوسط للجنين كما تم تقييمه بواسطة الموجات فوق الصوتية دوبلر.
def: "Increased peak systolic velocity of the fetal middle cerebral artery (MCA) as evaluated by Doppler ultrasound." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8593-2186, PMID:28191060]
comment: The technique for MCA peak systolic velocity measurement involves an axial section through the fetal head that includes the thalami and cavum septum pellucidum is obtained and the circle of Willis visualized with color or power Doppler. The MCA is examined close to its origin from the internal carotid artery. The sample volume should be placed in the center of the vessel and the angle between the ultrasound beam and the direction of blood flow kept as close to 0 degrees as possible. Angle correction can be used if required. The highest peak systolic waveform is measured, in the absence of fetal breathing movements. An elevated MCA Doppler measurement indicates that the fetus is likely to be anemic, but this measurement is not perfectly sensitive or specific.
is_a: HP:0034190 ! Abnormal fetal cardiovascular physiology
property_value: dc:date "2022-03-12T23:26:48Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034192
name: Pulmonary thromboembolism
synonym: "الانصمام الرئوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تجلط في رئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الانصمام الرئوي ناتج عن انسدادات تنشأ من الجلطات الوريدية التي تنتقل لتسد شرايين الرئة.
def: "Pulmonary embolism is caused by emboli, which have originated from venous thrombi, traveling to and occluding the arteries of the lung." [PMID:29770793]
comment: Pulmonary embolism (PE) is the most dangerous form of venous thromboembolism, and undiagnosed or untreated PE can be fatal. Acute PE is associated with right ventricular dysfunction, which can lead to arrhythmia, haemodynamic collapse and shock. Furthermore, individuals who survive PE can develop post-PE syndrome, which is characterized by chronic thrombotic remains in the pulmonary arteries, persistent right ventricular dysfunction, decreased quality of life and/or chronic functional limitations.
is_a: HP:0001907 ! Thromboembolism
property_value: dc:date "2022-03-16T14:05:15Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034193
name: Stratum basale cleavage
synonym: "انشقاق الطبقة القاعدية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقاعات بالجلد السفلي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انشقاق ضمن خلايا البشرة الكيراتينية، وهو الطبقة الداخلية من البشرة ويتكون من خلايا متكاثرة تعطي طبقات الجلد الخارجية.
def: "Cleavage within the epidermal keratinocytes, which is the innermost layer of the epidermis and consists of proliferating cells that give rise to the outer layers of the epidermis." []
comment: Cleavage in epidermolysis bullosa simplex occurs within the basal keratinocytes.
synonym: "Blistering with cleavage within basal keratinocytes" EXACT []
synonym: "Cleavage within the basal keratinocyte layer" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0033802 ! Intra-epidermal blistering
property_value: dc:date "2022-03-16T14:18:29Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034194
name: Suprabasal cleavage
synonym: "انشقاق فوق القاعدي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقاعات في الطبقة العلوية للبشرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انشقاق داخل طبقة الخلايا فوق القاعدية للبشرة، التي تقع مباشرة فوق الطبقة القاعدية وتتكون من خمس إلى عشر طبقات من الخلايا.
def: "Cleavage within the suprabasal cell layer of the epidermis, which lies directly above the basal layer and is composed of five to ten layers of cells." []
synonym: "Blistering with suprabasal clefting" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0033802 ! Intra-epidermal blistering
property_value: dc:date "2022-03-16T14:20:08Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034195
name: Triggered by muscle relaxant
synonym: "محفز بواسطة مرخيات العضلات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة حدوث الأعراض بسبب مرخيات العضلات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى علامة أو عَرَض يتحفز أو يُحدث نتيجة التعرض لمرخٍّ للعضلات مثل السكسمقسمونيوم والميفاكوريم.
def: "Applies to a sign or symptom that is provoked or brought about by exposure to a muscle relaxant such as suxamethonium and mivacurium." []
is_a: HP:4000101 ! Triggered by exposure to medication
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-07T13:21:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034196
name: Ductus venosus agenesis
synonym: "عدم التكوّن في القناة الوريدية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "غياب القناة الوريدية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل تطوري يتميز بعدم تكوّن القناة الوريدية (تحويلة تسمح للدم المؤكسج في الوريد السُرّي أن يتجاوز الكبد في الدورة الدموية الجنينية).
def: "A developmental defect characterized by lack of formation of the ductus venosus (a shunt that allows oxygenated blood in the umbilical vein to bypass the liver in the fetal circulation)." [PMID:10765517, PMID:21335936, PMID:24871613, PMID:24931552]
comment: The ductus venosus (DV) plays an essential role in the fetal circulation because it allows the oxygenated placental blood to bypass the liver and enables preferential flow via the right atrium and foramen ovale to the left atrium. Furthermore, normal umbilical flow via DV is involved in the normal development of the intrahepatic portal venous system. The lack of critical anastomoses between the portal and umbilical venous system and hepatic-systemic venous system results in agenesis of ductus venosus and shunting of umbilical blood through an aberrant vessel. Between 1 in 2532 to 1 in 556 fetuses are affected.
synonym: "Agenesis of the ductus venosus" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0010948 ! Abnormal fetal cardiovascular morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-07T14:12:24Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034197
name: Third trimester onset
synonym: "بداية في الثلث الثالث" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "يبدأ في الثلث الثالث من الحمل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير هذا المصطلح إلى سمة ظاهرية لوحظت لأول مرة قبل الولادة خلال الثلث الثالث، والذي يُعرف بأنه يبدأ من 28 أسبوع. 0 يوم (28+0) من الحمل.
def: "This term refers to a phenotypic feature that was first observed prior to birth during the third trimester, which is defined as 28 weeks and zero days (28+0) of gestation and beyond." []
is_a: HP:0011461 ! Fetal onset
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-07T15:49:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034198
name: Second trimester onset
synonym: "بداية في الثلث الثاني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "يبدأ في الثلث الثاني من الحمل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير هذا المصطلح إلى سمة ظاهرية لوحظت لأول مرة قبل الولادة خلال الثلث الثاني، والذي يشمل نطاق الأعمار الحملية من 14 أسبوع 0/7 إلى 27 أسبوع 6/7 (شاملاً).
def: "This term refers to a phenotypic feature that was first observed prior to birth during the second trimester, which comprises the range of gestational ages from 14 0/7 weeks to 27 6/7 (inclusive)." []
is_a: HP:0011461 ! Fetal onset
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-07T16:11:04Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034199
name: Late first trimester onset
synonym: "بداية متأخرة في الثلث الأول" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "يبدأ مبكرًا خلال الحمل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير هذا المصطلح إلى سمة ظاهرية لوحظت لأول مرة قبل الولادة في الثلث الأول خلال الفترة الجنينة المبكرة، والتي تُعرف بأنها بين 11 أسبوع 0/7 إلى 13 أسبوع 6/7 من الحمل (شاملاً).
def: "This term refers to a phenotypic feature that was first observed prior to birth in the first trimester during the early fetal period, which is defined as 11 0/7 to 13 6/7 weeks of gestation (inclusive)." []
synonym: "Early fetal onset" EXACT []
synonym: "Early foetal onset" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0011461 ! Fetal onset
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-07T16:13:41Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034200
name: Abnormal CSF homovanillic acid concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز حمض الهوموفانيلك في السائل النخاعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في مستوى مادة كيميائية في سائل الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن التركيز الطبيعي لحمض الهوموفانيلك (HVA) في السائل النخاعي. HVA هو ناتج أيضي للدوبامين.
def: "Any deviation from the normal concentration of homovanillic acid (HVA) in the cerebrospinal fluid. HVA is a metabolite of dopamine." []
is_a: HP:0025454 ! Abnormal CSF metabolite concentration
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-10T10:30:43Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034201
name: Increased CSF homovanillic acid concentration
synonym: "زيادة تركيز حمض الهوموفانيلك في السائل النخاعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في مستوى مادة كيميائية في سائل الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في تركيز حمض الهوموفانيلك (HVA) في السائل النخاعي. HVA هو ناتج أيضي للدوبامين.
def: "Elevated concentration of homovanillic acid (HVA) in the cerebrospinal fluid. HVA is a metabolite of dopamine." []
is_a: HP:0034200 ! Abnormal CSF homovanillic acid concentration
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-10T10:31:36Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034202
name: Abnormal iduronate sulfatase concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز الإيدورونات سولفاتاز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في مستوى الإنزيم في الجسم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في مستوى إنزيم الإيدورونات سولفاتاز في الدورة الدموية.
is_a: HP:0012379 ! Abnormal circulating enzyme concentration or activity
property_value: dc:date "2022-04-10T10:45:55Z" xsd:dateTime
