id: HP:0034241
name: Prenatal death
synonym: "وفاة قبل الولادة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وفاة داخل الرحم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وفاة الجنين في الرحم.
def: "Death of a fetus in the uterus." []
synonym: "Death before birth" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Intrauterine death" EXACT []
