property_value: dc:date "2022-05-28T21:54:01Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034280
name: Target cells
synonym: "خلايا الهدف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلايا الدم المستهدفة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلايا الهدف (الكودوسيت) تحتوي على قرص وسطى من الهيموغلوبين محاطًا بمنطقة باهتة وحافة خارجية من الهيموغلوبين بجانب غشاء الخلية مما يعطيها مظهر الهدف.
def: "Target cells (codocytes) have a centrally located disk of hemoglobin surrounded by an area of pallor with an outer rim of hemoglobin adjacent to the cell membrane giving the cell the appearance of a target." [PMID:27372866, PMID:32965812]
synonym: "Codocytes" EXACT []
