[Term]
id: HP:0034310
name: Post-vaccination yellow fever
synonym: "الحمى الصفراء بعد التطعيم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى الحمى الصفراء بعد اللقاح" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدوى بفيروس الحمى الصفراء الخاص بلقاح حي مُضعف.
def: "Infection with the yellow fever virus of the live-attenuated vaccine." [PMID:31270247]
synonym: "Postvaccination yellow fever" EXACT []
