[Term]
id: HP:0034322
name: Reduced tissue galactocerebrosidase activity
synonym: "انخفاض نشاط جالاكتوسيريبروزيداز النسيجي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص نشاط إنزيم محدد في الأنسجة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز أو نشاط إنزيم جالاكتوسيريبروزيداز (EC 3.2.1.46) أقل من الحد الأدنى الطبيعي. يمكن قياس هذا الإنزيم في أنسجة متعددة بما في ذلك الخلايا البيضاء والليفوبلاست المستزرعة.
def: "Concentration or activity of galactocerebrosidase (EC 3.2.1.46) below the lower limit of normal. This enzyme can be measured in multiple tissues including leukocytes and cultured fibroblasts." [PMID:34015306]
comment: Reduced galactocerebrosidase activity is a feature of Krabbe disease. Galactosylceramidase is a lysosomal enzyme involved in the catabolism of galactosylceramide, a major lipid in myelin, kidney, and epithelial cells of the small intestine and colon
synonym: "Reduced circulating galactocerebrosidase activity" NARROW []
synonym: "Reduced galactocerebrosidase activity in cultured fibroblasts" NARROW []
synonym: "Reduced leukocyte galactocerebrosidase activity" NARROW []
