property_value: dc:date "2022-09-04T15:46:32Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034349
name: Supravalvar pulmonary stenosis
synonym: "تضيق الرئة فوق الصمام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضيق فوق صمام الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه قلبي يتميز بتضيق عند مستوى تقاطع الشرايين الرئوية فوق الصمام الرئوي.
def: "A cardiovascular malformation associated with narrowing at the level of the pulmonary sinotubular junction above the pulmonic valve." [PMID:34304616]
