[Term]
id: HP:0034350
name: Valvular pulmonary stenosis
synonym: "تضيق الصمام الرئوي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضيق صمام الرئة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه قلبي يتميز بتضيق في المخرج البطيني الأيمن مباشرة عند مستوى الصمام الرئوي.
def: "A cardiovascular malformation associated with narrowing of the outflow tract of the right ventricle immediately at the level of the pulmonary valve." []
