[Term]
id: HP:0034354
name: Trichoschisis
synonym: "تشقق الشعرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تكسّر الشعر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كسور عرضية في أعمدة الشعر (تشقق الشعرة) تتميز بكسر عرضي حاد لعمود الشعرة.
def: "Transverse fractures through the hair shafts (trichoschisis). Trichoschisis is characterized by a sharp transverse fracture of the hair shaft." [PMID:23180925]
comment: Hair from individuals with trichothiodistrophy (TTD) exhibits an alternating light and dark (so-called tiger tail) banding pattern with trichoschisis. See figure 2 of PMID:23180925.
is_a: HP:0003328 ! Abnormal hairshaft morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-09-04T19:03:05Z" xsd:dateTime
