[Term]
id: HP:0034363
name: Corneal pterygium
synonym: "ظفرة القرنية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عين المتزلج" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ظفرة القرنية هي مرض يصيب سطح العين، يتميز بنمو على شكل جناح من النسيج الليمبي والملتحمة على القرنية المجاورة.
def: "Corneal pterygium is an ocular surface disease characterized mainly by a wing-shaped growth of limbal and conjunctival tissue over the adjacent cornea." [PMID:34104871]
comment: In ophthalmological contexts, the word 'pterygium' is frequently used without further qualifiers to denote corneal pterygium.
