[Term]
id: HP:0034384
name: Elevated circulating insulin:C-peptide ratio
synonym: "ارتفاع نسبة الأنسولين إلى السي بيبتايد في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ارتفاع نسبة الأنسولين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة نسبة الأنسولين إلى السي بيبتايد في الدورة الدموية.
def: "Increased ratio of insulin to C-peptide in the blood circulation." [PMID:15161766]
comment: Insulin and C-peptide are secreted into portal vein in equimolar amounts, but the serum ratio is normally from 1:5 to 1:15 due to removal of approximately 50% of insulin from blood during initial passage through the liver.
is_a: HP:0040214 ! Abnormal circulating insulin concentration
property_value: dc:date "2022-09-07T13:34:06Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034385
name: Abnormal left ventricular endsystolic diameter
synonym: "شذوذ في قطر نهاية الانقباض البطيني الأيسر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في حجم البطين الأيسر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف عن النطاق الطبيعي لقطر نهاية الانقباض البطيني الأيسر.
def: "A deviation from the normal range of the left ventricular endsystolic diameter." [PMID:24451180]
comment: The measurement of the left ventricular endsystolic diameter is performed in the parasternal long-axis view, perpendicular to the long axis of the left ventricle at the tips of the mitral valve leaflets. It refers to the transverse (left-to-right) internal (luminal) distance, excluding thickness of walls. The normal range can be taken as 20-40 mm (total 2SD range 17.6-52.3 according to PMID:24451180).
is_a: HP:0025169 ! Left ventricular systolic dysfunction
property_value: dc:date "2022-09-07T13:37:59Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

