synonym: "شعر قليل الكبريت" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كمية منخفضة بشكل غير طبيعي من الكبريت في الشعر.
def: "Abnormally low amount of sulfur in hair." [PMID:11369901]
comment: Normal hair keratin is high in sulfur content.
synonym: "Hair sulfur content reduced" EXACT []
synonym: "Hair sulphur content reduced" EXACT uk_spelling []
