[Term]
id: HP:0034432
name: Intertriginous distribution
synonym: "توزيع بين ثنيات الجلد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "توزيع الطفح بين ثنيات الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على توطين آفة جلدية في أي منطقة من الجسم حيث يمكن أن يتلامس سطحا جلد متقابلين ويتسبب في احتكاك.
def: "Applies to the localization of a skin lesion involving any area of the body where two opposing skin surfaces can touch and rub or chaff." [PMID:21396557]
comment: The word intertrigo comes from the Latin inter (between) and terere (to rub) and reflects the rubbing together of skin against skin to create maceration and irritation, hence, friction dermatitis or chaffing.
synonym: "Intertriginous distribution of skin lesions" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: dc:date "2022-11-26T13:08:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034433
name: Distributed along skin tension lines
synonym: "توزيع على طول خطوط شد الجلد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طفح جلدي على طول خطوط الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على توطين آفة جلدية تتوافق مع خطوط شد الجلد، وهي شقوق خطية في الجلد تشير إلى اتجاه ترتيب ألياف الكولاجين تحت الجلد. تُعرف خطوط شد الجلد أيضًا بخطوط لانجر أو خطوط الاسترخاء.
def: "Applies to the localization of a skin lesion that correspond to skin tension lines, which are linear clefts in the skin that indicate the direction of orientation of the underlying collagen fibers. Skin tension lines are also known as Langer's lines or lines of cleavage." []
synonym: "Distributed along Langer's lines" EXACT []
synonym: "Lesions follow lines of cleavage" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: dc:date "2022-11-26T13:11:23Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

