[Term]
id: HP:0034500
name: Glenoid fracture
synonym: "كسر الجلونويد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كسر في تجويف الكتف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كسر في حفرة الكتف، وهو طبق ضحل يقع على الجهة الجانبية لعظم الكتف ويعتبر جزء من مفصل الكتف الذي يتلاقى ليتصل برأس العضد.
def: "A fracture of the glenoid fossa, a relatively shallow dish is located on the lateral scapula and is the socket portion of the shoulder joint that meets to articulate the humeral head." [PMID:31335046]
is_a: HP:0041245 ! Fractured shoulder bone
property_value: dc:date "2022-12-10T17:40:08Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034501
name: Widened mediastinum
synonym: "توسع المنصف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة عرض المنصف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في عرض المنصف، وغالباً ما يعرف بأنه أكبر من 6 إلى 8 سم.
def: "Abnormal increase in the width of the mediastinum, often defined as being greater than 6 to 8 cm." [PMID:30969712]
comment: This feature can be ascertained by plain chest radiography. A wide mediastinum has many causes which include thoracic aortic aneurysm of the ascending and proximal descending aorta, aortic dissection of ascending and proximal descending aorta, unfolding of the aorta, traumatic aortic rupture, hilar lymphadenopathy, mediastinal masses, mediastinitis, cardiac tamponade, and fractured ribs or thoracic vertebrae.
synonym: "Mediastinal widening" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0045026 ! Abnormal mediastinum morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-12-10T17:43:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034502
name: Narrow mediastinum
synonym: "تضيّق المنصف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضيق في وسط الصدر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في عرض المنصف.
def: "Abnormal decrease in the width of the mediastinum." []
is_a: HP:0045026 ! Abnormal mediastinum morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-12-10T17:53:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034503
name: Ovarian torsion
synonym: "التواء المبيض" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التواء في المبيض" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التواء المبيض هو التواء في الأربطة التي تدعم البنى المحيطة بالملحقات، مما يقطع تدفق الدم إلى المبيض.
def: "Ovarian torsion is a twisting of the ligaments that support the adnexa, cutting off the blood flow to the ovary." [PMID:32809510]
is_a: HP:0031065 ! Abnormal ovarian morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-12-10T17:59:22Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034504
name: Septate gallbladder
synonym: "المرارة ذات الحاجز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حاجز في المرارة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تتميز المرارة ذات الحاجز بوجود حاجز يقسم المرارة إلى حجرتين. عند وجود الحاجز بالطول، تسمى المرارة ثنائية الفص، وعند وجود حاجز عرضي يفصل القاع عن باقي المرارة، تُسمى المرارة بشكل الساعة الرملية.
def: "Septate gallbladder is characterized by the presence of a septum that divides the gallbladder in two chambers. When the septum dividing the gallbladder lies longitudinally it is called bilobed gallbladder and when there is a transverse septum separating the fundus from the rest of the gallbladder it is called an hour-glass gallbladder." [PMID:19547674]
is_a: HP:0012437 ! Abnormal gallbladder morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-12-10T18:01:54Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034505
name: Gallbladder wall thickening
synonym: "زيادة سمك جدار المرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "جدار المرارة السميك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في سمك جدار المرارة.
def: "Abnormal increased in the thickness of the wall of the gallbladder." [PMID:24370153]
comment: Gallbladder wall thickening is a common yet nonspecific finding that can occur in a wide range of gallbladder diseases and extracholecystic conditions.
is_a: HP:0012437 ! Abnormal gallbladder morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-12-10T18:04:23Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034506
name: Gallbladder enlargement
synonym: "تضخم المرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "المرارة المتضخمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في حجم المرارة.
def: "Abnormal increased in the thickness of the size of the gallbladder." [PMID:34496644]
synonym: "Gallbladder enlarged" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012437 ! Abnormal gallbladder morphology
property_value: dc:date "2022-12-10T18:07:02Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034507
name: Gallbladder mass
