def: "Reduced hydrolysis (splitting of a bond and the addition of the hydrogen anion of water) of the sulfuric ester linkage in the molecule of cerebroside sulfate, possibly leading to accumuation of cerebroside sulfate." [PMID:6137805]
comment: This feature can be assayed by cerebroside sulfate loading tests of cultured dermal fibroblasts.
