comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب بصري حيث تبدو الأشياء في مجال الرؤية وكأنها تهتز (تقفز، تهتز، تتذبذب).
def: "A visual disturbance in which objects in the visual field appear to oscillate (jump, jiggle, vibrate)." [PMID:21102332]
comment: Oscillopsia most often results from abnormal eye movements or from impaired vestibulo-ocular reflex.
