alt_id: HP:6000178
def: "Excretion of pus (purulent discharge) from the opening of the parotid duct." [PMID:34952006]
comment: See Figure 2 of PMID:34952006. The Stensen duct is also known as the parotid duct and is the route that saliva takes from the major salivary gland (parotid gland) to the mouth.
synonym: "Purulent drainage from Stensen duct" EXACT []
synonym: "Purulent Stensen duct drainage" EXACT []
