[Term]
id: HP:0034782
name: Obstipation
synonym: "انحباس البراز والغازات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم القدرة على إخراج البراز أو الغاز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الانحباس هو عدم القدرة على تمرير البراز أو إخراج الغازات.
def: "Obstipation is the inability to pass either stool or flatus (gas)." []
comment: Obstipation can be a sign of an acute obstruction of the GI tract, either of the small or large bowel.
synonym: "Lack of flatulence" EXACT []
synonym: "No gas passage" EXACT []
synonym: "Tympanic distended abdomen" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0002019 ! Constipation
property_value: dc:date "2023-06-12T12:48:58Z" xsd:dateTime
