property_value: dc:date "2023-07-01T11:06:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034807
name: Paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnea
synonym: "ضيق التنفس الليلي الانتيابي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نوبات ضيق التنفس ليلاً" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوبات من ضيق التنفس تحدث ليلاً وقد توقظ المريض من النوم.
def: "Attacks of breathlessness that occur at night and may awaken the sleeping patient." [PMID:26933707]
synonym: "Paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnea" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002094 ! Dyspnea
property_value: dc:date "2023-07-01T11:11:31Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:0034808
name: Eyelid pain
synonym: "ألم الجفن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجع في الجفن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير مريح يتميز بعدم الراحة الجسدية مثل الوخز أو النبض أو الألم ويرتكز في الجفن.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the eyelid." []
is_a: HP:0012531 ! Pain
is_a: HP:0031879 ! Abnormal eyelid physiology
property_value: dc:date "2023-07-01T11:16:00Z" xsd:dateTime
