comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في كمية ألياف الكولاجين في الأدمة.
def: "Abnormally reduced amount of collagen fibers in the dermis." [PMID:29606302]
comment: See Figure 4C of PMID:29606302.
is_a: HP:0031512 ! Abnormal cutaneous collagen fibril morphology
property_value: dc:date "2023-07-10T11:07:29Z" xsd:dateTime
