synonym: "ورم مخاطي رحمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم في الرحم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم مخاطي (ورم من نسيج ضام بدائي) متمركز في الرحم.
def: "A myxoma (tumor of primitive connective tissue) localized to the uterus." []
is_a: HP:0010784 ! Uterine neoplasm
property_value: dc:date "2023-07-10T11:49:12Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

