[Term]
id: HP:0040012
name: Chromosome breakage
synonym: "تكسر الكروموسومات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تقصف الكروموسومات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: معدل مرتفع لتكسر الكروموسومات أو تبديل مواقعها يحدث إما تلقائيًا أو عقب التعرض لمواد تضر بالـDNA. يمكن اختبار هذه الخاصية عبر علاج الخلايا اللمفاوية المستنبتة بمواد مثل المطفرات الكيميائية، الإشعاع، والعوامل الممّثلة.
def: "Elevated rate of chromosomal breakage or interchanges occurring either spontaneously or following exposure to various DNA-damaging agents. This feature may be assayed by treatment of cultured lymphocytes with agents such as chemical mutagens, irradiation, and alkylating agents." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:12407692]
synonym: "High frequency of chromosome breaks in lymphocytes" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased chromosomal breakage" EXACT []
synonym: "Increased chromosomal breakage rate" EXACT []
synonym: "Multiple chromosomal breaks" EXACT []
synonym: "Tendency to chromosomal breakage" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C0376628
is_a: HP:0003220 ! Abnormality of chromosome stability
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399

