property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399

[Term]
id: HP:0040138
name: Mucinous histiocytosis
synonym: "هستيو سيتوز المخاطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حبوب تحت الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حمى ذات استشعار متعدد ونقاط جلدية ذات لون الجلد، تتميز بتسلل بين الكولوجين والهستيو سيتوزيات الخيطية والطلائية والمخاط في طبقات الجلد العلوية والوسطى.
def: "Multiple subcutaneous non-fragile and skin-coloured papules characterized by interstitial infiltrate of spindle and epithelioid histiocytes, and mucin. There are well circumscribed aggregates of epithelioid histiocytes and mucin in the upper and middle dermis,with the histiocytes arranged between collagen bundles and separated from the epidermis by a Grenz zone." [PMID:10606860]
synonym: "Histiocytosis, mucinous" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:87412005
xref: UMLS:C0334126
is_a: HP:0100727 ! Histiocytosis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399

[Term]
id: HP:0040139
name: Lipogranulomatosis
synonym: "الشذوذ الحبيبي الشحمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تجمعات صفراء تحت الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ترسب كتل صفراء من المواد الشحمية في الجلد والأغشية المخاطية، مما يؤدي إلى تفاعلات حبيبية.
def: "Yellow nodules of lipoid material are deposited in the skin and mucosae. This gives rise to granulomatous reactions." []
comment: Usually caused by a faulty lipid metabolism
