[Term]
id: HP:0040194
name: Increased head circumference
synonym: "زيادة محيط الرأس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "محيط رأس كبير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في محيط الرأس عند طفل ينمو. يُقاس محيط الرأس بشريط غير مرن، ويحيط حول الرأس من فوق الحاجبين والأذنين وحول مؤخرة الرأس. يتم رسم هذا القياس على مخطط النمو المناسب.
def: "An abnormally increased head circumference in a growing child. Head circumference is measured with a nonelastic tape and comprises the distance from above the eyebrows and ears and around the back of the head. The measured HC is then plotted on an appropriate growth chart." []
synonym: "Increased head circumference" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4083076
is_a: HP:0000240 ! Abnormality of skull size

[Term]
id: HP:0040195
name: Decreased head circumference
synonym: "نقص محيط الرأس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "محيط رأس صغير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص غير طبيعي في محيط الرأس عند طفل ينمو. يُقاس محيط الرأس بشريط غير مرن، ويحيط الرأس من فوق الحاجبين والأذنين وحول مؤخرة الرأس. يُعرف صِغر الرأس عندما يكون محيط الرأس أقل بمقدار اثنين أو ثلاثة انحرافات معيارية عن المتوسط لمجموعات مستندة إلى العمر والجنس.
def: "An abnormally reduced head circumference in a growing child. Head circumference is measured with a nonelastic tape and comprises the distance from above the eyebrows and ears and around the back of the head. The measured HC is then plotted on an appropriate growth chart. Microcephaly is defined as a head circumference (HC) that is great than two standard deviations below the mean of age- and gender-matched population based samples. Severe microcephaly is defined with an HC that is three standard deviations below the mean." [PMID:26505062]
comment: Although HC measures skull size, it typically also reflects overall brain volume and has been described as a widely used proxy of neural growth and brain size. Brain size outside of normal values is an important risk factor for cognitive and motor delay. Microcephaly at birth has been termed primary microcephaly and that acquired after birth is secondary microcephaly.
synonym: "Decreased head circumference" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:271611007
xref: UMLS:C0424688
is_a: HP:0000240 ! Abnormality of skull size

[Term]
id: HP:0040196
name: Mild microcephaly
synonym: "صغر الرأس الخفيف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صغر رأس خفيف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في محيط الرأس (OFC) بين -3 و-2 انحرافات معيارية مقارنة بالمعايير الطبيعية المتماثلة مع العمر.
def: "Decreased occipito-frontal (head) circumference (OFC). For the microcephaly OFC must be between -3 SD and -2 SD compared to appropriate, age matched, normal standards (i.e. -3 SD <= OFC < -2 SD)." []
xref: UMLS:C1836806
is_a: HP:0040195 ! Decreased head circumference

[Term]
id: HP:0040197
name: Encephalomalacia
synonym: "تلين الدماغ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "أنسجة الدماغ اللينة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تلين الدماغ هو فقدان أو تليين نسيج الدماغ بعد احتشاء الدماغ، نقص التروية الدماغية، العدوى، إصابة الرأس، أو إصابة أخرى.
def: "Encephalomalacia is the softening or loss of brain tissue after cerebral infarction, cerebral ischemia, infection, craniocerebral trauma, or other injury." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0003-6754]
synonym: "Cerebral softening" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:58762006
xref: UMLS:C0014068
is_a: HP:0002060 ! Abnormal cerebral morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0003-6754

