[Term]
id: HP:0040212
name: Risus sardonicus
synonym: "السخرية الشديدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ابتسامة عضلية ثابته" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انقباض ثابت وساخر للوجه وتعبير مفعم بالقلق ناتج عن تشنجات في العضلة الماضغة وعضلات الوجه الأخرى.
def: "Fixed sarcastic grimace and anxious expression. Caused by spasms of the masseter and other facial muscles." []
comment: Accompanied by rigidity of neck and trunk muscles and arching of back. Often observed as a sign of tetanus.
synonym: "Rictus grin" EXACT []
