id: HP:0040225
name: Decrease in high molecular weight von Willebrand factor Multimers
synonym: "انخفاض في العوامل متعددة الوحدات ذات الوزن الجزيئي العالي لفون ويلبراند" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض عوامل فون ويلبراند الكبيرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في العوامل متعددة الوحدات ذات الوزن الجزيئي العالي لفون ويلبراند.
def: "A decrease in high molecular weight von Willebrand factor multimers." []
comment: Requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium.
synonym: "Decrease in HMW VWF multimers" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280718
is_a: HP:0030131 ! Abnormal von Willebrand factor multimer distribution

[Term]
id: HP:0040226
name: Decreased level of heparin co-factor II
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى معين الدم الثاني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص معامل مساعد الهيبارين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب في التخثر متعلق بانخفاض تركيز معين الدم الثاني.
def: "An abnormality of coagulation related to a decreased concentration of heparin co-factor II" []
comment: Requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "Heparin co-factor II deficiency" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280717
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040227
name: Decreased level of histidine-rich glycoprotein
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى الجليكوبروتين غني بالهيستيدين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص الجليكوبروتين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يؤدي انخفاض هذه المستويات إلى زيادة تثبيط تفكك الليفين وتقليل تثبيط التخثر.
def: "Decrease of these levels result in increased inhibition of fibrinolysis and reduced inhibition of coagulation" []
comment: Requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280716
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040228
name: Decreased level of plasminogen
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى البلازمينوجين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص البلازمينوجين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في مستوى البلازمينوجين.
def: "A decreased level of Plasminogen" []
comment: Requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "Hypoplasminogenemia" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280715
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway
is_a: HP:0032312 ! Decreased circulating globulin concentration

[Term]
id: HP:0040229
name: Decreased level of thrombomodulin
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى الثرومبومودولين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص الثرومبومودولين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الثرومبومودولين هو عامل مساعد في تنشيط البروتين C بواسطة الثرومبين. في حالة النقص، سيكون هناك بروتين C أقل وميل لزيادة التخثر.
def: "Thrombomodulin is a cofactor in the thrombin induced activation of Protein C. In the case of deficiency there will be less Protein C and tendency to clot" []
comment: Requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "BDCA-3" RELATED []
xref: UMLS:C4255334
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040230
name: Decreased level of tissue plasminogen activator
synonym: "انخفاض مستوى منشط البلازمينوجين النسيجي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص منشط البلازمينوجين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يقوم بروتين tPA بتحفيز تحويل البلازمينوجين إلى بلازمين، وبالتالي يساهم في تكسير الجلطات. عند وجود نقص فيه، سيؤدي ذلك إلى زيادة في التخثر.
def: "The tPA protein catalyzes the conversion of plasiminogen to plasmin, and thus break down of clots. When there is a deficiency there will be an increase of thrombosis" []
comment: Requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "Decreased level of tPA" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280714
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040231
name: Abnormal onset of bleeding
synonym: "اضطراب في بداية النزيف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بداية نزيف غير طبيعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
xref: UMLS:C4280713
is_a: HP:0001892 ! Abnormal bleeding

[Term]
id: HP:0040232
name: Delayed onset bleeding
synonym: "نزيف بدء متأخر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تأخر في نزيف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نزيف غير طبيعي متعلق بإجراء أو صدمة لا يبدأ في وقت الإصابة الأولي، ولكن يتأخر لمدة 24 ساعة على الأقل.
def: "Abnormal bleeding related to a procedure or trauma which does not start at the time of the initial insult, but after delay by at least 24 hours." []
xref: UMLS:C4280712
is_a: HP:0040231 ! Abnormal onset of bleeding

[Term]
id: HP:0040233
name: Factor XIII subunit A deficiency
synonym: "نقص تحت وحدة A لعامل XIII" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص في عامل التخثر 13" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص في العامل XIII الوحدة الفرعية A، مما يؤدي إلى انخفاض نشاط العامل XIII. يقوم العامل XIII المنشط بربط ألياف الفبرين لتثبيت الجلطات.
def: "Deficiency of factor XIII subunit A, leading to a reduced factor XIII activity. Activated Factor XIII cross-links fibrin polymers solidifying the clot." []
comment: Measurement of subunit A or B can be performed by Elisa kits. Adding the more granular term would facilitate mutation analysis as both subunits are encoded by different genes. This is not always performed in the diagnostic workup so 'Reduced factor XIII activity' would sufice. This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "Reduced factor XIII, subunit A" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C2750514
is_a: HP:0008357 ! Reduced factor XIII activity

[Term]
id: HP:0040234
name: Factor XIII subunit B deficiency
synonym: "نقص عامل التخثر الثالث عشر الوحدة الفرعية ب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص عامل التخثر الثالث عشر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص في الوحدة الفرعية ب من عامل التخثر الثالث عشر مما يؤدي إلى نقص في نشاط العامل الثالث عشر. يُفعِّل العامل الثالث عشر المُنَشَّط تشابك البوليمرات الفبرينية لتثبيت الجلطة.
def: "Deficiency of factor XIII subunit B, leading to a reduced factor XIII activity. Activated Factor XIII cross-links fibrin polymers solidifying the clot." []
comment: Measurement of subunit A or B can be performed by Elisa kits. Adding the more granular term would facilitate mutation analysis as both subunits are encoded by different genes. This is not always performed in the diagnostic workup so 'Reduced factor XIII activity' would sufice. This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "Reduced factor XIII, subunit B" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C2750481
is_a: HP:0008357 ! Reduced factor XIII activity

[Term]
id: HP:0040235
name: Leukocyte inclusion bodies
synonym: "أجسام تضمينية في الكريات البيضاء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تراكمات داخل الكريات البيضاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أجسام تضمينية داخل الخلايا (تراكمات لمواد يمكن صبغها، عادة بروتينات) في الكريات البيضاء.
def: "The presence of intraceullar inclusion bodies (aggregates of stainable substances, usually proteins) in leukocytes." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "Dohle-like leukocyte inclusion bodies" EXACT []
synonym: "Inclusion bodies in leukocytes" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280711
is_a: HP:0008264 ! Neutrophil inclusion bodies

[Term]
id: HP:0040236
name: Hyperfibrinolysis
synonym: "فرط تحلل الفبرين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تحلل متزايد للفبرين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في تكسير الفبرين، مرتبطة بعدم استقرار الجلطة والنزيف.
def: "Increased degradation of fibrin, associated with clot instability and bleeding" []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C3805089
is_a: HP:0040224 ! Abnormality of fibrinolysis

[Term]
id: HP:0040237
name: Impaired binding of factor VIII to VWF
synonym: "ضعف ارتباط العامل الثامن بمولد فون ويلبراند" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف ارتباط العامل الثامن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ضعف في ارتباط العامل الثامن مع العامل فون ويلبراند. يتم تحديد ذلك باستخدام فحص ELISA المعدل.
def: "Impaired binding of factor VIII to von Willebrand Factor. This is determined using a modified ELISA assay." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "von Willebrand Disease Type II Normandy" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280710
is_a: HP:0012146 ! Abnormality of von Willebrand factor

[Term]
id: HP:0040238
name: Impaired neutrophil chemotaxis
synonym: "قلة اتجاه الكريات البيضاء المتعادلة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قصور في حركة الكريات البيضاء المتعادلة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في هجرة الكريات البيضاء المتعادلة تجاه الجاذبات الكيميائية كجزء من الاستجابة المناعية الفطرية.
def: "An impairment of the migration of neutrophils towards chemoattractants as part of the innate immune response" []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
synonym: "Neutrophil migratory defect" EXACT []
xref: UMLS:C4280709
is_a: HP:0005400 ! Reduction of neutrophil motility

[Term]
id: HP:0040239
name: Increased plasma vitamin K epoxide after vitamin K supplementation
synonym: "زيادة إبوكسيد فيتامين ك في البلازما بعد تناول مكملات فيتامين ك" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة إبوكسيد فيتامين ك بعد المكملات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة إبوكسيد فيتامين ك في البلازما بعد تناول مكملات فيتامين ك يظهر في النوع الثاني من نقص عوامل التخثر المعتمدة على فيتامين ك، ولكنه لا يظهر في النوع الأول.
def: "Increased plasma vitamin K epoxide after vitamin K supplementation is present in VKCFD (vitamin K-dependent clotting factor deficiency) type 2, but not in VKCFD type 1." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280708
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040240
name: Increased ratio of VWF propeptide to VWF antigen
synonym: "زيادة نسبة مستودع بروبيبتيد VWF إلى مستضد VWF" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة نسبة البروبيبتيد إلى المستضد لـVWF" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشير زيادة نسبة المستودع البروبيبتيدي للبروبيبتيد VWF إلى المستضد لـVWF إلى أن نقص VWF ليس نتيجة ضعف في التصنيع بل نتيجة سرعة التخلص منه. يتم قياس المستودع البروبيبتيدي لـVWF بواسطة ELISA.
def: "An increased VWF propeptide to VWF antigen indicates that deficiency of VWF is not due to impaired synthesis but due to rapid clearance. The VWF propeptide is measured by ELISA." []
comment: Some forms of von Willebrand Disease Type I (particularly those previously classified as type IC) and Acquired von Willebrand Disease. This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280707
is_a: HP:0012146 ! Abnormality of von Willebrand factor

[Term]
id: HP:0040241
name: Increased RIPA
synonym: "زيادة تحريض الصفيحات بالرستوسيتين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة تراكم الصفائح الدموية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة تجمع الصفيحات الدموية في استجابة لجرعة منخفضة من الرستوسيتين.
def: "Increased platelet agglutination in response to low-dose ristocetin" []
comment: Characteristic of type 2B von Willebrand Disease or platelet-type (pseudo) VWD. (NB: this is not the same as enhanced ristocetin coafactor assay activity) This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280706
is_a: HP:0030402 ! Abnormal platelet aggregation

[Term]
id: HP:0040242
name: Muscle hemorrhage
synonym: "نزف عضلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نزيف في العضلات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نزيف يحدث داخل العضلة.
def: "Bleeding occurring within a muscle" [PMID:27231694]
synonym: "Intramuscular haemorrhage" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Intramuscular hemorrhage" EXACT []
synonym: "Muscle haemorrhage" EXACT uk_spelling []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:95422003
xref: UMLS:C0151702
is_a: HP:0011029 ! Internal hemorrhage
is_a: HP:0011805 ! Abnormal skeletal muscle morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0040243
name: Prolonged euglobulin clot lysis time
synonym: "طول زمن انحلال الجلطة اليوغلوبولين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زمن طويل لانحلال الجلطة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة غير طبيعية في طول الزمن المطلوب لانحلال الجلطة في التجربة المختبرية في غياب مثبطات البلازمين الطبيعية. يُعتبر هذا الاختبار فحصًا سريريًا لقياس انحلال الفبرين. يتم ترسيب جزء اليوغلوبولين من البلازما ويُستخدم لتشكيل جلطة بإضافة الثرومبين؛ بعد تكوين الجلطة يمكن مراقبة سرعة تكسير الجلطة.
def: "Abnormally increased length of time required for an in vitro clot to dissolve in the absence of the normal plasmin inhibitors. This test is a clinical assay used to measure fibrinolysis. The euglobulin fraction of plasma is precipitated and used to form clot by addition of thrombin; after clot forms the rate of clot breakdown (fibrinolysis) can be monitored." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280705
is_a: HP:0040224 ! Abnormality of fibrinolysis

[Term]
id: HP:0040244
name: Prolonged Russell's viper venom time
synonym: "زيادة وقت سم أفعى راسل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زمن تخثر طويل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة الوقت اللازم للتخثر في اختبار سم أفعى راسل.
def: "Increased time to coagulation in the Russell's viper venom assay" []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280704
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040245
name: Reduced alpha-2-antiplasmin activity
synonym: "انخفاض نشاط ألفا-2-أنتيبلاسمين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض نشاط البروتين المانع للألياف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض نشاط ألفا-2-أنتيبلاسمين، وهو بروتين يقوم بتعطيل إنزيم البلاسمين الذي يُحفز عملية إذابة الجلطات.
def: "Reduced activity of alpha-2-antiplasmin. This protein inactivates the protease plasmin that drives fibrinolysis." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280703
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040246
name: Reduced antithrombin antigen
synonym: "انخفاض مستضد مضاد الثرومبين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص مضاد الثرومبين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض مستوى مستضد مضاد الثرومبين، مما قد يزيد من خطر تكوّن الجلطات.
def: "Reduced antithrombin antigen. A reduced level of antithrombin may lead to an increased risk of thrombus formation." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280702
is_a: HP:0010990 ! Abnormality of the common coagulation pathway

[Term]
id: HP:0040247
name: Reduced euglobulin clot lysis time
synonym: "انخفاض زمن انحلال الجلطة اليوغلوبولين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زمن انحلال الجلطة القصير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في مدة الزمن اللازمة لانحلال الجلطة في المختبر في غياب مثبطات البلاسمين الطبيعية. يستخدم هذا الاختبار لقياس عملية إذابة الجلطات؛ حيث يتم ترسيب جزء اليوغلوبولين من البلازما واستخدامه لتشكيل الجلطة عن طريق إضافة الثرومبين، ويمكن متابعة معدل انحلال الجلطة.
def: "Abnormally decreased length of time required for an in vitro clot to dissolve in the absence of the normal plasmin inhibitors. This test is a clinical assay used to measure fibrinolysis. The euglobulin fraction of plasma is precipitated and used to form clot by addition of thrombin; after clot forms the rate of clot breakdown (fibrinolysis) can be monitored." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280701
is_a: HP:0040224 ! Abnormality of fibrinolysis

[Term]
id: HP:0040248
name: Reduced plasminogen activator inhibitor 1 activity
synonym: "انخفاض نشاط مثبط منشط البلازمينوجين 1" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نشاط منخفض لمثبط إذابة الجلطة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض نشاط مثبط منشط البلازمينوجين 1، وهو بروتين يقلل من عملية إذابة الجلطات في الدم عن طريق تثبيط منشطي البلازمينوجين الرئيسيين: منشط الأنسجة ومنشط اليوروكيناز.
def: "Reduced activity of plasminogen activator inhibitor 1. This protein down-regulates fibrinolysis in the circulation by inhibiting the two major plasminogen activators: tissue-plasminogen activator and urokinase-plasminogen activator." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280700
is_a: HP:0430126 ! Abnormal circulating plasminogen activator inhibitor 1 activity

[Term]
id: HP:0040249
name: Reduced plasminogen activator inhibitor 1 antigen
synonym: "انخفاض مستضد مثبط منشط البلازمينوجين 1" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص بروتين مثبط لعملية إذابة الجلطات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض مستوى مستضد مثبط منشط البلازمينوجين 1.
def: "Reduced level of plasminogen activator inhibitor 1 antigen." []
comment: Added the antigen level as diagnosis with only activity levels is very difficult due to assay problems. Activity levels of control patients also include 0 within the normal limit. This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280699
is_a: HP:0430126 ! Abnormal circulating plasminogen activator inhibitor 1 activity

[Term]
id: HP:0040250
name: Reduced prothrombin antigen
synonym: "انخفاض مستضد البروثرومبين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص البروثرومبين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض مستوى مستضد البروثرومبين كما يقاس بواسطة اختبار ELISA. البروثرومبين هو عامل تخثر يعتمد على فيتامين ك ويتم شطره بروتينيًا لتشكيل الثرومبين.
def: "Reduced prothrombin antigen as measured by ELISA assay. Prothrombin is a vitamin K-dependent coagulation factor that is proteolytically cleaved to form thrombin." []
comment: This term has been requested and created by members of the BRIDGE consortium
xref: UMLS:C4280698
is_a: HP:0012200 ! Abnormality of prothrombin

[Term]
id: HP:0040251
name: Hand dimple
synonym: "غمازة في اليد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "دمل في اليد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض جلدي ينتج عن تعلق الجلد بالبنى العميقة (العظم) في اليد.
def: "A cutaneous indentation resulting from tethering of the skin to underlying structures (bone) of the hand." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
comment: Use case: PMC4498842
synonym: "Hand dimples" EXACT plural_form []
xref: UMLS:C4280697
is_a: HP:0010781 ! Skin dimple

[Term]
id: HP:0040252
name: Abnormal size of the clitoris
synonym: "شذوذ حجم البظر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حجم غير طبيعي للبظر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
xref: UMLS:C4280696
is_a: HP:0000056 ! Abnormal clitoris morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0040253
name: Increased size of the clitoris
synonym: "زيادة حجم البظر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في حجم البظر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة حجم البظر.
xref: UMLS:C4280695
is_a: HP:0040252 ! Abnormal size of the clitoris

[Term]
id: HP:0040254
name: Decreased size of the clitoris
synonym: "صغر حجم البظر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حجم البظر صغير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: صغر حجم البظر بشكل غير طبيعي مقارنة بالحجم الطبيعي.
xref: UMLS:C4280694
is_a: HP:0040252 ! Abnormal size of the clitoris

[Term]
id: HP:0040255
name: Aplasia/Hypoplasia of the clitoris
synonym: "عدم التنسج أو نقص التنسج البظر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "غياب أو نقص تطور البظر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
xref: UMLS:C4280693
is_a: HP:0000056 ! Abnormal clitoris morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0040256
name: Aplastic/Hypoplastic nasopharyngeal adenoids
synonym: "عدم التنسج أو نقص التنسج في اللحمية البلعومية الأنفية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم أو صغر اللحمية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب أو نقص التنسج في اللحمية البلعومية الأنفية.
def: "Absence or underdevelopment of the nasopharyngeal adenoids." []
synonym: "Adenoids small or absent" RELATED []
