[Term]
id: HP:0100014
name: Epiretinal membrane
synonym: "الغشاء فوق الشبكية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "غشاء على سطح الشبكية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الغشاء فوق الشبكية هو ورقة رقيقة من الأنسجة الليفية على سطح الشبكية على طول الغشاء الداخلي. يظهر كغشاء شبه شفاف رمادي اللون وخالي من الأوعية الدموية على سطح الشبكية.
def: "An epiretinal membrane is a thin sheet of fibrous tissue on the surface of the retina along the inner limiting membrane. It appears as a greyish semi-translucent avascular membrane over the internal limiting membrane (ILM) on the surface of the retina." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154, PMID:32809538]
comment: If the epiretinal membrane is localized in the macula, it can cause disturbances of vision.
synonym: "Cellophane maculopathy" EXACT []
synonym: "Epiretinal membranes" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Macular pucker" EXACT []
synonym: "Premacular fibrosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Surface wrinkling retinopathy" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:133853005
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:367649002
xref: UMLS:C0339543
is_a: HP:0030498 ! Macular thickening
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-05-14T09:53:27Z

[Term]
id: HP:0100015
name: Stahl ear
synonym: "أذن شتال" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة حجم في الحلمة الأذنية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود طية إضافية وهي الطية الثالثة للحلمة الأذنية، تنشأ عند أو فوق الانقسام الطبيعي للأنطويل.
def: "The presence of a supernumerary, i.e. third, crus of the helix in the helix, arising at or above the normal bifurcation of the antihelix." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: The helix is often poorly formed. Four types have been recognized in the surgical literature [Yamada and Fukuda, 1980].
synonym: "Additional crus" EXACT []
synonym: "Third crus" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:253252004
