[Term]
id: HP:0100028
name: Ectopic thyroid
synonym: "الغدة الدرقية المنتبذة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "موقع غير طبيعي للغدة الدرقية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توجد الغدة الدرقية خارج موقعها الطبيعي.
def: "Mislocalised thyroid gland." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: An aberrant or ectopic thyroid gland may occur anywhere along the path of initial descent of the thyroid. A total failure to descend contrasts with the incomplete descent of the thyroid, in which case the resulting final resting point of the gland may be high in the neck or just below the hyoid bone. Apart from an abnormal descent, accessory thyroid tissue can also occur, arising from remnants of the thyroglossal duct anywhere along the path of the thyroglossal duct tract.
synonym: "Aberrant thyroid" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
synonym: "Aberrant thyroid gland" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormal thyroid location" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Ectopic thyroid gland" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Heteropic thyroid gland" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:214660000
xref: UMLS:C0266283
is_a: HP:0008188 ! Thyroid dysgenesis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-06-10T10:16:37Z

[Term]
id: HP:0100029
name: Lingual thyroid
synonym: "الغدة الدرقية اللسانية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الغدة الدرقية عند قاعدة اللسان" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غدة درقية شاذة أو منتبذة تقع في قاعدة اللسان، خلف الثقبة العوراء نتيجة فشل الغدة الدرقية في النزول.
def: "An aberrant thyroid gland or Ectopic thyroid located at the base of the tongue, just posterior to the foramen cecum as a result of a failure of the thyroid to descend." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: A lingual thyroid is the most common form of an aberrant thyroid gland.
