[Term]
id: HP:0100268
name: Upper lip pit
synonym: "حفرة الشفة العلوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض في الشفة العلوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض يوجد على الشفة العليا، عادة بجانب خط الوسط.
def: "Depression located on the vermilion of the upper lip, usually paramedian." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: A lip pit may be connected by a fistula to mucous minor salivary glands in the upper lip. In addition, a lip pit may on occasion be seen with a surrounding tissue elevation (mound). Pits located at the labial commisure (cheilon) are distinct from lip pits (see Commissural pit).
