[Term]
id: HP:0100269
name: Paramedian lip pit
synonym: "حفرة الشفة الجانبية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض بجانب الشفة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض موجود بجانب خط الوسط على حافة الشفة.
def: "Depression located paramedially on the vermilion of a lip." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: A lip pit may be connected by a fistula to mucous minor salivary glands in the upper or lower lip. In addition, a lip pit may on occasion be seen with a surrounding tissue elevation (mound). Pits located at the labial commisure (cheilon) are distinct from lip pits (see Commissural pit).
synonym: "Paramedian labial pits" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
