[Term]
id: HP:0100313
name: Cerebral granulomatosis
synonym: "التهاب الدماغ الحُبيبي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب دماغي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب في الدماغ يتضمن استجابة حُبيبية، أي استجابة التهابية غير محددة تتضمن حُبيبات، وتعرف بأنها تجمع منظم مكثف من الخلايا البلعمية الناضجة مثل الخلايا الظهارية الكبيرة والخلايا العملاقة.
def: "Cerebral inflammation involving a granulomatous response, i.e., a non-specific inflammatory response involving granulomas, defined as a compact organized collection of mature mononuclear phagocytes including epithelioid and giant cells." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:937513]
comment: A granuloma is a compact (organized) collection of mature mononuclear phagocytes (macrophages and/or epithelioid cells) which may or may not be accompanied by accessory features such as necrosis or the infiltration of other inflammatory leukocytes (Adams DO. The granulomatous inflammatory response. Am J Pathol 1976:84:163-192).
xref: UMLS:C4022150
is_a: HP:0002060 ! Abnormal cerebral morphology
is_a: HP:0002955 ! Granulomatosis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-08-10T03:19:05Z

