comment: Arabic Definition: تجمعات نووية أو سيتوبلازمية للمواد الملونة داخل خلايا الدماغ.
def: "Nuclear or cytoplasmic aggregates of stainable substances within cells of the brain." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Inclusion bodies are usually derived from proteins.
