[Term]
id: HP:0100323
name: Juvenile aseptic necrosis
synonym: "النخر العقيم اليفعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "موت العظم عند الأطفال" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يضم النخر العقيم اليفعي مجموعة من الأمراض العظمية التي تتميز بوقف إمدادات الدم إلى العظم، يتبعها نخر موضعي في العظم غالبًا في المشاش لدى الأطفال أو المراهقين.
def: "Juvenile aseptic necrosis comprises a group of orthopedic diseases characterized by interruption of the blood supply of a bone, followed by localized bony necrosis most often of the epiphyses of bones of children or teenagers." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: Causes may be rapid growth, heredity, trauma or overuse and anatomic conformation.
synonym: "Aseptic epiphyseal necrosis" RELATED []
xref: UMLS:C4020710
xref: UMLS:C4022146
is_a: HP:0010885 ! Avascular necrosis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-08-10T04:02:42Z

[Term]
id: HP:0100324
name: Scleroderma
synonym: "تصلب الجلد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ظاهرة مناعية ذاتية مزمنة تتميز بالتليف (أو تصلب) وتغيرات في الأوعية الدموية للجلد.
alt_id: HP:0001594
alt_id: HP:0007426
def: "A chronic autoimmune phenomenon characterized by fibrosis (or hardening) and vascular alterations of the skin." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: A chronic autoimmune phenomenon characterised by fibrosis (or hardening), vascular alterations, and autoantibodies. Sclerosis of the skin occurs in association with disorders as diverse as mixed connective tissue disease and systemic sclerosis. This term is intended to represent the phenotypic feature scleroderma rather than a particular disease.
synonym: "Progressive systemic scleroderma" EXACT []
synonym: "Pseudoscleroderma" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:403524003
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:89155008
xref: UMLS:C0011644
xref: UMLS:C1274865
is_a: HP:0001072 ! Thickened skin
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-08-10T04:14:42Z

