[Term]
id: HP:0100599
name: Bifid penis
synonym: "قضيب منشطر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قضيب مزدوج" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هيكلة قضيبيتين منفصلتين من الطرف إلى قاعدة العمود.
def: "Two penile structures, separated from the tip to the base of the shaft." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154, PMID:23650202]
comment: In individuals with complete duplication often one will find Hypospadias, Epispadias, Bladder exstrophy, or Bifid scrotum, which should be coded separately, as well as urinary tract duplications, renal anomalies, and gastrointestinal duplications. The terms indicate the presence of (part of) two penises, but do not indicate whether they are caused by splitting or double formation.
synonym: "Diphallia" EXACT []
synonym: "Penile duplication" EXACT layperson []
