[Term]
id: HP:0100632
name: Pulmonary sequestration
synonym: "عزل الرئة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نسيج رئة غير متصل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود قطعة من نسيج الرئة غير متصلة بتوريد الدم الرئوي ولا تتواصل مع أنسجة الرئة الأخرى (غير متصلة بالمجاري الهوائية القصبية المعتادة ولا تقوم بوظيفة في التنفس).
alt_id: HP:0010960
def: "The presence of a piece lung tissue which is not attached to the pulmonary blood supply and does not communicate with the other lung tissue (not connected to the standard bronchial airways and not performing a function in respiration)." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154, PMID:20610189]
comment: Typically, the sequestered lung tissue receives all or most of its blood supply from an anomalous systemic artery, with the origin of this artery being variable.
synonym: "Bronchopulmonary sequestration" EXACT []
synonym: "Cystic lung lesion" RELATED []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:18620009
xref: UMLS:C0006288
xref: UMLS:C4020703
is_a: HP:4000059 ! Abnormal lung development
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-12-29T05:05:08Z

