comment: Arabic Definition: تصبغ داكن للظفر (بني، أسود، مزرق، وأحمر).
def: "Dark discoloration of a fingernail or toenail (brown, black, bluish and reddish)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:22792094]
comment: The most serious disease of the nail unit, melanoma, primarily presents with melanonychia. However, melanonychia most often occurs as a result of benign etiologies such as nail matrix melanocytic activation, nail matrix melanocytic hyperplasia, subungual hematoma, glomus tumor, and nail invasion by melanin-producing pathogens.
