[Term]
id: HP:0100656
name: Thoracoabdominal wall defect
synonym: "خلل في جدار الصدر والبطن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فتح في جدار الصدر والبطن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فشل في إغلاق جدار الصدر والبطن، قد يكون ناتجًا عن فشل في إغلاق الجدار البطني أمامياً خلال الأسبوع الرابع من النمو.
def: "Failure of the chest and abdominal wall to close, which is likely caused by the failure of the ventral wall to close during week 4 of development." [PMID:29348951]
comment: Thoracoschisis is a very rare congenital anomaly defined by the herniation of intra-abdominal organs through a defect in the thoracic wall. It be accompanied by thoracic ectopia cordis and gastroschisis.
synonym: "Thoracoabdominal schisis" EXACT []
