[Term]
id: HP:0100681
name: Esophageal duplication
synonym: "ازدواجية المريء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ازدواج المريء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب تطوري يحدث فيه ازدواج لجزء من العضلة والطبقة تحت المخاطية للمريء بدون ازدواج في النسيج الطلائي.
def: "A developmental disorder in which there is a duplication of a portion of the muscle and submucosa of the esophagus without epithelial duplication." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:10464795]
comment: Esophageal duplication is a rare cause of mediastinal mass. An esophageal duplication may be a simple epithelial cyst or duplication that contains muscle and submucosa but not epithelium. In most cases, the duplication is located in the lower third of the esophagus, and the most common associated symptom is difficulty in swallowing. Esophageal duplication occurs because of maldevelopment of the posterior division of embryonic foregut.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:66865009
xref: UMLS:C0266135
is_a: HP:0002031 ! Abnormal esophagus morphology
is_a: HP:0011140 ! Gastrointestinal duplication
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-12-30T02:08:38Z

[Term]
id: HP:0100682
name: Tracheal atresia
synonym: "رتق الرغامى" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم تكون الرغامى بشكل كامل عند الولادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: غياب خلقي أو نقص كبير في تطور الرغامى بحيث أنه لا يوجد اتصال بين الحنجرة من الأعلى والحويصلات الهوائية في الرئتين من الأسفل.
def: "A congenital absence or considerable underdevelopment of the trachea such that communication between the larynx proximally and the alveoli of the lungs distally is lacking." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:9776081]
comment: Diagnosis can be made if the neonate presents with respiratory distress at birth, unable to produce an audible cry in spite of an obvious physical effort, and cannot be intubated but shows some improvement when ventilated by bag and mask.
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:53189005
xref: UMLS:C0265766
is_a: HP:0002777 ! Tracheal stenosis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2010-12-30T02:09:37Z

