def: "Excess deposit and expansion of adipose tissue in an unusual pattern which cannot be lost through diet and exercise ." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: The pattern of fat deposition is most often bilateral, symmetrical and usually from the waist to a distinct line just above the ankles.
