[Term]
id: HP:0100702
name: Arachnoid cyst
synonym: "كيس العنكبوتية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كيس مملوء بالسوائل في الدماغ أو الحبل الشوكي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: جمع للسوائل خارج النسيج البارانشيمي وداخل العنكبوتية، وتكون هذه السوائل ذات تركيبة مشابهة للسائل الدماغي الشوكي.
def: "An extra-parenchymal and intra-arachnoidal collection of fluid with a composition similar to that of cerebrospinal fluid." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: Arachnoid cysts can be found on the brain, or on the spine. Intracranial arachnoid cysts usually occur adjacent to the arachnoidal cistern. Spinal arachnoid cysts may be extradural, intradural, or perineural.
synonym: "Arachnoid cysts" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Fluid-filled sac located in membrane surrounding brain or spinal cord" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
