[Term]
id: HP:0100767
name: Abnormal placenta morphology
synonym: "شذوذ شكل المشيمة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مشكلات في المشيمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل أو شذوذ في المشيمة، العضو الذي يربط الجنين النامي بجدار الرحم لتمكين امتصاص المغذيات وإزالة الفضلات وتبادل الغازات.
def: "An abnormality of the placenta, the organ that connects the developing fetus to the uterine wall to enable nutrient uptake, waste elimination, and gas exchange." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The placenta is a fetomaternal organ. The fetal portion of the placenta is the villous chorion and the maternal portion is the decidua basalis. The two portions are connected by anchoring villi that are anchored to the decidua basalis by the cytotrophoblastic shell.
synonym: "Abnormality of the placenta" EXACT []
synonym: "Placental issue" EXACT layperson []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:169957005
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:33552005
xref: UMLS:C1306893
is_a: HP:0001194 ! Abnormalities of placenta or umbilical cord
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2011-06-07T11:03:03Z

[Term]
id: HP:0100768
name: Choriocarcinoma
synonym: "السرطان المشيمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "سرطان المشيمة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم سرطاني عدواني، وغالبا ما يكون في المشيمة، يتميز بالانتشار المبكر عبر الدورة الدموية إلى الرئتين وينتمي إلى النوع الأقصى من طيف مرض الأرومة الغاذية الحملي، وهو نوع فرعي من أورام الخلايا الجذعية.
def: "A malignant, trophoblastic and aggressive cancer, usually of the placenta. It is characterized by early hematogenous spread to the lungs and belongs to the far end of the spectrum of gestational trophoblastic disease (GTD), a subset of germ cell tumors." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:188188009
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:44769000
xref: UMLS:C0008497
is_a: HP:0031502 ! Trophoblastic tumor
is_a: HP:0100767 ! Abnormal placenta morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2011-06-07T11:05:40Z

