[Term]
id: HP:0100770
name: Hyperperistalsis
synonym: "فرط الحركة التمعجية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اضطراب في حركة المعدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نشاط زائد للتموجات (الحركة الانقباضية للأعضاء الأنبوبية في الجهاز الهضمي) يتجلى بمرور الطعام بسرعة زائدة عبر المعدة والأمعاء.
def: "Excessively active peristalsis (wave of contraction of the tubular organs of the gastrointestinal tract) marked by excessive rapidity of the passage of food through the stomach and intestine." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Stomach churning" BROAD layperson [http://www.healthhype.com/stomach-churning-sensation-feeling-causes-remedies.html, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:271838002
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:80306002
xref: UMLS:C0232474
xref: UMLS:C0857071
is_a: HP:0030914 ! Abnormal peristalsis
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2011-06-07T11:53:08Z

[Term]
id: HP:0100771
name: Hypoperistalsis
synonym: "نقص التمعج" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بطء حركة الأمعاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض أو عدم كفاية التمعج، مما يؤدي إلى بطء مرور المحتويات عبر الجهاز الهضمي.
def: "Reduced or inadequate peristalsis, with resultant slow passage of contents through the digestive tract." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Intestinal hypoperistalsis" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:77853002
xref: UMLS:C0232475
xref: UMLS:C4020700
