[Term]
id: HP:0100774
name: Hyperostosis
synonym: "فرط التعظم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة نمو العظم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمو زائد أو تضخم غير طبيعي لنسيج العظم.
def: "Excessive growth or abnormal thickening of bone tissue." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Hyperostosis refers to a localized bone overgrowth process (as opposed to sclerosis, which refers to a generalized disturbance with increased bone density).
synonym: "Bone Hypertrophy" EXACT []
synonym: "Bone overgrowth" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
