[Term]
id: HP:0100777
name: Exostoses
synonym: "نمو زائد عظمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: النمو الزائد العظمي هو نمو حميد يبرز من سطح العظم. يكون مغطى بغضروف، وينشأ من عظم يتطور من الغضروف.
def: "An exostosis is a benign growth the projects outward from the bone surface. It is capped by cartilage, and arises from a bone that develops from cartilage." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Formation of new noncancerous bone on top of existing bone" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
