[Term]
id: HP:0100785
name: Insomnia
synonym: "الأرق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبة في النوم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: صعوبة مستمرة في بدء أو الحفاظ على النوم، أو الاستيقاظ مبكرًا عن المطلوب، على الرغم من وجود الفرص والشروط الملائمة للنوم.
def: "Persistent difficulty in starting or maintaining sleep, or waking up earlier than desired, despite having adequate opportunities and conditions for sleep." [PMID:36115372]
comment: The individual subjectively reports the inability to sleep, which may manifest as prolonged sleep latency, frequent awakenings, or premature morning awakening. This phenomenon is often linked or associated with distress, reduced daytime functioning, or dissatisfaction with sleep.
synonym: "Difficulty staying or falling asleep" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
synonym: "Inability to sleep" EXACT []
