synonym: "الإكانثولوسيس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقدان ارتباط الخلايا في البشرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فقدان الروابط بين الخلايا، مثل الديسموزومات، مما يؤدي إلى فقدان التماسك بين الخلايا الكيراتينية.
def: "The loss of intercellular connections, such as desmosomes, resulting in loss of cohesion between keratinocytes." [https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154]
comment: Acantolysis results in a positive Nikolsky's sign in which slight rubbing of the skin results in exfoliation of the outermost layer.
synonym: "Nikolsky's sign" RELATED []
