[Term]
id: HP:0100806
name: Sepsis
synonym: "الإنتان" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدوى في مجرى الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يُعرف الإنتان بأنه خلل وظيفي في الأعضاء يمثل خطرًا على الحياة ناتج عن استجابة غير منظمة للمضيف تجاه العدوى.
def: "Sepsis is defined as life-threatening organ dysfunction caused by a dysregulated host response to infection." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:26903338]
comment: For clinical operationalization, organ dysfunction can be represented by an increase in the Sequential Sepsis-related Organ Failure Assessment (SOFA) score of 2 points or more.
synonym: "Infection in blood stream" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6548-5200]
xref: UMLS:C0036690
is_a: HP:0032101 ! Unusual infection
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2011-06-09T01:05:51Z

[Term]
id: HP:0100807
name: Long fingers
synonym: "أصابع طويلة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الأصبع الوسطى أطول بأكثر من انحرافين معياريين عن المتوسط للعمر الحملي أو فوق المئين السابع والتسعين للأطفال. والأصابع الخمسة تحتفظ بنسبة طولها الطبيعية بالنسبة لبعضها البعض، أو أصابع تبدو أطول بشكل غير متناسب مقارنةً براحة اليد.
alt_id: HP:0006010
def: "The middle finger is more than 2 SD above the mean for newborns 27 to 41 weeks EGA or above the 97th centile for children from birth to 16 years of age AND the five digits retain their normal length proportions relative to each other (i.e., it is not the case that the middle finger is the only lengthened digit), or, Fingers that appear disproportionately long compared to the palm of the hand." [PMID:19125433]
synonym: "Long fingers" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C1858091
is_a: HP:0001167 ! Abnormal finger morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4530-3154
creation_date: 2011-06-09T01:13:15Z

