[Term]
id: HP:0100841
name: Microgastria
synonym: "صغر المعدة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حجم المعدة صغير" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل تطوري يتميز بوجود معدة أنبوبية أو كيسية صغيرة في المنتصف.
def: "A developmental anomaly with a small tubular or saccular midline stomach." [PMID:10067744]
comment: Patients with microgastria usually have poor growth, inadequate food consumption, or a complication of the small gastric cavity and gastroesophageal reflux, including frequent vomiting or pneumonia.
