[Term]
id: HP:0100852
name: Abnormal fear-induced behavior
synonym: "سلوك خوف غير طبيعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: السلوك الناتج عن الخوف غير الطبيعي يشمل الأفعال الملحوظة. يتميز هذا السلوك باستجابات غير طبيعية للخوف أو مستويات خوف غير طبيعية. تشمل أمثلة هذا السلوك تجنب المواقف التي تثير الخوف.
alt_id: HP:0001296
def: "An abnormal fear-induced behavior includes observable actions. This behavior is characterized by abnormal responses to fear or abnormal fear levels. Examples of such behavior include avoiding fear-inducing situations." []
comment: Internal responses to fear, which are experienced by an individual and do not necessarily involve clear behavioral changes (observable actions), should be labeled with a term for fear-related cognition, such as HP:5200230.
synonym: "Abnormal fear-induced behavior" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormal fear/anxiety-related behavior" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormal fear/anxiety-related behaviour" EXACT uk_spelling []
