[Term]
id: HP:0200036
name: Skin nodule
synonym: "عقدة جلدية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم صغير تحت الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشبه الحطاطة شكلاً ولكن يزيد قطرها عن 10 ملم في العرض والعمق، وغالبًا ما تتركز في الأدمة أو الدهون تحت الجلد.
def: "Morphologically similar to a papule, but greater than either 10mm in both width and depth, and most frequently centered in the dermis or subcutaneous fat." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
comment: A nodule is a palpable, solid, round lesion in the deep skin or subcuteaneous tissues that is larger and deeper than a papule. Nodules are solid circumscribed masses. A common definition is that a skin nodule has a diameter of more than 5 mm in infants and more than 10 mm in older children.
synonym: "Growth of abnormal tissue on or under the skin" EXACT []
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:95319004
xref: UMLS:C0037287
is_a: HP:0011355 ! Localized skin lesion
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399
creation_date: 2010-06-18T01:48:50Z

[Term]
id: HP:0200037
name: Skin vesicle
synonym: "حويصلة جلدية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "فقاعة صغيرة على الجلد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع محصور يحتوي على سائل في البشرة أقل من 10 ملم في القطر عند أعرض نقطة يشتمل على إفرازات سيروزية أو مصل مختلط بالدم أو القيح، يمكن أن تكون منفصلة أو مجمعة، وقد تختفي تلقائيًا أو تتضاعف إلى بثرات كبيرة.
def: "A circumscribed, fluid-containing, epidermal elevation less than 10mm in diameter at the widest point that (i) Contain serous exudates or serum mixed with blood or pus; (ii) Are discrete, grouped, irregularly distributed, or linear as in Rhus dermatitis; (iii) Are short-lived. Vesicles may break spontaneously or evolve into bullae by enlarging or coalescing with other vesicles." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
comment: Vesicles should be distinguished from bullae, which are are blisters that are greater than one cm in diameter containing serous or seropurulent fluid. Puss-filled vesicles are termed pustules.
xref: UMLS:C3814530
is_a: HP:0008066 ! Abnormal blistering of the skin
is_a: HP:0011355 ! Localized skin lesion
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399
creation_date: 2010-06-18T01:58:15Z

