[Term]
id: HP:0200043
name: Verrucae
synonym: "الثآليل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "البثور" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الثآليل، وهي نموات حميدة على الجلد أو الأغشية المخاطية تسبب مشاكل جمالية بالإضافة إلى الألم والانزعاج. غالبًا ما تظهر الثآليل على اليدين والقدمين والمناطق التناسلية.
def: "Warts, benign growths on the skin or mucous membranes that cause cosmetic problems as well as pain and discomfort. Warts most often occur on the hands, feet, and genital areas." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
comment: Cause is a virus called HPV (human papilloma virus), which infects the skin and causes the abnormal growth. There are many different varieties of the virus, which usually depends on the location of the lesion.
synonym: "Warts" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:30285000
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:57019003
xref: UMLS:C3665596
is_a: HP:0012740 ! Papilloma
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399
creation_date: 2010-06-18T11:35:25Z

[Term]
id: HP:0200044
name: Porokeratosis
synonym: "بوروكيراتوسيس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب استنساخي في تكوين الكيراتين يسبب وجود بقع ضامرة محاطة بحدود سميكة مميزة سريريًا ونسيجًا تعرف بالصفائح القرنوية.
def: "A clonal disorder of keratinization with one or multiple atrophic patches surrounded by a clinically and histologically distinctive hyperkeratotic ridgelike border called the cornoid lamella." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
