[Term]
id: HP:0200057
name: Marcus Gunn pupil
synonym: "حدقة ماركوس غان" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: استجابة غير طبيعية للحدقة تتسم بـ (1) تضييق حدقتي العينين عندما يتم تسليط الضوء على العين الطبيعية، و (2) توسع حدقتي العينين عندما يتم نقل الضوء بسرعة من العين الطبيعية (بعد تعرض قصير للضوء للعين الطبيعية) إلى العين المصابة.
def: "An aberrant pupillary response characterized by (i) Constriction of pupils of both eyes when the light stimulus is applied to the normal eye, and (ii) Dilatation of pupils of both eyes when the light stimulus is rapidly transferred from the normal eye (after brief light exposure to the normal eye) to the affected eye." [PMID:23520419, PMID:32491607]
synonym: "Relative afferent pupil defect" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Relative afferent pupillary defect" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:232122003
xref: SNOMEDCT_US:247015002
xref: UMLS:C0549122
is_a: HP:0000587 ! Abnormal optic nerve morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399
creation_date: 2012-11-18T12:14:22Z

