[Term]
id: HP:0400000
name: Tall chin
synonym: "ذقن طويل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة البعد العمودي من الحد الفاصل للشفة السفلى إلى النقطة السفلية الأبعد للذقن.
def: "Increased vertical distance from the vermillion border of the lower lip to the inferior-most point of the chin." [eom:96d8ca16a3c80216, PMID:19125436]
synonym: "Increased height of chin" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased height of menton region" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Long chin" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Long lower third of face" RELATED layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Tall chin" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Vertical excess of chin" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Vertical hyperplasia of chin" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
