def: "Median longitudinal ear length less than two SD above the mean determined by the maximal distance from the superior aspect to the inferior aspect of the external ear." [eom:2cff5ac9b681fc73, PMID:19152421]
comment: The commonly used term Microtia is a bundled term comprising decreased length and width (surface area).
