[Term]
id: HP:0410008
name: Abnormality of the peripheral nervous system
synonym: "خلل في الجهاز العصبي المحيطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في الأعصاب المحيطية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي خلل في الجزء من الجهاز العصبي الذي يتكون من الأعصاب والعقد خارج الدماغ والحبل الشوكي.
def: "Any abnormality of the part of the nervous system that consists of the nerves and ganglia outside of the brain and spinal cord." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Abnormality of the peripheral nervous system" EXACT layperson []
xref: UMLS:C4073187
is_a: HP:0000707 ! Abnormality of the nervous system

[Term]
id: HP:0410009
name: Abnormality of the somatic nervous system
synonym: "خلل في الجهاز العصبي الجسدي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في الأعصاب الجسدية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي خلل في الجزء من الجهاز العصبي المحيطي المرتبط بالإحساس والتحكم الإرادي في عضلات الهيكل العظمي لحركات الجسم.
def: "Any abnormality of the part of the peripheral nervous system associated with sensation and skeletal muscle voluntary control of body movements." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
comment: The SoNS consists of afferent and efferent nerves. Afferent nerves are responsible for relaying sensation to the central nervous system; efferent nerves are responsible for stimulating muscle contraction, including all the non-sensory neurons connected with skeletal muscles and skin.
xref: UMLS:C4073188
is_a: HP:0410008 ! Abnormality of the peripheral nervous system

