id: HP:0410017
name: Otitis externa
synonym: "التهاب الأذن الخارجية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب الأذن للسباحين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب أو عدوى في القناة السمعية الخارجية أو الصيوان أو كلاهما.
def: "Inflammation or infection of the external auditory canal (EAC), the auricle, or both." [http://search.medscape.com/search/?q=otitis%20externa, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Swimmer's ear" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0000372 ! Abnormal auditory canal morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0410018
name: Recurrent ear infections
synonym: "عدوى الأذن المتكررة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهابات الأذن المتكررة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: قابلية متزايدة للإصابة بعدوى الأذن، تتجلى في نوبات متكررة من التهابات الأذن.
def: "Increased susceptibility to ear infections, as manifested by recurrent episodes of ear infections." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432]
synonym: "Frequent ear infections" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Recurrent ear infections" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0002719 ! Recurrent infections

[Term]
id: HP:0410019
name: Epigastric pain
synonym: "ألم الشرسوف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم في الجزء العلوي من البطن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ألم يتموضع في منطقة الجزء العلوي من البطن الذي يقع مباشرة أسفل الأضلاع.
def: "Pain that is localized to the region of the upper abdomen immediately below the ribs." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://www.healthgrades.com/symptoms/epigastric-pain]
synonym: "Epigastrium pain" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012531 ! Pain

[Term]
id: HP:0410020
name: Fish odor
synonym: "رائحة السمك" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: رائحة جسم تتميز برائحة كريهة وشبيهة برائحة السمك المتعفن نتيجة الإفراز المفرط للثلاثي ميثيل أمين في البول والعرق والنفس للأفراد المصابين.
def: "Body odor characterized by an offensive body odor and the smell of rotting fish due to the excessive excretion of trimethylamine (TMA) in the urine, sweat, and breath of affected individuals." [http://www.medicinenet.com/fish_odor_syndrome_trimethylaminuria/article.htm]
synonym: "Fish odor" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Fishy body odor" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5316-1399]
synonym: "Fishy body odour" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Fishy odor" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Fishy odour" EXACT uk_spelling []
is_a: HP:0500001 ! Body odor

[Term]
id: HP:0410021
name: Musty odor
synonym: "رائحة عفنة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: رائحة جسم لاذعة.
def: "Pungent body odor." []
synonym: "Musty odor" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0500001 ! Body odor

[Term]
id: HP:0410022
name: Vaginal fish odor
synonym: "رائحة سمك في المهبل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "رائحة سمكية في المهبل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: رائحة سمكية في منطقة المهبل، وهي سمة مميزة لحدوث التهاب المهبل البكتيري، وتنتج عن ثلاثي ميثيل أمين.
def: "A fish odor in the vaginal area, that is characteristic of bacterial vaginosis (BV), and is due to trimethylamine (TMA)." [PMID:16086821]
synonym: "Vaginal fish odor" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0410020 ! Fish odor

[Term]
id: HP:0410023
name: Abnormal distribution of cell junction proteins in buccal mucosal cells
synonym: "توزيع غير طبيعي لبروتينات الوصل بين الخلايا في خلايا الغشاء المخاطي الشدقي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "توزيع غير طبيعي لبروتينات الخلايا الفموية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كمية أو موقع غير طبيعي لبروتينات الوصل بين الخلايا مثل بلاكوجلوبين أو Cx43.
def: "An anomalous amount or location of cell junction proteins such as plakoglobin or Cx43." [PMID:26850880]
comment: Buccal mucosal cells are harvested from the oral mucosa in the region of the cheek, and can be used as a surrogate tissue to measure cell junction proteins because it is difficult to obtain cells from a tissue of interest such as the myocardium. Cell junction proteins, such as plakoglobin and the major cardiac gap junction protein Cx43 may have an abnormal distribution in diseases such as arrhythmogenic cardiomyopathy.
is_a: HP:0031476 ! Abnormal buccal mucosa cell morphology
is_a: HP:3000019 ! Abnormal buccal mucosa morphology
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432

