comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة كمية النيكوتينورات في الدم.
def: "An increased amount of nicotinurate in the blood." []
synonym: "Increased circulating N-nicotinoylglycine level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0410205 ! Abnormal circulating nicotinurate concentration
property_value: dc:date "2018-09-11T23:40:36Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432

[Term]
id: HP:0410207
name: Positive methadone plasma/serum test
synonym: "إيجابية اختبار الميثادون في البلازما/المصل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود ميثادون في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الكشف عن الميثادون أو مستقلبه 2-إيثيليدين-1،5-ديميثيل-3،3-دايفينيلبيروليدين (EDDP) في البلازما أو المصل.
def: "Detection of methadone or its metabolite 2-ethylidene-1,5-dimethyl-3,3- diphenylpyrrolidine (EDDP) in plasma or serum." []
comment: Methadone is an opioid drug that is used to treat severe pain or in the treatment of individiuals with opioid dependency.
is_a: HP:0500100 ! Plasma/serum xenobiotic
property_value: dc:date "2018-09-11T23:47:39Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432

[Term]
id: HP:0410208
name: Positive plasma/serum cotinine test
synonym: "إيجابية اختبار الكوتينين في البلازما/المصل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود كوتينين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الكشف عن الكوتينين، وهو قلويد يوجد في التبغ والمستقلب الرئيسي للنيكوتين، في البلازما أو المصل.
def: "Detection of cotinine, an alkaloid found in tobacco and the predominant metabolite of nicotine, in plasma or serum." [PMID:10027825]
comment: Cotinine is used as a biomarker for exposure to tobacco smoke.
is_a: HP:0500100 ! Plasma/serum xenobiotic
property_value: dc:date "2018-09-11T23:57:25Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432

[Term]
id: HP:0410209
name: Folate deficiency in CSF
synonym: "نقص الفولات في السائل النخاعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص فيتامين ب9 في السائل النخاعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض تركيز حمض الفوليك، المعروف أيضًا بفيتامين ب9، في السائل النخاعي.
def: "A reduced concentration of folic acid, which is also known as vitamin B9 in the cerebrospinal fluid." [PMID:15581159]
comment: Cerebral folate deficiency is usually measured as low levels of folate in the CSF, in the presence of normal folate metabolism outside the nervous system.
synonym: "Folate deficiency in cerebrospinal fluid" EXACT []
