[Term]
id: HP:0410251
name: Decreased neutrophil toll-like receptor signalling
synonym: "انخفاض الإشارة الخاصة بمستقبلات الالتهابات الفطرية في الخلايا المتعادلة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ضعف إشارات مستقبلات الخلايا المتعادلة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في تفعيل الخلايا المتعادلة بعد ارتباط مستقبلات الالتهابات الفطرية (TLR)، ويُقاس عادةً بتقييم طرح CD62L بعد التحفيز باستخدام LPS في التدفق الخلوي.
def: "Abnormal decrease of neutrophil activation following toll-like receptor (TLR) ligation, commonly measured by evaluation of CD62L shedding after stimulation with lipopolysaccharide (LPS) using flow cytometry." [PMID:16426002, PMID:8614468]
comment: An abnormality in the cleavage of L-selectin during the process of guiding neutrophils to the site of infection. Proteolytic cleavage of L-selectin results in rapid shedding from the cell surface, which has a role in neutrophil rolling and accumulation at the site of infection.
synonym: "Abnormal L-selectin shedding" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011990 ! Abnormal neutrophil physiology
property_value: dc:date "2018-10-19T17:56:39Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432

[Term]
id: HP:0410252
name: Persistently decreased total neutrophil count
synonym: "انخفاض العدد الكلي للعدلات بشكل مستمر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص مستمر في خلايا الدم البيضاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض غير طبيعي في العدد المطلق للعدلات في الدم، لكل ميكروليتر، مقارنة بمجموعة مرجعية معينة للجنس والفئة العمرية، مستمر لمدة 3 أشهر أو أكثر.
def: "Abnormal decrease of the absolute number of neutrophils in the blood, per microlitre, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group, which persists for 3 or more months." [PMID:23953336]
comment: Often defined as neutropenia with an absolute neutrophil count (ANC) less than 1,500,000,000/L lasting for more than 3 months.
synonym: "Chronic neutropenia" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0001875 ! Decreased total neutrophil count
property_value: dc:date "2018-10-19T18:25:23Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432

[Term]
id: HP:0410253
