[Term]
id: HP:0410292
name: Abnormal isohemagglutinin level
synonym: "مستوى شذوذ في الأيزوهماغلوتينين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مستوى شاذ للأجسام المضادة للدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: مستوى شاذ من الأيزوهماغلوتينين في الدم. الأيزوهماغلوتينين يشير إلى الأجسام المضادة الطبيعية في نظام فصائل الدم ABO.
def: "An abnormal level of isohemagglutinin in the blood. An isohemagglutinin refers to the naturally occurring antibodies in the ABO blood group system (i.e., anti-A in a group B person, anti-B in a group A person, and anti-A, anti-B, and anti-A,B in a group O person)." []
synonym: "Abnormal level of natural antibody to blood group agents" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Abnormal natural antibody level to blood group antigens in blood (isohemagglutinin)" EXACT layperson []
