synonym: "Hypertrophy of upper jaw" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased projection of maxilla" NARROW [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased projection of upper jaw" NARROW layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased size of maxilla" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Increased size of upper jaw" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Large maxilla" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Large upper jaw" EXACT layperson [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Maxillary excess" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Maxillary hyperplasia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Maxillary macrognathia" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Maxillary prognathia" RELATED [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Maxillary prominence" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5889-4463]
synonym: "Prognathia of the upper jaw" RELATED []
