def: "The presence of antibodies in the blood circulation that react against a component of a parasite of the genus Schistosomiasis is a parasitic disease historically known as bilharzia caused by the trematode of the genus Schistosoma. Schistosomiasis is a parasitic disease historically known as bilharzia caused by the trematode of the genus Schistosoma." []
synonym: "Schistosoma antibody titer high in blood" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0430060 ! Bloodstream parasite-specific antibody positivity
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-02-04T08:51:46Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0430090
name: Anti-Powassan virus antibody positivity
synonym: "إيجابية الأجسام المضادة لفيروس بواسون" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أجسام مضادة لفيروس بواسون" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أجسام مضادة في الدم تستجيب ضد مكونات فيروس بواسون، وهو فيروس ينتقل عن طريق القراد ويؤثر في المقام الأول على مناطق شمال شرق الولايات المتحدة وكندا وروسيا. يعد المرض معديًا وينتقل إلى الإنسان عبر أنواع مختلفة من القراد.
def: "The presence of antibodies in the blood circulation that react against a component of a Powassan virus (POW), which is an arbovirus within the family of Flaviviruses primarily found in the Northeastern United States, Canada, and Russia. It is a zoonotic infection transmitted to humans by several tick species and is the only member of the tick-borne flaviviruses endemic to North America." [PMID:34033361]
synonym: "Anti-Powassan encephalitis virus antibody positivity" EXACT []
synonym: "Powassan encephalitis antibody titer high in blood" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0430083 ! Anti-arbovirus antibody positivity
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-02-04T08:54:05Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0430091
name: Marker expression
synonym: "تعبير العلامة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود علامة في الخلايا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الكشف عن علامة مثل البروتين بواسطة تقنيات تحليل الأنسجة المناعية أو تقنيات التحقيق ذات الصلة. يمكن استخدام وجود أو عدم وجود هذه العلامات لتحديد أنواع الخلايا بناءً على ملف تعريف العلامات المعبر عنها.
def: "Detection of a marker such as a protein by immunohistochemistry or related investigation techniques. The presence or absence of such markers can be used to identify cell types on the basis of a profile of expressed markers. These terms do not imply abnormality and can be used for any cell type or organ." []
is_a: HP:0020228 ! Biospecimen phenotypic feature
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-02-06T10:50:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0430092
name: BCL2 expression
synonym: "تعبير BCL2" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود BCL2 في الخلايا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الكشف عن وجود BCL2 في الخلايا المثيرة للاهتمام باستخدام الأجسام المضادة لـ BCL2 المرفقة بصبغة لونية (للتحليل النسيجي المناعي) أو مادة مضيئة (للقياس بالتدفق الخلوي).
def: "Detection of the presence of BCL2 on the cell(s) of interest with the use of anti-BCL2 antibodies conjugated to a chromogen (for immunohistochemistry) or fluorophore (for flow cytometry)." [PMID:28522442]
comment: The BCL2 proteins are central regulators of the mitochondrial apoptotic pathway. Overexpression of the BCL2 is associated with a poor prognosis in diffuse large B-cell lymphoma.
is_a: HP:0430091 ! Marker expression
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-02-07T04:42:57Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0430093
name: BCL6 expression
synonym: "تعبير BCL6" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود BCL6 في الخلايا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الكشف عن وجود BCL6 في الخلايا المثيرة للاهتمام باستخدام الأجسام المضادة لـ BCL6 المرفقة بصبغة لونية (للتحليل النسيجي المناعي) أو مادة مضيئة (للقياس بالتدفق الخلوي).
def: "Detection of the presence of BCL6 on the cell(s) of interest with the use of anti-BCL6 antibodies conjugated to a chromogen (for immunohistochemistry) or fluorophore (for flow cytometry)." [PMID:24220798]
comment: BCL6 is a transcriptional repressor which has emerged as a critical regulator of germinal centers (GCs) of lymph nodes. BCL6 is also a frequently activated oncogene in the pathogenesis of human B cell lymphomas, most of which derive from the GC B cells.
is_a: HP:0430091 ! Marker expression
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-02-07T04:45:50Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:0430094
name: CD5 expression
synonym: "تعبير CD5" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود CD5 في الخلايا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الكشف عن وجود CD5 في الخلايا المثيرة للاهتمام باستخدام الأجسام المضادة لـ CD5 المرفقة بصبغة لونية (للتحليل النسيجي المناعي) أو مادة مضيئة (للقياس بالتدفق الخلوي).
def: "Detection of the presence of CD5 on the cell(s) of interest with the use of anti-CD5 antibodies conjugated to a chromogen (for immunohistochemistry) or fluorophore (for flow cytometry)." [PMID:10889824]
comment: The CD5 antigen is expressed by most T cells and a subset of B cells. Human CD5 positive B cells are present in fetal lymphoid tissue, their frequency decreasing with fetal age. In adult human tissues, CD5 positive B cells have been reported to be present in the germinal center and mantle zone. Malignancies of CD5 positive B cells include mantle cell lymphoma and chronic lymphocytic leukemia.
is_a: HP:0430091 ! Marker expression
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199
property_value: terms:date "2024-02-07T04:47:44Z" xsd:dateTime

