[Term]
id: HP:0500006
name: Urethritis
synonym: "التهاب الإحليل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب في قناة البول" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب في الإحليل.
def: "Inflammation of the urethra." [PMID:26220178]
comment: Urethritis is characterized by discharge, dysuria and/or urethral discomfort but may be asymptomatic. Common etiologies include gonococcal urethritis as well as infection by chlamydia trachomatis, mycoplasma genitalium, ureaplasma urealyticum, trichomonas vaginalis, anaerobes, herpes simplex virus, and adenovirus.
is_a: HP:0000795 ! Abnormality of the urethra

[Term]
id: HP:0500007
name: Iris flocculi
synonym: "زوائد قزحية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زوائد على القزحية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ظهور أكياس متعددة على حافة الحدقة تبدو ككتل متموجة أو مسطحة ذات لون غامق تُبرز من الحافة الحدقة للقزحية.
def: "Multiple cysts along the pupillary margin that appear as spherical or tear-drop-shaped pigmented lesions or wrinkled masses emerging from the pupillary border of the iris." [PMID:27843899, PMID:7575269]
comment: Iris flocculi cause little, if any, visual impairment in most cases. However, they are occasionally associated with dissecting aortic aneurysm due to a shared mutation in smooth muscle that affects both the iris and the aorta. {xref="PMID:27843899"}
is_a: HP:0000525 ! Abnormality iris morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0500008
name: Cornea verticillata
synonym: "قرنية دوامية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "دوامات في قرنية العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ترسبات ذهبية بنية أو رمادية مع توزيع دوامي، عقارب الساعة، في الجزء السفلي ما بين الجفون من القرنية.
def: "Golden brown or gray deposits with a clockwise, whorl-like distribution in the inferior interpalpebal portion of the cornea." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Cornea verticillata can be a feature of Fabry disease and can occur as an adverse effect of mediciations including amiodarone. {xref="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199"}
synonym: "Vortex keratopathy" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000481 ! Abnormal cornea morphology

[Term]
id: HP:0500009
name: Dysplastic gangliocytoma of the cerebellum
synonym: "ورم الغريني الخلوي الشاذ في المخيخ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم نادر في المخيخ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وهو ورم نادر النمو ببطء في المخيخ، يُعتبر أحيانًا شكل من الهامارتوما، يتميز بزيادة في سماكة الطبقة الحبيبية للمخيخ.
def: "It is a rare, slowly growing tumor of the cerebellum, a gangliocytoma sometimes considered to be a hamartoma, characterized by diffuse hypertrophy of the granular layer of the cerebellum." [PMID:11073535]
comment: Often associated with Cowden syndrome. {xref="PMID:11073535"}
synonym: "LDD" RELATED abbreviation []
synonym: "Lhermitte-Duclos disease" RELATED []
is_a: HP:0001317 ! Abnormal cerebellum morphology

