synonym: "وجه دائري ومنتفخ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجه دائري ومنتفخ مع ترسبات دهنية في الحفرة الزمنية والخدين، ووجود ذقن مزدوجة.
def: "A rounded, puffy face with fat deposits in the temporal fossa and cheeks, a double chin." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: Moon facies can occur in persons treated with high-dose corticosteroids or with Cushing disease.
synonym: "Moon face" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Puffy face" EXACT layperson []
synonym: "Puffy facies" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0001999 ! Abnormal facial shape

[Term]
id: HP:0500012
name: Abnormal gonadotropin-releasing hormone concentration
synonym: "خلل تركيز هرمون الغونادوتروبين المطلق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تغير في مستوى هرمون الغونادوتروبين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انحراف من التركيز الطبيعي الهرمون المطلق للغونادوتروبين (GnRH) في الدم. يعمل إفراز GnRH المتقطع من تحت المهاد على مستقبلاته في الغدة النخامية الأمامية لتنظيم إنتاج وإفراز الغونادوتروبينات، والهرمون المنبه للجريب والهرمون اللوتيني.
def: "A deviation from the normal circulating concentration of the normal gonadotropin-releasing hormone (GnRH). Intermittent GnRH secretion from the hypothalamus acts upon its receptor in the anterior pituitary to regulate the production and release of the gonadotropins, follicle-stimulating hormone (FSH) and luteinizing hormone (LH)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
synonym: "Abnormality of GnRH level" EXACT abbreviation []
synonym: "Abnormality of gonadotropin-releasing hormone level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0003117 ! Abnormal circulating hormone concentration

[Term]
id: HP:0500013
name: Lack of gonadotropin-releasing hormone pulsatility
synonym: "عدم وجود تذبذب في إفراز الهرمون المطلق لموجهة الغدد التناسلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم تذبذب إفراز الهرمون" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إفراز الهرمون المطلق لموجهة الغدد التناسلية الذي لا يحدث بطريقة تذبذبية.
def: "Secretion of gonadotropin-releasing hormone that does not occur in a pulsatile fashion." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
comment: The decapeptide gonadotropin-releasing hormone (GnRH) is the master hormone regulating reproduction. GnRH is released from some 1000 neurons within the hypothalamus in a pulsatile manner. Hypothalamic GnRH gene expression occurs intermittently (in a pulsatile fashion). The primary target of hypothalamic GnRH is the anterior pituitary gonadotrope, which responds to stimulation by increasing the synthesis and secretion of the gonadotropins luteinzing hormone (LH) and follicle stimulating hormone (FSH), which in turn regulate gonadal development and function.
synonym: "Absence of GnRH pulsatility" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0500012 ! Abnormal gonadotropin-releasing hormone concentration

