synonym: "شذوذ شكل الشريان الحنكي الأكبر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شذوذ في الشريان الحنكي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في الشريان الحنكي الأكبر.
def: "An abnormality of a greater palatine artery." []
comment: The greater palatine artery is a terminal branch of the maxillary artery that supplies blood to the hard palate and nasal septum.
synonym: "Abnormality of greater palatine artery" EXACT []
