[Term]
id: HP:4000019
name: Anti-BP230 antibody positivity
synonym: "إيجابية الأضداد ضد BP230" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أضداد BP230" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود الأجسام المضادة الذاتية (الغلوبولينات المناعية) في المصل التي تتفاعل ضد BP230.
def: "The presence of autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the serum that react against BP230." [PMID:32048350]
comment: Bullous pemphigoid (BP) is an autoimmune disease associated with subepidermal blistering due to autoantibodies directed against BP180 and BP230. BP180 is currently considered as the major pathogenic autoantigen.
