def: "A decreased proportion of circulating mucosal-associated invariant T (MAIT) cells relative to total T cell count." [PMID:32161190]
comment: Flow cytometry may identify MAIT cells as CD3+Valpha7+CD161hi or Tet-MR1+CD161hi.
synonym: "Reduced mucosal-associated invariant T cell proportion" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced proportion of mucosal-associated invariant T cells" EXACT []
