[Term]
id: HP:4000061
name: Pancreatic alpha-cell hyperplasia
synonym: "فرط تنسج في خلايا ألفا البنكرياسية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة في عدد خلايا ألفا في البنكرياس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة منتشرة ونوعية في عدد خلايا ألفا.
def: "A diffuse and specific increase in the number of alpha-cells." [PMID:24285676]
comment: Alpha cells are glucagon-secreting endocrine cells in the pancreatic islets of the pancreas.
is_a: HP:0004510 ! Pancreatic islet-cell hyperplasia
property_value: dc:date "2021-06-23T16:27:00Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000062
name: 3-4 metacarpal synostosis
synonym: "التحام مشط اليد الثالثة والرابعة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التحام عظام الإصبع الأوسط والبنصر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوه خَلقي في اليد يتميز باندماج العظمتين المشطيتين الثالثة والرابعة (المرتبطة بالإصبع الأوسط والإصبع البنصر).
def: "A congenital hand malformation characterized by the coalescence of the coalescence of third and fourth metacarpals (i.e., those corresponding to the middle and ring fingers)." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, PMID:27698627]
comment: Metacarpal synostosis is best described as a failure of differentiation causing a union between 2 adjacent metacarpals.
synonym: "Fused third and fourth metacarpals" EXACT []
synonym: "Middle and ring finger metacarpal synostosis" EXACT []
synonym: "Synostosis of third and the fourth metacarpal bones" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0009706 ! Synostosis involving the 3rd metacarpal
is_a: HP:0009707 ! Synostosis involving the 4th metacarpal
property_value: dc:date "2021-09-08T21:33:50Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000063
name: Sleep related hallucination
synonym: "هلاوس مرتبطة بالنوم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "هلاوس عند النوم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هلاوس تحدث أثناء بداية النوم أو عند السقوط للنوم في أي حاسة ممكنة، عادة قد تكون سمعية أو بصرية أو لمسية.
def: "Hallucination during onset/falling asleep in any sensory modality, usually auditory, visual, or tactile." []
is_a: HP:0000738 ! Hallucinations
is_a: HP:5200293 ! Sleep-wake transition abnormality
property_value: dc:date "2025-10-20T09:34:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000064
name: Poor sleep
synonym: "النوم السيئ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبة في النوم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوم يوصَف بأنه غير مُرَوِّح بشكل كافي، مضطرب، أو بجودة غير كافية، بغض النظر عن المدة. قد يتضمن صعوبة في المحافظة على استمرارية النوم، الإفاقة المتكررة، إحساسًا بالنوم الخفيف أو السطحي، أو الاستيقاظ بشعور غير منعش. يُتعرّف عليه عادة عن طريق الإبلاغ الذاتي أو المقابلة السريرية وليس من خلال قياسات موضوعية.
def: "Subjectively or observationally reported sleep that is insufficiently restorative, disrupted, or of inadequate quality, regardless of duration. Poor sleep may involve difficulty maintaining sleep continuity, frequent awakenings, a sense of light or shallow sleep, or waking up feeling unrefreshed. It is typically identified through self-report or clinical interview and not by objective measurements." []
synonym: "Low-quality sleep" EXACT []
synonym: "Poor sleep quality" EXACT []
synonym: "Sleeping badly" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002360 ! Sleep disturbance
property_value: dc:date "2025-10-20T09:51:34Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000066
name: Abnormal iliac artery morphology
synonym: "شذوذ مورفولوجيا الشريان الحرقفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شذوذ في شكل الشريان الحرقفي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي خلل هيكلي في الشريان الحرقفي.
def: "Any structural anomaly of the iliac artery." []
comment: The common iliac artery originates from the aorta and divides into the internal and external iliac arteries, supplying oxygenated blood to the lower extremities (via the external iliac artery), the pelvis and its viscera (via internal iliac artery) as well as the peritoneum, psoas major muscle, ureter, and surrounding tissues.
is_a: HP:0011004 ! Abnormal systemic arterial morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-11-24T01:28:09Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000067
name: Iliac artery aneurysm
synonym: "تمدد الشريان الحرقفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انتفاخ في الشريان الحرقفي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: بروز أو تمدد غير طبيعي في الشريان الحرقفي.
def: "Abnormal outpouching or sac-like dilatation in the iliac artery." [PMID:9685125]
is_a: HP:4000066 ! Abnormal iliac artery morphology
property_value: dc:date "2021-11-24T01:34:01Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000068
name: Abnormal interest
synonym: "اضطراب الاهتمام" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اهتمام غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أي انحراف عن شدة أو موضوع الاهتمامات العادية للشخص، والتي تتحدد كحالة من منح الانتباه الانتقائي لشيء ما.
def: "Any deviation from normal intensity or subject of a person's interests, which can be defined as a state of giving selective attention to something." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708]
is_a: HP:0000708 ! Atypical behavior
property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000069
name: Persistent preoccupation with parts of objects
synonym: "انشغال دائم بأجزاء من الأشياء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تركيز على أجزاء معينة من الألعاب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نوع من الاهتمام غير الطبيعي يتسم بالتركيز المستمر والشديد على أجزاء معينة من لعبة أو شيء. على سبيل المثال، قد يدور الأفراد المصابون عجلات سيارة لعبة بدلًا من تشغيلها.
def: "A type of abnormal interest characterized by a persistent and intense focus on parts of a toy/object. For example, affected individuals may spin the wheels on a toy car rather than drive the toy car." []
synonym: "Fixated interest in unusual objects" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
synonym: "Fixated interest with parts of objects" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
synonym: "Fixation with parts of objects" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4422-1708, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
is_a: HP:5200108 ! Nonfunctional or atypical use of objects in play
