property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000078
name: Fixated interest with abnormal intensity
synonym: "اهتمام موجه بشدة غير طبيعية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "شدة اهتمام غير عادية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اهتمام شديد غير طبيعي بموضوع أو شيء معين بحيث لا يكون عادةً خارجاً عن المألوف في السياق الاجتماعي للشخص المتأثر.
def: "An abnormally intense interest in a topic or object that is not atypical for the social context of the affected person." [PMID:23880382]
comment: Typical examples of fixated interests with abnormal intensity include flipping the flag on a mailbox up and down repeatedly for long periods of time, taking a fork or other such objects everywhere, repeatedly lining up toys in the same order, or repeatedly reading information about a favorite topic such as a sports team.
is_a: HP:4000070 ! Fixated interests
