property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000083
name: Lack of interest in peers
synonym: "فقدان الاهتمام بالأقران" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة الاهتمام بالأطفال الآخرين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يتضح عدم الاهتمام بالأقران من نفس العمر والمجموعات الاجتماعية عندما يُظهر الفرد، مثل الطفل، اهتماماً أكبر بالتواصل مع البالغين بدلاً من الأطفال في نفس فئتهم العمرية.
def: "Lack of interest in peers of comparable age and social groups is evident when an individual, such as a child, shows more interest in socializing with adults rather than children their own age." [PMID:34169757]
synonym: "Ignores peers" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced desire to interact with peers" EXACT []
synonym: "Reduced interest in other children" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012760 ! Reduced social responsiveness
