property_value: terms:creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:4000087
name: Abnormal communicative facial expressions
synonym: "اضطراب الإيماءات الوجهية التواصلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تعابير وجهية غير طبيعية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تعابير غير طبيعية (حركات أو وضع عضلات الوجه التي تنقل الحالة العاطفية للفرد إلى المراقبين أثناء التفاعل الاجتماعي) تشمل خللاً في الكمية، النطاق، ملاءمة السياق، والجودة.
def: "Abnormal expressions (movements or position of muscles of the face that convey the emotional state of an individual to observers during social interactions) comprising abnormalities of quantity, range, context-appropriateness, and quality." []
comment: This term describes the way facial expressions are used for communicating to other people (social communication). This term does not comprise abnormal facial expressions related to motoric neurological deficits such as hypomimic facies observed in individuals with Parkinson syndrome.
synonym: "Abnormal facial expression use" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9112-5148, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508]
is_a: HP:0000758 ! Abnormal nonverbal communicative behavior
property_value: dc:date "2022-08-18T12:34:20Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9112-5148
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508

[Term]
id: HP:4000088
name: Facial expressions that do not match the context
synonym: "تعبيرات وجهية لا تتناسب مع السياق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم تطابق تعابير الوجه مع الموقف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إنتاج تعبيرات وجهية غير متوافقة مع السياق الاجتماعي.
def: "Production of facial expressions that are misaligned with the social context." []
is_a: HP:4000087 ! Abnormal communicative facial expressions
property_value: dc:date "2022-08-18T12:41:20Z" xsd:dateTime
