[Term]
id: HP:4000090
name: Abnormal gesture use
synonym: "اضطراب استخدام الإيماءات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "استخدام غير طبيعي للإيماءات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شذوذ في استخدام الإيماءات معرفة على أنها حركات اليد أو الكتف أو الرأس التي تنقل معنى مشترك داخل ثقافة معينة لتحل محل أو تكمل التواصل اللفظي.
def: "Abnormality in the use of gestures defined as hand, shoulder, and head movements that convey a shared meaning within a culture that replace or supplement verbal communication." []
comment: Gestures refer to movements of the arms, hand, shoulders, or head and do not include facial expressions.
synonym: "Abnormal communicative gesture use" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9112-5148, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508]
synonym: "Abnormal communicative gestures" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9112-5148, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508]
synonym: "Abnormal gestures" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9112-5148, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6670-9157, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508]
