[Term]
id: HP:4000092
name: Poor conversational reciprocity
synonym: "ضعف تواصل المحادثة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبة في التواصل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نقص استخدام الحديث التبادلي (ذهابًا وإيابًا) مقارنة بما هو متوقع لمستوى اللغة.
def: "Reduced use of reciprocal (back and forth) conversation, as compared to what would be expected for language level." []
comment: Poor conversational reciprocity may be characterized by deficits in the ability to make comments about discussion topics of others, failure to ask questions, and not building a conversation on comments of others. Affected persons may not know what to say next in a conversation, may not notice if others are bored with a given topic, may conduct a one-sided conversation (talking but not listening), or may veer off topic more than is socially acceptable.
synonym: "Failure of normal back-and-forth conversation" EXACT [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389]
is_a: HP:5200136 ! Reduced social reciprocity
property_value: dc:date "2022-08-29T13:04:27Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389

[Term]
id: HP:4000093
name: Ectopic tooth eruption
synonym: "خروج الأسنان في موقع غير طبيعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "طلوع الأسنان في المكان الخطأ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة تنشأ فيها الأسنان الدائمة، بسبب نقص في النمو في الفك أو جزء من الفك، تتبع مسارًا تقاطعياً مع سن لبني، مما يتسبب في فقدانها المبكر ويؤدي إلى مواصفات غير صحيحة للأسنان الدائمة.
def: "A condition in which the permanent teeth, because of deficiency of growth in the jaw or segment of jaw, assume a path of eruption that intercepts a primary tooth, causes its premature loss and produces a consequent malposition of the permanent tooth." [PMID:22114445]
is_a: HP:0006292 ! Abnormality of dental eruption
property_value: dc:date "2023-01-16T07:30:03Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:4000094
name: Corpus cavernosum hypoplasia
synonym: "نقص تنسج في الجسم الكهفي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خلل في نمو العضو التناسلي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل نمو يتسم بتطور ناقص في الجسم الكهفي.
def: "A developmental anomaly characterized by undergrowth of the corpus cavernosum." [PMID:21220346]
is_a: HP:0100623 ! Abnormal corpus cavernosum morphology
property_value: dc:date "2023-01-16T07:43:02Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:4000095
name: Elevated circulating thymine concentration
synonym: "ارتفاع تركيز الثايمين في الدورة الدموية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة الثايمين في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز قاعدة النواة الثايمين في الدورة الدموية أعلى من المعدل الطبيعي.
def: "Concentration of the nucleobase thymine in the blood circulation above the normal range." [PMID:33916495]
is_a: HP:0004353 ! Abnormal circulating pyrimidine concentration
property_value: dc:date "2023-01-16T07:48:07Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:4000100
name: Positive lactose hydrogen breath test
synonym: "اختبار تنفس الهيدروجين مع اللاكتوز إيجابي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اختبار اللاكتوز إيجابي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ارتفاع مستوى غاز الهيدروجين في النفس بعد تناول اللاكتوز عن طريق الفم. في الأفراد الذين يعانون من عدم تحمل اللاكتوز، سيتم استقلاب اللاكتوز الغير مهضوم في القولون بواسطة البكتيريا القولونية، مما يؤدي إلى إطلاق غاز الهيدروجين.
def: "Elevated hydrogen gas level in exhaled breath following oral administration of lactose. In individuals with lactose intolerance, undigested lactose in the colon will be metabolized by colonic bacteria, releasing hydrogen gas." [PMID:18985811]
comment: The enzyme lactase phlorizin hydrolase, located at the intestinal brush border, is necessary for the hydrolysis of lactose, the main sugar in milk. Due to the genetically programmed decrease in intestinal lactase activity that occurs post-weaning (lactase non-persistence), a large proportion of the human population loses, in adult age, the possibility to digest and absorb lactose.
is_a: HP:6000259 ! Positive hydrogen breath test
property_value: dc:date "2023-01-16T09:09:11Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: HP:4000101
name: Triggered by exposure to medication
synonym: "محفز بسبب التعرض للدواء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ناتج عن الدواء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
