def: "Concentration or activity of N-acetylgalactosamine-6-sulfatase as measured in cultured fibroblasts is below the limits of normal." []
comment: N-acetylgalactosamine-6-sulfatase (EC 3.1.6.4) catalyzes the cleavage of the 6-sulfate groups of the N-acetyl-D-galactosamine 6-sulfate units of the macromolecule chondroitin sulfate and of the D-galactose 6-sulfate units of the macromolecule keratan sulfate.
