name: Abnormal pitch
synonym: "نغمة غير طبيعية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صوت غير طبيعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الارتفاع المستمر بشكل غير عادي للنغمة أو انخفاضها في الصوت أو الكلام مما يعتبر خارج السياق للموضوع الاجتماعي أو يختلف بشكل كبير عن خط الأساس للفرد.
def: "Persistently abnormally high or low-pitched vocalization or speech than is considered the norm for the context of social situation or significantly different from baseline of the individual." []
comment: Pitch refers to the frequency of sound waves (measured in Hertz).
is_a: HP:5200010 ! Abnormal Intonation
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9593-5508
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3777-1389

[Term]
id: HP:5200006
name: Disjointed sentences
synonym: "جمل غير متماسكة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حديث غير مترابط" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشوهات مستمرة في هيكل الجمل في الكلام، حيث قد لا تكون العبارات مرتبطة منطقياً ببعضها البعض، وتعطي انطباعًا بالتمتمة. قد يكون هذا ميزة مميزة للفرد أو تغيير عن المعتاد للفرد المتأثر.
def: "Persistent abnormalities in the sentence structure in speech, phrases may not be logically connected to each other, gives the impression of rambling. This may be a characteristic feature of the individual or may be a change from the norm of the affected individual." []
comment: Loose association is highly correlated with flight of ideas and for which it is the speech-based expression. Typically it is very difficult to follow the logic in the expressed speech. The affected individual's speech is characterized by expressions in speech that have weak (e.g. tangential/circumstantial) connections between ideas.
synonym: "Loose association" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025782 ! Abnormal syntax
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5395-5036
