[Term]
id: HP:5200007
name: Neologism
synonym: "كلمة مبتكرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كلمة جديدة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الاستخدام المتكرر لكلمة مخترعة تكون فريدة للفرد.
def: "Consistent use of an invented word that is unique to an individual." []
is_a: HP:0025773 ! Abnormal semantics
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8430-6039
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2592-4715
