[Term]
id: HP:5200026
name: Impaired social imitation
synonym: "ضعف التقليد الاجتماعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة التقليد في المجتمع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض استخدام تقليد المهام أو حركات الآخرين في اللعب أو التعلم.
alt_id: HP:5200031
alt_id: HP:5200032
def: "Reduced use of imitation of tasks or movements of others in play or learning." [PMID:18221343]
comment: The ability to imitate others is common in children during early cognitive development (4-5 years old) and can be abnormal in children with developmental delay.
synonym: "Decreased imitation of others" NARROW []
synonym: "Reduced immediate imitation of others" NARROW []
is_a: HP:0012760 ! Reduced social responsiveness
