[Term]
id: HP:5200129
name: Abnormal rituals
synonym: "اضطرابات الطقوس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التمسك بالطقوس غير العادية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الإصرار على طقوس يفرضها الشخص على بيئته بما في ذلك توجيه سلوك من حولهم.
def: "Insistence on rituals which are self-imposed on a person's environment including directing the behavior of those around them." []
is_a: HP:5200130 ! Insistence on sameness

[Term]
id: HP:5200130
name: Insistence on sameness
