comment: Arabic Definition: يدل على تعلق شديد بأشياء لا تُعتبر عادة موضع اهتمام.
is_a: HP:5200108 ! Nonfunctional or atypical use of objects in play

[Term]
id: HP:5200134
name: Jumping
synonym: "قفز" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "القفز المتكرر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في تكرار القفز في نفس المكان بشكل مفرط.
def: "An excessive frequency of jumping in place." []
synonym: "Bouncing" EXACT []
synonym: "Hopping" EXACT []
synonym: "Pogo-ing" EXACT []
is_a: HP:5200019 ! Stereotypic whole-body movements
is_a: HP:5200066 ! Vestibular sensory seeking

[Term]
id: HP:5200135
name: Delay in the acquisition of cooperative play skills
synonym: "تأخر في اكتساب مهارات اللعب التعاوني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تأخر في اللعب الجماعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: فشل في اكتساب القدرة على اللعب بشكل تعاوني، وهو نوع من اللعب حيث يعمل الأطفال معًا نحو هدف مشترك ويظهرون اهتمامهم باللعب وبالأطفال الآخرين المشاركين.
def: "Failure to acquire the ability to play cooperatively, a type of play in whichchildren work together towards a common goal and in which a child displays interest both in the play and in the the other child or children involved in playing. This ability is observed in neurotypical children from the age of 3 to 6 years." [PMID:35052266]
is_a: HP:0012434 ! Delayed early-childhood social milestone development

[Term]
id: HP:5200136
name: Reduced social reciprocity
synonym: "انخفاض التبادلية الاجتماعية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة التفاعل الاجتماعي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض الاستجابة لمشاعر الآخرين و/أو عدم تعديل السلوك وفقاً للسياق الاجتماعي.
def: "Reduced responses to other people's emotions and/or a lack of modulation of behaviour according to social context." [PMID:21769705]
synonym: "Reduced friendship reciprocity" NARROW []
synonym: "Reduced social reciprocity with peers" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012760 ! Reduced social responsiveness

