[Term]
id: HP:5200213
name: Diminishment of emotional responsiveness
synonym: "تناقص الاستجابة العاطفية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة التعاطف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في ميل الشخص لإظهار استجابة عاطفية أو تعاطف تجاه الآخرين خلال التفاعلات الشخصية مقارنة بالمستوى الطبيعي السابق لهذا الشخص.
def: "A reduction in the tendency of a person to display emotional responsiveness or empathy towards others during interpersonal interactions as compared to that person's previous norm." [PMID:33370320]
comment: This feature may be reported by family members, friends, or peers.
synonym: "Diminishment of empathy" EXACT []
is_a: HP:5200310 ! Diminishment of social interactions
