[Term]
id: HP:5200261
name: Abnormal demeanor
synonym: "اضطراب في السلوك الخارجي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تصرف غير عادي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: خلل في السلوك الخارجي، الذي يشير إلى السلوك الظاهر أو الطريقة التي يظهر بها الشخص أمام الآخرين فيما يتعلق بالاتجاه، والوضع، والسلوك العام.
def: "An anomaly in demeanor, which refers to the outward behavior, manner, or conduct of a person. It encompasses how an individual presents themselves to others in terms of attitude, posture, and general comportment." []
comment: Demeanor can be assessed by observation of an individual's posture, gestures, facial expressions, overall mannerisms, or other behavioral manifestations.
is_a: HP:0000708 ! Atypical behavior
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1111-7357
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7954-5235
