property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4298-5074
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4618-6544

[Term]
id: HP:5200263
name: Abnormally increased volition
synonym: "زيادة غير طبيعية في الإرادة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة الإرادة والنشاط" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة مفرطة في السلوكيات المدفوعة بالهدف وغير المدفوعة بالهدف وكذلك الطاقة والاهتمام العالي الذي يسمح للأفراد بالبدء، والنشاط لتنفيذ عمل مستمر وموجه. غالباً ما تكون الزيادة مدمرة وتؤدي عادةً إلى نتائج غير مفضلة.
def: "An excessive increase in motivated and goal directed as well as non-goal directed behaviors that are usually accompanied by elevated energy and interest that allows individuals to get started, be energized to perform a sustained and directed action. The increase is often disruptive and typically results in unfavorable consequences." []
synonym: "Abnormally increased energy" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormally increased motivation" EXACT []
synonym: "Abnormally increased personal volitional state" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025780 ! Abnormal volitional state
