[Term]
id: HP:5200291
name: REM sleep behavior disorder
synonym: "اضطراب سلوك نوم حركة العين السريعة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اضطراب في سلوك النوم أثناء الأحلام" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب سلوك نوم حركة العين السريعة (RBD) هو حالة نوم مزمنة تتميز بتجسيد الأحلام وفقدان الترهل العضلي خلال حركة العين السريعة.
def: "REM Sleep Behavior Disorder (RBD) is a chronic sleep condition characterized by dream enactment and loss of REM atonia." [PMID:32733361, PMID:36515157]
comment: Normally during rapid eye movement (REM) sleep, the body experiences temporary paralysis (REM atonia) of most of the body's muscles while the brain is active and dreaming.
synonym: "Rapid eye movement sleep behavior disorder" EXACT []
synonym: "Rapid eye movement sleep behaviour disorder" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "RBD" EXACT abbreviation []
