[Term]
id: HP:5200293
name: Sleep-wake transition abnormality
synonym: "خلل في انتقال بين النوم واليقظة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اضطراب في الانتقال بين النوم واليقظة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو اضطراب للنوم يحدث مع الوعي والتذكر خلال الانتقال بين حالات النوم واليقظة.
def: "A parasomnia that occurs with awareness and recollection during the transition between sleep and and awake states." [PMID:30252388, PMID:32949545]
comment: Sleep-wake transition abnormalities include rhythmic movement disorder, sleep starts, sleep talking, and nocturnal leg cramps.
synonym: "Disturbance during transitions between sleep and wake states" EXACT []
synonym: "Sleep state switching" EXACT []
synonym: "Sleep-wake transition disorders" EXACT []
