synonym: "قصر النوم الخفيف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تقليل في مدة المرحلة N1 من النوم غير السريع لحركة العين (NREM).
def: "Decreased duration of phase N1 of nonrapid eye movement (NREM) sleep." [PMID:30252388]
comment: N1 sleep may be delayed or disrupted by a number of sleep disorders, including insomnia, hypersomnia, and movement disorders such as restless legs syndrome.
