[Term]
id: HP:5200310
name: Diminishment of social interactions
synonym: "انخفاض التفاعل الاجتماعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قلة التواصل مع الآخرين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في ميل الشخص للبحث عن أو الحفاظ على التواصلات الاجتماعية أو التفاعلات مع الآخرين مقارنةً بالمقاييس المعتادة للفرد.
def: "A reduction in the tendency of a person to seek or maintain social connections or interactions with others compared to previous norms for an individual." [PMID:17391357, PMID:31997686]
comment: This feature may be reported by family members or peers. This feature is distinct from (but may be accompanied by) loneliness, which can be defined as a perceived discrepancy between one's actual and desired social relationships.
synonym: "Reduced, declined or lessened social interactions" EXACT []
is_a: HP:5200243 ! Abnormal change in social behavior
