[Term]
id: HP:5200352
name: Hypnagogic sleep paralysis
synonym: "شلل النوم التنويمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم القدرة على الحركة عند النوم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: شلل النوم الذي يحدث عند الغفوة.
def: "Sleep paralysis that occurs when falling asleep." [PMID:28735779]
comment: During sleep paralysis, a person often hallucinates sounds or sensations, such as the presence of a person in the room or even on their chest. If sleep paralysis and these hallucinations occur as a person is falling asleep, they are considered hypnagogic hallucinations.
synonym: "Inability to move while falling asleep" EXACT []
synonym: "Predormital sleep paralysis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025233 ! Sleep paralysis
is_a: HP:5200296 ! Abnormal transition from sleep to wakefulness
