[Term]
id: HP:5200418
name: Folie Ã  deux
synonym: "الجنون الثنائي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الجنون المشترك" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تُنتقل المعتقدات الوهمية من شخص إلى آخر.
def: "Delusional beliefs are transmitted from one individual to another." []
synonym: "Shared psychosis" EXACT []
