property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10131
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000046
name: Pulsus paradoxus
synonym: "النبض المتناقض" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انخفاض الضغط عند الشهيق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير النبض المتناقض إلى انخفاض ضغط الانقباض بأكثر من 10 ملم زئبقي أثناء الشهيق.
def: "Pulsus paradoxus refers to a systolic pressure drop greater than 10mmHg during inspiration." [PMID:29493917]
comment: Pulsus paradoxus results from alterations in the mechanical forces imposed on the chambers of the heart and pulmonary vasculature and is often due to pericardial disease, particularly cardiac tamponade and to a lesser degree constrictive pericarditis.
synonym: "Kussmaul pulse" EXACT []
synonym: "Paradoxical pulse" EXACT []
synonym: "Paradoxical pulse volume" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0032552 ! Abnormal pulse
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10132
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000047
name: Chest pain triggered by palpation
synonym: "ألم صدري ينجم عن الجس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجع في الصدر عند اللمس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يمكن أن يتسبب ألم الصدر عند جسه، وهو قد يكون مؤشرًا على التهاب الغضروف الضلعي.
def: "Chest pain can be induced by palpation of the chest, which may be an indication of costochondritis." []
synonym: "Chest pain reproducible on palpation" EXACT []
