property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000049
name: Chest pain described as ripping or tearing
synonym: "ألم صدري يوصف كتمزيق أو قطع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم حاد في الصدر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ألم صدري يوصف كإحساس بالتمزيق أو القطع.
def: "Chest pain described as a tearing or ripping sensation." [PMID:21250256]
comment: The pain of aortic dissection may be described as tearing or ripping and does not improve with nitroglycerin.
is_a: HP:0025280 ! Pain characteristic
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10136
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

