[Term]
id: HP:6000084
name: Sunken fontanelle
synonym: "اليافوخ الغائر" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اليافوخ الذي يكون عميقاً أكثر من المعتاد. يكون اليافوخ عادةً ثابتاً نسبياً ويميل قليلاً إلى الداخل. يمكن أن يكون اليافوخ الغائر علامة على الجفاف أو سوء التغذية.
def: "Fontanelle that is more deeply set than normal. Fontanelles are normally relatively firm and curve only slightly inward. A sunken fontanelle can be a sign of dehydration or marasmus." [PMID:12825844]
is_a: HP:0011328 ! Abnormal fontanelle morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10010
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000085
name: Angulation of penis
synonym: "انحناء القضيب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "القضيب المنحني" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تشكل زاوية (ميل) على طول محور القضيب.
def: "Formation of an angle (tilt) along the shaft of the penis." [PMID:31869082]
comment: This finding can be observed with penis fracture and Peyronie Disease. The latter is caused by a plaque (scar tissue) that pulls on the surrounding tissues and causes the penis to curve or bend, usually during an erection.
synonym: "Bent penis" EXACT layperson []
is_a: HP:0000036 ! Abnormal penis morphology

