synonym: "تفاقم ما بعد الولادة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة الأعراض بعد الولادة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ينطبق على علامة أو عرض موجود أثناء الحمل ويصبح أسوأ بعد الولادة.
def: "Applied to a sign or symptom that is present during pregnancy and becomes worse following birth." []
synonym: "Symptoms worsen in post-partum state" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025285 ! Aggravated by
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/9990
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

