[Term]
id: HP:6000094
name: History of outdoor activities
synonym: "تاريخ الأنشطة الخارجية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الوقت الذي يقضى خارجاً" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تاريخ قضاء كمية كبيرة من الوقت في الهواء الطلق بسبب العمل أو الهوايات المتعلقة بالخارج، مثل الصيد، البستنة، الزراعة، العمل في الزراعة، البستنة، التعدين، العمل في الحقول الرطبة.
def: "History of spending a substantial amount of time outdoors with occupation or hobbies related to the outdoors, including hunting, gardening, farming, agriculture, horticulture, miners, working in wet fields." []
is_a: HP:0032443 ! Past medical history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/9994
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000095
name: Draining sinus tract in skin
synonym: "الناسور النازح في الجلد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الناسور هو قناة غير طبيعية تنبع من سطح الجلد أو سطح مخاطي إلى بؤرة عمقها مركز التعفن.
def: "A sinus tract is an abnormal channel that originates from the skin or a mucous surface to a deep-seated focus of suppuration." [PMID:34145466]
comment: A soft tissue ulcer can show a sinus tract leading to a deeper soft tissue abscess and may occasionally extend to a joint. Chronic osteomyelitis can be associated with a sinus tract and cloaca (opening or rupture of bony cortex overlying an area of osteomyelitis) draining granulation tissue, pus, or necrotic debris from the bone to the skin.
synonym: "Discharging sinus" EXACT []
synonym: "Draining tract in skin" EXACT []
synonym: "Tract under skin draining associated abscess" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0011355 ! Localized skin lesion
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/9996
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000096
name: Corneal transplant history
synonym: "تاريخ زراعة القرنية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زراعة قرنية سابقة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تاريخ جراحي سابق لاستبدال القرنية بنسيج قرنية من متبرع.
def: "Past medical history of surgical replacement of the cornea with corneal tissue from a donor." []
synonym: "History of corneal transplantation" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0430103 ! Past surgical history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7988
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000097
name: Spontaneous lens capsule rupture
synonym: "تمزق تلقائي في كبسولة العدسة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تمزق عدسة العين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تمزق كبسولة العدسة، ويكون ذلك في الغالب كمضاعفة لجراحة العدسة، ولكن هذا المصطلح يشير إلى تمزق كبسولة العدسة غير المرتبط بالجراحة أو الصدمة الكبيرة.
def: "Breakage of the capsule of the lens. This is most often observed as a complication of lens surgery, but this term refers to lens capsule rupture not related to surgery or major trauma." [PMID:35198824]
comment: Spontaneous lens capsule rupture has been observed with Marshall syndrome.
is_a: HP:0000517 ! Abnormal lens morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7989
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000098
name: Contact lens wearer
synonym: "مرتدي العدسات اللاصقة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تاريخ طبي سابق لارتداء العدسات اللاصقة.
def: "A past medical history of wearing contact lenses." [PMID:26292204]
is_a: HP:0032443 ! Past medical history
