property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000099
name: Airway mucosal thickening
synonym: "تثخن مخاطية المجاري الهوائية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة في سمك المخاطية في المجاري الهوائية عن الحد الأعلى الطبيعي.
def: "Increase in thickness of the mucosa of the airways above the upper limit of normal." [PMID:32957425]
comment: This feature can be observed in mucolipidosis type II. Progressive airway thickening can lead to respiratory insufficiency.
is_a: HP:0012253 ! Abnormal respiratory epithelium morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8000
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000100
name: Hyperpolarized transepithelial nasal potential difference
synonym: "فرق الجهد الأنفي فوق الندي المفرط الإستقطاب" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "زيادة الجهد الأنفي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: زيادة (أكثر سلبية) في الجهد عبر الظهارة الأنفية.
def: "Increased (more negative) voltage across the nasal epithelium." [PMID:21594779]
comment: The resulting (or basal) potential difference (PD) is negative or polarized (viewed from the epithelial surface) and in normal subjects, it is usually between -15 and -25 mV. The measurement continues by the sequential perfusion of compounds that block inwardly directed sodium transport through inhibition of ENaC (amiloride), followed by augmentation of chloride transport through CFTR. During perfusion of amiloride, the potential difference depolarizes as ENaC transport is reduced, and the PD typically approaches a low polarizing value (typically between 0 and -10 mV).
is_a: HP:0002795 ! Abnormal respiratory system physiology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8002
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000101
name: Corneopalpebral synechiae
synonym: "التصاق القرنية والجفن" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التصاق العين والجفن" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التصاق بين الملتحمة في جفن العين والقرنية.
def: "An adhesion between the conjunctiva of the eyelid and the cornea." [PMID:20301721]
is_a: HP:0000481 ! Abnormal cornea morphology
is_a: HP:0000492 ! Abnormal eyelid morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7982
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000102
name: Breast intraductal papilloma
synonym: "الورم الحليمي داخل القنوات الثديية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم في قنوات الثدي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الورم الحليمي داخل القناة هو ورم حميد يوجد داخل قنوات الثدي. يتسبب النمو بسبب التكاثر غير الطبيعي لخلايا ظهارة القناة. الورم الحليمي داخل القناة المنفرد يوجد عادة بشكل مركزي خلف الحلمة ويؤثر على القناة المركزية. الأورام الحليمية المتعددة داخل القنوات تقع بشكل محيطي، وتوجد في أي ربع من أثداء وتؤثر على القنوات المحيطية.
def: "Intraductal papilloma is a benign tumor found within breast ducts. The abnormal proliferation of ductal epithelial cells causes growth. A solitary intraductal papilloma is usually found centrally posterior to the nipple affecting the central duct. Multiple intraductal papillomas are located peripherally, found in any breast quadrant affecting the peripheral ducts." [PMID:30137824]
is_a: HP:0100013 ! Neoplasm of the breast
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7952
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000103
name: Precipitous labor
synonym: "مخاض سريع للغاية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مخاض سريع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: المخاض السريع للغاية هو الولادة السريعة جدًّا، والتي تُعرف عادةً بأنها طرد الجنين خلال أقل من 3 ساعات من بدء التقلصات المنتظمة.
def: "Precipitous labor is extremely rapid labor and delivery, usually defined as expulsion of the fetus within less than 3 hours of commencement of regular contractions." [PMID:25584099, PMID:30940371]
synonym: "Precipitous delivery" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0002686 ! Pregnancy history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7957
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000104
name: Twin pregnancy
synonym: "حمل توأمي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حمل بتوأم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: أن يكون هناك تاريخ للأم بحمل تضمن وجود جنينين في الرحم.
def: "Maternal history of a pregnancy with two fetuses in the uterus." [PMID:33622004]
is_a: HP:0002686 ! Pregnancy history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7959
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000105
name: Vaginal mass
synonym: "كتلة مهبلية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "انتفاخ في المهبل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تضخم أو انتفاخ موضعي في المهبل. كلمة
def: "A swelling or enlargement localized to the vagina. The word mass is usually used at an early stage of the diagnostic workup before the precise nature of the swelling has been determined." []
is_a: HP:0000142 ! Abnormal vagina morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7960
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000106
name: Costovertebral angle tenderness
synonym: "رقة زاوية الكساء الفقري الضلعي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم في زاوية العمود الفقري والضلع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ألم يتم استثارته عن طريق الضغط في المنطقة داخل زاوية الكساء الفقري الضلعي، والتي تتكون من الضلع الثاني عشر والعمود الفقري.
def: "Pain that is elicited by palpation of the region inside of the costovertebral angle, which is formed by the 12th rib and the spine." [PMID:36605912]
comment: Costovertebral angle tenderness can be observed with conditions including pyelonephritis and ureteral stones.
synonym: "Costovertebral angle pain" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012531 ! Pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7962
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000107
name: Cervical motion tenderness
synonym: "رقة حركة عنق الرحم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم عند تحريك عنق الرحم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ألم يتم استثارته عن طريق تحريك عنق الرحم، يمكن تحديد هذه الحالة عن طريق الفحص الحوضي. تُعتبر علامة فحص نسائي يمكن أن تشير إلى وجود عدوى في الصفاق.
def: "Pain that is elicited by moving the uterine cervix. This finding can be ascertained by pelvic exam. Cervical motion tenderness is a gynecological exam finding that could be indicative of peritoneal infection." [PMID:31424870]
synonym: "Chandelier sign" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012531 ! Pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7964
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000108
name: Abnormal urethral discharge
synonym: "خلل إفرازات الإحليل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "إفرازات غير عادية من الإحليل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: السائل الذي يخرج من الإحليل وليس بولاً أو سائل ما قبل القذف أو منياً.
def: "Fluid that originates from the urethra that is not urine, pre-ejaculate or semen." []
synonym: "Abnormal penile discharge" NARROW []
synonym: "Abnormal urethral discharge" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000795 ! Abnormality of the urethra
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7965
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000109
name: Supernumerary finger flexion crease
synonym: "ثنية مرنة فائضة في الإصبع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "خط زائد على الإصبع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود ثنية إضافية على الإصبع في شخص ذو تشريح مفاصل طبيعي.
def: "The presence of an extra digital crease in and individual with normal joint anatomy." [PMID:12244551]
