def: "The activity of nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (NADH)-cytochrome b5 reductase in erythrocytes (red blood cells) is below the lower limit of normal." [PMID:8874222]
synonym: "NADH-cytochrome b5 reductase low" EXACT []
