[Term]
id: HP:6000220
name: Pharyngeal mass
synonym: "كتلة بلعومية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تورم في الحلق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: توسّع أو تورم غير طبيعي موضعي في البلعوم (أي في الحلق، الفضاء الذي يربط الأنف والفم بالحنجرة والمريء). تُستخدم كلمة كتلة عادة في المراحل المبكرة من عملية التشخيص قبل تحديد طبيعة التورم بدقة.
def: "An abnormal enlargement or swelling localized to the pharynx (i.e., the throat, the space that connects the nose and mouth to the larynx and esophagus). The word mass is usually used at an early stage of the diagnostic workup before the precise nature of the swelling has been determined." []
is_a: HP:0033151 ! Abnormal pharynx morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7883
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000221
name: Positive stool occult blood test
synonym: "اختبار الدم الخفي في البراز الإيجابي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود دم خفي في البراز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود دم مخفي (غير مرئي) في البراز.
def: "The presence of hidden (occult) blood in the stool." [PMID:30725823]
comment: This test is commonly used for colorectal cancer screening. Blood in stool may be a sign of hemorrhoids, colorectal cancer, or another condition.
synonym: "Positive faecal occult blood test" EXACT uk_spelling []
synonym: "Positive fecal occult blood test" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0031685 ! Abnormal stool composition
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7887
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6000222
name: Painful defecation
synonym: "إمساك مؤلم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم عند التبرز" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس مزعج يتميز بعدم الراحة الجسدية يحدث عند إخراج البراز.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort that occurs when passing stool." []
synonym: "Pain associated with bowel movements" EXACT []
