synonym: "تاريخ استخدام مستحضرات تجميل الوجه" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "استخدام المكياج على الوجه" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تاريخ طبي لاستخدام مكياج الوجه.
def: "A medical history of use of facial makeup." [PMID:28722951]
comment: Facial makeup use may be associated with canaliculitis, which refers to inflammation of the lacrimal canaliculus.
