def: "The concentration of stearoylcarnitine (C18:0) in the blood circulation is below the lower limit of normal." []
comment: Stearoylcarnitine, also known as acylcarnitine C18:0, is a fatty ester lipid molecule.
is_a: HP:0033445 ! Reduced circulating acylcarnitine concentration
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8426
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

