comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز الإنترلوكين 15 في الدورة الدموية أعلى من الحد الأقصى الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of interleukin 15 (IL-15) in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." [PMID:22064066]
comment: Interleukin-15 (IL-15) is a pleiotropic cytokine with a broad range of biological functions in many diverse cell types.
