[Term]
id: HP:6000475
name: Anti-beta fodrin antibody positivity
synonym: "إيجابية الأجسام المضادة ضد بيتا فودرين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أجسام مضادة لبيتا فودرين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أجسام مضادة ذاتية (غلوبينات مناعية) في الدورة الدموية التي تتفاعل ضد مكون من بيتا-فودرين.
def: "The presence of autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the blood circulation that react against a component of beta-fodrin." [PMID:11673564]
comment: Fodrin, a heterodimer composed of alpha and beta subunits, is an abundant protein of eukaryotic cell membrane skeleton. The alpha/beta-fodrin dimers self-associate head-to-head into tetramers and serve as the basic structural element of the membrane skeleton. Individuals with Sjogren syndrome may display antibodies to fodrin.
is_a: HP:0030057 ! Autoimmune antibody positivity
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8731
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

