def: "Applies to an abnormality of the skin whose boundary to the surrounding normal skin is not clearly defined." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/8041
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

