[Term]
id: HP:6000544
name: Positive mycobacterium CSF microscopy
synonym: "الفحص المجهري للسائل الشوكي للكشف عن المتفطرات" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تحليل السائل الشوكي للكشف عن المتفطرات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إظهار المتفطرات عن طريق الفحص المجهري للسائل النخاعي.
def: "The demonstration of mycobacterium by microscopy of the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF)." [PMID:28105125]
comment: Ziehl-Neelsen (Z-N) staining of cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) for acid-fast bacilli (AFB) is the cornerstone of the laboratory diagnosis of tuberculous meningitis (TBM). However, the sensitivity of conventional Z-N staining for the detection of AFB in CSF specimens is suboptimal.
