def: "Activity of the enzyme Carboxypeptidase N (arginine carboxypeptidase, EC 3.4.17.3) in the blood circulation below the lower limit of normal." [PMID:12560874]
comment: Carboxypeptidase N cleaves basic amino acid residues from the C terminal of peptides and proteins.
