def: "Applied to a sign orr symptom that is worsed by administration of opiate medications." []
comment: Opiate drugs increase pain in narcotic bowel syndrome.
is_a: HP:4000176 ! Aggravated by exposure to medication
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10117
