comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب الجلد والأنسجة الرخوة للأذن الخارجية.
def: "Inflammation of the skin and soft tissues of the outer ear." []
comment: In contrast to auricular chondritis, auriculitis does not specifically affect the cartilage of the ear.
