def: "Activity of the mitochondrial enzyme phosphomannose isomerase (PMI; EC 5.3.1.8) in tissues below the lower limit of normal. The activity can be measured in multiple tissues including leukocytes, fibroblasts, and liver." [PMID:9525984]
is_a: HP:6000231 ! Abnormal tissue enzyme concentration or activity
