[Term]
id: HP:6000875
name: Wide sacroiliac joint
synonym: "مفصل العجز الحرقفي العريض" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مسافة واسعة بين العظام في منطقة الحوض" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تكون المسافة بين العجز والحرقفة من عظام الحوض في المفصل العجزي الحرقفي أعلى من الحد العلوي الطبيعي.
def: "Distance between the sacrum and the ilium bones of the pelvis at the sacroiliac joint is above the upper limit of normal." []
is_a: HP:0100781 ! Abnormal sacroiliac joint morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10534
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1020-5412

[Term]
id: HP:6000876
name: Anti-Glutamate Receptor delta2 antibody positivity
synonym: "الإيجابية للأجسام المضادة لمستقبل الغلوتامات دلتا 2" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الأجسام المضادة ضد مستقبل الغلوتامات" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أجسام مضادة ذاتية في المصل تتفاعل ضد مستقبل الغلوتامات دلتا 2.
def: "The presence of autoantibodies in the serum that react against glutamate receptor delta2." [PMID:17049194, PMID:36696031]
comment: Glutamate receptor delta2, a member of the glutamate receptor family, is predominantly expressed in cerebellar Purkinje cells and plays a crucial role in cerebellar functions. Anti-GluRdelta2 autoantibody has been detected in a patient with chronic cerebellitis.
is_a: HP:0030057 ! Autoimmune antibody positivity
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10543
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6714-5727

