[Term]
id: HP:6001010
name: Inability to protrude lips
synonym: "عدم القدرة على بروز الشفاه" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عدم القدرة على تحريك الشفاه للأمام" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عدم القدرة على ترويم أو بروز الشفاه.
def: "Lack of ability to purse or pucker the lips." [PMID:30804066]
comment: The anomaly can be related to abnormalities of the muscles, nerves, or structure of the face.
