id: HP:6001040
name: Small intestinal adenoma
synonym: "ورم غدي معوي صغير" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ورم صغير في الأمعاء الدقيقة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ورم في الأمعاء الدقيقة يتكون من نسيج غدي.
def: "A small bowel tumor with adenomatous epithelium." [PMID:7248908]
comment: Grossly and histologically, adenomas arising in the mucosa of the small intestine are similar to the adenomas found in the colon.
is_a: HP:0100833 ! Neoplasm of the small intestine
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/9153
