[Term]
id: HP:6001041
name: Maternal retinal mottling
synonym: "تغضرف شبكية الأم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "بقع في شبكية الأم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تغضرف (بقع أو لطخات ذات درجات مختلفة) في الظهارة الصبغية للشبكية لدى أم المريض الأساسي. تغضرف الشبكية قد يشير إلى حالة تعطيل X مشوبة في الأم.
def: "Mottling (spots or blotches with different shades) of the retinal pigment epithelium in the mother of the index patient. Retinal mottling may indicate a mosaic X-linked inactivation state in the mother." [PMID:17460294]
is_a: HP:0002686 ! Pregnancy history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/7986
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001042
name: Twisted gallbladder pedicle
synonym: "التواء قاعدة المرارة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التواء في قاعدة المرارة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هيكل مخروطي ممتد يوجد في عنق المرارة مع تتقارب العديد من الصدىات الخطية باتجاه قمته. يُظهر هذا الاكتشاف بواسطة الفحص بالموجات فوق الصوتية ويمكن أن يشير إلى التفاف المرارة.
def: "A stretched conical-shaped structure found at the gallbladder neck with several linear echoes converging towards its tip. This finding is demonstrated by sonography and can indicate gallbladder volvulus." [PMID:35355530]
synonym: "Conical structure at the gallbladder neck" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012437 ! Abnormal gallbladder morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10049
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001043
name: Cholecyst-enteric fistula
synonym: "ناسور بين المرارة والأمعاء" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اتصال غير طبيعي بين المرارة والأمعاء" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ناسور بين المرارة والأمعاء.
def: "Fistula between the gallbladder and the intestine." [PMID:28613584]
is_a: HP:0012437 ! Abnormal gallbladder morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10056
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001044
name: Dyschronometria
synonym: "خلل توقيت" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "صعوبة قياس الوقت" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: قدرة متأثرة بشدة على قياس أو تقدير الفواصل الزمنية بدقة.
def: "Impaired ability to accurately measure or estimate time intervals." [PMID:17214571, PMID:19874739, PMID:27127597, PMID:31526769, PMID:37622046]
comment: Common signs of dyschronometria are often generic to cerebellar ataxia, including a lack of spatial awareness, poor short term memory, and inability to keep track of time. For example, when asked to wait for thirty seconds, or tap every second that has gone by, those affected will be able to perform the task for a short time and then become derailed. This can result from a loss of focus, however, more often than not the individual affected can no longer tell what they are doing and they become disoriented. This often takes form in forgetting basic time keeping unless a timer is set, such as when cooking for example. Dyschronometria does not affect the 24-hour circadian rhythm, which is sustained by a different biological process.
is_a: HP:0010524 ! Disturbed sensory perception
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10065
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001045
name: History of recent intermittent breastfeeding
synonym: "تاريخ الإرضاع غير المنتظم الحديث" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "الإرضاع غير المنتظم مؤخراً" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تاريخ إرضاع حديث غير منتظم للرضيع (أي، بشكل متقطع).
def: "History of recently intermittent breastfeeding an infant (i.e., on and off)." []
comment: Recent on and off breastfeeding can be a risk factor for galactocele and breast abscess.
is_a: HP:0032443 ! Past medical history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10076
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

