[Term]
id: HP:6001047
name: Circumscribed
synonym: "محدد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مكان محدد" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ يتميز بتوزيع ومظهر محددين بشكل جيد ومحصور في منطقة معينة.
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose distribution and appearance are well-defined and localized to a specific area." []
