property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001048
name: Lobulated
synonym: "مفصص" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "سطح غير منتظم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ يُظهر العديد من التجاويف والارتفاعات التي تنتج سطحًا ذو هيئة غير منتظمة.
def: "Applies to an abnormality that displays multiple indentations and/or elevations producing an irregular surface contour." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10082
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001049
name: Spiculated
synonym: "مشوك" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حواف مشطوبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ له حواف غير منتظمة ومشعة أو شائكة.
def: "Applies to an abnormality with irregular, radiating, or spiky edges." [PMID:32809592]
comment: A spiculated mass is a centrally dense lesion seen on mammography with sharp lines radiating from its margin. The spicules can vary greatly in length, from a few millimeters to several centimeters. In malignant lesions, spicules represent a mixture of tumor cells and fibrosis invading the normal tissue surrounding the lesion.
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10112
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001050
name: Whorled
synonym: "حلزوني" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "مثل الدوائر الحلزونية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يشير إلى شذوذ يكون توزيعه ومظهره يشبه سلسلة من الدوائر المتداخلة أو الحلزونات.
def: "Applies to an abnormality whose distribution and appearance resembles series of a concentric circles or spirals." []
is_a: HP:0012836 ! Spatial pattern
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10126
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001051
name: Delta brush pattern on EEG
synonym: "نمط الفرشاة الدلتا في تخطيط كهربية الدماغ" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نمط غير طبيعي في تخطيط كهربية الدماغ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: نمط فرشاة الدلتا هو نمط عابر يميزه موجة دلتا بطيئة مع نشاط سريع متراكب.
def: "Delta brushes are transient patterns characterised by a slow delta wave with superimposed fast activity." [PMID:30214965]
comment: Delta brushes are the hallmark of the EEG of premature infants.
is_a: HP:0002353 ! EEG abnormality
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10421
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001052
name: Tibiotalar synostosis
synonym: "الالتحام الظنبوبي الكاحلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التحام العظام في الكاحل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التحام بين التقاطع بين الظنبوب البعيد، والشظية والكاحل.
def: "Fusion of the junction between the distal tibia, fibula and the talus." [PMID:27577507, PMID:27594929]
is_a: HP:0005928 ! Synostosis involving the fibula
is_a: HP:0005929 ! Synostosis involving the tibia
is_a: HP:0009140 ! Synostosis involving bones of the feet
