synonym: "رائحة تشبه جورب متسخ" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: رائحة مميزة يُقال إنها تشبه رائحة الجوارب القذرة.
def: "A characteristic smell said to resemble the odor of dirty socks." [PMID:16602101, PMID:33521113, PMID:38484105]
comment: This feature is characteristic of isoveleric acidemia.
is_a: HP:0500001 ! Body odor
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10551
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6714-5727

[Term]
id: HP:6001064
name: Anti-acetylcholine receptor antibody positivity
synonym: "إيجابية الأجسام المضادة لمستقبل الأسيتيل كولين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجود أجسام مضادة في الدم ضد مستقبل الأسيتيل كولين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود أجسام مضادة ذاتية (غلوبولينات مناعية) في الدورة الدموية تتفاعل ضد مستقبل الأسيتيل كولين.
def: "The presence of autoantibodies (immunoglobulins) in the blood circulation that react against acetylcholine receptor." [PMID:18474849]
comment: Nicotinic acetylcholine receptors (AChR) are ligand-gated cation channels that are present throughout the nervous system. The muscle AChR mediates transmission at the neuromuscular junction; antibodies against the muscle AChR are the cause of myasthenia gravis. The ganglionic (alpha 3-type) neuronal AChR mediates fast synaptic transmission in sympathetic, parasympathetic, and enteric autonomic ganglia. Impaired cholinergic ganglionic synaptic transmission is one important cause of autonomic failure.
is_a: HP:0030057 ! Autoimmune antibody positivity
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

