comment: Arabic Definition: ألم مفرط في منطقة محددة، يفوق ما يمكن توقعه من الفحص الجسدي.
def: "Exquisite tenderness in a specific region, beyond what one would surmise from examination." []
comment: This finding may be observed with several diseases including necrotizing fasciitis and gas gangrene.
