[Term]
id: HP:6001130
name: Distal radioulnar joint arthritis
synonym: "التهاب المفصل الزندالكعبي البعيد" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "التهاب المفصل بين الكعبرة والزند" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: حالة التهابية للمفصل الذي يربط نهايات عظم الكعبرة والزند البعيدة، والمعروف بمفصل الزندالكعبي البعيد. قد يتميز التهاب هذا المفصل بتوسعه، وإزاحة الجزعة البعيدة لليد، والأدلة الشعاعية للفصال العظمي بما في ذلك النمو العظمي الزائد، والخراجات تحت الغضروف، وتصلب تحت الغضروف، وتضيق الفراغ المفصلي.
def: "An inflammatory condition of the joint that connects the far ends of the radius and the ulna, known as the distal radioulnar joint (DRUJ). DRUJ arthritis may be characterized by widening of the DRUJ interval, volar/dorsal displacement of the distal ulna, radiographic evidence of osteoarthritis at the DRUJ joint including osteophytes, subchondral cysts, subchrondal sclerosis, and joint space narrowing." [PMID:23027692]
comment: Arthritis of the distal radioulnar joint (DRUJ) between the sigmoid notch of the distal radius and the ulnar head can be caused by traumatic, inflammatory, congenital, and degenerative processes.
synonym: "Arthritis of the distal radioulnar joint" EXACT []
synonym: "DRUJ arthritis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0003059 ! Abnormality of the radioulnar joints
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10719
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001131
name: Radial head fracture
synonym: "كسر رأس الكعبرة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كسر في الكعبرة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كسر في نهاية الكعبرة القريبة المتعلقة برأسها.
def: "Fracture of the proximal end of the radius involving the radial head." []
is_a: HP:0003978 ! Fractured radius
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10796
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001132
name: Elbow lateral collateral ligament tear
synonym: "تمزق الرباط الجانبي الوحشي للمرفق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تمزق رباط في المرفق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إصابة في الرباط الجانبي الوحشي (LCL) للمرفق. يعتبر LCL بنية معقدة تربط بين محفظة ورباط، ويعتبر حاسمًا في تثبيت التمفصلات بين الذراع الزندي وعظم الكعبرة. قد يؤدي إصابة LCL إلى عدم استقرار المرفق، مما يسمح للكعبرة والزند بالابتعاد عن عظمة العضد عند تطبيق إجهاد الاستدارة الخارجية على الساعد.
def: "An injury to the lateral collateral ligament (LCL) of the elbow. The LCL is a complex capsuloligamentous structure critical in stabilizing the ulnohumeral and radiocapitellar articulations. LCL injury can result in elbow instability, allowing the proximal radius and ulna to externally rotate away from the humerus as a supination stress is applied to the forearm." [PMID:23261198]
synonym: "Lateral ulnar collateral ligament tear" EXACT []
synonym: "Ligamentous tear on the lateral aspect of the elbow" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0020300 ! Abnormal elbow morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10797
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001133
name: Elbow medial collateral ligament tear
synonym: "تمزق الرباط الجانبي الأنسي للمرفق" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تمزق رباط من الجهة الداخلية للمرفق" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إصابة في الرباط الجانبي الأنسي (MCL) للمرفق.
def: "An injury to the medial collateral ligament (MCL) of the elbow." [PMID:19468906]
comment: Elbow medial collateral ligament sprain occurs when the elbow is subjected to a valgus force exceeding the tensile properties of the medial collateral ligament (MCL). This is an injury seen more often in throwing athletes.
synonym: "Ligamentous tear on the medial aspect of the elbow" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0020300 ! Abnormal elbow morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10798
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001134
name: Coronoid fracture
synonym: "كسر الناتئ الإكليلي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كسر في الالتحام العلوي للزند" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كسر في الناتئ الإكليلي على الجزء العلوي من عظم الزند.
def: "Fracture of the coronoid process on the proximal ulna." [PMID:39381286]
comment: The coronoid process acts to buttress against the posterior translation of the ulna on the humerus. It is also the attachment site for the anterior elbow capsule, brachialis, and the medial collateral ligament of the elbow. Coronoid fractures are critical injuries and are suggestive of elbow instability.
is_a: HP:0003987 ! Fractured ulna
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10799
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001135
name: History of spinal cord injury
synonym: "تاريخ إصابة النخاع الشوكي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "سابق إصابة النخاع الشوكي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: سجل طبي يشير إلى حدوث إصابة في النخاع الشوكي قبل الشكوى الحالية.
def: "A medical history of hving had a spinal cord injury prior to the presenting complaint." [PMID:32809556]
comment: Spinal cord injury (SCI) results from direct or indirect spinal cord damage. The most common SCI cause is acute trauma from motor vehicular crashes (MVCs), although the condition may also arise from insidious etiologies such as malignancies and chronic tuberculous infection. Spinal cord lesions may lead to permanent disability, significant morbidity, and even mortality. High spinal injuries often impair cardiorespiratory function, requiring emergent interventions.
is_a: HP:4000110 ! Exposure history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10804
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001136
name: Femoral nerve distribution
synonym: "توزيع العصب الفخذي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم في منطقة العصب الفخذي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تنميل في الجزء الأمامي/الداخلي من الفخذ (الأعصاب الجلدية الأمامية والداخلية للفخذ) و/أو الجزء الداخلي من الساق والقدم (توزيع السافين). قد يرافقه ضعف في عضلة الفخذ الرباعية.
def: "Paresthesias in anterior/medial aspect of the thigh (anterior and medial cutaneous nerves of the thigh) and/or medial aspect of the lower leg and foot (saphenous distribution). May be accompanied by weakness in the quadriceps." []
synonym: "Femoral nerve distribution" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025849 ! Localized along nerve distribution
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10805
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001137
name: Triceps tendon rupture
synonym: "تمزق وتر العضلة ثلاثية الرؤوس" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "قطع في وتر العضلة ثلاثية الرؤوس" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تمزق (قطع) في وتر العضلة ثلاثية الرؤوس.
def: "Breakage (tear) of the triceps tendon." [PMID:28832209]
is_a: HP:0100550 ! Tendon rupture
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10807
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001138
name: Digoxin exposure
synonym: "تعرض للديجوكسين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تناول دواء الديجوكسين" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: وجود تاريخ للتعرض لعلاج بالديجوكسين.
def: "History of having been treateed with digoxin." [PMID:29262029]
comment: Digoxin is a cardiac glycoside derived from the foxglove plant (digitalis species). It has inotropic effects and is utilized in the management of systolic dysfunction in patients with congestive heart failure (CHF) and as an atrioventricular nodal blocking agent for managing atrial tachydysrhythmias. Gastrointestinal upset is the most common symptom of digoxin toxicity. Patients also may report visual symptoms, which classically present as a yellow-green discoloration, and cardiovascular symptoms, such as palpitations, dyspnea, and syncope.
synonym: "Digitalis exposure" EXACT []
synonym: "Lanoxin exposure" EXACT []
is_a: HP:4000112 ! Medication history
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10675
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001139
name: Upper arm pain
synonym: "ألم في الذراع العلوية" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم في الذراع العليا" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير مريح يتميز بشعور بدني مزعج (مثل الوخز، النبض، أو الألم) يتركز في الذراع العلوية.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the upper arm." []
comment: Pain anywhere between the shoulder and elbow. Upper arm pain may be observed with conditions such as ulnar shaft fracture, intersection syndrome of hand tendons, Galeazzi fracture, radial tunnel syndrome, and wrist dislocation.
synonym: "Proximal arm pain" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0012513 ! Upper limb pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10793
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001140
name: Capitellum fracture
synonym: "كسر في الكابيتيليوم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "كسر في نهاية عظم الذراع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: كسر جزئي أو كامل في الكابيتيليوم لعظم العضد، وهو بروز ناعم ومجسم على الجزء الجانبي من سطح المفصل البعيد لعظم العضد.
def: "A partial or complete breakage of the capitulum of the humerus, which is a smooth, rounded eminence on the lateral portion of the distal articular surface of the humerus." []
synonym: "Capitellar fracture" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0041055 ! Fractured humerus
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10794
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001141
name: Anterior shoulder pain
synonym: "ألم أمامي في الكتف" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم في مقدمة الكتف" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير مريح يتميز بشعور بدني مزعج (مثل الوخز، النبض، أو الألم) يتركز في الجزء الأمامي (الأمامي) من الكتف.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the anterior (front) part of the shoulder." []
comment: Pain localized to the anterior aspect of the shoulder. Anterior shoulder pain may be observed in conditions such as proximal biceps tendon tear.
is_a: HP:0030834 ! Shoulder pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10811
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001142
name: Pain at the anterior aspect of the elbow
