[Term]
id: HP:6001145
name: Pain at the posterior aspect of the knee
synonym: "ألم في الجانب الخلفي من الركبة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم خلف الركبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير سار يتميز بعدم الارتياح الجسدي (مثل الوخز أو الخفقان أو الأوجاع) المتمركز في الجزء الخلفي من الركبة، أي مقابل الجانب الذي توجد فيه الرضفة.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the back part of the knee, that is, opposite to the side of the knee where the patella is located." []
comment: Pain at the posterior aspect of the knee may be observed with Baker cyst.
is_a: HP:0030839 ! Knee pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10822
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001146
name: Biceps tendonitis
synonym: "التهاب وتر العضلة ذات الرأسين" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: التهاب وتر حول رأس العضلة ذات الرأسين.
def: "Biceps tendinitis is inflammation of the tendon around the long head of the biceps muscle." [PMID:19725488]
comment: MRI may show increased T2 signal around the biceps tendon or ultrasound showing thickening of the biceps tendon.
synonym: "Biceps tendinitis" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025230 ! Tendonitis
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10826
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001147
name: Increased peripheral nerve cross sectional area
synonym: "زيادة مساحة المقطع العرضي للعصب المحيطي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "تضخم في العصب" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إظهار الموجات فوق الصوتية لزيادة مساحة المقطع العرضي لعصب محيطي أثناء مروره عبر موقع محتمل للانضغاط.
def: "Ultrasonography showing increased cross sectional area (CSA) of a peripheral nerve as it travels through a potential site of compression." []
comment: This feature may be observed in conditions such as carpal tunnel syndrome, ulnar tunnel syndrome, cubital tunnel syndrome, and radial tunnel syndrome.
synonym: "Peripheral nerve enlargement" EXACT []
synonym: "Peripheral nerve swelling" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0000759 ! Abnormal peripheral nervous system morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10783
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001148
name: Pain exacerbated by passive flexion at joint
synonym: "آلام تتفاقم عند الانحناء السلبي للمفصل" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجع عند تحريك المفصل" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ألم في الطرف يزداد سوءًا عند ثني المفصل بشكل سلبي.
def: "Pain in extremity that worsens with joint is passively flexed." [PMID:25878982]
comment: This feature may be observed in acute compartment syndrome.
is_a: HP:0025280 ! Pain characteristic
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10786
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001149
name: Positive hook test at the elbow
synonym: "اختبار هوك إيجابي عند الكوع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اختبار شد عند الكوع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: عند استدارة الساعد بالكامل وثني الكوع بزاوية 90 درجة، يقوم الفاحص بإدخال إصبع حول وتر العضلة ذات الرأسين البعيد في الجزء الأمامي من الكوع. يكون الاختبار إيجابيًا عندما لا يوجد هيكل يمكن شده حوله.
def: "With forearm fully supinated and elbow flexed to 90 degrees, examiner hooks a finger a bit around the distal biceps tendon at the anterior aspect of the elbow. Test is positive when there is lack of appreciable cord like structure to hook around." [PMID:32788933]
comment: This sign can indicate a distal biceps tendon tear.
synonym: "Positive distal biceps hook test" EXACT []
synonym: "Positive O'Driscoll hook test" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0034430 ! Abnormal joint physiology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10814
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001150
name: Positive Speed's test
synonym: "اختبار سبيدز إيجابي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "اختبار ألم في الكتف الأمامي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: الضغط اليدوي للأسفل على الذراع عند ثني الكتف بزاوية 90 درجة، الكوع ممتد بالكامل، وراحة اليد متجهة للأعلى يسبب ألم في منطقة الكتف الأمامية؛ وسمي باسم الدكتور سبيد.
def: "Manual downward pressure on the arm with the shoulders flexed forward to 90 degrees, elbows fully extended, and palm facing up recreates pain in the anterior shoulder region; named after Dr. Speed." [PMID:9848587]
comment: The Speed's test was recorded as positive if the patient experienced pain in the proximal portion of the shoulder during the application of a downward force applied to the arm. The patient's arm was placed with the forearm in full supination at 90 degrees of shoulder elevation. See Figure 1 of PMID:9848587.
is_a: HP:0025823 ! Positive provocative functional shoulder test
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10825
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001151
name: Triangular lunate bone
synonym: "عظم الهلالي المثلث" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "عظم اليد المتضرر" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: اضطراب في الأقواس الكبرى والصغرى لعظم الهلالي، حيث يظهر الهلالي بشكل مثلث، معروف بعلامة القطعة من الفطيرة. وغالبًا ما يحدث بسبب السقوط على اليد الممدودة، وسيشعر المرضى بألم عند اللمس على ظهر المعصم وقد يكون لديهم نقص حس في توزيع العصب الوسيط.
def: "A disruption of the greater and lesser arcs of the lunate bone, with the lunate having a triangular silhouette, know as the piece of pie sign. Often caused by falling on an outstretched hand, patients will have tenderness to palpation over the dorsum of the wrist and may have sensory deficits in the median nerve distribution." [PMID:22529764, PMID:23616330]
comment: See Figure 3 of PMID:23616330.
synonym: "Piece of pie sign of lunate bone" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0004248 ! Abnormal lunate bone morphology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10733
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001152
name: Pain exacerbated by wrist deviation
synonym: "ألم يتفاقم مع انحراف المعصم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجع عند تحريك المعصم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: يتفاقم الألم مع انحراف المعصم نحو الزند أو الكعبرة.
def: "Pain worsens with wrist ulnar or radial deviation." []
comment: Ulnar: Triangular fibrocartilage complex tear; Ulnocarpal abutment syndrome Radial: Triangular fibrocartilage complex tear.
is_a: HP:0025280 ! Pain characteristic
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10742
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001153
name: Pain on the lateral aspect of the foot
synonym: "ألم في الجانب الوحشي من القدم" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "أوجاع في جانب القدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير مريح يتسم بانزعاج جسدي (مثل الوخز أو الخفقان أو الأوجاع) موضعي في جانب القدم الأقرب إلى الإصبع الصغير.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the side of the foot nearest to the little (fifth) toe." []
synonym: "Lateral foot pain" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0025238 ! Foot pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10743
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001154
name: Pain at the medial aspect of the knee
synonym: "ألم في الجانب الإنسي من الركبة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجع في داخل الركبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير مريح يتسم بانزعاج جسدي (مثل الوخز أو الخفقان أو الأوجاع) موضعي في الجهة الداخلية للركبة، أي المنطقة التي تواجه الركبة الأخرى.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the inner side of knee, that is, the region of the knee that faces the other knee." []
comment: This feature may be observed with medial collateral ligament knee injury.
is_a: HP:0030839 ! Knee pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10744
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

[Term]
id: HP:6001155
name: Pain at the lateral aspect of the knee
synonym: "ألم في الجانب الوحشي من الركبة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "وجع في خارج الركبة" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: إحساس غير مريح يتسم بانزعاج جسدي (مثل الوخز أو الخفقان أو الأوجاع) موضعي في الجهة الخارجية للركبة، أي المنطقة التي تواجه بعيدًا عن الركبة الأخرى.
def: "An unpleasant sensation characterized by physical discomfort (such as pricking, throbbing, or aching) localized to the outer side of knee, that is, the region of the knee that faces away from the other knee." []
comment: This feature may be observed with lateral collateral ligament injury.
is_a: HP:0030839 ! Knee pain
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/10745
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199

