synonym: "تورم في الإصبع" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تضخم أو تورم غير طبيعي يتركز في أحد الأصابع.
def: "An abnormal enlargement or swelling localized to a finger." []
comment: The word mass is usually used at an early stage of the diagnostic workup before the precise nature of the swelling has been determined.
