synonym: "ألم في الجانب الإنسي من الكوع" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "ألم في جانب الكوع الداخلي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: ألم متمركز في الجانب الإنسي من الكوع.
def: "Pain localized to the medial aspect of the elbow." []
comment: The medial aspect of the elbow refers to the inner side of the elbow. Conditions characterized by this finding include medial epicondylitis.
