[Term]
id: HP:6001269
name: Choledocholithiasis
synonym: "تحصى القناة الصفراوية المشتركة" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "حصوات في القناة الصفراوية" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تحصى القناة الصفراوية المشتركة هو وجود حصوات داخل القناة الصفراوية المشتركة.
def: "Choledocholithiasis is the presence of stones within the common bile duct." [PMID:28722990]
comment: It is estimated that common bile duct stones are present in anywhere from 1-15% of patients with cholelithiasis.
is_a: HP:0035013 ! Abnormal extrahepatic bile duct morphology
