comment: Arabic Definition: هي تضخم أو انتفاخ غير طبيعي في البطن ينبض أو يخفق.
def: "An abnormal enlargement or swelling in the abdomen that pulses or throbs." [PMID:22644671]
comment: Clinical palpation of a pulsating abdominal mass alerts the clinician to the presence of a possible abdominal aortic aneurysm (AAA).
