synonym: "زيادة مادة في الدم" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: تركيز المالونيل كارنيتين في الدورة الدموية أعلى من الحد الأقصى الطبيعي.
def: "The concentration of malonylcarnitine in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal." [PMID:37144154, PMID:39069445]
synonym: "Elevated Blood C3DC level" EXACT []
synonym: "Elevated C3DC in plasma" EXACT []
synonym: "Elevated levels of malonylcarnitine in blood acylcarnitine profile" EXACT []
synonym: "Elevated plasma malonylcarnitine level" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0010966 ! Abnormal circulating fatty-acid anion concentration
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/11149
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6714-5727

[Term]
id: HP:6001316
name: Sertoli cell hypoplasia
synonym: "نقص تنسج في خلايا سيرتولي" EXACT [PAVS:AR]
synonym: "نقص في عدد خلايا سيرتولي" RELATED [PAVS:AR]
comment: Arabic Definition: هو انخفاض غير طبيعي في عدد خلايا سيرتولي في الخصية.
def: "Abnormal decrease in the number of Sertoli cells in the testis." []
is_a: HP:0000035 ! Abnormal testis morphology
