comment: Arabic Definition: انخفاض في قدرة القدم على الانعكاس للداخل بسبب الألم أو الضعف أو الحاجز الميكانيكي.
def: "Decreased foot inversion secondary to pain, weakness, or mechanical block." []
comment: This feature is assocaited with a reduced foot range of motion and may be experienced as a stiff foot.
synonym: "Foot inversion limited" EXACT []
is_a: HP:0034430 ! Abnormal joint physiology
property_value: IAO:0000233 https://github.com/obophenotype/human-phenotype-ontology/issues/11156
